window.FWN_HERO_SUMMONING_PEACE_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_HERO_SUMMONING_PEACE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1501,"title":"Chapter 1501 - Seeking More Possibilities of Baby Castellas 6","paragraphs":["After Lillywood-san, Magnawell-san and Megiddo-san, our next stop would naturally be Isis-san’s place.","Despite our sudden visit, the kind Isis-san welcomed us with open arms, and we talked about Kuro’s baby castellas over tea.","[......I see...... Baby castellas are delicious...... I can understand...... your desire to make it even better.]","[Right! Yes, baby castellas have endless possibilities!]","[......Unnn...... However...... I’m not that well-informed..... A method Kuromueina hasn’t tried yet...... Hmmm...... Everyone, what do you think?]","With a troubled look on her face at Kuro’s question, Isis-san asked her subordinates. Iris-san is good at cooking, so we might get some pretty good opinions from her.","As I was thinking about this, I was patting Eul, who is on my lap and rubbing her body against me, acting all spoiled.","[Baby castellas huh, flavor-related factors seemed to be often tried and tasted...... How about changing the texture? Such results would certainly differ depending on the ingredients, but the texture changes can also depend on how it’s baked. Even if two different dishes have the same flavor, having different textures would bring about a different eating experience for the consumer.]","[I see, it’s true that until now, I’ve had Ein cook them to the perfect degree of doneness, but it is possible to bake the baby castellas slightly crispy.]","Iris-san was the first to respond, and as to be expected of someone with her skills, it was a simple, but versatile piece of advice. Certainly, even if the flavor of your creation was the same as usual, eating something with a different texture would feel different, and since Kuro has received rice flour from Alice, it seems going through this would give her a wide variety of uses.","[......I didn’t eat much until I became Isis-sama’s subordinate, but us Witches have our own blend of spices. It’s not that it’s not on the market, but they were stuff that were actively sold, so it’s almost never on the market. I remember that its taste was relatively suitable for baby castellas.]","[Heehhh...... Ingredients unique to each species do exist after all. I have acquaintances among the Witches, so I’ll ask them next time. Thanks.]","Polaris-san’s answer was recommending something like a secret spice of the Witches, and hearing that made Kuro interested. There are many species in the Demon Realm, and it seems that there are many with their own unique food cultures.","And then, Sirius-san’s turn came next, and with her arms folded and twisting her head in thought, Sirius-san spoke, seemingly lacking in confidence.","[......H- How about...... using sap?]","[Isn’t that just something you Insectoids like? This is why muscleheads can’t be properly asked questions......]","[......Do you even have a good opinion to give out?]","[It’s a rare ingredient, but Bloody Berries are indispensable. I can prepare a lot of them though.]","[Aren’t those poisonous fruits used to nourish corpses!? Only corpse b*tches like you would happily eat something like that!]","[......Ahh?]","[......Huh?]","[Consider the time and place, you idiots. Don’t fight here.]","After both of them expressed their unique opinions, Sirius-san and Rasal-san grabbed each other’s collars and started bickering with each other. From what I’ve heard, they’re the kind of people who get along better the more they fight.","Well, as they had been thrown outside of the room by an astounded Iris-san, leaving those two aside...... The last one is Spica-san.","[Hmm~~ Can Blue Crystal Flowers be eaten~~? I can adjust it so that their blooms are edible~~]","[Ah, we did think of that on the way here. If Spica-chan doesn’t mind, I would like it if you could share some with us.]","[Yes~~ Well then, I’ll prepare some which you can bring back home~~]","Spica-san’s answer was that thing which we were thinking about upon hearing from Camellia-san, edible Blue Crystal Flower petals.","Since only Spica-san is the only Blue Crystal Flower Spirit in the world, it’s an ingredient that only Spica-san can make, and Kuro herself seemed very interested in it.","[Well~~ Everyone at Isis-san’s place sure is unique and interesting.]","[......Unnn...... They’re girls I’m proud of......]","[I see~~ I’m glad you’re having fun, Isis. By the way, what’s your personal opinion like, Isis?]","[......Hmmm...... How about...... chilling it?]","[Come to think of it, Alice made those ice cream-filled baby castellas during the Six Kings Festival, so I guess it’s possible to steer them toward frozen desserts?]","[That would certainly be interesting. Baby castellas exclusively eaten when it’s hot...... Great! I can feel it! Baby castellas’ possibilities!!!]","I kinda hate the fact that I’m ending up talking strangely too, but there’s no doubt that if baby castellas can be made tasty even when they’re cold, they would be delicious.","[......W- Well, in any case, thank you, Isis-san.]","[......Unnn...... If I’m able to help Kaito and Kuromueina...... I’m also happy.]","Saying that, Isis-san gave me an angelic smile.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [In terms of camp units, it seems like Death King camp has given the most opinions.]"]},{"number":1502,"title":"Chapter 1502 - Seeking More Possibilities of Baby Castellas 7","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","With the arc transitioning to the God Realm next time, today’s chapter is a bit short.","Well then, now that we had finished visiting Isis-san’s place, after we went to Kuro’s house by Teleportation Magic, we decided to discuss what we’re going to do hereafter.","[So, Kuro, what are we going to do now? There are still a lot of people Kuro and I know here in the Demon Realm, but should we go visit them?]","[Unnn, that’s a good idea. However, I think we should finish going around the Six Kings first.]","[......Unnn?]","Somehow, she said something strange. We should have already finished going around the Six Kings. Lillywood-san, Magnawell-san, Megiddo-san, Isis-san...... Yep, we should have visited them all.","However, with the way Kuro said that though, I have a bad feeling about this. And the existence that got that bad feeling even more than me showed herself and called out to Kuro.","[......No, you’ve already finished visiting all of the Six Kings, you know?]","[No, there’s still Shalltear left after all.......]","[No, no! You’re already asking that for the third time, you know!? What’s so fun in asking the opinion of someone who’s so uninterested that I can’t be bothered to answer even once!? Isn’t that too much of a responsibility on me?]","[Unnn, I guess you’re right. I definitely am being helped by Shalltear a lot, and I really am grateful...... So, do you have any opinions in mind?]","[......Are you a demon or what? With the current flow of things, you’re decisively doing that all calm and composed!?]","Yeah, she is a Demon. There’s no mistaking that, she’s the Baby Castella Demon after all. Even so, she’s seriously gonna ask Alice multiple times huh. Well, Kuro is also on good terms with Alice, so I guess she’s just half-jokingly asking that...... However, with how accommodating Alice is, she still ended up giving her another suggestion.","[......Haahhh...... How about having them served with some soup and eating them after dipping the baby castellas into it?]","[Isn’t that a bit too simple? It’s true that a food’s taste can change by preparing a separate soup or sauce, but can you really say that it expands the possibilities of baby castellas? Instead of escaping towards external taste changes, I want something that has the spirit of changing the fundamentals.]","[And why the heck are you giving harsh commentaries on my suggestion!? Even though, with all the random suggestions all sorts of people have given until now, aren’t you just saying “I see~~” to all that!!!?]","Indeed, this certainly is the first time that Kuro had expressly refused the suggestion. Although it feels like this was just because the one suggesting that is Alice but......","[......That’s just how things turned out, don’t you think?]","[......Kuro-san, I just suddenly thought of something...... You’ve been having a lot of your baby castellas confiscated by me lately, so are you taking this opportunity to strike back?]","[............Ahh~~ Shalltear, thanks for the good suggestion! Well then, Kaito-kun, let’s go to the next area!]","[Ahh, got you there, didn’t I!!!? What, for no reason are all, you planning to do this for a few more times!!!?]","Alice vehemently threw her tsukkomis at Kuro, who was intentionally avoiding the topic so obviously that it was clear to see, and was now trying to redirect the topic to heading towards the next person to visit.","It’s just, both of them had smirks on their faces, giving the impression that they were just playing around, and just as Kuro had said back then, I could tell that the two of them were really on good terms with each other, somehow making me smile.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It certainly feels like they’re on good terms with each other. The way Kuro interacts with her seems genuine and unguarded......]"]},{"number":1503,"title":"Chapter 1503 - Seeking More Possibilities of Baby Castellas 8","paragraphs":["After consulting with each other, we decided to take a break visiting people here in the Demon Realm and go to the God Realm next. And when it came to going to the God Realm, who would be the first one receiving the brunt of Kuro’s questioning......","[...... So, why is it that you came to me first?]","[Because you seem to be the most earnest person to answer us.]","Yes, as per usual, it was Chronois-san.","[I’m sorry, Chronois-san...... Bothering you even when you’re at work.]","[No, you had it rough too, Miyama...... Now then, as for the suggestion you asked for, I can’t give you anything very useful. However, I’ve heard stories about confectioneries coated with chocolate. Instead of putting something inside or kneading the ingredients with the dough, why not experiment with external add-ons?]","[......I see!]","As might be expected of the earnest Chronois-san, she answered our question properly even though she was taken aback by our sudden visit.","However, I see. Coating huh...... Indeed, many of baby castellas Kuro had had something inside them, so even though that was a simple suggestion, changing up one’s outlook sure is effective.","[However, I’ve been thinking about this for a long time...... but Underworld King, what is it that drives you to go that far? When it comes to baby castellas, you become slightly crazy...... I think it’s time you made a compromise.]","Whoa there, here comes a sharp comment from Chronois-san...... I’m really glad that her sensibilities are normal. Well, she would probably, or rather, she would definitely just say that she wants to pursue the infinite possibilities of baby castellas.","[Then, let me ask you this: Chronois-chan, if Shiro asks you for “delicious baby castellas”, would you serve her something you compromised in?]","[W- What!? N- No, that’s not possible! Such disrespect to Shallow Vernal-sama isn’t something......]","[Unnn, that’s right. You’re obviously going to give Shiro the supreme dish, right? However, do you think doing that...... you would be able to make such a thing?]","[ ! ? ]","Well then, it seems like things are heading in a strange direction...... as Chronois-san herself looked quite shocked...... I mean, as was the case with Olivia-san, Shiro-san’s name sure is too effective against the Gods.","The moment Shiro-san’s name was brought up, Chronois-san’s eyes changed......","[Those who compromise on things now...... would regret it when the time comes! It is only when you have the confidence and track record of having walked this endless road that you will be able to prepare the best dish for that moment!]","[.......I- I...... I was mistaken. For seeking for the possibilities of baby castellas to be this necessary for Shallow Vernal-sama......]","[Unnn, I’m glad you understand. “Realizing” one’s mistake at this point isn’t a waste. You can even say that you have acquired a big piece of growth.]","......If they weren’t talking about baby castellas, it would have sounded like a good line to someone encouraging others’ growth...... I’ll say this once again, if only they weren’t talking about baby castellas......","As I was thinking that, a white light appeared in front of Kuro, and a huge paper fan appeared out of nowhere and sent Kuro flying in. Somehow, it’s like the space had been cracked open and she was blown into that subspace-like place...... Well, she’s probably gonna be okay anyway.","And as for who did that attack, I don’t even bother to think about it. Yes, it was definitely Shiro-san.","(......I just realized something, that this obsession of hers for baby castellas should be put to an end once and for all. Especially before strange misunderstandings spread and entered Kaito-san’s mind......)","Ah, no, you don’t have to worry. I’m well aware how crazy Kuro is about baby castellas, so I knew very well...... all the stuff she had been rambling about were just Kuro’s random comments.","After Kuro and Shiro-san’s second clash of the day ended, the place we went to was Life-san’s temple...... Come to think of it, I don’t think I’ve ever seen Kuro and Life-san together before. Well, I had guessed they knew each other before, but this would be the first time I’d seen them talking with each other.","Entering the temple, how should I say this...... I found Life-san sleeping while standing, but when I called out to her, she woke up and listened to our question.","[......I see, you’re asking for a wide range of opinions because you need a completely new approach to things. I don’t eat much, so my knowledge is just from what I’ve heard...... but how about changing the size of the food?]","[Size? Not the shape?]","[Yes. If I’m not mistaken, there’s a custom in the other world where they make dishes bigger and give them prefixes like mega- or giga-. How about applying this custom to your dish?]","[......That isn’t really a custom back there, but there were indeed people who make such larger-than-normal-sized food.]","While nodding to Life-san’s words, I suddenly had a bad feeling. I’ve certainly seen such huge dishes on the internet. However, I didn’t really want such a suggestion to be brought up if possible.","If Kuro is going to make a giant baby castella...... No matter how I try to think about it, I don’t think she’s going to make anything sensible-sized at all. It would be great if things just ended up with heartburn but......","[......Mega baby castella...... Giga baby castella...... Nice.]","See that, now the Baby Castella Demon got a twinkle in her eyes. She’s definitely going to put this in action. Even if she did decide to discard this idea this time, she’ll definitely make it and bring it to me sooner or later.","I wonder why? If you normally think about it, it should be twice the normal size or something around that size...... but why the heck am I imagining “Kuro holding a baby castella bigger than a person’s face” in my mind from a while ago? There’s no way that would become real, right?","I- It should be alright. As expected, you can’t make a baby castella of that size properly...... No, guess that’s not gonna happen huh. It’s just a guess, or rather, if it’s Ein-san, she can definitely make that happen.","[Thanks, Life-chan! That was very helpful!]","[No, I’m glad that I was able to be of help...... Well then, I’m off to my daily meditation routine, so if you’ll excuse me.]","Come to think of it, there’s that baby castella dish I ate at the Six Kings Festival that was so big that I thought it was a prank, but compared to what I felt Kuro would create in the future, it may have been just a cute size sitting on a plate.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Actually, even if she did create a gigantic baby castella, she could eat it all up if she converted it into magic power the moment she ate it, so I feel like the only one who would suffer would be Kaito, who has a limited stomach capacity......]"]},{"number":1504,"title":"Chapter 1504 - Seeking More Possibilities of Baby Castellas 9","paragraphs":["After visiting the temples of Chronois-san and Life-san, the place we went to after that would obviously be Fate-san’s temple. When we arrived at Fate-san’s temple, she greeted us with a smile, riding a cushion just like usual.","[Kai-chan, welcome~~]","[Hello, Fate-san. I’m sorry for the sudden visit.]","[No problem. I’m always happy to see you, Kai-chan...... Even so, it’s unusual that you’re coming here with Kurorin.]","[Sorry for the bother, Fate-chan.]","[......Kurorin? Arehh? Fate-san, do you call Kuro that?]","If I’m not mistaken, Fate-san should be referring to Kuro as “Underworld King”. When I asked her about it, Fate-san explained with a smile.","[Ahh, you see, when we went swimming before, I started calling Death King “Ai-chan”, right? So, I can’t really just stay calling Underworld King that way, I changed the way I called her too and started calling her Kurorin. Well, both of us are Kai-chan’s lovers anyway, so I’d like the two of us to get along well with each other~~]","[Right, right, I’ve never been given a nickname like that before, so it felt pretty new to me. Ehehe, it’s Kurorin lol~~!]","Kuro, who had a childish smile on her face and posed with her index fingers on her cheeks, was very cute. How should I say this...... Kuro’s someone who basically goes with the flow, so I feel like she’s got a good affinity with Fate-san.","Fate-san herself, who seemed to be uninterested in other people in the beginning, is now actively trying to communicate with my other lovers, so she may be the friendliest among everyone. How should I say this...... I feel that she has grown, or perhaps, changed.","[......So, coming here with Kurorin, did you two have some business in mind?]","[Yeah, about that, Kaito-kun and I are looking for new possibilities for baby castellas, and we are asking around for people’s suggestions.]","[Fumu fumu...... Eh? The way you say that, you’re here to ask for mine?]","[Unnn. And so, Fate-chan, do you have a good idea in mind?]","Kuro’s question made Fate-san look clearly confused. Has Fate-san ever eaten baby castellas before? Rather, it felt like many of the mutual acquaintances of mine and Kuro’s seem to have surprisingly never eaten baby castellas......","After giving it some thought, Fate-san nodded with a serious expression on her face.","[......I see, it’s a request from none other than Kai-chan and Kurorin, and I’d like to help if I can. And so, I’ll answer as best as I can...... “Shalltan, in my place, will”!!!]","[I see. Well then, I’m counting on you, Shalltear.]","[Wait a minute there! What, you trying to turn this into some kind of joke!!!?]","With a sharp look on her face, Fate-san threw everything to Alice, her face now looking so refreshed that it seemed as if she had let go of troubles, to which Kuro also went along and turned the question to Alice. That being the case, Alice, who is being asked for the fourth time, would naturally not stay quiet at all.","Alice, clearly looking flustered when appeared, drew near Fate-san.","[Listen here, Fate-san may not know about this, but I’ve answered this thing, which I’m freaking uninterested in, three times already. I’m begging you here, don’t throw that thing over here.]","[I see...... Seems like you also had it rough, Shall-tan. But don’t get me wrong here, I’m not being malicious here. It’s just, I think this is for the best...... You see, I’m a Supreme God, and even though I’ve been broadening my horizons thanks to Kai-chan, I’ve lived with a narrow sense of values until then. It’s difficult for me to give an answer that Kurorin can accept...... However, I want to be of help to Kurorin and Kai-chan, who have come to rely on me like this, so after careful consideration, I made this statement.]","[......Fate-san.]","[......Well, I also simply think it’s troublesome.]","[I’m sure that’s the main reason!!!]","[No, it’s not like that’s my only reason...... this being troublesome is just about 99.9% of it.]","[That’s no different from a hundred, oi......]","For a moment, I thought they were having a nice talk, but it seems like Fate-san was being the usual, and the reason why she passed this to Alice was that it was too troublesome. Well, even though she has changed in many ways, Fate-san is still Fate-san, and the way she looks at troublesome things.","[And so, Kurorin. There you go, Shalltear will give you a transcendentally amazing answer after all.]","[I understand! Then, Shalltear, please give me the transcendentally amazing answer.]","[......Fuu...... Fufufu...... Hahaha...... I see...... If things are gonna go that way, then I also have my own ideas in mind.]","[......Ahh~~ O- On second thought, I’ll just answer it myself......]","[......Ah, I- I guess I also went too far with the joke...... For the time being, Shalltear...... Let’s put down that dagger with a tremendous amount of magic power......]","It might be just my imagination, but I felt like I heard the sound of something popping. And then, seeing the dagger that Alice took out of nowhere, Kuro and Fate-san’s faces turned pale.","[Authority Activated. Limited Loan Request...... Codename: Abyss Tartarus.]","[......Ahh, I can’t move...... The whole spatial axis is restrained. Fate-chan, this is probably gonna be bad, right?]","[I feel like something omnipotent is coming...... Shall-tan had such a hidden card huh......]","[This presence...... I remember sensing that from that battle in the God Realm...... Magnawell’s clone, this...... Is it possible that Shalltear is on good terms with Earth God?]","[Hmmm, I can’t imagine that monster God getting along with people from outside her world...... But it’s Shalltear after all. She must have done something amazing to achieve that.]","I feel like things are getting pretty crazy, but Kuro and Fate-san’s conversation felt somewhat relaxed.","Well, Alice and Fate-san are best friends, and she also gets along well with Kuro. Alice also had that evil...... or rather, a mischievous smile on her face so...... unnn. Well, I guess they quarrel because they are close......","And then, after seeing off the three who disappeared into some subspace somewhere, I wondered what I should do while left alone here.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Eh? That dagger calls out that omnipotent iron ball?]","Makina : [Unnn. I got a lot of them left around here, so I added it as a set!]","Serious-senpai : [The heck, that thing’s omnipotent. You’re treating it as if you just gave out a potato as a freebie......]"]},{"number":1505,"title":"Chapter 1505 - Seeking More Possibilities of Baby Castellas 10","paragraphs":["Now then, Kuro and Fate-san have been taken away by Alice. I think there’s probably gonna be some decisive moment-like battle going on in the subspace, but the question is what I should do now that I am left behind.","As I was thinking this, the view suddenly changed and I was teleported to the Sanctuary.","[......Arehh? The Sanctuary?]","[Since Kaito-san seemed to be free, the attentive lover that I am, I called you here to have some tea together with me so you won’t be bored waiting for them.]","[I- I see...... Thank you.]","She sure emphasized that “attentive lover” part a lot. I feel like her expression looked somewhat smug. Well, but I certainly was wondering what to do while the others left me behind, so I’m grateful for her offer.","I sat down at the seat that Shiro-san had prepared for me and drank tea. I feel like I’m starting to forget my original purpose for going around here and there...... seeking the possibilities of baby castellas.","[Isn’t it fine, forgetting it all together?]","[No, well...... Since I’ve already gone along with her this far, I’m going to stay with her on this until the end.]","[The God that I am, I will tell you my prediction. At first, she will make them seriously, but soon, she will start mixing multiple methods and ingredients, turning things chaotic......]","[Please stop with the nasty predictions. And most of all, I’m afraid that it’s going to come true.]","In fact, I did feel like that was going to happen. At the stage where she tries to make them right away, she will probably keep it safe at first, such as making baby castellas using rice flour...... Midway through, I think she’ll start rambling about the pursuit of possibilities, about how infinite it apparently was, and start mixing up a lot of different things.","It’s no exaggeration to say that whether or not that can be controlled well will make the difference between life and death when her creations actually get eaten. Let’s make a firm assumption hereafter and prepare for that.","[Well then, in preparation for Kaito-san who stands before a rough path, let’s have baby castellas as our teacakes.]","[......I’m troubled whether you’re being concerned or am harassing me———- Delicious!]","Even though I knew I was going to have to eat a mountain of baby castellas after this, I was hungry so I tried to eat some, and was surprised.","How should I say this...... It tasted really good. It doesn’t have a particularly special taste to it, but it was just the way I liked it.","[What are these baby castellas? They taste really great.]","[They’re baby castellas that change flavor depending on the person’s favorite taste. I just created them.]","[....................]","Then, wouldn’t this be the ultimate baby castella? In a way, this is just too perfect of a solution......","[I did serve it to Kuro before...... but she just started saying stuff along the lines of “Can one really say that being the most delicious makes it the ultimate?”, talking about philosophical things at length, so I remember ignoring what she was saying.]","[I can see that. I feel like she would talk endlessly about nonsensical stuff.]","[It really was long, so I stopped listening at all halfway through.]","[I think that’s the right choice.]","Somehow, I get the impression that what Kuro is looking for is the ultimate (conceptually speaking), and the time and trial-and-error to pursue such a thing are also part of the goal.","That’s why, even if the best-tasting baby castellas appeared with Shiro-san’s almighty power, that wouldn’t satisfy Kuro. She might say something like “If the process of getting there isn’t included, that isn’t enough”.","[Well, I guess for Kuro, improving baby castellas is kind of a hobby.]","[Maybe so. The reason why she likes it so much, even I don’t really know about it either......]","[Even if she were to explain that to me, I don’t think I would understand.]","[That’s right.]","Hearing my words, the corners of Shiro-san’s lips slightly lifted and chuckled. Since she must have known Kuro for a long time, she might be feeling half-exasperated and half-amused.","While I was thinking this, a black vortex appeared and Kuro appeared.","[Hey, Shiro! If you’re gonna bring Kaito-kun away, you could have at least told me something! I was so surprised when we returned and he wasn’t there. Well, I immediately knew right away that he was here in the Sanctuary since I can’t tell where he is......]","I might be digressing here, but since the Sanctuary disables all detection, it seems like it would be impossible to search for someone with Detection Magic while they’re in the Sanctuary.","Though I say that, in my case, I basically nullify that kind of magic with Shiro-san’s Blessing, so in the first place, it seems that I can’t be detected by anyone other than Kuro and a few other people.","And since Kuro and those few other people who can detect me know that I’m in close contact with Shiro, they can tell right away that I’m in the Sanctuary if they can’t detect me.","[Well, it doesn’t matter. We were going to come to Shiro’s place after visiting Fate-chan anyway......]","[Fumu, do you have business with me? As long as it’s not about the possibilities of baby castellas, let’s hear it.]","At any rate, there is one thing I’m concerned about now. That is, whether they will start another fight here......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Now then, have they finished gathering all suggestions now? In the LN, the result of mixing everything was a safe one...... but this time, with there being too many opinions mixed in, will things develop differently?]"]},{"number":1506,"title":"Chapter 1506 - Seeking More Possibilities of Baby Castellas 11","paragraphs":["The journey to seek out the possibilities of baby castellas, or rather, to ask around for it, came to an end with Shiro-san. Well, it certainly is time to call it quits, and since Kuro ended up fighting Shiro-san for the second time, we just decided it’s about time we start making prototypes.","We returned from the Sanctuary to my house and moved to the kitchen to make preparations. Given the size of my home, it’s natural, but the kitchen is too big for the number of people living there.","[Alright then, let’s get to cooking!]","[Unnn...... Unnn? Kuro, when did you put on an apron?]","[Ahh, this is just a variant of my usual coat.]","When I turned my gaze towards Kuro, she was wearing a black apron and had her hair tied up in a short ponytail. Seeing her like this feels refreshing, or rather, I’ve seen Kuro with a short ponytail a few times, but matching such a hairstyle with the apron makes her look pretty cute.","[You wearing an apron looks fresh and cute.]","[Eh? You think so? Ehehe, thanks!]","When I honestly praised her, Kuro happily smiled. Then, after a few moments, Kuro took out her notes with the suggestions we’d heard so far and spoke.","[......Now then, what should we try out? As expected, we don’t have enough time to try out everything.]","[Hmmm. You’re right...... I guess it would be good to start making rice flour baby castellas? It really depends on what kind of taste it has, but the fact that you can change the base of your baby castellas will likely increase the number of your options.]","[You’re right. If I remember correctly, from what Shalltear said, the texture is supposed to be chewy and feels light and fluffy, right? Well then, we first try making baby castella with rice flour, and then improve things from there!]","[Alright. Well, let’s do our best.]","The process to make baby castellas isn’t that difficult. As long as I have the ingredients and a baking mold, even I, who isn’t very good at cooking, can normally make them.","Kuro too, even though she usually has her baby castellas made by Ein-san, she also sometimes makes them herself like that time with the Sacred Tree Festival, so I have the impression that she can cook them normally.","In fact, the work went without a hitch, and in no time at all, the rice-flour baby castellas were ready.","[It’s done! They look pretty good.]","[Yeah, you did great with the baking temperature, and the smell is good too.]","[Let’s taste them right away! Here, Kaito-kun, ahhn.]","Kaito holds up a finished rice flour baby castella and offers it to me. It seems that she’s going to give me the first bite.","There’s nothing weird mixed in this time, so I gratefully open my mouth and take a bite.","[......Ah, it’s really chewy. The taste is simple, but this feels new. Here, you have some too, Kuro.]","[Ahhn....... It certainly is interesting. The taste is even better than I thought it would be, and like Shalltear said, it feels light and fluffy, and I feel like I can eat a lot of it.]","[Yeah, I think it would go well with chocolate.]","[That certainly sounds delicious. Alright, let’s improve this rice flour baby castella from here on out!]","It seems like Kuro’s plan this time was to focus on rice flour baby castellas. Just like how I recommended chocolate this time, it looks like we will be making a variety of flavors of rice flour baby castellas.","The aftertaste is quite refreshing and light, so it seems like it goes well with strong flavors. I think it would be delicious not only with chocolate, but also with jam.","As I had such thoughts in mind, I looked at Kuro and saw her plopping a huge tuna-like fish on a cutting board.","[......Wait a moment there, Kuro, what do you think you’re doing?]","[Eh? Like I said, for the improvement of baby castellas...... I will attempt putting in something solid into it......]","[No, no, even if you say that, you don’t just start with fish, right!? What’s more, it doesn’t look like you’re planning to knead the fish in the batter, just putting it in solid form...... That definitely wouldn’t match! It would definitely taste bad!!!]","[Kaito-kun, possibilities can sometimes exceed one’s expectations. I want to explore every corner of the possibilities of baby castellas!]","[Like I said, do you have to push the boundaries of what’s possible right from the start!?]","Starting out with fish with this flow of things, the Baby Castella Demon is just too scary. Moreover, she isn’t even denying that it doesn’t match...... pursuing possibilities with a mysterious expectation of “99.9% not matching, but there might be a 0.1% miracle that might happen”, that kind of thing is done after having conducted safe trials.","[Anyway, stop with the fish!]","[H- Hmmm. Well, if Kaito-kun says so...... Then, let’s go with a rockbird thigh......]","[For the time being, can’t you go with ingredient that are likely to go well with sweets!?]","Just when I thought she had given up on fish, she brought out poultry next...... I- I really can never be too careful. If I don’t keep an eye out on her, she’ll have preposterous baby castellas created before I knew it...... Let’s be careful.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I thought they were gonna go flirting along the way, but in the end, everything just blew up...... As expected of the Baby Castella Demon.]"]},{"number":1507,"title":"Chapter 1507 - Seeking More Possibilities of Baby Castellas 12","paragraphs":["The prototype of the baby castellas I’m now making with Kuro was created mainly with chocolate and jam for now. No, I was really tired...... If I let my guard down a bit, she would start pulling out strange ingredients and ramble about infinite possibilities, and I was desperate to stop her.","However, thanks to keeping an eye on her, I think we were able to make baby castellas that looked delicious without any problems.","[......We already made quite a few, so why don’t we go to my room and eat them?]","[I guess so. Somehow, without aiming for it, what we created was more fruit-based. I guess the odd-ones out would be the ones made of leaves of the Spirit Tree?]","[Kneading it to the dough gives it a deep green color...... but I wonder what kind of taste it will have? It looked matcha-flavored, but according to Sieg-san, these leaves seem to have a peculiar taste.]","[I’m curious about them myself, but since we’re at it, let’s compare them with the others!]","Well, there certainly are strange combinations mixed up, but since there are no ingredients mixed in that are obviously dangerous, I can eat them without worry.","Rather, I think this would be the most honest pursuit for baby castella arrangement. Rather than using meat or fish, ingredients that would make sweets delicious are actually chosen......","At any rate, we moved to my room with the finished baby castellas. There’s a lot here, both in variety and quantity, so it’s almost impossible for me to eat them all, but I’ll just leave that to Kuro, who can eat as much as she wants, while I would just sample them out and eat what I like.","[......So, do you want to try the one with the leaves of the Spirit Tree first?]","[Right. That’s what I’m most curious about after all.]","Since the Elves normally eat them, it shouldn’t taste so bad that it would be unpalatable, so I brought it to my mouth...... It has a deep green color like matcha, but it tastes like mint...... It has this refreshing flavor to it. Its flavors were also rather strong, as it seemed like it would wake one up from drowsiness...... I see. Indeed, it’s a flavor that would be disliked by people who don’t like it.","[It has a minty feel to it.]","[Indeed, it feels like a refreshing herb. Also, it has this slight grassy feel to it, so children who aren’t fond of such flavors wouldn’t like them. However, the aftertaste is refreshing and invigorating, so it might be delicious when combined with something.]","[Ah~~ Indeed, the flavor is quite strong, but the refreshing feeling after eating it is nice. It would be delicious even if made into something like choco mint.]","[Sounds great. It’s because it has a stronger flavor than mint that it can be combined with a variety of strong flavors.]","It’s true that with just this alone, it would have a bit too strong of a flavor, but combined with other flavors, I feel like it will be an interesting flavor. Unnn, this would definitely bring about a very legitimate pursuit of a possibility...... This is great. Seeking the possibilities of baby castellas originally should be like this.","You don’t just throw in fish in it, or use frog meat to make some baby castellas shining gold...... It should be like this......","[......If I want to match this refreshingness, white fish would do......]","[....................]","You there, you’re talking about matching that with just the leaves of the Spirit Tree, right? You aren’t planning for some demonic combination inside baby castellas, right?","That refreshing herb-like flavor certainly might go well with white fish, but adding all that to baby castellas is just a completely superfluous addition.","[K- Kuro, let’s try the next one!]","[Eh? Ahh, you’re right. This one...... Hmm~~ The jam-filled one is delicious.]","[Kuro likes fruity flavors a lot after all.]","[Unnn. They have stable sweetness and deliciousness. Strawberry jam is good, but I think the one with marmalade is refreshing and delicious. Here, Kaito-kun, you try it out too. Ahhn.]","[......Unnn. It’s delicious. It’s a classic, but it’s a combination you can’t go wrong with.]","Jam-filled baby castellas would generally be quite delicious. Well, baby castellas and jam originally go well together, so I feel like there’s no chance this combination would go wrong.","It’s just, this combination could make it a little too sweet, so if I’m going to make jam-filled ones, it might be better if the baby castellas themselves are made a little less sweet. However, it would go quite well with coffee, so it’s great.","[Hmmm, even so, seeking the possibilities of baby castellas with Kaito-kun like this is fun!]","[......Well, I guess trying all sorts of things certainly was fun?]","[Ehehe, let’s do this again.]","[Just in moderation, okay?]","While stroking the head of Kuro, who was leaning against me with a happy smile, I wryly smiled. Well, there certainly were troublesome parts and surprising developments, but I had fun going around with Kuro and making baby castella through trial and error with her.","As long as there were no odd combinations involved, it was fun to the extent that I thought it might be nice to accompany her on these kinds of things occasionally.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Unnn. That’s a good ending to the arc. Let’s go to the next one!]","? ? ? : [No, don’t you think there might still be sugar development from here?]","Serious-senpai : [......Stop...... Stop it.]"]},{"number":1508,"title":"Chapter 1508 - After Seeking the Possibilities of Baby Castellas","paragraphs":["For the time being, the pursuit for the possibilities of baby castellas is over...... No, according to Kuro, there is no end to the possibilities of baby castellas, but for the time being, I guess I can consider that today’s matter is over.","After eating dinner and taking a bath, I went back to my room to stretch my body and relax.","I’m tired from all the traveling around, so I want to take a good rest...... If I had to point out a problem, I guess it would be that Kuro looked intent on staying the night? Well, if baby castellas aren’t involved, I don’t really find anything tiring from hanging out with her, so I think I can spend my time with her leisurely.","[Kaito-kun, thank you for today.]","[No, even with all the things that happened, I had a good time too.]","[Ehehe, I’m glad to hear that. Alright, since we’re at it, let’s go watch stars on the balcony.]","[Sounds great. I also wanted to relax leisurely too......]","Seeing Kuro smile brightly makes me feel calmer. The weather is nice today anyway, so I feel like the stars above the skies would look beautiful.","When I went out to the balcony with Kuro, the ground below her feet undulated like waves and a familiar tatami mat appeared.","[Oh, there’s that tatami mat again.]","[For stargazing with Kaito-kun, having a tatami mat is the standard!]","[Come to think of it, tatami mats sure appear quite often.]","It’s a bit surreal, sitting on a tatami mat on a Western-style balcony and stargazing on it, but that is exactly what I had done since the first day I came to this world, so it’s something I’m rather used to.","I think it was the same on the first day, back when I first had barbecue with Kuro, and on the night of the Sacred Tree Festival...... We were lying down on a tatami mat.","[Now, now, Kaito-kun. Here, here!]","[Hmmm...... Then, if you’ll excuse me......]","Kuro sat down and patted her thighs. It seemed like she was going to give me a lap pillow, so I took her upon her words and laid down.","Her soft touch and her warmth...... Looking up, there’s also Kuro’s gentle smile...... Unnn, it’s comforting, or rather...... It’s like, I feel like this is happiness.","Kuro’s hand moves and gently caresses my head. Hmmm, I feel very happy and comfortable here, but there’s just this one drawback...... laying down like this makes me look at Kuro more, so I can’t see much of the stars.","[As I thought, I really like having Kaito-kun on my lap like this~~ Somehow, really feeling that Kaito-kun is nearby makes me feel happy.]","[......Me too. For some reason, I feel relieved lying on your lap like this, Kuro.]","[I see...... If you feel that way, I’m happy too.]","Hearing my words, Kuro gently smiled, brought her face closer, and kissing me lightly on my forehead, she smiled.","How should I say this...... I felt my heart skipping a beat by Kuro, who seemed more mature than usual, but it wasn’t fun to keep on being at a loss by her attacks, so just as Kuro was raising her head back, I abruptly lifted my head and surprised her with a kiss of my own, before returning back to her lap.","[......Ahh, got surprise attacked.]","[You’re the one who surprise attacked first though.]","[Fufu, I guess you’re right~~]","Looking at Kuro, who seemed to be having fun from the bottom of her heart, I couldn’t help but smile. How should I say this...... I think it’s a happy thing to be able to enjoy even the smallest things in life.","[......Well, that being said, you haven’t been looking at the stars, you know?]","[Ahaha, you’re right. I had just been looking at Kaito-kun. Let’s save all the gazes to Kaito-kun for later and look at the stars for now.]","[The starry sky looks pretty good today. I mean, the starry sky has always been beautiful when I look at it with Kuro.]","[Well, I certainly am proposing stargazing on great days, but it certainly is always beautiful.]","Maybe I can see the stars more beautifully than usual because I’m watching them together with Kuro, but as expected, I’m too embarrassed to actually say it out loud......","[But perhaps, I feel that the stars look prettier than usual because I’m with my beloved Kaito-kun.]","[...................]","[Unnn? What’s the matter?]","[Ahh, no, I was just thinking the exact same thing, so I’m a little surprised.]","[Ehehe, we’re the same then.]","[Right.]","Exchanging looks with each other, Kuro and I laughed. How should I say this...... I’m strangely happy feeling as if our hearts were in sync, making me feel like my love towards Kuro grew even stronger.","As if guided by this rising emotion, I looked up and kissed Kuro again, who was already waiting for me with her eyes closed. Although there was a beautiful starry sky above us, I had a feeling that my eyes would be fixed on Kuro for a while.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [T- This is...... a surprise attack! T- That’s cowardly......]","? ? ? : [Isn’t it just the usual?]","Serious-senpai : [......Well...... That is, umm...... Well......]","T/N: It’s that day again. A new update for the nocturne fanfic. Click HERE to check it out."]},{"number":1509,"title":"Chapter 1509: 1509 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Past 1 ~ ~","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I apologize for the delay in the popularity poll extra chapter, as I have not had time to write the extra chapter in addition to my work + daily updates + working on the LN.","To be honest, I wish I had done this earlier, but I decided to write these chapters as part of the regular updates instead of a separate one.","And so, the extra chapter of Isis, which won the first place in the popularity poll, is now starting. Some parts will be partly referencing the LN, but it will be very different.","This arc will consist of Past, Present, and Future.","There was once a being in an empty space with no ups and downs, and no lefts and rights. A space no one knows how vast it was.","When that being acquired an ego, the first thing it felt...... was an inexpressible sense of solitude and loneliness. Therefore, the being sought for another, beings other than itself.","However, the being did not have the great power one would describe as omnipotent, and to just create a place...... a world that held no land nor life, it could only be accomplished by scraping off parts of its existence.","That being used most of its power to create the world. It lost most of its power. Most of the things it had been able to do as a matter of course were no longer possible.","But even so, if it healed the deep loneliness that welled up in its heart, the being thought it wouldn’t mind...... and having used up almost all of its power, the being fell into a long sleep.","Holding hope within its heart that the next time it wakes up, many lives other than itself are flourishing in the world it created......","After an unknown amount of years, the being awoke from its long and deep sleep, and rejoiced that there was so much life in the world it had created.","Finally, it would be relieved of its loneliness...... with the power to speak and convey its intentions to others. However, even though it had lost this ability as a price for creating the world, it still had one power that remained in its perfect form...... “the authority to connect its heart with others”. By using this power, it believed that it could communicate and emotionally connect with many lives.","The being had always been alone until now. It has never been in contact with others and has existed in a world of nothingness with an indescribable sense of loneliness.","Of course, it had never communicated with another person before...... so it didn’t know.","It didn’t know that it held a special kind of magic power that could “dye the hearts of others with deep despair”.","The being that connected its heart with others, feeling nearly liberated from its long loneliness, dyed most of the world in despair...... and ending up becoming known as the “Great Evil God of Despair”, it was sealed away by the beings it created.","Why? How did this happen? It just didn’t want to be alone, even though all it wanted was to share warmth with others...... However, even when it wanted to shout its thoughts out, it no longer had the ability to speak, and the Great Evil God once again fell into a long sleep.","After another long time passed, the seal of the Great Evil God was broken. With a sense of loneliness that had swelled to the point of being unbearable, the Great Evil God connected its heart with all living beings in the world once again...... enveloping the world in despair.","However, not all people’s hearts were dyed in despair. Despite being enveloped by the magic power of despair, a single girl who continued to hold onto hope became the gathering point for hope from all over the world. At that moment, the Hero of Hope was born, leading to the defeat of the Great Evil God.","Not wanting to disappear in solitude without obtaining anything it wanted, it gathered the last of its strength and flung its soul out of the world.","Without knowing where it would end up or what would happen to it...... There, it encountered the personified End of a Story, marking the end of the one who was called the Great Evil God of Despair and the beginning of a new existence...... Though that would be a different story altogether.","The place where it...... she was born was a battlefield stained with blood, where numerous corpses lay.","After a battle in which two species fought against each other, a grand one even in the Demon Realm, she suddenly appeared.","[...........................]","With snow-white hair and skin, blood-red eyes, and a beautiful dress, her great presence made itself known in the midst of the battlefield.","Soon after, the eyes of the warriors of both species were drawn to that being. However, it wasn’t that their eyes were involuntarily drawn by the being’s beauty, but instead, they reflexively turned their heads reflexively to the presence that was so repulsive and sinister.","Immediately afterward, jet-black magic power was released from the being. It wasn’t that she unleashed any magic, that was purely her magic power leaking out of her body...... magic power that didn’t even hold any hostile intent. It was just a spontaneous release of magic power, an act conducted naturally like that of a newly awakened creature yawning.","And with that single act...... Tens of thousands of lives that gathered on the battlefield died.","Floating in midair, clad in pale blue light, the being turned her gaze to the surroundings for the first time. Numerous corpses lay around her, unaware that it was her who had taken all these lives...... The girl with an innocent-looking face muttered.","[......Lonely.]","That was the moment of birth of Isis Remnant, she who would later be called Death King, and at the same time, the first word she uttered in her life.","The girl in a blue dress floats through the land of the Demon Realm. With the feeling of loneliness welling up in her heart, she seeked out others......","Soon after, the girl found a small monster. Her face breaking into a smile, the girl approached the monster...... only for the monster to quickly die out.","[......Why?]","Picking up the corpse of the monster that suddenly died without a word, she looked around her.","Why did this monster die?","Why are the surrounding plants and trees withering?","Why is the ground cracking and turning black?","The girl was indeed a newborn being. However, as she was born from the magic power of the dead, she was born with a certain amount of intelligence and knowledge.","That is why it didn’t take her long to realize that it was her fault.","Several years had passed since the girl realized that she was the one who had sprinkled death around. Even as the feeling of loneliness festers in her heart, the girl has yet to be touched by even a single warmth.","Alone and lonely, the girl hugged her knees, sitting in the desolate wilderness.","Her body doesn’t require food or sleep, but for some reason, she was terribly sleepy at that moment. As she closed her eyes, her consciousness sank as if drawn to something.","And then———— she had a dream.","A sky covered in thick clouds, a snowy field with nothing but black snow falling all over...... and seemingly reflecting the heart of the girl, there was only one shadow standing in that lonely world.","Someone in a tattered robe, with a body shape similar to her, though her face was not visible.","[......Who...... are you?]","“......I am you.”","[......Me?]","“......We are the Incarnation of Death. A being who reaps life, scattering despair around us. You need not seek warmth anymore, for the day you’ll acquire it will never come.”","[ ! ? ]","The girl clad in shadows spun her words in exactly the same voice as her. Though she herself hadn’t said it out loud, it was a thought that she had been harboring in her heart for the past few years.","[......You’re wrong.]","“What I say isn’t wrong. What we’re clad in is the magic power of death.”","[......Magic power...... of death?]","“Yes, we are the incarnation of death...... The magic power we’re clad in reaps lives, a cold, malevolent force that extinguishes the flames of beings’ souls. Who is it that would accept a being like us?”","[...................]","Is this really just a dream? The girl questioned, but the other girl, all too aptly, continues to speak of the darkness that has begun to emerge in her heart.","[......That...... isn’t the case...... It was just that...... I haven’t met them yet.]","“Is that so? If you feel that way, then so be it. However, do not forget this...... There will be no one who will accept us in the real sense of the word. Expecting something that doesn’t exist will only hurt us...... That’s something you must not forget.”","And with those words, the girl woke up from her dream. She was asleep for only a few minutes. But after waking up, the landscape around her seemed much colder and lonelier than before.","A few more years passed, exactly 10 years after the girl was born...... That being appeared.","[Hello there. Are you the girl I’ve heard so much about?]","[......Who?]","[My name is Kuromueina. Nice to meet you.]","A conversation with the brightly smiling Kuromueina...... For the girl, it was the first time in her life.","That is why the girl’s heart was filled with joy and sadness at the same time.","[......Don’t...... go any closer.]","[......Why?]","[......If you...... get closer...... You will die.]","This person was the first one who didn’t run away from her and exchanged words with. Not wanting to kill such a person, the girl spoke words of warning.","However, Kuromueina, after smiling slightly, approached the girl without stopping.","[......Don’t...... approach.]","[It’s alright. I won’t die...... You won’t kill me.]","While telling her this in a gentle voice, Kuromueina approached her...... and gently embraced the girl with a look of mixed fright and loneliness on her face.","[See, I’m alright, aren’t I?]","[......Uuu...... Unnn.]","It was the first time for the girl to feel the warmth of another person...... and when she felt it, big tears streamed down from her eyes.","[Well then, once again, hello there. If you don’t mind, could you tell me your name?]","[......I don’t...... have a name.]","[Is that so? In that case, I’ll give you one...... Let’s see, your name will be...... Isis! You are Isis Remnant!]","[......Isis...... Remnant...... my...... name.]","Tears seemingly not stopping from leaking out of her eyes, the girl...... Isis murmured the name given to her.","Thereupon, Kuromueina released Isis from her embrace and reached out her hand to her with a dazzling smile on her face.","[Isis, do you want to come with me? You have a lot of magic power, but it seems you can’t control it properly...... If you want, I will teach you various things.]","[ ! ? ]","Those were words that made Isis extremely happy. That’s why, without hesitation, she held onto the held-out hand. After that would be days free from the painful, cold loneliness...... is what she thought.","Yes, Isis had forgotten. She completely forgot the words told to her by her other self in her dream, only thinking of her happiness.","Accompanied by Kuromueina, Isis came to her house, spontaneously laid down on the bed in the room given to her and closed her eyes.","As if someone was calling her...... She really felt sleepy......","Then, she found herself in that place again. In the field of black snow, with her other self clad in a black robe......","“So, you’ve come again.”","[......What you said before...... It was a lie...... Kuromueina...... She...... She accepted me...... She...... She held out her hand to me.]","“......Is that really so?”","[......What do you mean?]","While Isis happily told her this, the other Isis asked back in the same cold tone as before. As if to say that Isis is mistaken......","“Indeed, Kuromueina held out her hand to us. However, does that really mean she accepts us?”","[......Kuromueina did...... She accepted me......]","“We can’t kill Kuromueina. Kuromueina is much stronger than we are...... That’s all there is to it.”","[......What...... What are you saying!?]","Before she knew it, Isis found herself raising her voice. She doesn’t know why, but the words of the being in front of her really bothered her.","“If you hadn’t realized it yet, then that’s fine for now. However, don’t forget...... Kuromueina is not the being we seek. You may only feel a slight discomfort at first, but as time goes on, this discomfort will grow larger.”","[ ! ? ......You...... What do you even know!?]","“......I would know this. You are me, and I am you...... That’s why, I would know. I’m sure someday, you’ll realize it too...... You’ll end up realizing it. Realizing that we would have been happier if we didn’t realize it, for doing so would only lead us to greater suffering.”","[......That...... won’t happen.]","“......Is that so? If that were the case...... That would be great.”","Those lonely words echoing in her ears, Isis regained consciousness, with an unexplainable thorn in the back of her mind......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [At the beginning, it seems like the monologue of the Great Evil God of Despair has been added......]","? ? ? : [It seems that the Great Evil God is involved as an important key in a certain scene in the Present.]"]},{"number":1510,"title":"Chapter 1510: 1510 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Past 2 ~ ~","paragraphs":["Isis came to Kuromueina, and the next day after her first night of her stay in Kuromueina’s residence, she was introduced to the people who lived in the same house. Though I say that, there were actually just two other people here......","[Well then, Isis, let me introduce you. This child is Ein!]","[Nice to meet you, I welcome your visit. I am Ein, Kuromu-sama’s servant.]","[......Ah...... N- Nice to meet you...... Isis...... Errr...... Servant?]","[That’s just something Ein says on her own, so don’t worry about it.]","[Kuromu-sama! I have made up my mind. In order to repay the great debt of gratitude I owe to Kuromu-sama who took care of me, I will show my utmost dedication through the path of a servant...... Yes, I will strive to become a perfect servant, to the point where I may even be called the very definition of a “follower”!!!]","[......Ah, unnn. Well, good luck with that.]","[Yes!]","Seeing Ein’s declaration while clenching her fist, Kuromueina threw vague words of encouragement with a slightly exasperated expression on her face. Even those words seemed to have a tremendous effect on Ein, making her motivated enough to think that one could see flames behind her.","Seeing her like that though, Isis confusedly asked Ein.","[......Umm...... Is Ein...... not afraid...... of me?]","[Afraid? Ahh, I see, you do have quite a fierce magic power. However, there’s no problem with it. The servant that I am shall not show a pitiable appearance before her master. Feeling abnormalities from magic power of this level is unbefitting of a servant.]","[......Well, Ein is strong and won’t be intimidated by Isis’ magic power. The other child would also be fine...... right?]","After seeing Ein, not cowering in fear at her magic power unlike other creatures, Isis looked slightly relieved as she smiled. Seemingly happy that she was able to meet someone who doesn’t fear her like Kuromueina......","She then turned her attention to the other person in the room...... a being that had taken the form of a gigantic magical beast exceeding 10m...... Megiddo.","[Rather than intimidated, I’m feeling excited instead. Don’t you look like a strong-looking guy!? Ou, you said you’re Isis, yeah?]","[......U- Unnn.]","[I’m Megiddo, nice to meet ya. Well then, since we’ve finally met, for the sake of understanding each other, let’s fight!]","[......Eh? ......Fight?]","[That’s right! Living creatures come to an understanding with each other through battles! ......No, you look like a ghost of some sort, but if you have a will, you’re a living creature!!!]","For Megiddo, who could be described as a battle maniac, Isis, who is clad in tremendous magic power, is a rather welcome opponent, seemingly making them itching to fight.","This was a reaction unlike any she had seen before, and so, looking clearly bewildered, Isis’ gaze moved to the side.","[......Ah...... Errr...... I don’t...... really know how to fight.]","[What!? Even though you have that amazing amount of magic power?]","[......U- Unnn...... I’ve never...... fought anyone.]","Her words aren’t a lie. Isis has never engaged in anything like a battle. Most creatures just die when they get too close to her, and those who don’t quickly flee.","The people she had properly interacted with would just be Kuromueina, Isis and Megiddo.","[Well, I’m gonna teach her how to fight after this.]","[......Hmmm. There’s that! You’ll learn how to fight by actually fighting! And so, how about you and I......]","[Megiddo? How about you and I make things clear between us?]","[Ahh, no, that’s a bit...... I’ll restrain myself.]","Apparently, Megiddo can’t raise their head against Kuromueina, as the words Kuromueina said with a smile made their huge body shrink.","After chuckling at the situation, Kuromueina called out to Isis.","[Ahh, as you can see, there’s a big tree next to my house, right? That’s a World Tree. The World Tree is a powerful mass of vitality, so you don’t have to worry. It won’t wither even if Isis approaches it.]","[......That’s a big tree...... Amazing.]","[Well, there are still a lot of things you don’t know, so I think you may be worried, but I’ll be teaching you all that...... I’ll be in your care from now on.]","[......Ahhh...... Unnn!]","Looking at the three who welcomed her with warm smiles, Isis happily smiled with tears in her eyes. Feeling that the place she had been seeking for was here......","The snowy field covered with thick clouds. Beneath the falling snow, Isis was once again facing her other self with a black hood over her head.","“You’ve come again.”","[......It isn’t just Kuromueina...... Ein...... Megiddo...... They accepted me...... This place...... This is where I belong.]","“Is that so? If that’s what you think, then so be it. However, I think otherwise...... This place isn’t your place. At least, it isn’t the place you wanted.”","[......That...... isn’t true.]","“Do you really think so? The way I see it, I think you’re just trying to compromise on something similar...... It’s fine, you need not mind me. If you had really found the place you belong to, that is fine, but if not...... There will come a day...... when you’d eventually realize it.”","At the words her other self spoke, Isis couldn’t immediately say “You’re wrong”. She doesn’t know why. Even though she thinks that the words of the being in front of her are wrong...... Somewhere in her heart, she found herself accepting those words.","She couldn’t understand the reason why. However, there was this indescribable eerie feeling in her heart...... that the being in front of her seems to know more about Isis than even she herself does.","......Without her knowledge, it seemed as if the snow falling on the snowy field was increasing in force.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [A Maid Fanatic back when the word maid didn’t exist in the world yet...... You sure can feel her youth. Even so, even though she swapped out different words, she was still saying similar things back then......]"]},{"number":1511,"title":"Chapter 1511: 1511 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Past 3 ~ ~","paragraphs":["The land of the Demon Realm dyed in red, flames that destroy everything surges like a tsunami. They were flames that burned everything, even melting the earth on its path, but immediately after that, pale cold air hit the flames, trapping the flames in ice.","It would normally be impossible for flames to be frozen, but the cold air, which was created by magic, isn’t ice naturally existing in this world, capable of freezing even flames.","Seeing the tsunami of flames transforming into a wall of ice, Megiddo charged forward and shattered the ice. Their huge body enveloped in black flames, and their size, coupled with the way their steps crushed the earth, make them look like the very embodiment of destruction.","On the other hand, Isis, who is too small compared to Megiddo, clad in pale light and floating in the air...... Without being perturbed by the approaching Megiddo, she brought forth a huge magic circle behind her.","Thereupon, the black flames wrapped around Megiddo collided with the white cold air unleashed by Isis, causing a huge explosion. It was an explosion so large that it’s hard to know how many kilometers in radius were blown away. However, both of them, standing at the center of such an explosion, dispersed the nearby smoke as if nothing happened.","[Hahaha, well~~ You really are strong, Isis. That magic power of yours is especially interesting. For the clash of our magic of the same level to result in mine getting outclassed, that means your magic power is special, right?]","[......Unnn...... Regarding my magic power of death...... Kuromueina said...... she doesn’t quite understand it either.]","[Well, it definitely is an unusual magic power. Even with magic power control techniques as efficient as yours, it doesn’t seem to be suppressed.]","[......However...... Compared to before, I’m now able to control it...... Creatures no longer die just by getting close to me...... This is thanks to Kuromueina.]","Megiddo smiled satisfactorily at the fierce battle, while Isis had a slightly troubled expression on her face. Some years have passed since she arrived in Kuromueina’s home, and under Kuromueina’s guidance, Isis had acquired an extremely high level of skill in controlling magic power.","Thanks to this, she was able to suppress her magic power of death to some extent...... but even so, she was still unable to completely suppress it, only being able to narrow the range of its effects or slightly weaken it.","It was good that she stopped indiscriminately killing plants and other living creatures around her, but in the end, the fact that the creatures that encountered her escaped in her presence remained unchanged. Even so, her situation was much better than before, so Isis was sincerely grateful to Kuromueina.","While they were talking like this, they heard Kuromueina’s voice.","[Megiddo~~ Isis~~ It’s time to take a break, how about we drink some tea?]","[Ou!]","[......Alright.]","After nodding to Kuromueina’s words, Isis snapped her fingers and a Spatial Isolation Barrier covering their surroundings was lifted. The two of them then moved to a table in front of the huge World Tree.","Kuromueina was already seated, and Ein had prepared drinks for each of them.","[......Even so...... This place...... sure is peaceful...... Back when it was just me...... everywhere I went...... there were always people fighting.]","[Unnn? Ahh, of course, this place’s peaceful. The only people who would mess with Kuromueina’s residence are the suicidal chaps. You may not know this, Isis, but Kuromueina is famous for being the most powerful in the Demon Realm.]","[......So that’s how it is...... Amazing.]","[Hmmm, it’s simply because I had traveled around the Demon Realm for a long time. Those were just traces of that time that made me strangely famous.]","Even though Kuromueina said that with a wry smile, in fact, the words Megiddo said were the truth. The name of Kuromueina, the strongest being in the Demon Realm, is widely known in the Demon Realm, and even the inhabitants of the Demon Realm, who fight daily under the ideology that strength is justice, recognize and acknowledge that only Kuromueina stands on a pedestal on a different level from others.","So much so that if Kuromueina sets out to have the Demon Realm under her rule, the most famous and powerful people would lower their heads in front of her and accept her as the ruler of the Demon Realm in a matter of days......","[In fact, this place had become something like a non-aggression zone, but the Demon Realm is still the same, with battles still happening here and there every day. The strong people out there are made up of strong colleagues of mine, so unless something special happens, nothing will change. Well, if Kuromueina is going to rule the Demon Realm, then that is a different story.]","[I have no intention of doing that. Not like them fighting is that bad anyway. I’m not saying that strength is justice, but that doesn’t mean being weak makes people justice either. If people of different ideologies live together, there would inevitably be times when those ideas clash. The current state of the Demon Realm is also a way of being for a world, and I have no intention of denying others their way of life...... Well, if people ask me to help them or mediate between two camps, I’ll cooperate with them.]","Kuromueina is a gentle and calm person, but there was this part of her that was indifferent to everything that isn’t related to those she calls family. Whether it’s the strong or the weak, whether their surroundings consider them good or bad, she would regard them all impartially.","Megiddo and Isis knew this themselves and didn’t say anything more. Instead, Isis moved her gaze toward Ein, who was preparing a cake.","[......Ein...... Is something wrong?]","[......I blundered.]","[......Blundered? ......With the cake? ......I think it’s beautifully done though.]","[No, it’s wasted. Look here. The cream is misshapen.]","Looking at Ein, who had a frustrated expression on her face, Isis tilted her head and asked, to which Ein pointed at the cake she was making with an annoyed expression on her face.","Indeed, just as Ein said, the cream in the part of the cake she was pointing to looked slightly distorted...... but it was almost unnoticeable.","[Nah, isn’t it fine enough already?]","[That isn’t good. Also, I don’t like the solidness of the sponge, and I could have also cut the fruits better! As someone who aspires to be the perfect servant, I can’t accept such a level of quality...... Anyhow, I will rewind time and rebuild it again, so please wait for a while.]","[No, how many times do you think you’ve done that before!?]","After expressing her complaints, Ein declared that she will rebuild the cake...... but this exchange really happens every time they’re having tea, so it was no surprise that Megiddo would reflexively retort.","Ein is a perfectionist, and she hates making compromises, so she does a lot of remakes until she’s satisfied with her creations. Even so, with Ein’s current skill, she was unable to create her ideal finished product, making her look dissatisfied at moments such as this time.","[No, that’s enough already, so let’s just eat.]","[......Ugh, if Kuromu-sama says so...... Haahhh...... I’m still a long way from being the perfect servant.]","This type of exchange would generally continue until Kuromueina finally stops Ein. Even with a dissatisfied expression on her face, they saw Ein following Kuromueina’s words and arranging the cake, making the three of them smile wryly.","[It’s alright to compromise in an adequate spot, you know?]","[Megiddo, compromise is something that I, who aspires to be the perfect servant, should avoid the most. A true servant is someone who always strives for the ultimate and stands by the side of perfection!]","[......Errr...... I don’t really understand what you mean...... but do your best.]","Ein’s current state, as she passionately talked about her ideology, was something Isis was already familiar with, so she just wryly smiled and started eating her cake.","[I’d have liked something spicy than sweet food though. Hey, Ein. Can you make a spicy cake?]","[Does it really have to be a cake?]","[I don’t really care what it looks like as long as it tastes good.]","[That certainly is like you, but you being like that makes you someone not worth cooking for.]","With an exasperated expression on her face at Megiddo’s words, who was being simple-minded in a sense, Ein brewed her own tea and sat down.","After watching this scene, seemingly as if she thought of something, Isis asked Kuromueina.","[......Kuromueina...... Do you have...... any favorite snacks?]","[Me? Hmmm, I like cakes...... but I’d like something I can hold in one hand and eat in one bite.]","[......Like cookies?]","[Cookies aren’t bad, but I just don’t feel that spark from them...... I suppose I prefer something with a softer texture? Like, having the cake become bite-sized...... Ahh, no, making cakes of that size would make the cream a hindrance in holding it huh? Hmmm, well, I just had this vague image in mind, so you don’t have to worry about me. I like everything, so I don’t really have a preference.]","Although she had a vague image in her mind of what kind of sweets she preferred, it was difficult for her to explain it, so Kuromueina could only wryly smile.","Enticed by that, Isis and the others also smiled. In the Demon Realm riddled with strife, the atmosphere in that place was strangely calm and warm.","As Isis reflected upon such happiness, a certain someone’s voice inadvertently crossed her mind.","————-Someday, you’ll realize it too...... Realizing that we would have been happier if we didn’t realize it......","Feeling as if she saw her other self standing still in the field of black snow, Isis shook her head slightly...... as if to shake off the indescribable anxiety within her mind......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Just when I thought it was gonna be full serious, a sudden heartwarming development arrived!?]","? ? ? : [Ein-san when she was still inexperienced, Kuro-san when she still hadn’t happened upon baby castellas, and when her thoughts were still close to that of Shallow Vernal-sama...... And then, there’s that gorilla that’s no different from the present. Only that gorilla hadn’t changed.]"]},{"number":1512,"title":"Chapter 1512: 1512 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Past 4 ~ ~","paragraphs":["About a hundred years after Isis arrived at Kuromueina’s place, she stood in front of the World Tree, a huge tree right next to Kuromueina’s home.","From what she heard from Kuromueina, this tree used to be the size of an ordinary tree, but over the years, it has grown larger and has now become so huge that it almost pierced the skies.","Keeping a short distance from it, Isis spoke to this huge tree.","[......So...... Ein had made new clothes again...... and she had been complaining about it...... Saying that even though it’s practical...... It apparently wasn’t elegant enough...... It’s amazing...... how she can make a lot of things though.]","Ein, who aims to be the perfect servant, has acquired skills in various fields, including ones related to the creation of clothing. Of course, at their level, normal materials wouldn’t hold up during battle, so in the end, she was constructing them with magic power, but Ein says that the best way to make something perfectly is to try making the real thing.","However, it seems that she’s finding it difficult to create something satisfactory, as she repeated the process over and over again.","As she talked about this, Kuromueina came floating from the sky.","[I’m back~~]","[......Welcome home...... Is the battle in the west...... settled?]","[Unnn. I somehow managed to find a common ground for both sides. Well, the root of the problem still remains, so they’d probably clash with each other again...... Isis, you talking with the World Tree again?]","Kuromueina, who is called the Strongest in the Demon Realm, is often called as a mediator in complicated battles, and this time, she returned after taking charge of the discussion between two species that were in an intense conflict with each other.","After talking about it with a wry smile, Kuromueina asked while looking at the World Tree, Isis nodded her head.","[......Unnn...... I’m sure the World Tree...... being alone here...... is also lonely.]","[I see. Isis is very kind.]","Isis often talks to the World Tree like this. Of course, being a tree, she doesn’t get any response from the World Tree, but she often talks about what Kuromueina and the others were like.","Perhaps, because there are no other trees around, Isis could see the figure of the lone World Tree overlapping with the lonely her.","[But even so, I think it’s okay to not be that far away from it, right?]","[......If I get too close...... it might scare the World Tree.]","[I’m sure it will be fine. I’ve told you this before, but the World Tree has tremendous magic power. Besides, the World Tree is older than Isis, so it should be alright now that you can control your magic power to some extent.]","[......You...... think so?]","Even though she had an uneasy expression on her face when she heard Kuromueina’s words, Isis slowly approached the World Tree. Seeing her like that, Kuromueina pondered.","(Even so, she still can’t fully control that magic power huh. Magic power that can’t be blocked by barriers or Defensive Magic...... Isis’ magic power is clearly superior to normal magic power. Its nature is close to that of Gods’ Authority...... resembling Ein’s Time Magic. Did she do something again? Geez......)","In fact, at this point in time, the people Kuromueina called her family, including Isis, had something in common. That is, they clearly have some factor that separates them from the other inhabitants of the Demon Realm.","Ein has the ability to manipulate time, an ability much superior than magic, Megiddo has abnormal combat power and destructive impulses, and Isis has her peculiar magic power...... and she was convinced that Shallow Vernal, her half-body was involved.","Astounded at her half-body, who was experimenting on people as she pleases, she watched as Isis reached out to touch the World Tree.","[......A- Are you sure...... it will...... be alright?]","[It will be alright. Even if your magic is peculiar, Isis is a very gentle child. I’m sure the World Tree itself knows that.]","[......U- Unnn.]","Encouraged by Kuromueina’s words, Isis reached out to the World Tree. Just as her timidly stretched-out hand touched the World Tree, “a hand that came out of the World Tree” held Isis’ hand.","“......Yes, no matter what kind of magic power you have, I can feel your kind heart.”","[......Eh?]","In front of the startled Isis, the trunk of the World Tree moved and a woman with hair made of leaves appeared from within. Isis was bewildered, not knowing what had just happened, but the nearby Kuromueina nodded, seemingly having comprehended something.","[Are you perhaps the incarnation of the World Tree?]","“Yes. “Nice to meet you” is what I should say at a moment like this, yes? Thank you for protecting me since I was a small tree. I had already been conscious even back then, but I still didn’t know how to materialize my form, so my greeting was delayed.”","[I see, so that kind of thing happens huh. This is the first time I’ve seen a being that isn’t a Demon, but an incarnation dwelling inside a tree. However, I’m glad I got to meet and talk with you like this. What should I call you?]","Seeing a being like the woman in front of her was also a first for Kuromueina, as she looked really curious about her. Nevertheless, as Kuromueina looked at her with a bright smile, the woman smiled back.","“My name as a tree is Yggdrasil...... but I would also like to get a name from you like everyone else, so would that be alright?”","[Okay. Let’s see...... Then, how about Lillywood?]","“Lillywood...... is a good name. Well then, I will call myself Lillywood Yggdrasil. I am in your care hereafter, Kuromueina, Isis.”","[Unnn. Nice to meet you.]","[......N- Nice to meet you...... Lillywood.]","As for the extremely rare being like Lillywood, after later discussions between Kuromueina and Lillywood, it was decided to call her a “Spirit”, and Lillywood, the Spirit of the World Tree, became the newest addition to Kuromueina’s family.","Isis is very happy about the addition of a new family member, and perhaps due to their compatible personalities, she and Lillywood quickly became good friends, and it didn’t take long for Lillywood to become the one she’s closest in her family.","Every day is full of life. Indeed, every day is happy and joyful...... She should have gotten what she wanted. But strangely enough, deep down within Isis, there still remained an indescribable sense of loneliness.","And as such thoughts lingered in her mind, she often dreamed of the other Isis standing in the snowfield. The other Isis never said a word to her. Unless Isis herself called out to her, she basically just stood there for a long time...... However, at the sight of this other Isis, she felt an indescribable sense of unease.","Silent as the other Isis may be, it was as if she was saying...... “You still haven’t gained anything”......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It’s actually refreshing seeing this part of the past. When it comes to snippets of the past, there was only that arc when Alice came to this world and a little story about Kuromueina, so the order of encounters around here had been a bit vague...... And even though it feels heartwarming, there was still seriousness scattered about, that’s why I’m also satisfied. Stuff like this is good......]"]},{"number":1513,"title":"Chapter 1513: 1513 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Past 5 ~ ~","paragraphs":["A few years had passed since the Spirit Lillywood joined Kuromueina’s family, and just when Lillywood had become a part of the family, another new member joined the family.","However, he was unlike the other members of the family. Next to Kuromueina’s home, the whole family looked up to a huge dragon.","[How should I say this...... He’s quite spectacular, isn’t it?]","[......You picked up another awesome one, Kuromueina.]","[......He’s big...... and has awesome magic power...... Isn’t he too strong for a monster?]","“Does that mean that if monsters live for many years and grow up, they will come to possess such powerful magic power?”","Ein, Megiddo, Isis, and Lillywood looked up to see a huge dragon that must have been over 500 meters tall. Kuromueina found him when she went out and brought him back the same way she did with Isis, but it was the first time for the four of them to see a monster of this size.","Later, Colossal-type Dragons began to appear, but at this point of time, even the largest Dragons were only tens of meters at most, so a monster of this size was truly out of the standard.","[I named this child Magnawell. As you can see, he’s a special child, so I thought I’d raise him here...... Ahh, by the way, just as I was saying, this child really is just a young child.]","[Huh? No, even when it’s this size?]","[Unnn. He’s still a child that hasn’t grown to adulthood yet. Born with this overwhelming magic power and physique...... Perhaps, he was born to become the king of monsters...... In the end, that guy probably had her hand on this again......]","[......Unnn? ......That guy?]","[Ahh, no, it’s nothing.]","Megiddo is astonished that Magnawell, who has too great of a magic power and physique, is still a child. Well, their astonishment is understandable, for if it’s already over 500m in a state where it hasn’t reached its growth period yet, it would be almost silly to think how big it would be when it grew up.","It’s a very non-standard creature, but Kuromueina seemed to have some idea in mind for the reason for its existence. However, even when Isis asked about it, she just dodged the question with a smile, seemingly not willing to talk about it.","[Well, in any case, everyone gets along with him, okay? With this much magic power, it should also not feel frightened of Isis.]","[......Unnn...... Alright...... I’m in your care...... Magnawell.]","Magnawell responds to those words with a roar that shakes the earth. At present, it seemed like he was unable to speak, but Kuromueina said that he would gradually teach him, so there was a high possibility that he would eventually be able to speak.","In the decades since Magnawell became a member of Kuromueina’s family, he has grown several times in stature and has acquired not only combat skills, but also a high level of intelligence, making it possible for him to communicate with others.","Although he is the youngest in the family, he speaks in a rather old-fashioned manner, but his family members, including Kuromueina, are already very old, so they don’t mind a few thousand years of age difference.","“Isis, do you know where Megiddo could be? I thought I’d ask them to accompany me for combat training......”","[......Errr...... There’s apparently some interesting fellow in the south who are going on a rampage...... and they say they’re going to fight...... Some sort of raging tempest...... or storm...... Anyway, they’re fighting something.]","“Ahh, I do feel like catching wind of such a thing. That a troublemaker had been going around claiming to be the strongest...... One can’t really claim to be the strongest with Kuromueina around, don’t you think?”","“Among the young Demons nowadays, it seems that Kuromueina is considered an exception, someone who is in a separate category. That’s why, when they say they’re the strongest...... They’re talking about if you exclude Kuromueina.”","In response to Magnawell’s words, Lillywood, who was hanging out with Isis, responded with a wry smile. She explains that it’s already a well-known fact in the Demon Realm that Kuromueina is the strongest, making her considered more like a legend. Hearing this, Magnawell has an indescribable expression on his face.","“What is with that...... I just couldn’t comprehend how the youngsters feel.”","[......Magnawell...... I think you’re also a youngster.]","“If anything, isn’t there a high probability that Magnawell is younger than that Demon?”","“Mhmm...... Mumu...... I can’t deny such a possibility.”","Magnawell is still around 100 years old, which is quite young compared to Isis and Lillywood. Nonetheless, at such a young age, it can already be said that he already stands among the most powerful in the Demon Realm, showing his tremendous talent......","“However, Megiddo may have been being the same as usual...... but there really is no end to the conflicts in the Demon Realm.”","“One who has once gained great power tends to desire even greater heights...... Perhaps, if all the bloodthirsty High-ranking Demons were to be killed, peace might come.”","[......That would be...... very difficult...... Strong Demons really are strong...... They’d also have a lot of troops.]","Although the Demon Realm is a place of constant strife, there is a power structure to some extent, where powerful people reign at the top of the hierarchy. Isis and the others all stand at the top of the Demon Realm, but there are multiple High-ranking Demons with abilities close to them.","In the first place, their leader, Kuromueina, had no intention of interfering in the Demon Realm’s way of life, so the girls didn’t feel like doing anything about it either.","“Well, we wouldn’t if some sort of trigger occurs hereafter, so perhaps, one day, the Demon Realm will suddenly become peaceful.”","“A Demon Realm not under Kuromueina’s rule? I can’t picture how such a thing is possible.”","Yes, a peaceful Demon Realm was still a pipe dream at this point, and even Magnawell and the others couldn’t even imagine it...... That a little while later, a being that joined their family not long after this, as Magnawell jokingly talked about, had actually eradicated all the wicked Demons and brought order to the Demon Realm in less than a hundred years......","[......If you want to train...... How about I help you?]","“Indeed, that would be great. I have some magic I’d like to try out. I’m sorry, but won’t you keep me company?”","[......Unnn...... Alright.]","But at this point in time, this being has not even appeared in this world. There was still some time before the transformation that would significantly change the lives of the Demon Realm, including the lives of the family, would come.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [You could say Alice had actually done one outrageous thing. I mean, she’s really like the ruler behind the scenes of the world. The person herself was more like an idiot though.]","? ? ? : [You asking for a beating? Even so, as expected of Alice-chan. Well, Alice-chan killed the villains of the Demon Realm more for her own purpose......]"]},{"number":1514,"title":"Chapter 1514: 1514 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Past 6 ~ ~","paragraphs":["Megiddo, who hadn’t been home to Kuromueina’s home for several days, returned. It wasn’t unusual for Megiddo to be away from home for a few days, as they sometimes goes out to fight when they heard rumors of a strong person, but this time, they unusually brought someone back with them.","Ozma, who had been brought to their home by Megiddo, had a stunned look on his face when he saw Isis and the others.","[Ou, I’m back!]","[......Welcome back...... Megiddo.]","“Who’s that guy?”","[Ahh, this guy’s called Ozma, he’s quite strong and I like him, so I brought him here. He’s quite the capable chap!]","[......Ahh~~ Hello, I’m Ozma. Anyhow, I’ve become Master Megiddo’s follower? Subordinate? Well, things turned out that way, so please kindly take care of me.]","After introducing himself in a leisurely tone, Ozma looked at Isis and Lillywood in front of him, and the huge Magnawell near the house. Then, when his gaze finally settled on the cooking Ein, he let out a sigh. Incidentally, Kuromueina isn’t here now because she was called in as a mediator.","[......Haahhh...... How should I say this...... It’s embarrassing how ignorant I am. I had heard of the Strongest in the Demon Realm, Kuromueina-sama, but for there to also be these incredible people out there, I can’t believe I thought I was the strongest.]","[You think so? When we fought, I think we had a pretty good match.]","[That is at the moment, yes? Even though I look like this, I’m confident in my ability to judge my opponent’s strength. I’m almost completely trained...... Well, I’ll probably only be able to get a little bit stronger over the years. However, all of these people, including Master, are still in the process of developing. Good grief, how dreadful this is.]","Just as Megiddo said, at this point in time, Ozma’s ability is close to that of Isis and the others. However, Ozma’s ability has already been trained to the point that it has almost reached its upper limit, whereas Isis and the others are still far from reaching their limits and can continue to grow, and Ozma felt that before long, he would be helplessly left behind by the others. Thus, he could only scratch his head with a wry smile.","[Well, in any case, please take care of me from now on.]","[......Unnn...... I’m also in your care...... Ozma.]","In this way, Ozma joined the group not as part of the family, but as Megiddo’s subordinate, and as she felt that the atmosphere became even more lively, Isis happily smiled.","Yes, Isis was really happy. She was convinced that her lonely days of solitude since her birth had become so lively, and that happy times would continue from now on.","Yes, that’s why, she forgot...... Since she came to Kuromueina’s home, she had rarely gone to other places...... lessening her chance to be aware of something early on.","She had forgotten what kind of effect the magic power of death she was clad on has on most people......","Some time after Ozma joined the group, Kuromueina was focusing on the creation of magic dolls. Her project wasn’t to create an ordinary magic doll, but a magic doll that grew like a living creature, and although she was still making experimental attempts, development was progressing smoothly.","“......Not to burst anyone’s bubble by saying this now, but this feels tantamount to creating life.”","[Unnn. That’s why I’m not eager to do this excessively, nor do I intend to teach people this creation method, so I’ll only make one...... three at most, maybe? This would also serve as an experimental test of the magic theory regarding a completely independent and self-adjusting magic technique.]","Nodding at Lillywood’s words, Kuromueina continued to work on the magic doll. The body of the doll, who she will name “Zwei”, is almost complete, and all that remains to be done is to make the final adjustments to the magic formulas imbued in its body.","“Rather, with the materials it needed, is it even possible to make a second one? Is that thing you used as a core something that can be easily made?”","[Unnn. It’s a substance miraculously created as a result of multiple materials with considerable magic power melting and mixing within an impossible amount of heat, so I guess reproducing it would be difficult.]","[I mean, where did you even find such strange material?]","The material Kuromueina was going to use for the core of the magic doll was extremely rare, and it was a material that everyone here had never seen before. According to Kuromueina, it was a miracle material that was created by accident, and there was no way for people to reproduce it.","[......Well, I found it when I was working on restoring a third of the Demon Realm that a certain someone had scorched in the past.]","[......Ahh~~ no...... ummm...... I’m sorry.]","It appears that the cause was Megiddo’s previous deeds in the past, so as the person themself guessed it, they scratched their head with an embarrassed expression on their face.","[......However...... She will be a new addition to our family...... so I’m looking forward to it.]","“Indeed. I’m looking forward to seeing what kind of character she will become and how she will grow.”","Just like that, the family members watched as Kuromueina assembled the magic doll and completed it. As light dwelled within the eyes of the doll, its face slowly moved.","[Good morning, Zwei. I’ve already incorporated some basic knowledge into you, but do you know who I am?]","[Yes, Kuromueina-sama. There is nothing wrong with the information processing. The data regarding the members of the family are also consistent with the prio———-!?]","[......Zwei? ......Are you alright?]","[ ! ? Wait, I blun...... I see! Isis, stop! Move away......]","Zwei, who had successfully booted up and stood up, moved her gaze, seemingly confirming the information she received, but her movement...... stopped the moment she saw Isis.","Looking at Zwei, whose eyes were wide open and her expression turned pale, Kuromueina seemingly guessed what was going on and called out to Isis, but it was already too late, as a worried Isis approached Zwei......","[Hyiihh, ahh, NOOOOOOOOOO!]","[......Ah.]","With a frightened expression on her face, she distanced herself away from Isis. Yes, before she knew it, Isis had forgotten about it. After coming to Kuromueina’s home, all the people Isis met were all exceptional and powerful individuals with outstanding talent and extraordinarily immense magic power, selected elites even among the Demon Realm.","That’s why, before she knew it, that fact had been driven into the corner of her consciousness. That her magic power of death...... to most of the world, it’s a hideous thing that stirs up fundamental fear in people to the point that it’s unapproachable...... and mysteriously, Zwei’s reaction at this time clearly reminded her of it.","——————–I’m sure someday, you’ll realize it too...... You’ll end up realizing it. Realizing that we would have been happier if we didn’t realize it, for doing so would only lead us to greater suffering.","As it felt like the snow falling on the dark snowy field where her other self stood had turned into a blizzard...... She remembered her other self’s words.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Well, at that time, I...... Alice-chan wasn’t there, but that sure is a heavy past. Fortunately, she will be saved later by Kaito-san, so that alone is a relief.]"]},{"number":1515,"title":"Chapter 1515: 1515 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Past 7 ~ ~","paragraphs":["As Kuromueina stood on the rooftop of her abode in the Demon Realm, Lillywood approached.","[How was Isis?]","“Sleeping. Even though her body shouldn’t require sleep, her falling asleep may have been due to mental fatigue.”","[I see...... That was a blunder. This time was my mistake. I also wanted to observe the growth process of her magic power, so I kept Zwei’s initial magic power low. At the very least, I should have made her have enough magic power to withstand Isis’ magic power of death.]","“Just like me, I think Isis herself had just forgotten about it. Everyone here was strong enough to converse with Isis after all.”","Kuromueina, Lillywood, and of course, the members of the family all know about Isis’ magic power of death. In fact, until the time Magnawell had been brought back home, they were very careful and quite cautious about whether or not he could handle the magic power of death.","However, since Isis herself almost never went out and had no contact with anyone other than her family, the reactions of the other creatures when they were exposed to her magic power of death had somehow been pushed to the corner of her mind.","“......Kuromueina, is there any way to protect oneself against Isis’ magic power other than a person being reasonably strong?”","[I’ve done some research, but it seems difficult. The magic power of death is too unique. Its nature is so close to the Gods’ authority that it can’t be blocked by any kind of Defensive Magic.]","“Authority?”","[Yeah. Errr, besides the Demon Realm where we live, there’s another realm where the World Creator...... the God who created this world resides, the God Realm. Well, if I explain about stuff in detail, this will take long, so it’s enough if you simply recognize that authority is the power of that Creator, a higher power than magic.]","“So such a realm exists...... I’ve only heard rumors of Gods from legends and folklore. Do they sometimes appear in the Demon Realm?”","[The ones who seldomly visit the Demon Realm are like the lowest ranks among the Gods. Well, I’ll tell you more about that sometime. There is something I’d like your help with after all.]","Kuromueina had planned to face Shallow Vernal sooner or later. But at the moment, she is still in the process of gathering the strength to fight off the Gods who would likely oppose them.","After lightly chuckling upon such a thought, Kuromueina returned to the topic.","[Anyhow, returning back to the topic, Isis’ magic power of death has several characteristics. First of all, it has the power to instill fundamental fear in those who come into contact with it. Regarding this, it has this characteristic of “the greater the difference in ability with Isis, the greater the effect”. If the magic power of death comes in contact with Lillywood, whose strength was on par with Isis, it would only have an effect equivalent to her magic power exerting slight pressure, but if the difference in ability is large, it would be at a level where coming on contact with it would make a person lose consciousness. Though I say that, that was already after Isis managed to mitigate the effect to a considerable extent.]","“I did hear how before Kuromueina taught her, she used to kill all living and inorganic things around her.”","[Unnn. Next, the pressure exerted by her magic power of death is influenced by Isis’ own mentality. Well, magic power originally is something easily influenced by emotions, but that is especially remarkable in her magic power of death. And finally, the magic power of death itself is so strong that even Isis herself can’t completely control it. If Isis grows and becomes much stronger than she is now, she might be able to control it, but that will take her a huge amount of years.]","“In any case, it means that it’s difficult to do something about it right away.”","[......Unnn. For the time being, Zwei will be brought up in a separate house that was built exclusively for her. I’m going to ask Ein to go over there and help me raise Zwei. After she grows to a certain extent, enough for her to withstand the magic power of death, I’ll have her meet Isis again.]","Zwei, in her current state, is unable to resist the magic power of death. Zwei herself knows Isis’ circumstances through the knowledge given to her by Kuromueina, so she feels sorry for her reaction when they met for the first time...... but the magic power of death isn’t something that can be handled just by having knowledge about it, as no matter what Zwei herself thinks, if she gets close to Isis, she will be crushed by her fear and end up running away screaming again.","In the end, in her current situation, there’s no other way to oppose Isis’ magic power of death other than increasing one’s strength.","Although Kuromueina and the others are unaware of it, the magic power of death was originally created based on the special magic power of the Great Evil God of Despair, a World Creator from another world, and it’s not something that can be coped with by just mental strength.","If there is a being who can suppress the magic power of death and take Isis’ hand with just their magic power, even though there’s a big difference in ability between them and Isis, then one can even say that their mental strength exceeds even the realm of Gods.","[......I just hope that this time’s incident didn’t inflict emotional scars on Isis......]","“You’re right. Let’s also be careful not to let her thoughts drift in the wrong direction.”","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The greater the difference in ability between Isis and the other party, the stronger the effect will be...... In fact, even when they weren’t aware of it, Aoi and Hina did faint with Isis’ arrival, so it actually may be quite the outrageous magic power. Well, there’s that guy who braved through it even though he was declared the weakest in the series...... As expected of the Singularity.]"]},{"number":1516,"title":"Chapter 1516: 1516 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Past 8 ~ ~","paragraphs":["Over the years, Zwei, who had acquired solid skills under the guidance of Kuromueina, was able to resist Isis’ magic power of death to some extent, and apologized to Isis for their first meeting, to which Isis told her “Don’t worry about it” with a gentle smile and their relationship was restored.","Although the thorns that remained in their hearts hadn’t disappeared, it is safe to say that a certain conclusion had been reached. One day, Kuromueina gathered her family together and broached about “that” topic.","[I think it’s time I told you about this. About the God Realm...... About the Creator God of this world...... Shallow Vernal.]","[Ahh~~ What was it again? You talking about that fairy tale, right? That a God named Shallow Vernal created the world....... However, if you’re going out of your way to talk about this, I guess that’s true?]","[Unnn. And I’m going to pick a fight with Shallow Vernal sooner or later. No, it’s not that I’m trying to be a God or anything, I just want to punch her because she pisses me off.]","After saying this, Kuromueina began to talk about the God Realm and the Gods residing in it. They didn’t know why Kuromueina would know such a thing, but they didn’t find it strange for Kuromueina, who could be said to be the oldest Demon, having lived in the Demon Realm for a long time, to know the truth that is not generally known.","And after her explanation, Kuromueina asked her family to cooperate with her to fight against Shallow Vernal when she would eventually challenge the God Realm, and they gladly agreed.","“Low-ranking Gods, High-ranking Gods...... and then, Supreme Gods huh. They would be troublesome. There’s that authority that is unconditionally superior to magic but......”","[......Fighting the Supreme Gods...... even for us...... unless we have good match-ups against them...... I think it would be difficult.]","[From what I hear, I should be in charge of that God of Space and Time. According to Kuromu-sama, my ability is something close to authority, and if anyone can compete with the Authority of Time, it would be me.]","Magnawell and Isis muttered, and Ein also considered this matter with a serious expression on her face. After hearing about Kuromueina’s story, she understood that those High-ranking Gods and Supreme Gods would be very troublesome opponents.","The Supreme Gods, in particular, would likely be stronger than their group at the moment, making them have the assumption that only by attacking them by surprise and fighting them in match-ups advantageous for them would they finally be able to fight on equal footing.","[If God of Life’s authority is related to life, then Isis would definitely be a good match against her. I also wanna fight myself a Supreme God...... but that matter would be for Kuromueina’s objective, so I guess I can only hold myself back.]","[I see Master knows prudence...... I’d also like to participate too, but I can’t leave Zwei-chan alone here, and someone has to be house-sitting...... Ah~~ In that case, the one with the lowest ability had to be me huh...... What a shame.]","In fact, Zwei is not strong enough to join that battle in the God Realm, and in the current situation, she would only be a hindrance. On the other hand, if she were to be left alone in the Demon Realm, there might be people who would take advantage of the opening of their absence, so it was necessary for Ozma to remain behind as her guard.","While the talk was coming together to some extent, Lilywood thought about it with a serious expression on her face and mentioned the biggest problem they would have on hand.","“......However...... What about the God of Fate? From what I’ve heard, it doesn’t sound like anyone of us can counter her other than Kuromueina......”","[Unnn. I’m having trouble with that too. Her Authority of Fate is really too powerful that compatibility isn’t an issue for her. If I defeat her though, she will end up exhausting me a bit before fighting Shallow Vernal...... I’ll hold off on this matter, at least until I can find a way to deal with the God of Fate.]","Yes, at the moment, the Supreme Gods are superior to Isis and the others in terms of ability, and if they don’t have a favorable match-up against them, they wouldn’t even be able to establish a proper battle.","Ein, who has the same Authority of Time as the God of Time and Space, and can nullify the God of Time and Space’s Time Manipulation with her authority. Isis, who has quite the particular efficacy on life through her magic power of death...... These two must be assigned to the God of Time and Space and the God of Life respectively.","In order to face the large numbers of High-ranking Gods and Low-ranking Gods, the three-person formation of Magnawell, whose stature makes him good with wide-range attacks, Megiddo, who is well-balanced and capable of all kinds of combat, and Lillywood, who can supply magic power to others while also using her inexhaustible magic power to heal those around her...... In that case, the one inevitably standing in their way would be the strongest God, God of Fate.","The Authority of Fate has too wide of a range of applications, making it impossible for them to gain an advantage in terms of compatibility, and there aren’t enough pieces to deal with the Authority that manipulates what can be said as the logic of the world itself, so they have come to the conclusion that it’s not feasible to implement the plan under the current circumstances.","The objective that Kuromueina spoke of, the progress of the Demon Realm. It was only a thousand years after they had this conversation that it came true...... when the being who can be said to be the final piece came to this world.","And at the same time, it was that being...... Shalltear’s arrival that greatly changed the environment in the Demon Realm and Kuromueina’s group, and at the same time, drastically changed Isis’ circumstances.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ahh, I see, from the perspective of the family members at that time, there were just no countermeasures against Fate......]","? ? ? : [Fate-san’s Authority has a range that covers the entire world and is seriously a cheat that can interfere with all fate. Unless you take countermeasures that aren’t bound by the rules, such as what I...... Alice-chan did, changing her fate in their battle, or you have the same authority as her, it would be impossible to fight against her.]"]},{"number":1517,"title":"Chapter 1517: 1517 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Past 9 ~ ~","paragraphs":["After being picked up by Kuromueina and becoming a member of her family...... Isis’ happy days continued.","She met and spent her days with family members who, like Kuromueina, weren’t afraid to talk to her, and her days were filled with the warmth she had always wanted.","Recently, a mysterious girl named Shalltear, a person who came from another world, joined the family, and the environment surrounding her became more and more lively.","The days she spent with her family were boisterous, but full of happiness. However...... For some reason, there were times when she suddenly felt loneliness she couldn’t quite express.","Whenever she felt this, she would fall asleep...... and dream about her other self.","“......We sure meet a lot lately.”","[......What you had said....... everything is wrong...... I’m...... really...... happy.]","It was as if she were saying that to herself. In response to those words though, the other Isis replied calmly without hesitation.","“Is that so...... Then, “why did you come here again?””","[......Eh? ......That is...... because...... you called me here.]","After her abrupt sleepiness would always come to this dream...... this conversation with her other self. Isis thought it was because her other self was calling her.","However, the other Isis, clad in a black robe, quietly shook her head.","“You’re mistaken. I haven’t called you here. You came here by your own will.”","[......What do you mean?]","“......What we’re currently in is the deepest place in our heart.”","[.......................]","Calmly pointing to the skies, the other Isis spoke in a voice that even sounded gentle. As if guided by his movements, Isis looked up at the sky and only saw dark, thick clouds.","“You said you are happy. We are indeed happy...... but deep down, our heart is still covered by thick clouds. Not a single ray of warmth had reached us.”","[......What are...... you saying? ......I don’t understand...... I have no idea...... what you’re trying to say.]","“It was just as I told you before. You will realize the things that we’d be better off not realizing. No...... This is something you’ve realized all along. That’s why you feel lonely even when you’re with Kuromueina and the others.”","[......I don’t know! ......What are you trying to say!?]","The words of the other Isis, the dark, enclosed skies...... It brings about an irresistible sense of frustration to her mind, making Isis scream. In response to such an Isis though, the other Isis...... spoke to her in a calm, gentle voice.","“......Please don’t get me wrong. I’m not trying to hurt you. The two of us aren’t separate entities. You and I are both Isis Remnant. Your happiness is my happiness, and what makes you sad also makes me sad.”","[......Then...... why do you....... keep on...... denying my happiness?]","“I don’t think either of us is the leading self or anything like that. Both of us are Isis Remnant. Everyone has feelings deep inside them that they don’t want to show to others...... feelings that you keep on turning your eyes away from. The reason why you keep on meeting me...... The reason why you keep on coming here is because you keep on turning away from your true feelings.”","[......My...... true feelings? ......Tell me then...... Why is it...... that even though I’m happy...... that I keep on feeling lonely? ......What is it...... that I kept on...... looking away from?]","“......If you can keep your eyes averted, you will definitely be happy. But if I had realized this, you will realize it someday. No, it seems like you’re already on the verge of realizing it...... In that case, maybe I should just tell it to you here?]","Saying this, the other Isis looks up at the dark cloud-covered sky. Her hair as white as Isis’ hair spilled out from between the gaps in her robe, swaying along the occasional breeze.","“......This is happiness, isn’t it? We have a family, we all laugh together...... Thanks to what Kuromueina has taught us, we’ve been able to suppress the magic power of death, even if only to a certain extent.”","[......Unnn...... With Kuromueina...... With everyone...... Surrounded by family...... I am......]","“However, “Zwei was afraid of us at first”.”","[ ! ? ]","With those words, the black snow that continued to fall around them seemed to gain momentum. Feeling as if her heart was rapidly cooling down, Isis’ eyes opened wide and she looked at her other self.","Indeed, it was just as the other Isis said, the Zwei created by Kuromueina had been terribly afraid of Isis when she was just created. Let alone talk to her, she didn’t even try to approach her.","However, that was in the past. Now, Zwei talks to Isis just as she does to the others and adores her as a family member.","[......That is...... But...... now!]","“Unnn. It’s alright now...... “because she had learned how to clad herself in magic power enough to resist our magic power of death”.”","[......Eh? ......Ahh.]","“......In the end, that’s all there is to it.”","Astonished, Isis stiffened. It’s as if the place where she now stands is crumbling beneath her feet, feeling helpless. Yes, she had realized it, what exactly her other self said that she was better off not noticing......","“Kuromueina held out her hand to us. However, that’s only because Kuromueina is “stronger than us”. Lillywood and the others call us their family. However, that’s only because “Lillywood and the others are capable of resisting our magic power of death”.”","[......Ah...... Ahhhhh......]","“Without the power to resist our magic power of death, Kuromueina wouldn’t have reached out to us. Lillywood and the others wouldn’t have called us their family. Yes, not one of them...... “would have ever accepted us”.”","[......You’re...... You’re wrong...... Stop......]","“In the future, Kuromueina and the others will be accepted by those without power. However, they won’t accept us...... There is no one who will unconditionally accept us. Thus, there will never come a time when their warmth would reach the depths of our heart.”","[Stop!]","Isis’ voice sounded like she was about to cry. The words of the other Isis violently shook the true wish that had remained dormant in the depths of her heart.","What Isis really seeks is unconditional warmth...... just like the one given from a parent to a child, happiness that seemed to envelop her body.","However, such a thought kept on following Isis, she kept on thinking about the future. No matter how well she meets someone she gets along with, the thought that “if they don’t have the power to resist her magic power of death, they wouldn’t have accepted her” won’t go away from her mind.","“......Why don’t we just compromise? There’s no one who will unconditionally accept us. So, why don’t we be content with what we have? If you can keep looking away, you’d better off just keeping your gaze away. Otherwise, we will continue to suffer for a long time to come.”","The other Isis told her in a gentle voice. As the other Isis herself said, it’s not that she wanted to make Isis unhappy.","That’s why she proposed this. Keep on turning her gaze away from her true wish and give up......","[......It might just be...... that we haven’t...... met yet.]","“......You’ll never meet such a person. Ever.”","[...... That’s not true...... I’m sure ...... I’m sure...... They must be out there.]","“...... I understood it. I am also you after all. That’s why, I knew you wouldn’t give up. However, I don’t think we’ll ever find someone like that.”","No further words were exchanged between the girls. Only the black snow that continued to fall increased in amount, freezing the depths of their heart.","The other Isis was right. But even if that’s so, Isis could not give up. She couldn’t give up on it...... on what she wanted the most...... beings who would unconditionally accept her everything, beings who would take her hand even if they held no power to resist the magic power of death.","“......I’m sorry. If I could disappear, you would be saved, but please forgive this me who was unable to do anything.”","Isis is already awake. The murmur of the other Isis...... “The murmur of the Great Evil God, the origin of her magic power of death” never reached her ears.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Ahh, incidentally, please check out “Extra Chapter: Visitor’s Beginnings”, when Alice-chan and Isis-san met. You can see there the transcendentally cool Alice-chan.]","Serious-senpai : [Isn’t it an arc about a certain someone that isn’t just not inferior, but was even more twisted than Isis?]","? ? ? : [......No comment.]"]},{"number":1518,"title":"Chapter 1518: 1518 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Past 10 ~ ~","paragraphs":["Isis Remnant...... has chosen a thorny path, not to compromise with what she has now, but to continue to search for what she truly seeks...... turning her back on her own heart that tells her that she will never find it.","[Eh? A castle? Well, it’s not impossible to make one...... but why are we making one again?]","[......From now on...... I’d like to be like the old Kuromueina...... traveling through the Demon Realm...... and then find a place to settle down...... and build a castle there...... I’d like Shalltear to build it for me...... and bring it with me using Space-Time Magic.]","At first, Isis asked her family, Shalltear, to create a castle where she would later live. Being as versatile as she is, she thought Shalltear could create her a castle.","In fact, it was indeed possible for her, but Shalltear had a somewhat difficult expression on her face when she was asked this.","[......Isis-san, as expected, why don’t you stay here with Kuro-san? It’s already a well-known fact that Kuro-san is the Strongest in the Demon Realm, and I don’t think there will be any problem with two Kings staying in her place. Under Kuro-san, there will be many talented people, people who can resist the magic power of death......]","[......No...... I’ve already made up my mind...... I will...... look for them myself...... just like Kuromueina did back then......]","[I see...... I understand. So, what kind of castle do you want?]","Shalltear wanted her family to take the position of the Six Kings and bring order to the Demon Realm, but she often suggested to Isis that she should stay with Kuromueina.","Isis’ magic power of death is so unique that Shalltear expected that Isis wouldn’t find any subordinates. No, if she just focused her search only on subordinates, she really might be able to find them. All she had to do was to find someone who could withstand her magic power of death and subdue them with her power.","However, that is not what Isis is looking for. What she is seeking the most is a being that accepts her without the power to resist her magic power of death, and above all, she’s actually trying to find that being. She knew she wouldn’t look at anything else until she found that being...... but from Shalltear’s perspective, she feels that it would be very difficult...... or even impossible.","[......I want a big castle...... so that a lot of people can live in it...... with a big dining room so that everyone can eat together...... and that thing Shalltear talked me about...... the bath where everyone gets into...... Onsen, was it? ...... I want one of those too.]","[......Isis-san. I know this isn’t a good thing to say, but if you turn your eyes away from reality, you’ll regret it if you set your expectations too high for the future...... No, I suppose this isn’t something I could tell you huh. I understand. Since we’re at it, let’s build the best castle ever!]","[......Unnn...... Thank you.]","[Please let me know when you decide on a place to settle down. I’ll also come visit you once in a while.]","[......Unnn.]","Shalltear was about to warn her that if she expects too much from the future, she would suffer severe repercussions due to the gap between expectations and reality, but she stopped mid-sentence.","After all, she was in the same state as Isis, as she was continually searching for a being that she herself thought she would never find.","That’s when, when she thinks about the despair Isis would feel later, she felt the desire to stop her...... but precisely because she had gone down a similar path herself, she understood all too well that nothing anyone said here would be able to stop Isis. That’s why she couldn’t intervene.","In the end, Shalltear listened to Isis’ request and completed the castle just as she asked. When Isis saw the finished product, her eyes were shining with hope...... No, it was as if she was trying to force herself to look forward to the future by turning away from what she didn’t want to think about right now.","She decided to travel through the Demon Realm, just as Kuromueina had done in the past. A journey to find the being who would accept her unconditionally...... It could be described as something like a battle.","A thousand years have passed since she began her journey. The concept of Peerage-holders and the Six Kings, created by Shalltear’s proposal, became well known in the Demon Realm, and Isis also became widely known as the Death King.","At the same time, her family members that came to be known as the Six Kings became independent from Kuromueina and moved to different parts of the Demon Realm, and began to build up their own influence.","It was lonely and painful for Isis to live apart from her beloved family, but it was also a good opportunity for her to search for the thing she hadn’t found yet.","Five thousand years have passed since she began her search. The Demon Realm, where once all that mattered was the ability to fight, has been at peace thanks to Shalltear’s work, and each region has come to have its own unique characteristics and history.","By this time, Isis had already visited every corner of the Demon Realm. However, she was still unable to find the being she sought.","She toured every region. She saw Demons of all races. However, the only thing she felt from those who fled in fear of her magic power of death was always a clear rejection.","Seeing her being rejected no matter where she went, Lillywood, who was closer to her more than anyone in their family, couldn’t bear it any longer and suggested “Why don’t you settle down and look for a place to belong?”. Accepting her suggestion, Isis decided to settle in a place called the Land of Death, where no other living creatures resided. By the time she made this decision, her loneliness had become so immense that it was beyond her control.","How many times had she shed tears?","How many times had she embraced her body, which trembled with loneliness?","How many times had she been jealous of the other members of the Six Kings who were accepted by many......?","“It seems like it didn’t work again today.”","[......Why...... Why...... Why was I born...... with the magic power of death?]","“......I’m sorry.”","[......Why...... are you...... apologizing to me?]","“I guess it’s because you’re crying?”","The other Isis, whom she met in her dream, looked up at the dark sky, which seems to have become thicker, and told her the words she have repeated many times before.","“......You’re not giving up yet?”","[......Perhaps...... They still...... haven’t been born yet.]","“Is that so? I think that’s not possible though. No one will accept us.”","[......You’re annoying...... Shut up.]","If she had been able to, it might have been easier for her to give up, to compromise. However, Isis could not give up what she wished for. Ironically, this made her heart suffer even more.","Ten thousand years had passed since she began her search. The feeling of resignation grew and grew, and Isis gradually stopped going out of her castle.","She spent her time alone in the spacious castle, reading a large number of books she has collected throughout her travels around the Demon Realm. The words of the other Isis...... that there would be no one who would ever accept her, weighed heavily on his mind.","Still, she couldn’t completely give up, and just the number of times she went out didn’t go down to zero. Under the pretext of “hobby”, she searched for the being that she couldn’t find, with the excuse of collecting items that appear in books.","Twenty thousand years had passed since she began her search. The world drastically changed. The invasion to the Human Realm by the Demon Lord led to the Treaty of Friendship between the three realms...... and the expansion of the world she had been living in.","Therefore, it would be inevitable...... that she would harbor hope in the expanded new world......, but she wasn’t accepted.","While the other members of the Six Kings were accepted and their sphere of activity had expanded...... she alone was rejected.","What she got was the fear and awe of being the “most terrifying among the Six Kings”. As one would have roughly expected, she also wasn’t able to find what she wanted.","[......Why...... How come...... I was...... just......]","“Why don’t we give up already? We had worked hard enough. We traveled around the Human Realm, even met people from another world...... but still, not one of them had accepted us. That’s why......”","[......No...... Staying lonely like this...... I won’t...... give up.]","“......Is that so?”","On the snowfield with a black blizzard blowing around her, Isis and the other Isis shed tears.","Trembling with loneliness, they despaired about their circumstances...... yet they continued to struggle, unable to give up hope.","Could that be...... perhaps the reason why? Because they did not give up everything there, the miracle that they had been waiting for ...... finally appeared a thousand years later.","After a really long time, Isis met the being that she had been searching for————- Miyama Kaito.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Seriously, when I read Isis-san’s past arc, I end up thinking “Kaito-san, please come already~~”.]","Serious-senpai : [Speaking of which, you were quite worried about Isis huh. Come to think of it, in the main story, Isis did mention how “you would sometimes come visit her”.]","? ? ? : [Well, she is family after all. To be honest, I didn’t think that Isis-san would find the person she was looking for, so I’m actually in the same camp as the other Isis-san. Kaito-san really is just that much of a singularity.]"]},{"number":1519,"title":"Chapter 1519: 1519 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Present 1 ~ ~","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","From this point on, we will enter Present. Since that point would be a convenient spot to separate chapters, today’s chapter will be a little short.","The timeline is just after Isis and Kaito became lovers, while the next chapter will be a story about a timeline that isn’t described much in the main story between the Six Kings Festival and the God Realm War, and then after that will be a story at the time of the God Realm War.","The being that Isis has been waiting for. By no means was he strong enough to resist her, but even still, he was able to accept her...... Her encounter with Miyama Kaito brought about a great change in her.","Love is something one falls in...... She had been beaten down by loneliness and despair for so long, it was inevitable that she would fall in love with Kaito, who accepted her for who she was.","After meeting Kaito, Isis’s face began to smile more and more. Every day was truly joyful and everything around her even seemed to sparkle.","When she heard that he accepted her feelings and asked her to be his lover...... she felt so much happiness that it was difficult to express it in words.","Whenever she spent time with her new lover and smiled from the bottom of her heart, her heart, which should have been frozen, was filled with nothing but warmth.","In the midst of such happiness, which could be called the peak of her life, Isis had a dream for the first time in a long time.","“.....................”","Staring back at her was the other Isis, whom she had met many times before.","[......It doesn’t matter...... what you say...... anymore...... Kaito...... is my destined person...... Together with Kaito...... I will be happy...... No...... I will show you...... that I will be happy.]","Saying this, Isis’ eyes were filled with a strong and definite light, very different from when she was shedding tears while shaking with loneliness.","[......I’m not the only one...... receiving it from Kaito...... I will also...... give Kaito happiness...... I’ll show you...... that I won’t make Kaito...... regret that...... he loved me...... Together with Kaito...... I will...... be happy...... If I’m together with Kaito...... We’ll definitely achieve it.]","Looking back, it seems that all along, Isis’s heart may have remained weak. No matter how powerful she was, her heart was that of a lonely, trembling child. But now, thanks to the presence of Miyama Kaito, Isis has gained a firm pillar of strength.","Therefore, with a strong and unshakable will, she confronted the other Isis who has been denying her until now.","“......Unnn. That’s what I think too.”","[......Eh?]","However, what came back was not a denial, but an affirmation.","“Fufu, why are you surprised? It’s just as I told you, it’s not that I wanted to make you unhappy. I am you, the both of us are Isis...... Your happiness is my happiness......”","As she calmly told her in a clear voice, the other Isis took off the hood of the robe that she had been wearing...... and there Isis found a face exactly the same as hers, smiling happily from the bottom of her heart.","“......Look, the clouds above us have cleared up.”","[......Ahh...... You’re right.]","Just as the other Isis had said, when she looked up at the sky, the sky, which had been dark and covered with thick clouds, had turned into a dazzling blue sky...... and warm light was shining into the snowfield.","“Kaito had illuminated us. He brought warmth to the depths of our heart.”","[......Unnn...... Kaito...... is amazing.]","“Unnn. I don’t need to reject you anymore...... and there’s no need for us to meet like this.”","[......Are you going to disappear?]","“I won’t disappear. I am you, and you are me...... Blending into one, as Isis Remnant, we will live together with Kaito from now on...... seeing the same things, having the same feelings.”","The other Isis said. Saying that her role is now over and that she will return to her original form from now on, living together with her......","[......Thank you.]","“What for?”","[......For taking on...... a thankless role...... all these years.]","“You’re weird, thanking yourself.”","[......Fufu...... I...... suppose.]","Unlike in the past, Isis was able to have a more relaxed mind, and so, she realized. The other Isis in front of her had been denying her own wish for a long time...... and when those times came, trying to lighten the pain in Isis’ heart, she went ahead and said hurtful words......","Illuminated by the warm sunlight, the two Isis brightly smiled.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Unnn? A story at the time of the God Realm? Putting aside stories between the Six Kings Festival and that battle in the God Realm, what’s that story around the God Realm War gonna be about?]","? ? ? : [Probably how we were able to help Kaito-san with a part of his ordeals. After all, a certain someone, somewhere, has left behind an authority-level power in its unique, complete form.]","Serious-senpai : [Ahhh...... Yeah, that did happen back then!]"]},{"number":1520,"title":"Chapter 1520: 1520 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Present 2 ~ ~","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","This is a story occurring between the Six Kings Festival and God Realm War.","The library in Isis-san’s castle is truly enormous. I had visited the Royal Library of the Symphonia Kingdom before, but there are probably far more books here than even that place.","When I think that Isis-san has read all the books here, it makes me painfully aware of the length of time she has spent in the library.","[......Kaito...... What’s wrong?]","[Ahh, no, I just hadn’t thought the place would be this vast from the outside......]","[......I had expanded the space...... with Space-Time Magic.]","[I hear those a lot. That’s how they do things in Kuro’s place, and Alice also said that her workshop and other rooms are expanded.]","[......Unnn...... Because space-related Barrier Magic...... like Space Isolation Barrier has been developed...... with a stable magic formula...... making them easy to use.]","[I see......]","Though she says they’re easy to use, this is something only for people of Isis-san’s level. In reality, Space-Time Magic is quite difficult, and large-scale Space Isolation Barriers are said to be some of the most advanced magic, rivaling even top-tier magic.","Thinking about it carefully, even Teleportation Magic, which is a classic example of difficult magic, seems to have properties similar to Space-Time magic, and that kind of magic would probably be generally difficult.","[......Isis-san, those books are?]","[......Ahh...... these are...... my recommendations...... for Kaito...... to read too.]","[I see, thank you. The books Isis-san recommended to me are all very interesting. so I’m looking forward to reading them.]","[......If Kaito says that...... I’m also...... happy.]","Isis-san looked happy as she held several books with a smile.","Since I’m staying at Isis-san’s house today, spending leisurely time and chatting about trivial things with her while reading a book is also nice...... but since I’m together with Isis-san, I felt like it’s a bit of a waste to spend my time with her just reading books. What a dilemma.","While I was thinking about this, Isis-san muttered with a somewhat nostalgic expression on her face.","[......When I was...... reading books here all by myself...... it felt lonely...... Even though the contents of the book are interesting...... it was kind of cold...... and always felt empty..... after I finished reading it.]","[......Isis-san.]","[......But thanks to those times...... just like this...... I can now recommend...... my favorite books to Kaito. I’m happy to know...... that those times...... weren’t in vain.]","[That’s right. I’m sure it’s not a waste. It may have been a lonely and difficult time for Isis-san, but wouldn’t it be possible that they could become an opportunity that will be useful for you in the future? Look, back at the Six Kings Festival, it was already alright for you to get close to people to about 3 meters, so if that range narrows in the future, it might be possible to have conversations with a variety of people more easily.]","[......You...... think so? ......Would...... such a day come?]","When we went around the festival together during the Six Kings Festival, even though the people seemed somewhat intimidated towards Isis-san while looking at us from a distance, I didn’t feel fear caused by her magic power of death from them.","The happier Isis is, the weaker the fear her magic power of death exerts towards those around her, so if I can make Isis-san happier in the future, I think it’s not impossible to shorten that 3m distance even more.","[After all, look, think about it. It’s only been half a year since Isis-san and I got to know each other, and it has become okay for people around to get close to you to some extent. This is definitely great progress. Well, I don’t know much about magic, so I don’t know the ropes for controlling the magic power of death...... but I intend to make Isis-san even happier from now on, so as a side effect, wouldn’t that matter turn out for the better?]","[......Kaito~~]","Yes, my purpose isn’t just to alleviate her magic power of death, but to make Isis-san happier. I would be happier if, as an added bonus, the range of people with whom Isis-san can interact expanded, and I hope that will happen.","Perhaps one day, Isis-san will have subordinates of her own, and many people will come to live in this castle.","When I told her my thoughts, Isis-san’s eyes moistened and levitating the book she was holding on the side, she leaped towards me.","[......Kaito...... I love you...... I love you very much.]","[Ye. I love you too, Isis-san.]","[......I’m happy...... With Kaito here, I’m sure things will be alright...... However...... It isn’t just Kaito making me happy...... I also want to make Kaito happy...... errr...... that’s why......]","[You’re right. One making the other happy would just be a one-way street, so let’s be happy together.]","[......Ahh...... Unnn!]","Isis-san’s face beamed with a smile at my words, and her expression was so beautiful that it was dazzling. Her beauty now doesn’t seem to just be ephemeral, as I felt budding strength held within it.","Not just receiving, but her giving such herself, isn’t that proof that Isis-san’s heart is getting stronger? In any case, as I reaffirmed my desire to support Isis-san as her lover, I felt guided by her expectant gaze, so I leaned in and kissed her lips.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Guhaak!? A sudden sugar ruuuuuuuush...... D*mn it, just when things are getting serious, Kaito just appears for a little bit and...... S- So this is the protagonist’s sugar power huh......]"]},{"number":1521,"title":"Chapter 1521: 1521 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episodes ~ ~ Present 3 ~ ~","paragraphs":["“Parting from Kuro at the fountain at the plaza, I began walking down the path towards Lilia-san’s mansion as the sun sets.” I’m kinda feeling a sense of deja vu...... It seemed a little strange, but as I wasn’t able to think of any particular cause for this feeling, I concluded that it must have been my imagination and just proceeded with my steps.","But...... at that moment———– I felt something out of place, far exceeding what I had been feeling just now.","It was almost evening, the time of the day when streets would normally be crowded with people returning home from work or going out shopping for dinner, but there wasn’t a single soul that could be found in the wide straight main street, filled with a strange silence.","Finding myself in such an abnormal scene, as if this space had been cut off from the rest of the world, I naturally stopped in place.","[......What the heck is———!?]","Immediately afterwards, a chill ran down my back and I can feel the hairs on my body rising.","The buildings in the vicinity were melting as if they were rotting, and the road in front of me was collapsing, a sensation so horrifying that it was almost impossible to imagine such a scene in my mind.","I don’t know why, but my body was shivering, and it felt like the sound of my thirsty throat was loudly resounding in my ears.","And it isn’t just in my head, all of my body...... and the instincts within it were warning me.","——–That something very frightening is coming.","It’s different from the pressure I’ve felt from Kuro’s magic power when she visited me in Lilia-san’s mansion before. It was much more fundamental, an inexplicably terrifying feeling that seemed to alert my instincts as a living being. In other words, a negative presence——– dense enough that I could feel it on my skin.","And then, from the end of the dimly-lit road which is tainted with silence, that appeared.","Long hair as white as ashes, morbidly white skin, deep and gloomy blood-like crimson eyes.","A woman dressed in a “black gothic dress-like clothing”, wrapped in a pale blue light, floating just like fluttering dandelions, she approached my direction with an eerie presence around her.","She looked like a ghost, but she held beauty that could be described as unequaled. However, even her beauty accentuates the fear I’m feeling.","[Kahh...... ahhh......]","Just by seeing the woman...... I felt like I saw an illusion that my head had been decapitated. I can’t breathe well and my whole body is shaking like crazy. And yet, I’m unable to move from where I stood at all.","Fear I’ve never felt before surged through my body, and at the same time, my instincts were intensely warning me.","Don’t get involved with her, quickly run away...... or else, I will be killed......","However, contrary to such thoughts, my legs won’t move at all, as if my feet were sewn to the ground.","“......What an unusual magic power...... Are you...... the Hero?”","[ ! ? ]","Her cold voice resounds, and her red eyes look at me. At that moment, I felt a chill that froze my whole body, and I lost all my words due to the intense discomfort I’m feeling.","Ahh, I knew this feeling...... It was just like “back then”.","The day I lost my parents. The crushed car, the feeling of blood running down my neck, the coldness that seemed to drain the heat from my body...... That’s right. This is the feeling of impending death...... An overwhelming fear that seemed to freeze my soul.","Yes, I felt so terrified of this woman I’d met for the first time.","As the feeling of fear seemed like it was starting to overwhelm my thoughts, the question of the unusual woman “Are you the hero?” popped within my mind.","Even though my instincts are telling me that I have to respond, that I mustn’t go against this being, my body just keeps on shaking and I can’t move properly.","“......I repeat...... Are you...... the Hero?”","As if my continued silence was off-putting, the woman changed her tone to a slightly stronger one and asked me the same question again.","It was as if I was being strangled by an invisible hand, pushing me down with an oppressive, suffocating feeling.","[......I’m an...... otherworlder, but...... I’m not..... the Hero.]","“......Is that so?”","The woman nodded to the words that I barely managed to squeeze out, without showing any particular reaction.","The silence is heavy. I feel as if the air itself has weight.","The trembling in my body grows even stronger, wanting to get rid of this hellish feeling as soon as possible.","After a few moments of silence, the woman holds out her hand to me to shake my hand.","“......I’m...... Isis...... Isis Remnant...... Nice to meet you.”","[Ughh!? Aaaahhhh......]","The moment I looked at the held-out hand, what rose in my hand was an intense sense of discomfort. A feeling of fear...... Far greater than my mind can tolerate, and I feel like nausea was rising from the pits of my stomach.","I have to escape, escape, run away, run...... my instincts were intensely screaming at me.","The hand that is supposed to look white and beautiful, looks like the sickle of the Soul Reaper.","I mustn’t hold that hand. If I were to hold her hand, I would die. Don’t defy her, don’t go against her, don’t take my eyes away from her...... One after another, they resounded in my head like an alarm clock waking me up from sleep.","“...................”","Seeing me like that, the woman slightly lowered her eyes, without saying anything. And the moment I saw the expression on her face, deep sorrow and intense loneliness in her slightly wavering eyes...... I felt as if she was inhabited by a feeling of loneliness that was too intense.","I “don’t have some sort of power that could help me read other people’s emotions”. That’s why, this was just a feeling of mine.","To be clear, I don’t understand the logic behind this. Why did I feel this way? I don’t know the logic for this thought, nor do I have a clear reason or basis for it. But for some reason———– If I were to run away here, I feel like I would regret it for the rest of my life.","“......Eh?”","I can hear the startled voice of the woman. My body, which should have been frozen in fear, awkwardly moved...... And I found myself slapping my cheeks with both of my hands.","The bizarre fear that still assaults my body hasn’t disappeared. I feel like puking at the prospect of imminent death. However, the thoughts that were coming to my mind are about to become something completely different.","Get your head out of your ass! Go think about the situation more seriously this time!","What did this person even do to me? Did she do any harm to me or had she ever directed her hostility towards me? No, she didn’t...... She had only asked me if I’m the Hero, and then, introduced herself and asked for a handshake. She didn’t do anything strange.","Looking back into the woman’s red eyes, which seems somewhat startled, I was about to reach out and accept the handshake...... but the intense sense of discomfort assaulted me again.","Clenching my teeth within this dizzying fear and discomfort, I still tried to desperately move my hand.","I don’t have any basis for my actions, nor do I have any reason why. I don’t even know why I’m so desperate...... However, I feel like I have to hold this person’s hand...... right here, right now.","If I had been in the same situation before I came to this world, I would have definitely ran away.","However, when I came to this world and met Kuro...... I understood that even a single goodwill could save a person’s heart. I’ve learned how glad I am to have her reach out to me, even if I’m hiding deep within the darkest depths of my heart.","For this reason, if I’m the only one who can reach into the depths of this person’s heart at this moment in time, then...... There’s no way I can run away from here.","I’m sweating profusely and my body is shaking like crazy...... but if I’m shaking, that means it isn’t that I can’t move! Then stop shaking there like an idiot, and get moving!","I don’t know if it had been answered because of my scream within my heart...... Clenching my teeth so hard that my lips were bleeding, I desperately tried reaching out...... Little by little, my hand moved toward the woman in front of me.","At that moment, the discomfort I felt became even more intense, and for a moment, I felt like I was going to lose consciousness, but I bit my lip hard to hold onto my awareness.","Even as my hand was shaking, and even though my body was shaking, I didn’t stop. The fear of death assaulting my mind is too intense. I want to escape. Even as this feeling grows stronger and stronger though, I still try to reach out my hand.","Little by little, an incredibly small distance at a time...... I tried to hold the woman’s hand at a pace so slow that it took me several minutes for my hand to move a single centimeter.","Whether I’m feeling nauseous and consciousness dimming, whether it’s sweat or tears flowing down my face...... What kind of face I’m making right now...... I don’t know any of that.","Why am I so desperate? Why do I need to feel this much pain, reaching out to this woman, whom “I have never met before”?","I’m just an ordinary guy with no special power. Therefore, moments like this make my weakness pretty clear. Even at this very moment, I’m afraid of this woman in front of me.","But still, I don’t know why...... but I just couldn’t bring myself to choose the option of giving up.","How much time passed? Anyway, my hand reached the hand of the woman who had spent a ridiculously long time waiting for me to hold it out the whole time.","The moment I held her hand, I was struck with fear even more intense than before, and I fell to my knees on the ground, unable to stand. However...... not yet.","I still haven’t spoken a word back to her yet. Get up, get up! I’m just feeling scared...... Bring about my whole body, muster all the strength I can!","Getting up, holding my wobbling leg with my other hand, I slowly turned my attention to the woman in front of me.","The smile on my face as I looked at her looked forced, but I think it can’t be helped. Still, I want to get along with her. Setting my mind straight to the thought of wanting to be friendly with her...... I spoke.","[......It’s nice to meet you...... I’m Miyama Kaito.]","As I told her this in a voice that is aptly described as me squeezing those words out of my throat, the girl smiled...... and the intense fear that had assailed my body completely vanished immediately afterward.","Not only that, but the surrounding scenery changed to a “snowfield”...... a blanket of silver-colored snow covering up my surroundings, and at the same time, “the memories that I had somehow forgotten until now” began to come back to me.","[......Eh? Arehh? Isis-san?]","“Unnn. You’re both right and wrong. I’m sorry, Kaito...... for trying to test you.”","Isis-san, who was wearing a black dress unlike her usual blue dress, said something I didn’t understand, in a voice that seemed to resonate in my ears just like Lillywood-san’s voice did.","What did she mean? The atmosphere around her also feels different from normal...... but the woman in front of me...... I think she’s definitely Isis-san.","[Errr, you are...... Isis-san, right?]","“You could say I indeed am, but you could also say I’m slightly different. However, unnn. I will be glad if you call me Isis.”","[I understand...... Ummm, Isis-san. Where is this?]","“With my power, I’ve “connected your heart with mine”. You can think of this as a dream. Earlier, I was trying to test Kaito a little bit, so you weren’t able to remember some of your memories......”","In a dream...... I see, the situation itself was rather strange, but thinking about the strange events that have just happened earlier, it makes sense.","Was that perhaps...... in a way, a reenactment of my encounter with Isis-san? I see, it felt a little strange...... but I guess that was because I was in a state where I couldn’t remember things?","I mean, Isis-san...... So you’re able to do stuff like that huh.","“I’m a part of Isis’ mind. It’s not that one of us is the real one or anything like that. It’s just that me and the other me blended together. If I were to explain it, you could say I’m the first Isis Remnant....... wait, Isis...... You could say that this self is another me. That’s why, you could say I indeed am Isis Remnant, but you could also say I’m different...... Hey, Kaito? Do you know who I am?”","[.......................]","Her riddle-like phrasing makes me tilt my head back and think. She’s indeed Isis Remnant, but you could also say she’s different...... If I take her word for it, the woman in front of me is Isis-san, but not Isis-san.","As I was thinking about this, something suddenly came to my mind.","[......Could it be...... You are “her magic power of death”......]","“Unnn. You’re right...... Though I suppose the most correct answer...... would be the “memory of the being that is the origin of her magic power of death”?”","[Errr, I’m sorry. I don’t really get what you......]","“It’s alright. I’ll explain it to you. That’s why I called Kaito here like this...... However, I want to walk with Kaito for a bit. Is that no good?”","The magic power of death...... Or rather, the other Isis-san looked at me with a slightly anxious expression on her face. She had the face of the Isis-san I know so much...... Whatever the case may be, I felt such a sense of relief that the being in front of me was indeed Isis-san.","[Of course, gladly...... There’s no reason for me to refuse an invitation to a date from my precious lover after all.]","“Ahh...... Unnn!”","Hearing my words, a smile that seemed like blooming flowers appeared on Isis-san’s lips, making her look so unfairly cute that I can’t help but smile.","Thereupon, Isis-san held out her hand to me, seemingly expecting something, and I, sensing her intentions, took her hand in mind and started walking with her.","[......How should I say this...... This place is beautiful, isn’t it? A world blanketed in silver snow...... With the clear skies above us, it feels especially so.]","“Kaito, have you not seen views like this that much?”","[Yes, we didn’t get a lot of snow where I lived. This feels rather refreshing.]","“Fufu, I see.”","[......You seem happy, Isis-san.]","“Unnn. I’m very, very happy. Not only because I’m together with Kaito...... but because I realized once again that Kaito is the coolest guy in the world.”","[N- No matter how you put it, you’re exaggerating......]","Isis-san looked really happy from the bottom of her heart, praising me with a big smile on her face. Embarrassed by this, I responded while scratching my cheek with my free hand, to which Isis-san shook her head.","“That’s not the case at all. After all, Kaito held my hand...... I believed that if it’s Kaito, you would face our magic power of death “even without your Sympathy Magic”. However, I never expected you would also hold our hand.”","[E- Errr......]","Ahh, I see. The meeting I just had with Isis-san was different from what I remember...... I don’t know what the logic of how it happened is, but I was in a state where I couldn’t use my Sympathy Magic earlier......","“The magic power of death is the fundamental fear of all beings, something that couldn’t be withstood by mere mental power...... is how it should have been, but Kaito suppressed even that. In the midst of fear that normally would have “caused one to go insane or have a mental breakdown dozens of times”, you still held my hand. Kaito really is amazing!”","[......A- Ahaha...... Well, you can count on me.]","Eeeeehhhh!? Was I in that much of a peril just now? Go insane? Mental breakdown? M- Magic power of death...... really is something amazing huh. I felt some shudder crawl behind my back, but seeing Isis-san looking very happy, I think it was worth the effort.","“Ahh, o- of course, if it seemed no good, I was going to restore you back to normal immediately.”","[It’s alright. I’m not misunderstanding anything, nor am I angry. Rather, I’m happy to meet your expectations, Isis-san.]","“Ahh, unnn! Ehehe, Kaito really is the coolest in the world...... I love you very much.”","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Look, we’re talking about the protagonist who clearly has the strongest mental strength in the series, even saying stuff like “walking for 100 years was surprisingly short”...... He really is just different.]","? ? ? : [No, it’s seriously inhuman being able to suppress the magic power of death with only his mental strength alone. That’s a power already on par with the Gods’ Authority...... No, well, I guess that’s to be expected of Kaito-san.]"]},{"number":1522,"title":"Chapter 1522: 1522 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Present 4 ~ ~","paragraphs":["Within the beautiful snowy field, I exchanged words with the other Isis-san whom I met in a dream.","[H- However, errr...... Isis-san is also amazing. Connecting your heart and temporarily blocking memory, you’re also able to do stuff like that huh.]","While it is quite a mysterious ability, I suppose Isis-san, who possesses far greater than I do, is capable of various things. However, I have a feeling that this had some special circumstances behind it, so I thought I would ask.","“......Hmmm. This is something only I can do right now. With the blessing Kaito received from Shallow Vernal, ordinary Mental Magic will be nullified.”","[Eh? Then, how would Isis-san be able to do stuff like this then......]","“Errr...... By acquiring the power of a God...... or something like that...... I guess?”","[Why is it that you yourself aren’t sure about that...... Rather, the power of a God?]","“Unnn, before I was “reborn” as Isis...... I was called the “Great Evil God of Despair”.”","[......Yes?]","Wait a second there. I feel like some outrageous information was just being casually brought up right there!?","I am curious about the fact that she was reborn, but I’m more curious about that name “Great Evil God of Despair”, especially with how familiar it felt.","I kinda feel like that name was brought up in Alice’s stories of her past...... N- No, having the same name doesn’t necessarily mean they’re the same entity......","“The being which is my...... no, our origin was a God from a world different from this one.”","[......Errr, could it be, you are......]","“Unnn...... As Kaito should have already guessed, I used to be the Evil God defeated by the Hero of Hope.”","[Ahh, as I thought, that really is the case.]","“Unnn...... I will explain that part properly as well.”","As I thought, she really was the Great Evil God of Despair that Alice had mentioned before. The Hero of Hope Isis-san mentioned should be Alice.","“Even though I was a God, I wasn’t that powerful. If it comes to combat ability, the current us is much more powerful than the us back then, and compared to the God of this world, Shallow Vernal, we are incredibly inferior.”","With her gaze fixed on the clear blue sky, Isis-san spun her words with a somewhat nostalgic look on her face. Indeed, if it’s true that she lost to the old Alice, then it’s possible that her combat abilities were inferior to the current Isis-san.","[......Lonely, I don’t want to be alone...... That’s all what I as the Great Evil God was thinking about. However, I wasn’t able to speak, and all I could do was connect my heart with the hearts of others...... That was the only way for me to connect with others.”","Just from hearing those words, I get the impression that she was a lonely God, and she didn’t seem like the kind of being that would be called an Evil God, but perhaps, there’s something more to the story than that.","“However, the “magic power of despair” dwelled within me. Just like the magic power of death, it brings those whose hearts I connected with to despair...... I almost destroyed the world twice because of it.”","[.......However, that’s not what Isis-san wanted...... and was just a side-effect, right?]","“......Unnn. I was lonely, I wanted to connect with someone...... but when I reach out for others, I end up enveloping the world in despair. The first time it happened, I was sealed. The second time, on a scale and at a speed even greater than the first, I nearly dyed the world in despair.”","Isis-san’s hand is trembling slightly. Remembering the loneliness of that moment, it felt as if she was freezing......","Putting a little bit of strength into my hand holding Isis-san’s hand, and without saying anything, I waited for her next words.","“...... And for the second time...... I was killed by the Hero of Hope. No, it’s more correct to say I was almost killed...... but I cast aside most of my body and fled to another world with only my soul, using the last of my strength,...... because I didn’t want to die...... all alone.”","Looking at it from a different perspective, it may truly be a heroic tale. The Great Evil God who once nearly destroyed the world has returned, and the Hero of Hope has defeated them.","However, the Great Evil God had no malicious intent to destroy the world, she was just lonely and wanted to connect with others...... And the only way she could connect with others was by bringing them to despair. It’s a very dreary story.","I couldn’t watch Isis-san trembling any longer, so I reflexively hugged her slender body.","For a moment, Isis-san looked surprised, but then she immediately smiled happily and pressed her face against my chest.","After a short period of silence, being careful not to rush her...... I slowly urged her to continue the conversation.","[......And then, you arrived in this world?]","“......Unnn. I arrived here and immediately met Shallow Vernal. As I said before, Shallow Vernal is on a completely different level from me. It would have been so easy for Shallow Vernal to crush me like a bug and make me disappear.”","I wonder what Isis-san...... the Great Evil God felt at that time? She didn’t want to die alone, so she desperately ran away...... only to meet a strong person she was helpless with on the path of her escape. The tragedy of that moment must have been so great that I can’t even imagine it.","“However, Shallow Vernal didn’t eliminate me. I don’t know what Shallow Vernal was thinking back then, but I think...... it was probably just a whim. She took my soul and recreated its core...... Gave me even greater power, and was born again.”","[......And that’s when Isis-san was born huh.]","“Unnn. In the process of my rebirth as Isis, the magic power of the dead gathered around me and the magic power of despair turned...... no, it evolved into the magic power of death. And for some reason, the memory of the being known as the Great Evil God of Despair remained in the depths of our soul, not completely erased...... Perhaps, the loneliness we felt back then may be because of the hazy memories that linger within it.”","Considering that, how long has Isis-san spent in solitude? Perhaps, it was so long that I can’t even imagine it anymore.","Having such a thought in mind, my embrace towards Isis-san naturally tightened.","“I usually exist as a part of Isis Remnant...... but since olden days, when Isis “receives strong rejection because of her magic power of death”, I appear as a separate consciousness in Isis’ dreams. Well, right now...... I wanted to talk to Kaito, so I kind of forced myself to come out.”","It seems that Isis-san’s story has come to an end. Now then, how should I respond to her?","It must have been hard, it must have been sad, it’s easy to put it into words. However, I don’t think I can say things like I understand her.","[......Thank you for telling me all about it. I’m glad to know a lot more about you than before, Isis-san.]","“......Kaito.”","[Don’t look so anxious. It’s alright...... Even if I know you have such a past, my feelings for you won’t disappear. Whether or not you have the memories of a Great Evil God or not, whether or not your tone of voice is different from the usual Isis-san...... You are definitely the Isis-san I know...... the Isis-san that I love.]","” ! ? Ahh...... Kaito...... Kaito......”","Hearing Isis-san’s words, she tightly hugged me, tears in her eyes. Looking at the anxiety on her face, I could already imagine what she was thinking.","I think that Isis-san basically doesn’t have self-confidence...... or rather, she has experienced a dreary loneliness, which often makes her think in a pessimistic way.","When she told me about the fact that her origin was this Great Evil God, she had such an anxious look on her face, as if she was afraid I would hate her for that.","But well, that’s an unnecessary worry. Something like that wouldn’t change the fact that I love Isis-san.","Isis-san, who was crying as she rubbed her face against my chest, looked up at me with moist eyes...... and slowly closed her eyes.","As for what she wanted, it’s easy to understand without having to think about it. Gently bringing my face close, I put my lips on Isis-san’s lips.","When my lips parted with hers, Isis-san looked like she was pouting a bit, but at the same time, she had a very happy expression on her face.","“......Kaito, I love you. I’m so happy to have met you that I regret all the time I haven’t spent with you.”","[......I also feel the same case.]","“......Unnn!”","Rising on her lips as Isis-san responded as such was a dazzling smile.","Holding hands with Isis-san, we walked through the beautiful snow field under the blue sky again. Isis-san seemed to be in a great mood, walking with a smile on her face that made me feel happy just seeing it.","“Hey, Kaito.”","[Is something the matter?]","“You will soon wake up. Then, I will be there with the other me as Isis Remnant, just as I have always been. But before that, I have one thing...... I’d like to ask Kaito a favor while I still have the memory of the Great Evil God of Despair.”","Hmmm? What in the world could she be requesting? The fact that she went out of her way of saying that “while she still has her memory of the Great Evil God of Despair” suggests that it would be something related to that.","However, according to Isis-san’s story, that Great Evil God was supposed to be a matter of a different world...... I wonder if there’s something that I can do to be of help with my abilities?","As I was thinking like that, Isis-san stared straight into my eyes and spoke with a serious expression on her face.","“Errr, I would appreciate it if you don’t tell Hero of Hope about me. Thanks to Kaito, Hero of Hope has stopped being bound by her past and has begun to look forward, and I don’t think there’s any need to remind her of me now.”","[I see. Well, for Alice, you would probably be an opponent who can be said to be her former nemesis, so if I talk about you, things may turn complicated....... I understand. If that’s what Isis-san says, I’ll keep your true identity hidden in my heart.]","“Unnn!”","After nodding with a bright smile, Isis-san stopped walking and faced me with a small smile on her lips.","“It’s almost morning...... about time for you to wake up.”","[......I see. I’m a little sad to part ways with you...... but you and Isis-san can continue to talk as much as you want, right?]","“Unnn...... I will be in your care from now on, Kaito.”","[Yes. I’m also in your care.]","“Kaito...... I love you. I love you so, so, so much......”","While saying that, Isis-san embraced my body, and I hugged her back. Feeling the soft warmth of her body, my consciousness slowly faded away.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [In the LN, she asked Kaito to send Alice a message for her, but in the WN, the timeline is after the Six Kings Festival, so Alice has already been saved by Kaito, so there’s no need to send a message like that......]","? ? ? : [Well, Alice-chan had actually realized that on her own later on, but she didn’t specifically mention it.]"]},{"number":1523,"title":"Chapter 1523: 1523 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Present 5 ~ ~","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","Today’s chapter is regarding the events in the God Realm War.","It happened when Kaito challenged Shallow Vernal’s ordeals. The people gathered in Sanctuary were anxiously waiting for him as he challenged the ordeal in a dream that can be said to be a dream created by Shallow Vernal.","Kaito’s lovers, who had a strong bond with him, were able to grasp the situation to some extent through their virtual counterparts based on themselves in the virtual world. However, because of this, they could sense that Kaito’s state wasn’t going well.","[......Things don’t look, do they?]","[Right. It feels like we can’t win even if we confront them head-on...... so the question is how we can skillfully act as a decoy and successfully attract their attention, guiding Kaito safely to his destination. I don’t think those things were made with the assumption that Kaito-san can beat it.]","Alice responded to Kuromueina’s words with a serious expression on her face. The current scene within the virtual world depicts Kaito and his friends’ escape from the pitch-black dragon created by Shallow Vernal with a car.","[This sure is vexing. Seeing all this happen, but only being able to wait......]","[Yes, I wish there was something else I could do to help.......]","[It really is difficult. As long as Shallow Vernal-sama is inside, any attempts to interfere will be thwarted. Unless there’s an extraordinary and unexpected method that would catch Shallow Vernal-sama off guard, further intervention is impossible.]","In response to Lilia and Sieg’s words, Fate told them that it would be difficult to help Kaito any further. Of course, Fate’s expression wasn’t one of accepting their current situation, but one of bitterness as she said this.","Even though she can feel that Kaito’s situation isn’t so good, it’s also difficult to help...... In such a situation, Isis had just quietly lowered her head.","“......Isis, are you alright?”","Seeing Isis like that, Lillywood worriedly called out to her. Although Lillywood is not Kaito’s lover and doesn’t accurately know the situation inside the Cradle of Oblivion, she understands from Kuromueina’s explanation that the situation isn’t favorable.","However, even though Lillywood spoke to Isis, she didn’t respond to her words, only mumbling to herself.","[......I can’t do...... anything more than this...... I want to help Kaito...... but I can’t even think of a way to do that.]","“.....................”","[......However...... if...... if you have a way...... Please...... Please help me...... Other me.]","“What are you————- Isis!?”","After muttering to herself, Isis’ body suddenly collapses and Lillywood hurriedly supported her. While Kuromueina and the others also looked back at Isis, noticing what was going on, Lillywood looked surprised after confirming Isis’ condition.","“......Asleep? In a situation like this, she suddenly fell asleep? Just what happened to Isis......”","A prairie full of colorful flowers blooming in the bright sunlight. Before she knew it, Isis found herself standing in such a place. When she looked around, she could see the being that she called out...... the other Isis clad in black dress, from a few distance away.","[......Ahh.]","“So you really noticed all along, but deliberately avoided mentioning it huh. That I am a lingering thought of the magic power of death......”","[......Unnn...... You are also me...... that’s why...... I knew immediately.]","“......I see.”","The consciousness that had been mixed together temporarily separates, facing each other in their mind. Held within Isis’ heart the thought that perhaps, the other Isis, who was once a God in a different world, might have a method that she herself hasn’t thought of yet......","The other Isis, having read her thoughts accurately, calmly spoke.","“First of all, I’ll say this now, we and Shallow Vernal have different strengths. We do not have the power to intervene in this virtual world in which Shallow Vernal is actively blocking intrusions.”","[......Is that so...... Is it no good then?]","“......However, there is one way in which we might be able to help Kaito. I have one ability that could counter Shallow Vernal’s power.”","[......Ability...... That is?]","“My “power to connect hearts”. This is the only thing that I have the full power of when I was a God, so I can influence the world created by Shallow Vernal. Of course, it would only be for a short time until Shallow Vernal realizes it and stops it......”","The only ability left behind in its perfect form by the Great Evil God, who had once given up all her abilities to create a world. The power to connect her heart with others...... It would normally be an ability that doesn’t hold much significance. However, Kaito is currently undergoing an ordeal in what could be said is a mental world.","By connecting her mind, she can temporarily intervene in the virtual world where Kaito is.","“I will now explain how to do this, so listen carefully. First of all......”","The other Isis explained. Hearing the way she could help Kaito, Isis firmly nodded her head.","Isis suddenly fell asleep, but after waking up only after a minute or so, she immediately called out to Kuromueina and the others.","[......I want to help Kaito...... Everyone...... Please cooperate with me.]","[......You have some sort of way to help him? Alright, what can we do?]","Seeing Isis’ eyes filled with strong determination, Kuromueina nodded without even asking for details. If it meant being able to assist Kaito, there was no need for further contemplation.","[......Hereafter...... I will use my power to connect everyone’s heart...... and Kaito’s heart...... so I want everyone to think strongly about Kaito.]","[......Kaito is now in a mental world. If we can convey our strong emotions, it means that it can directly become our strength in that world huh...... Regarding Kaito-san’s whereabouts, since we can grasp our positions to some extent in the virtual world, we can use that as a guide, right?]","[......Unnn...... Also, Fate...... use the Critical Point of Fate on me...... I need complete control of my magic power of death for this.]","[Okay~~ If there’s only one target, I should be fine with my current stamina.]","In exercising her authority to connect hearts, the most crucial factor is the magic power of death. Just as the Great Evil God of despair once did, if one carelessly connects hearts, many individuals will be influenced by the magic power of death.","However, if the Critical Point of Fate allows her to completely control the magic power of death, it makes it possible for her to connect her mind without affecting others.","......In a sense, it is a scene that the Great Evil God of Despair once dreamed of. With the ability she left behind with the desire to connect hearts with many individuals, to be liberated from loneliness......","The fact that this power, in a twist of fate, can be of assistance to her beloved Kaito...... a single tear naturally spilled from Isis’ eye.","Wiping away that tear with her finger, Isis, filled with a strong determination that she would undoubtedly become Kaito’s strength, utilizing the method she had heard from her other self...... she exercised her ability to connect hearts.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, so it was due to Isis’ power that Kaito’s lovers were able to lend their strength in the fight against the dragon huh......]","? ? ? : [Being a power that was outside Shallow Vernal’s awareness, and with her focus directed towards Kaito-san’s fight, Isis-san was able to completely catch her off guard and intervene. In a way, Isis-san could be considered the MVP of that battle.]"]},{"number":1524,"title":"Chapter 1524: 1524 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Future 1 ~ ~","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","From here on out is the future arc. No seriousness anymore.","Today, I was going to stay overnight at Isis-san’s house, so I came to her castle in the Land of Death.","I arrived in front of the familiar gate, which I had visited many times before. Waiting there for me is Isis-san, and when she saw me, she brightened up with a big smile and approached me.","[......Kaito...... Welcome.]","[Hello, Isis-san. I will be in your care today.]","[......Unnn...... If it’s Kaito...... you’re always welcome...... You coming to hang out with me...... makes me happy.]","[Hearing you feeling happy about that also makes me happy.]","Looking at Isis-san, who was really happy about my visit, I also felt happy and smiled. Right at that moment, Eul, who was at Isis-san’s feet, jumped up while wagging her tail. Catching her body, I lifted her up and embraced her.","[Ahaha, I see you’re also quite lively today, Eul.]","[Kyuu!]","[......I’m sure Eul is also...... very happy to meet Kaito.]","From what I’ve heard from Isis-san and Iris-san, Eul is so amazing that one can call her a genius, as she had apparently mastered magic at a considerable level. However, when she happily seeks affection from me or Isis-san, her appearance feels more like that of an adorable child.","In any case, I entered the castle with a warm welcome from Isis-san and Eul, before moving to the common room and taking a seat. After a while, Iris-san came over with tea and cake.","[Hello, Iris-san. I’m sorry for the intrusion.]","[Ahhh, welcome. You can take it easy. As I’ll be showcasing my skills for tonight’s dinner, feel free to have high expectations.]","[......Iris...... is really good at cooking...... and her meals are amazing.]","[Cooking has always just been a hobby, so I’m embarrassed to be praised like that.]","Placing tea and cake in front of me and Isis-san, even though Iris-san wears a wry smile in response to Isis-san’s words of praise, her expression shows a hint of happiness.","Then, after lightly chuckling when she saw Eul on my lap, she spoke.","[Well then, I will be excusing myself. Don’t cause too much trouble, Eulpecula.]","[Kyuu.]","After confirming that Eul firmly nodded her head, Iris-san slightly bowed and left the room.","[Speaking of which, you made a Blue Crystal Flower garden?]","[......Unnn...... Spica manages it...... It’s very beautiful...... Let’s go there together later.]","[I’m looking forward to it. Even so, with the increase in residents, the atmosphere of the castle certainly changed. It’s difficult to say how exactly it has changed, but I kinda feel that something changed in the castle’s overall atmosphere.]","[......Unnn...... I think...... that’s true...... Thanks to everyone coming here...... the whole castle seems to have become lively...... Every day has become enjoyable...... and I feel happy.]","For Isis-san, who has been living alone in this castle for so long, it must be a real joy to have multiple subordinates, including Iris-san, living in the same castle with her.","Seeing Isis-san really happy also makes me feel fulfilled...... I smiled, feeling that this is nice.","Thereupon, seeing my expression, Isis-san cutely tilted her head and curiously asked.","[......Kaito...... Is something the matter?]","[Ahh, no, it’s just, seeing Isis-san looking fulfilled makes me feel fulfilled too...... so I thought this feels nice.]","[......Unnn...... I understand...... that feeling very well...... I also feel that way...... when Kaito is happy...... I feel happy...... and when Kaito feels fulfilled...... I also feel fulfilled.]","[Somehow, being able to share the same feelings also feels good, don’t you think?]","[......Unnn! ......Being happy...... together with Kaito...... makes the happiness...... a lot greater.]","The smile on Isis-san’s face as she said that is truly dazzling, and her expression seems much brighter than when I first met her.","I’m totally convinced...... that the two nights and three days I would spend here with Isis-san would undoubtedly be enjoyable and filled with happiness.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......No seriousness anymore? No seriousness anymore? .......Eh? Why did you find it necessary to declare that here? ......Can I go home?]"]},{"number":1525,"title":"Chapter 1525: 1525 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Future 2 ~ ~","paragraphs":["I arrived at Isis-san’s castle to hang out with her, and after enjoying tea, I played with Eul for a while. After a while, Eul looked tired and started to doze off, so I put her down on her special bed and went outside with Isis-san.","Our purpose was to see the Blue Crystal Flower garden that Spica-san had created. Blue Crystal Flowers are said to be originally difficult to find in clusters. In the first place, the rules as to how they bloom were unknown, so it wasn’t possible to predict where they would grow in clusters.","Well, it turns out that it all depends on Spica-san’s mood......","[......Arehh, when did they build these paths?]","[......Unnn...... The road from the castle to the flower garden...... Rasal and Sirius...... worked hard together.]","[Heehhh, Rasal-san and Sirius-san huh...... I might just be projecting my thoughts on them, but Rasal-san feels like she was in charge of the brains while Sirius-san was in charge of the physical labor.]","[......Correct...... Rasal designed it...... Sirius built it...... and finally, Polaris...... she put up a barrier to keep snow from piling up...... bringing this place to a completion.]","In fact, based on her appearance, Rasal-san appears to be a Mage. No, she’s actually a Necromancer, but she has this atmosphere of a long-ranged combatant. On the other hand, Sirius-san feels like she specializes in close combat. She’s tall, muscular and uses swords......","Well, both of them are powerful Peak Count-ranks, so they can actually handle both close and ranged combat, but that’s the impression I got from the way they look.","[......Rasal is very smart...... and Sirius is very strong...... Together, they can do a lot of things.]","[Heehhh...... Seems like they have good affinity with each other.]","[......Unnn...... They’re close with each other...... They do fight a lot though...... just like Ein and Chronois.]","[......A- Ahh, I see...... The more they fight, the better they get along.]","From what Iris-san told me, I had the impression that they didn’t get along well, but when you liken them to Ein-san and Chronois-san, I can understand and agree with certain aspects.","While having such a conversation, walking hand in hand with Isis-san along the beautiful path, today’s weather is clear, and the snowy field looks quite beautiful. Looking at it this way, it’s strange how even the Land of Death can feel like a normal, beautiful place.","As I was thinking about this, we saw Sirius-san and Rasal-san beyond the path.","[Arehh, just when we were talking about them, it’s Sirius-san and Rasal-san.]","[......You’re right...... What are they doing there?]","From what I see from Sirius-san and Rasal-san, they seemed to be glaring at each other and holding each other’s collars, and the atmosphere around them doesn’t feel very peaceful.","[......You ready or what, corpse b*tch? I’m sure your deathly stench will be a little better if you die here in the Land of Death.]","[Kukaka, prattling about things you can’t do, you’re as brainless as always, musclehead.]","[......You two...... What are you doing?]","[ [ ! ? ] ]","Though they had an atmosphere that could be described as being on the verge of a conflict, the moment Isis-san called out, they looked surprised and immediately let go of each other’s collars. They then put their arms around each other’s shoulders.","[Oya? Isis-sama and Kaito-sama, what a coincidence! If you are taking this path, are you heading to Spica’s flower garden?]","[That’s great, the weather is so nice today, so it is a good day for a date. Ahh, we were just thinking of doing some training.]","[......Training?]","[Yes, Rasal’s various fights are very helpful, so I often ask her to be my training partner.]","Wearing smiles that seemed to be plastered on her face, the two of them answered Isis-san’s words with a gentle demeanor and began whispering to each other about something.","[......Sync our thoughts, now.]","[......Yeah, we can’t let the kind Isis-sama feel sad. Act friendly and get through this.]","I couldn’t hear what they were saying because of the distance, but it seemed that they had no intention to fight in front of Isis-san and were temporarily putting aside their differences.","Given Isis-san’s gentle personality, she would likely worry if the two of them were seriously arguing. Perhaps, Sirius-san and Rasal-san themselves were aware of it, and were behaving accordingly.","Well, if they can act like they are getting along so perfectly...... I guess it is already a fact that they are getting along well......","[......I see...... You two are good friends.]","[Hahaha, yes, we do. Even with this and that, Rasal and I get along well together.]","[Kukaka, likewise, Sirius keeps me from getting bored.]","Although they had smiles on their faces, the emotions conveyed by my Sympathy Magic are filled with a fierce competitive spirit. Moreover, it seems like there’s considerable strength in the hands holding each other’s shoulders.","[......Ahh...... but if you’re going to train...... make sure to put up a barrier...... Both of you are strong...... so you might cause damage to those around you.]","[ [ Hah! ] ]","The two of them answered in perfect sync to Isis who warned them with a gentle smile...... I think they really are good friends. And despite everything, I could really sense their deep admiration of Isis-san, and it’s evident that she has built a good relationship with her subordinates, making me feel the happiness Isis-san was feeling being with them.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Ahh, these two get along well when they’re in front of Isis huh......]","? ? ? : [The Death King’s subordinates are basically a group of people who love Isis-san, so they don’t want her to worry about them. Well, it probably is true that the two of them somehow really get along with each other.]"]},{"number":1526,"title":"Chapter 1526: 1526 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Future 3 ~ ~","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","My apologies. I didn’t have much time to write, so today’s chapter is short.","After meeting Sirius-san and Rasal by chance, we walked for a while again and saw a field of Blue Crystal Flowers that filled my field of vision with what can be described as a blue carpet.","[O- Ohh...... It’s amazing. It’s bigger than I had imagined. It’s really Blue Crystal Flowers as far as the eye can see.]","[......Unnn...... It’s so beautiful.]","As we arrived, admiring the truly amazing flower garden, we saw the familiar back of a woman in a dress in front of the flower garden...... Spica-san. When we approached, Spica-san turned around and spoke with a gentle smile.","[Oya? If it isn’t Isis-sama and Kaito-san~~ Are you on a date?]","[......Unnn...... I came here...... to see the Blue Crystal Flower garden...... together with Kaito.]","[Yes~~ The weather is also nice today, so the Blue Crystal Flowers look beautiful.]","As if guided by Spica-san’s words, I looked at the flower garden and saw the Blue Crystal Flower glistening in the sunlight.","Blue Crystal Flowers, as their name suggests, have a crystal-like atmosphere to it, so they are quite beautiful when the light hits them.","[It’s a very beautiful flower garden. They look beautiful in the sunlight, but it seems like they would also be beautiful in the moonlight, wouldn’t they?]","[That’s right~~ Blue Crystal Flowers are more beautiful at night because of their color. Of course, they are beautiful in the daytime, but they’re also nice to see at night.]","After saying that much, Spica-san clapped her hands, seemingly having just thought of something.","[That’s right! I’m done tending with the garden, so I had intended to go back now, but if you two are here for a date, I’ll give you a little present~~]","[Eh? Ohh......]","As Spica-san smiled and held out her hand, a large number of Blue Crystal Flowers that were in full bloom started moving on their own. Thereupon, a path formed in front of me and Isis-san, allowing the two of us to walk through.","The path seemed to lead to the center of the flower garden, as if the Blue Crystal Flowers were welcoming me and Isis-san.","If you go through this path, you will be able to see the flower garden~~ Please be careful not to step on the flowers, okay~~ Also, I made the central area a bit wider, so if you could leisurely enjoy your time while looking at the Blue Crystal Flowers there, both me and the Blue Crystal Flowers would be delighted.]","[......Thanks, Spica...... Me and Kaito...... both like Blue Crystal Flowers...... so we’re very happy.]","[Yes, thank you very much. We will take our time and fully enjoy it.]","[Yes~~ Hearing that you’re pleased also makes us happy. Well then, please enjoy your stay~~]","Hearing my and Isis-san’s words, Spica-san happily smiled. Then, with a leisurely wave of her hand, she began walking towards the castle with a relaxed pace.","After watching her back as she departed, I held hands with Isis-san and exchanged looks with each other.","[Well then, since Spica-san has gone to the trouble of preparing for us, let’s enjoy our date at the Blue Crystal Flower garden.]","[......Unnn...... I’m looking forward to it.]","Surrounded by Blue Crystal Flowers cherished both in my and Isis-san’s memories, we firmly held hands as we stepped into the flower garden.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Whoa there, that doesn’t look good...... This feels like a lovey-dovey flirting pattern......]","? ? ? : [It’s a long-awaited development.]","Serious-senpai : [It’s a development I was afraid of though!?]"]},{"number":1527,"title":"Chapter 1527: 1527 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Future 4 ~ ~","paragraphs":["I walk hand in hand with Isis-san through the garden of Blue Crystal Flowers. These beautiful blue flowers swaying with the slight breeze are memorable flowers for both Isis-san and I.","The first time I had found such a flower may have been when Isis-san gave it to me when we first met, but in the first place, if Isis-san hadn’t gone to search for a Blue Crystal Flower, we wouldn’t have encountered each other at that time.","If it weren’t for the Blue Crystal Flower, I think the way I had encountered Isis-san would have changed. For example, isn’t it possible that we’d get acquainted after being introduced by Kuro? If that had happened, considering the influence of Isis-san’s magic power of death, it’s naturally possible that Kuro would have set a distance between us which allowed me to have a conversation with Isis-san. There’s also a possibility that she had chosen not to introduce me to Isis-san, considering the danger posed by the influence of her magic power of death.","[......How should I say this...... Encounters are amazing, aren’t they?]","[......Unnn?]","[No, I was just thinking. If Isis-san hadn’t come to the Human Realm to look for Blue Crystal Flowers, I don’t think it would have been easy for me and Isis-san to meet.]","[......That’s true...... I didn’t go out much back then...... and I would hardly go to the Human Realm...... Even back then...... It was my first time going to the Human Realm after several years.]","Yes, while it is Isis-san’s hobby to collect the items that appear in a book, if the items are obtainable in the Demon Realm, she would likely search for them there. And if the setting of the book is the Demon Realm, she would undoubtedly search for them in the Demon Realm as well.","By chance, the setting of the book she happened to read was in the Human Realm, and it was near the capital of Symphonia Kingdom where said Blue Crystal Flower could be found. If one also considers her random thought of buying a book at that time, the likelihood of being able to meet back then is quite miraculous.","And if I had not met Isis-san, I might not have had the chance to get to know Lillywood-san, and with that being the case, I feel like things would turn out really differently.","[When you think about it, the likelihood of that happening is like a miracle...... but that’s how it is with encounters with people, isn’t it? There are a lot of people I wouldn’t have had the chance to meet if the gears of fate had misaligned a little bit.]","[......Unnn...... but...... if you think that way...... I’m really glad...... that I got to meet Kaito.]","[I feel the same way. I’m glad I was able to meet Isis-san. However, when you think about it, you could say that the Blue Crystal Flower was the catalyst for our meeting, right?]","[......Ahh...... You’re right...... It’s because I went looking for a Blue Crystal Flower...... that I got to meet Kaito.]","After saying that much, Isis-san seemed to have thought of something, as a small smile appeared on her lips.","[......In the book I read back then...... the Blue Crystal Flower was the Flower of Happiness...... A mystical flower that works miracles.]","[Right. In that book, it had cured an incurable disease.]","I also had Alice tell me the same book and read it, and indeed, in that story, the Blue Crystal Flower was portrayed as a miraculous flower with mysterious powers.","[......I think the Blue Crystal Flower...... that I found at that time...... was Kaito.]","[Somehow, being told that kinda makes me embarrassed...... but that also makes me happy.]","When I said that with a smile, Isis-san hugged my arm with a happy smile on her lips. Isis-san, leaning her body on me like a child acting spoiled, spoke.","[......Me too...... I’m also happy...... Ehehe...... Kaito...... I loooooove you.]","Isis-san’s innocent laughter and expression were truly adorable, just like that of an angel. How should I say this...... Lately, as her subordinates have increased and she has grown as their King, showing a more mature demeanor, I felt that Isis-san’s true nature hadn’t changed.","Enchanted by her radiant smile, I couldn’t help but let a smile escape as well. Thereupon, gently embracing her, I guided my hand that wasn’t holding her to caress her cheek.","[I love you too, Isis-san. I particularly love seeing you happily smiling as you do now.]","[......The reason why I can smile as I do now...... is because of Kaito.]","[If that’s the case, that’s a smile I can be proud of then. Please continue having such a smile by my side in the future as well.]","[......Unnn...... It will be alright...... Being together with Kaito...... is my happiness.]","Isis-san’s beautiful red eyes looked up at me, and our gazes overlapped. No more words were needed.","Somehow, it feels like we share the same happiness together, and naturally, feelings of endearment for Isis-san well up within me.","As soon as I bent down, Isis-san noticed it immediately, and closing her eyes, she slightly inclined her face upward. Seeing this gesture, as if she accepts my everything, I felt an indescribable affection welling up from deep within my heart, and I quietly placed my lips on her.","Isis-san’s lips, with her low body temperature, felt slightly cold due to the influence of the outside air, but they quickly became warm and soft to the touch. If I were to describe it, it felt as if our body temperatures were being balanced through our lips, creating a somewhat mysterious...... but irresistible pleasantness.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Kha......]","? ? ? : [It’s the long-awaited sweetness from all the previous seriousness, so the shock must have felt so overwhelming that she can’t even afford to scream......]"]},{"number":1528,"title":"Chapter 1528: 1528 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Future 5 ~ ~","paragraphs":["Blue Crystal Flower garden. The path that Spica-san had made for us was, as she had said, wider around the center of the flower garden.","Not only that, but I also feel like, probably due to the arrangement of Spica-san, the ground has turned into something like a lawn, creating a feeling where we can sit down and take a break.","[This should be the center area of the flower garden that Spica-san had mentioned earlier. It certainly feels spectacular, being surrounded entirely by Blue Crystal Flowers.]","[......Unnn...... It’s so beautiful...... Spica has also prepared a grassy ground for us...... Let’s relax here for a bit.]","[You’re right.]","The flower garden was beautiful from the outside, but the sight was just different when we came to the center. The space surrounded by Blue Crystal Flowers all around us felt somehow mystical and had an incredibly pleasant atmosphere.","The Land of Death itself was quiet with no other living creatures around, giving it a very magical feeling.","I sat down on the grassy ground alongside Isis-san. If you think about it carefully, the Land of Death was originally an extremely cold place, and even now, the temperature should be extremely low.","I had never really thought about it because Blue Crystal Flowers can bloom in basically any environment and the people under Isis-san’s command that I had met up to this point were some of the best in the Demon Realm, but without Shiro-san’s blessing, it would have been too cold for me as a normal human to stay here.","Sitting down here and being able to relax like this somehow felt incredibly luxurious.","[......Kaito...... There’s something I want to do...... but would it be alright?]","[Eh? Yeah, what is it?]","[......Errr...... Here...... I want Kaito...... to lie on my lap.]","I momentarily froze in surprise at the words Isis-san said with a smile, lightly tapping her thighs. However, upon reflection, I remembered several instances in which my lovers asked me to lie on their lap, and I had actually experienced it several times as well.","And above all, there’s no reason to refuse if it’s the request of my lover, Isis-san.","[Then, excuse me for a bit.]","[......Unnn.]","Following her request, I slowly put my head on Isis’ thighs. The grassy ground is soft and comfortable to lie on.","When I raised my gaze slightly, I could see Isis-san happily peering into my face. How should I say this...... This feels somewhat embarrassing, but the strong sense of happiness exceeds that.","Gently reaching out her hand to my head, Isis-san lightly stroked it and asked.","[......Kaito...... Does lying down there...... hurt?]","[No, I’m alright. Rather, it feels comfortable...... and I feel fulfilled.]","[......Unnn...... I also...... feel very fulfilled....... Being together with Kaito...... always makes me happy...... How should I say this...... Doing something together with Kaito...... I love it.]","[Ahh~~ I know exactly how you feel. The desire to do something for the person I love, the happiness knowing that they’re happy.]","[......Unnn...... Also...... Along with that...... Having the thought of wanting to do something for the person I love...... also makes me feel incredibly fulfilled.]","Those sounded like very deep and valuable words. Isis-san is a really kind person, but due to various factors, she spent a long time alone.","That’s why she must be happy to be able to do something that makes me, her lover, happy. Even if the things Alice told her were strange, she will do it if she hears that it will make me happy. And furthermore, I understand how Isis-san feels.","[I know exactly how you feel, as although it wasn’t much longer than Isis-san, there was a time when I didn’t have much interaction with people. It’s wonderful, isn’t it? Knowing that there is someone for whom you want to do something and wish for their happiness...... for their fulfillment, that feeling is truly wonderful, isn’t it?]","[......Unnn...... Hearing that Kaito also feels the same way makes me happy...... Hearing you’re fulfilled also makes me fulfilled...... Sharing the same feelings with you...... also makes me very fulfilled...... I’m so fulfilled...... that I feel helplessly happy.]","[I also feel fulfilled seeing you so fulfilled, Isis-san.]","[......Fufu...... We’re the same...... And my sense of fulfillment...... increased once again.]","Even in a trivial conversation, being able to feel joy and fulfillment like this, and that it increases along within our conversations, I truly believe it is a remarkable thing.","How should I say this...... The feeling of endlessly increasing fulfillment is truly comforting.","[Well, you can never have too much fulfillment, so let’s continue to accumulate it together.]","[......Unnn...... I’m sure that together with Kaito...... we can definitely be more fulfilled than we are now...... and I’ll also make sure...... that Kaito would be happier than you are now.]","[Ahaha. Then, let’s continue to enjoy ourselves in the future so that we can become even more fulfilled together than we are now.]","[......Unnn!]","Rather than one of us unilaterally making the other fulfilled, we will have fulfillment together...... Somehow, I kinda feel the same way as Isis-san felt earlier. I mean, by confirming each other’s feelings...... I felt my sense of fulfillment increase once again.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [That was a good Extra Chapter arc! Yep, we’re done here! Everyone’s gonna clean up, yes!!!?]","? ? ? : [We’re still at 5.]","Serious-senpai : [......Hyiiih.]"]},{"number":1529,"title":"Chapter 1529: 1529 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Future 6 ~ ~","paragraphs":["After enjoying the time with Isis-san in the flower garden, we returned to Isis-san’s castle again and spent a pleasant time in the library talking about books with Isis-san.","For some reason, I often find myself visiting the library when I visit Isis-san’s castle. Isis-san talks about various books, and the leisurely time I spend with her, nodding along and asking questions, is a very happy time.","[......This book...... is so good at describing the scenery...... that just by reading it...... I can picture it in my head...... as if I’m looking at the scenery myself.]","[Fumu fumu, this book also looks interesting. Hmmm, they all look interesting and I’m not sure which one to read first. Come to think of it, I’m changing the subject, but I don’t think I’ve seen Polaris-san today.]","[......Unnn...... Iris said...... that Polaris...... went to gather ingredients for dinner.]","Today I encountered Eul first, then Iris-san, then Sirius-san and Rasal-san, and having met Spica-san in the flower garden, I encountered almost all the people in Isis-san’s castle. However, the only one I hadn’t encountered was just Polaris-san, so curious, I asked about her and Isis-san said she went to gather ingredients for dinner.","Considering how she said she “gathered ingredients” rather than “buying”, perhaps she’s gathering ingredients that are normally difficult to obtain.","[......Because Kaito is coming...... everyone is excited...... Even Eul said she was going to decorate the dining room.]","[You didn’t have to be so fancy...... However, I’m happy to be welcomed.]","Thinking that they might be preparing a feast for dinner, I felt apologetic, but also a strong feeling of happiness.","It feels nice to have a friendly relationship with Isis-san’s subordinates...... or rather, her family. Even so, Eul is apparently decorating...... I knew she was smart and dexterous, but I didn’t know she was already capable of such a thing......","While I was thinking about this, the door to the library opened and I heard a young voice.","[......Excuse my intrusion. Isis-sama, are we to have dinner time as scheduled?]","[......Unnn...... It’s alright.]","[......Unnn? Eh? Arehh?]","The one who entered the room was a petite girl with silver semi-short hair whom I did not recognize, and wondering who she was, I tilted my head for a moment...... but the presence transmitted by my Sympathy Magic...... was that of Eul.","[......Eh? Are you...... Eul?]","[Yes! Ahh, that’s right. This would be the first time Kaito-sama sees this form. My apologies for surprising you.]","[......Eul...... can already use Humanization Magic...... so just like Megiddo, she can take on a human form.]","[Ahh, I see...... Humanized form huh.]","Now that she mentioned it, I guess that makes sense. Eul’s magic power is incredibly powerful, and from what I’ve heard from Isis-san and Iris-san, she’s an exceptional genius who quickly became proficient in Advanced Magic. In that case, it wouldn’t be surprising if she could also use Humanization Magic.","And looking at her after knowing that, I could see that her hair color is the same as the color of Eul’s fur, so I could certainly see the resemblance.","[......It’s just...... Eul doesn’t seem to like this form...... so she doesn’t use Humanization Magic very often.]","[Is that so?]","[H- Hmmm, rather than hate...... I don’t want to change my appearance with magic, I want my true appearance to be that of a Demon’s like Isis-sama. However, recreating one’s own body is a fairly advanced technique, and it’s still difficult for me at the moment. I haven’t fully mastered my latent magical abilities, and I also lack sufficient magic power, so I can’t use it. Therefore, because you could say that it’s still not complete, I don’t really want to be in this form. Today, since Kaito-sama had come all the way to visit us, I also wanted to do something, so I was decorating in this form.]","I see, I certainly heard from Isis-san that Eul is thinking of recreating her own body and doing some kind of reincarnation.","I heard that it would be the same magic as the one Kuro used to transform Neun-san’s body into a Demon’s, but it’s a magic so advanced that even Lilia-san didn’t know about its particulars and was surprised when she heard about it, so even if Eul is a genius, it’s probably not so easy to perform.","And so, until she’s able to do so, she’s using Humanization Magic in place of it in necessary situations.","After listening to the situation and responding with a nod, I put my hand on the petite Eul’s head and lightly patted her with a smile.","[......I see, you did your best to make me feel welcome. Thank you, Eul.]","[Ehehe, t- t- that’s only natural! I’ll do my best for Isis-sama and Kaito-sama’s sake!!!]","[I’m glad to hear that, but don’t overdo it, okay? Even so, I’m glad I’m able to talk with Eul like this.]","[I’m also happy to talk to Kaito-sama, and being patted on my head is happiness, so I’m glad I used Humanization Magic..... Ahh, b- but of course, the main reason I used it is to make sure the decorations are done properly!]","Along with her petite appearance, Eul, who was happily smiling when I was patting her head, looks incredibly adorable. Seeing her respond with such joy, much like a child being praised, was quite heartwarming.","[......Eul too, if you’re not busy...... How about we chat together?]","[Eh? Am I not disturbing you two by staying here?]","[That isn’t the case. Both Isis-san and I welcome you here.]","[Ahh...... T- Then...... In that case...... I will gratefully accept your kind words.]","Hearing what Isis-san and I said, Eul nodded her head with a really happy smile on her face.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [She hasn’t mastered her abilities, but with the enormous magic power as a Ten-Tailed Mystic Silver and talent as good as Lilia’s, it certainly is no wonder that she can use Humanization Magic......]","? ? ? : [Incidentally, since her change in appearance is caused by Humanization Magic, it seems like she has lost her ears and tails. That was something she couldn’t accept, so","she doesn’t intend to use it very much......]","Serious-senpai : [I mean, Eulpecula really feels like Isis and Kaito’s child huh......]"]},{"number":1530,"title":"Chapter 1530: 1530 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Future 7 ~ ~","paragraphs":["After a short conversation with Eul, who had turned into a humanized version of herself, she left the room, though looking a bit reluctant, saying she was going back to preparing the dining room.","But even so, she looked enthusiastic that they were about to throw a party. She was actually decorating the room after all......","[......Speaking of, it might be even better to someday invite acquaintances to Isis-san’s castle and have a party.]","[......Ahh...... that...... sounds fun...... However...... I wonder if they’ll come?]","[First, I don’t think there’s any problem with the Six Kings’ attendance. Kuro, Alice, Lillywood-san, Megiddo-san...... Even Magnawell-san, who had size problems, can come with no problem since he got that clone recently.]","It’s not like we’re actually planning a party, but I should try discussing it with Isis-san on the assumption that it might happen.","The Six Kings attending wouldn’t be a problem. I think the word party doesn’t really suit Megiddo-san, or rather, I feel like she just really fits more with banquets, but if the schedule is right, it shouldn’t be a problem to gather everyone.","[Even if you consider the influence of the magic power of death and limit the invitees to Peerage-holders, wouldn’t you be able to gather quite a bit of people? Other than Isis-san’s acquaintances, there are also those that your subordinates interact with......]","[......Indeed...... Sirius is acquainted with Megiddo’s men...... Rasal is also acquainted with Sechs and Tiamat.]","Tiamat-san...... or rather, Medea-san huh. I feel like she’s pretty dangerous...... but well, with Alice going with her as her guardian, wouldn’t it be alright? In fact, she had received a table and chairs from Rasal-san, so I guess they have a relationship in which they more or less talk with each other.","Come to think of it, even if the Six Kings’ subordinates were excluded, there are still those Isis-san talked with at the Harmonic Symphony’s tea party...... If I’m not mistaken, their names should be Claire-san and Bella-san? I wonder if those two will come if we invite them?","[......I think Fate-san and the others would come if we invited her, and I have a feeling that Lilia-san would also come if it fits her schedule...... Arehh? If you really set up a party, wouldn’t you be able to gather a considerable number of people?]","[......I- Indeed...... There are a lot...... of people who would come...... Ehehe...... Somehow...... this makes me happy.]","[You’re right. As expected, some things have changed...... Or rather, I feel like Isis-san’s kindness is beginning to spread to those around you, also making me happy.]","[......It’s thanks to Kaito...... It’s because Kaito saved me...... that I changed...... I’m absolutely sure of that...... That’s why...... thank you.]","[Ahaha, you’re welcome...... I guess?]","[......Unnn!]","Seeing Isis-san smiling happily makes me very happy as well. Now that I think about it, I really feel that Isis-san is beginning to be widely accepted.","Of course, Peerage-holders were originally capable of talking to Isis-san even with her magic power of death. However, I still have the impression that Isis-san was feared back then.","In fact, even Lilia-san, who had the strength of a Peerage-holder at the time, was initially quite intimidated by Isis-san and her magic power of death. However, now I feel that her fear of Isis-san has been resolved to the extent that she would welcome Isis-san with a smile if she came to visit her mansion.","The biggest factor for this is probably Isis-san’s mentality. As Alice mentioned, Isis-san used to be always in a tense state, constantly intimidating those around her, making it difficult for her gentle nature to be conveyed to those around her, which in turn made people fear her even more, ending up in a vicious cycle.","However, now that this situation has been resolved, people are beginning to see that Isis-san has a gentle and calm personality. Lillywood-san even mentioned that Isis-san has recently exuded a comforting and gentle atmosphere. So in the end, the most important thing really is the state of her heart.","[......In that case, why don’t you try to organize a full-fledged party? I’ll also help you out.]","[......Unnn...... I’d like to try it out...... With Kaito helping me...... I’m sure it will go well...... That’s why...... Let’s think about it together?]","[Yes. We also need to consult with your subordinates, but let’s think about a rough plan first. After that, we can consult Iris-san and the others and work things out.]","[......Unnn!]","Although it started out as an idea, just discussing it like this made me somewhat happy, as it made me realize that Isis-san is accepted by the people around her.","Since Isis-san herself was enthusiastic about the idea, the two of us talked about party planning for a while.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [If it actually gets held, it does seem like she’d gather quite a number of people.]","? ? ? : [Since the location and environment of the Land of Death is somewhat of a bottleneck, only people with considerable power will be able to gather, but a certain number of people could certainly gather.]"]},{"number":1531,"title":"Chapter 1531: 1531 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Future 8 ~ ~","paragraphs":["While I was happily talking with Isis-san about party plans, Polaris came to the storeroom.","[Isis-sama, Kaito-sama, my apologies for interrupting your conversation. Dinner is ready, and I have come to invite you.]","[......Thanks...... Polaris.]","[It seems like time has passed so quickly without us realizing it. Thank you, Polaris-san.]","It seems that we had gotten really engrossed with our talks that dinner time had already arrived before we knew it. When I thanked Polaris-san for calling us, Polaris-san politely bowed once.","This is just my vague impression, but I feel like Polaris-san is very polite and well-mannered.","[Well then, shall we put our books away and head to the dining room?]","[......Unnn.]","We put away the books we took out from their shelves and headed for the dining room with Polaris-san leading the way. When we got there, Isis-san’s castle was beautifully decorated, and it really felt like we were having a party.","Since they said Eul was the one decorating the place, I thought it would turn out like a birthday party decorated by a child...... but the place looked quite authentic. I guess that’s to be expected of Eul.","[Ah, Isis-sama, Kaito-sama!]","When Isis-san and I arrived, the humanized Eul happily rushed over.","[Ummm, I’ve decorated the place, b- but is it strange?]","[It was so beautifully decorated. You’re amazing, Eul.]","[......Unnn...... The place...... looked very beautiful.]","[Ehe, ehehe.]","Seeing Eul looking like she wanted to be praised, I put my hand on her head and stroked it, to which Eul happily smiled. How should I say this...... She really feels like a child and was really cute.","As we were led to our seats by a happy Eul, Sirius-san, Rasal-san and Spica-san arrived. Iris-san is preparing food at the back of the dining room, so other than her, everyone in Isis-san’s camp is now present.","[......Isis-sama, is it really alright, sitting together with us? If it’s just the two of you, couldn’t you enjoy it at your own pace?]","[......No...... Being with everyone...... makes me happier.]","[Yes, I also feel the same way. The dining room is very spacious, so it’s more fun to eat when the place is lively.]","The dinner is also attended by Isis-san’s subordinates. Rather, it’s usually the case that everyone","dinner together, so I informed them that them joining like usual is alright.","Having a meal alone with Isis-san would certainly also be fun, but since I came to Isis-san’s castle like this, I want to interact with everyone under her command.","[Since that’s the case, everyone can just be grateful for Isis-sama and Kaito-sama’s kindness and join you at the dinner table.]","[Yes~~ Well then, please excuse us~~]","While Eul energetically informed that to everyone, I couldn’t help but feel that her tone was slightly different from when she was talking to us. Perhaps, Eul was only trying to behave as politely as possible in front of me and Isis-san. Of course, there might be other details when it comes to Isis-san, but other than that, she gives the impression of a good girl wanting to be praised, which somehow made me smile.","Spica-san, with her relaxed tone of voice, sat down, and the others took their seats as well. With them seated, there are only two seats left with cups and other cutleries available in front...... Unnn? Two seats?","I know whose seat one of them is for. That would be Iris-san’s seat, who is preparing the food, but whose seat is the one next to hers for?","[......Isis-san, there are two seats left, Iris-san’s and...... who?]","[......Errr...... Just a moment.]","Isis-san got up from her seat, moved toward the window and went straight outside. Then, after a few moments, she returned with a puzzled Alice.","[......Eh? Me?]","[......Unnn...... Shalltear too, eat with everyone...... Shalltear...... being the only one outside...... must feel lonely.]","[Hahh...... Well, since the host has invited me, I guess I’ll have to accept the invitation.]","Alice, who usually accompanies me as my guard, considerately stays in a separate place when I’m spending time with my lovers.","This time too, for Isis-san’s sake, she was probably on the roof of the castle. The reason Isis-san went outside earlier was to call Alice.","And the fact that she also invited Alice to dinner is very typical of Isis-san. She really is angelic. Alice also looked slightly astounded, but seeing the seat prepared for her with a wry smile on her face, I guess she didn’t feel bad about it.","And Alice being seated next to Iris-san was her consideration. Putting aside Isis-san’s other subordinates, Iris-san isn’t being timid around Alice, and if Alice is next to her close friend Iris-san, she will be able to enjoy her meal and make the conversations more enjoyable.","If preparations were made by informing Iris-san in advance and arranging a seat for Alice with that in advance...... I felt like it really was just like Isis-san, and above all, I could feel her growth.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [As expected of Isis-san’s kindness. It’s wonderful that she cares about the transcendental beauty guard, Alice-chan, who plays an active role in secretly helping in all ways. It seems that there’s a certain someone who gave such a wonderful Isis-san the nickname “Death King”, but they sure are quite the heartless fellow, aren’t they?]","Serious-senpai : [T- This guy...... She’s actually single-handedly handling the roles of providing feedback, praise and criticism......]"]},{"number":1532,"title":"Chapter 1532: 1532 - Extra Chapter: Maids Omen","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I’m struggling a bit with the next chapters, so I’m going to put in a couple of other Extra Chapters in between.","This is the story of the Six Kings back when they used to live under Kuromueina.","At Kuromueina’s residence in the center of the Demon Realm, meals are basically eaten together by the family. In the first place, meals themselves are not essential for all High-ranking Demons, but since Kuromueina is a gourmand and loves to eat, the family has many instances in which they have meals together.","This time too, the family gathered around a table lined with dishes prepared by Ein. Of course, taking into consideration the size of the house and the fact that Magnawell was unable to enter the house, meals are often held on the terrace.","[Hmmm, it smells so good. Good gracious, Ein-san sure is great at cooking as usual.]","[......You seem to be dissatisfied, Shalltear? If you have something to complain about, feel free to speak up.]","[......Eh? No, rather, didn’t I compliment you just now?]","While preparing food for Shalltear, who hadn’t been a member of their family for that long of a time, Ein looked at her with an indescribable sense of frustration.","When Shalltear tilted her head at her gaze, seemingly trembling with humiliation, Ein squeezed out her answer.","[......You are indeed far superior to me in many respects. You’re even closer than I am to the ideal servant I aspire to be. I’ll admit, you’re better than me now...... but don’t expect that to be the case in the future!]","[Eeehhh, you’re suddenly getting all hostile against me for some reason...... Kuro-san, what’s with her?]","Hearing Ein say this with tears in her eyes, Shalltear, with an indescribable expression on her face, calls out to Kuromueina, who is sitting a short distance away.","Thereupon, with a wry smile on her face, Kuromueina answered Shalltear’s question.","[Well, she was just frustrated that she lost in various competitions like cooking against Shalltear.]","[......What, that’s just because of our age difference. Ein-san also has pretty high levels, so you’d be able to reach my level in the not-too-distant future.]","[......Even if you say that all leisurely, that will only be for the time being. I’ll definitely crush that triumphant look on your face.]","[Wasn’t I backing you up just a while now? Is anything I say not gonna work in your ears!?]","Yes, the newest addition to the family, Shalltear, was extremely versatile and could be described as a master of all fields.","It all started when Ein, who happened to see Shalltear cooking on a whim and was shocked by her skills, challenged her to a match and lost. As a person aiming to become an ideal servant, Ein was so frustrated by this defeat that she challenged her to a match in various other areas, such as dressmaking and the likes...... but she lost in all of them.","Being forced to admit that Shalltear is currently superior to her, she was unable to hide her frustrations, bringing about a strong sense of rivalry against Shalltear. Shalltear, on the other hand, felt no sense of rivalry against her, and was instead regretting her previous actions, wondering if she should have held back her skills and let herself lose.","[Listen here, you. The one who shall be the ideal servant will be me, not you...... I will never lose.]","[Nah, I’m not aiming for anything like that though...... Don’t bother getting me involved with your antics, just go ahead and be the ideal maid on your own.]","[......Maid? Shalltear, what is this maid?]","Ein reacted to the words Shalltear astoundedly uttered. She understood that Shalltear is a being from another world and that she held knowledge that Ein and the others didn’t know...... but be that as it may, there was something about the word “maid” that strongly drew her attention.","[Eh? Ahhh, that’s what the people of my world call the position you were aiming for. Well, just think of them as female servants. It’s not something you should be bothered about————-]","[......Maid...... Maid...... Why is it that I feel...... that I’m connected by fate with such a word......]","[......Ah~~ I kinda feel like I may have said something unnecessary. Let’s stop with this topic and get on with our meals......]","[Wait right there, Shalltear! Please tell me more about this maid!!! This is just my hunch, but I feel like this is the one I should be aiming for!]","She doesn’t know the reason, nor does she have any basis for such thought. But deep within Ein, she could feel her soul screaming. In order to clarify her vision, the ideal servant she was pursuing, the existence of this maid is indispensable......","Overwhelmed by this absurd amount of enthusiasm, Shalltear looked indescribably repulsed.","[......This looks really troublesome, so no.]","[Kuhh...... so you’re saying you won’t give me the hint to becoming an ideal servant so easily huh. Alright then, bring it on. When I win against you, I will have you tell me what a maid is!]","[No, there’s no merit for me to do that, right!? I understand. I don’t wanna go along with this match of yours, so I’ll tell you after meal......]","[Shalltear! Thank you!!!]","[......Even though you were staring at me like I slaughtered your parents just now, the change in attitude is just too quick......]","In contrast to Ein, who had a smile of heartfelt happiness, Shalltear looked as if things had really become troublesome.","And thus, that exchange became the catalyst that brought about a great change in the perception of maids in that realm...... no, in the whole Trinia.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Arehh? I thought the concept of maids was handed down by someone who used to play Hero......]","? ? ? : [ No, that isn’t the case. Well, that’s how the world perceived it, but that actually isn’t the case. It’s just, in the Human Realm, after the Treaty of Friendship, Ein-san spread the word that maids “possess bodies passed down by Hero actors”. Otherwise, there’s no way maids being stronger than average knights would become common sense.]","Serious-senpai : [Ahh...... Well, indeed...... Then, when you trace back all your maid troubles, isn’t that all your fault?]","? ? ? : [No, as expected, that’s just extreme logic. No matter how high spec Alice-chan’s brain is, there’s no way she can predict that a monster showing abnormal obsession with maids would be born from such a casual exchange......]"]},{"number":1533,"title":"Chapter 1533 - Intermission: Baby Castellas Beginnings","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I will return to the continuation of Isis Extra Chapters tomorrow.","This is a story of when the Six Kings were still living with Kuromueina in the Central Demon Realm.","Shalltear was cooking in the kitchen of Kuromueina’s home when Isis and Kuromueina arrived.","[......That smells good...... Shalltear...... Are you...... making something?]","[Unnn? Yes, I kinda felt like eating some, so I’m making baby castellas.]","[Baby castellas? Is that some snack from the world Shalltear lived in?]","[That’s right. Well, they’re just simple confectioneries, so it might be possible that it already exists in this world, just having a different name, but in my world, this confectionery I’m making was called baby castella. Since you’re here, Kuro-san, Isis-san, would you like to have some?]","Shalltear is a being who came from another world, possessing knowledge unlike those Kuromueina and the others know. She would sometimes cook on a whim like this, and it was quite fascinating for Kuromueina, Isis, and even for Ein, who isn’t present at the moment.","This time too, she had made baby castellas, which were unfamiliar to Isis and Kuromueina, and Alice and put them on a plate in front of the two.","[......Ahh...... delicious...... It has a very...... gentle taste.]","[.....................]","[The dish is simple, but it’s pretty good, isn’t it? The dishes that were elaborately made with all sorts of techniques certainly may be good, but even if that were the case, simple stuff like this can be the most delicious...... Wait, Kuro-san? Is it not to your liking?]","After eating a baby castella, Isis had a smile on her face, while Kuromueina, her eyes closed, froze where she sat. Wondering what was going on, Shalltear asked while tilting her head, and after a few moments, Kuromueina’s eyes opened wide.","[It’s this! This is it!!!]","[That? What is?]","[This is exactly what I’ve been looking for! Reasonably sized, gentle and easy to eat, simple yet profound, this is the snack I’ve been looking for!]","[......U- Unnn? I don’t really know what’s going on, but I’m glad you liked it.]","Despite feeling somewhat bewildered by Kuromueina’s unusual excitement, Shalltear, thinking all is well if she liked it, thought that this matter is concluded and was about to return to cooking, but immediately after that, Kuromueina’s swiftly placed her hands on Shalltear’s shoulders.","[Shalltear, what kind of confectionery is this baby castella?]","[W- What kind? No, it’s just a simply baked confectionery made with flour and eggs...... If you liked them that much, I can give you the recipe, you know? It’s so easy that anyone can make it as long as they have the ingredients and a baking mold.]","[Anyone can easily make this taste....... A- Amazing. Are there other variations or options for this?]","[Well, since it has a simple taste, it also makes it possible for various possibilities of application. You can put chocolate inside it while baking, or you can also knead something into the dough.]","[......It has wide expandability as well...... Amazing....... This is amazing.]","[You can put it in a paper bag and easily carry it around.]","[I can carry it in one hand and eat it whenever I want...... W- What ground-breaking item this is......]","Seeing Kuromueina praising so much in a way they’ve never seen before, Shalltear, as well as Isis, looked surprised.","Due to the overwhelming enthusiasm and praise from Kuromueina, with a complicated expression on her face, Shalltear decided to intentionally say random things.","[......You can go on a platform and eat it on a moonlit night to have it as tsukimi baby castella.]","(T/N: She’s basically changing tsukimi dango.)","[C- Changing with the circumstances...... H- How adaptable is this!?]","[............When you’re talking, you can intentionally mistakenly say “It’s heavy cocktail”, to which another would throw out a “No, it’s baby castella” tsukkomi, which has the effect of livening up the conversation.]","[I- It even has the effect of facilitating communication...... Its possibilities are infinite!!!]","[......No matter what I say, you’re gonna give them high praises huh. You like them that much......]","As Shalltear watched Kuromueina in a state of overwhelming praise, despite the random things she blurted out, she had an indescribable expression on her face.","It was difficult for Kuromueina herself to explain how she feels, but to put it simply, it was a situation where “she had encountered the food that perfectly matched her preferences after a long period of time”. Her eyes sparkled with excitement and looked deeply moved.","[I knew the moment I tasted it. Baby castellas have endless possibilities!]","[......Errr...... Shalltear...... Is that how it is?]","[No, even back in my previous world, I’ve never heard anyone say things like baby castellas having infinite possibilities......]","[It’s decided! I have decided! I will pursue the infinite possibilities of the baby castellas!!! And then, I will come across a multitude of baby castellas!!!]","[......Ahh, that so. Yeah, do your best there...... Then, I’ll be excusing myself here......]","Shalltear, feeling that things were going to be troublesome, tried to leave the scene after giving a noncommittal response, but Kuromueina quickly swooped in front of her.","In terms of ability, Kuromueina is superior to Shalltear, and it’s impossible to escape from Kuromueina when she’s serious.","[......Hey, Shalltear. Tell me more about baby castellas...... please?]","[I have a bad feeling about this! You kinda look like Ein-san when I taught her about maids!!! I guess a servant would really resemble her master huh? I’d prefer if you both don’t involve me in this......]","[Thank you, Shalltear! Well then, the two of us, let’s talk about the possibilities of baby castellas!]","[Did you even listen to what I said just now!? Where in the heck did I say I agreed!!!?]","Kuromueina going into a frenzy with her eyes sparkling is extremely unusual, or rather, it was something both the newcomer Shalltear and her long-time family Isis were seeing for the first time. Anyhow, just like that, she cheerfully dragged away the shrieking Shalltear.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, this marks the day the Baby Castella Demon was born...... No, including that maid matter, isn’t that all your fault!!!?]","? ? ? : [I mean, I didn’t know random stuff like that would bite me in the ass like that! Heck, I still don’t know what drives Kuro-san that much...... Rather, Alice-chan is a victim here, okay? A victim.]"]},{"number":1534,"title":"Chapter 1534: 1534 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Future 9 ~ ~","paragraphs":["Isis and Kaito, the Death King’s subordinates under the lead of Iris, and finally, Alice...... A total of nine people sit at the dinner table. Looking at this lively scene, Isis suddenly remembered the past.","The time when this castle had just been completed...... While thanking Shalltear for making the spacious dining room just as she had asked for, Isis once tried sitting on the chair she is now sitting on.","Thinking that one day she would sit here, surrounded by many subordinates...... her family in a lively dining room, Isis sat down on this chair...... but at that time, she saw nothing.","She hoped that such a future would happen. There was no mistaking that...... However, Isis back then couldn’t imagine anyone other than herself sitting in that big dining room.","No matter how many times she sat down and ate, all she could think of was the sight of herself alone in the spacious dining room. She had the vague desire to have a meal with her large family, but she wasn’t able to imagine anything concrete...... As if deep down in her heart, she had already given up on the idea that such a day would ever come......","Not wanting to admit the feeling of despair spreading through her heart, as if to avert her eyes from it, Isis stopped using this dining room. She closed the door of the dining room tightly, only trying to keep it clean with State Preservation Magic. As if to freeze her wish just as they are......","The time when the door of this dining room reopened was when Kaito, her beloved who she fortuitously met, came to stay at her home for the first time. Thinking about it again, since that time...... Her frozen dreams may have begun to move again......","Having such thoughts in mind, Isis moved her gaze.","[Try to hold back eating, oi.]","[Isn’t it fine, eating as I please? Iris can make more each time we run out......]","[If you want to eat something other than what’s on the table right now, make it yourself. Of course, you will have to provide your own ingredients.]","[Ehhh, I’m like, a guest here, you know?]","[My apologies, but may I ask for your understanding, Phantasmal King No Face-sama?]","[Ughee...... A- Alright already...... I’ll restrain myself, so please stop with those disgusting honorifics.]","Since they’re best friends, Iris and Alice are enjoying their meal in a casual atmosphere.","[......Hou, the taste is truly interesting, but it was indeed tasty.]","[Indeed, I’ve never been interested in eating, but very lately, I’m starting to think that isn’t so bad.]","[That, I agree. I have not eaten for a long time, but now, I’ve completely become a fan of Head-dono’s cooking.]","Sirius, Rasal and Polaris were eating the food prepared by Iris with admiration...... Sirius and Rasal, who usually quarreled frequently, don’t get in a bad mood when they are eating, as they were having trivial chats in the midst of their meal.","[Arehh~~? Why can’t I eat as nicely as Eul?]","[I’m not doing anything special though? Look, I just eat like this.]","[L- Like this? Hmmm, I enjoy eating, but I just can’t get used to using tableware.]","Spica, who had never eaten before because she had materialized as a Spirit, was still not used to handling tableware and was having a hard time with it.","Unlike her though, Eulpecula’s natural dexterity enabled her to master the knife and fork, and even chopsticks soon after learning Humanization Magic, and while teaching Spica how to use the knife and fork, she eats her own meal.","[......Isis-san?]","[......Ahh...... No, it’s just...... It’s so bustling...... and enjoyable.]","[You’re right. Everyone eating with smiles on their faces, things just naturally turn out fun.]","[......Unnn.]","While returning a smile to her beloved Kaito, who was smiling next to her, Isis slowly moved her gaze again.","This was a sight that she couldn’t imagine back then...... but now, it’s different. The scene before her wasn’t one where she’s eating with Kaito and her subordinates...... Just like when she had a vision of her subordinates gathering like this, Isis felt like she could see faint visions of the future in her eyes.","The sight of a large number of subordinates...... her family of around a hundred, having a meal in the dining room, cheerfully merrymaking, will surely become a reality someday...... and that she strongly believes she will make it a reality.","Isis’ frozen heart and dreams were illuminated and thawed by her sun, Kaito...... and she now has great warmth and hope held in her heart.","[......Kaito.]","[Yes?]","[......Ehehe...... I love you very much.]","Envisioning a happy future...... and realizing that this in itself was also happiness, Isis happily smiled.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Alright, that neatly wraps things up! WIth this, Isis’ Extra Chapter is......]","? ? ? :[That’s right. The important part is over, so all that’s left is Kaito-san and Isis-san flirting.]","Serious-senpai [......? ? ?]"]},{"number":1535,"title":"Chapter 1535: 1535 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Future 10 ~ ~","paragraphs":["The meal with Isis-san and her subordinates in the dining room was quite enjoyable. Isis-san’s subordinates have quite the personalities, but they are all nice people, and looking at them like this, you can tell that they get along well with each other.","Isis-san calls them her family, and I can say that they really are a close-knit family. Even though they are both subordinates, I feel that they are quite different from the Ten Demons or the Five Warlords. In terms of atmosphere, I guess they might be closer to the Seven Princesses back at Lillywood-san’s place. Just like how they get along well at Harmonic Symphony’s tea party, going to a festival with good friends......","Well, you could say that the good friendship among the Death King’s subordinates is a result of Isis-san’s personality.","[......Kaito...... The bath preparations are ready...... Should we go in?]","[Eh? Ah, I guess so. We’ve just finished dinner, so I’d like to freshen up.]","After eating dinner, I moved to Isis-san’s room to take a break after dinner, and while we were chatting leisurely, she made such a suggestion.","It was indeed a good time to take a bath. Since the bath at Isis-san’s home is an onsen, it would be nice to take a relaxing soak while watching the snowy landscape.","[......Unnn...... Then...... Let’s go.]","[......Eh? Ahh, yeah...... You’re right, let’s go.]","I was perplexed by Isis-san’s remark, but thinking about it again, from her first question, the way she spoke seemed to be under the assumption that we would be getting in the bath together.","Putting aside if it were back then, Isis-san and I are lovers, so there’s no problem bathing together...... No, of course, I still feel some embarrassment from doing that......","[......Ehehe...... All day today...... Always together with Kaito...... I’m so happy.]","[Hearing you say that also makes me happy.]","Hmmm, Isis-san’s reactions are all cute. Rather, she’s really happy to be with me, and even though it feels somewhat ticklish, it’s a happy feeling.","Finding ourselves holding hands without anyone particularly initiating it, we headed for the bath.","I had thought this when I came to stay overnight before, but the onsen at Isis-san’s house is truly spectacular. Because of the barrier, the onsen can’t be seen from the outside, but the outside can be normally seen from the inside and we were able to enjoy the view.","I have Shiro-san’s blessing, so this really isn’t something I particularly care about, but even in extremely cold weather, the temperature inside the barrier is maintained at a constant level, so it’s not cold.","In fact, even though the castle is in a land of snow and ice, it doesn’t feel chilly inside Isis-san’s castle, and the wind doesn’t blow in, probably because of the barrier.","[......Come to think of it, was this onsen built by Alice?]","[......Unnn...... She said...... it’s a free-flowing onsen.]","Where’s the source of this free-flowing onsen then? Well, I guess they can just use magic to arrange that. In fact, back at the Six Kings Festival, at the top floor of the Central Tower, inside what should be a subspace-like place, they also said that the onsen built there was also a free-flowing onsen...... Moreover, it doesn’t seem like Kuro and the others are using those words without fully understanding their meanings either. Well, with Alice being its creator, there certainly is a possibility that the hot water was being teleported from some source.","[......Kaito...... Let’s wash...... each other’s backs?]","[Eh? Ah, yes. Then, shall I wash you first?]","[......Unnn...... Thanks.]","I nodded to Isis-san’s words, who suggested that with a smile. After watching Isis-san sit down on a small bath chair, I wash her back with a shower-like magic tool.","[Does the water not feel hot?]","[......No...... It’s alright...... It feels good.]","[I’m glad to hear that. Come to think of it, when I first stayed over at Isis-san’s house, we also did the same thing.]","[......Unnn...... At that time...... I washed you first...... and now, the order is reversed...... Next time...... I’ll wash you first.]","[Ahaha, I see, we’re exchanging turns in who comes first.]","[......Unnn.]","I remember quite vividly the first time I stayed at Isis-san’s house. Rather, I can only remember how I was very nervous.","No, of course, I’m still nervous to some extent, but I still feel more relaxed than when I first came to stay over since we are now lovers.","[......Speaking of which...... At that time...... Kaito got dizzy.]","[......H- Hmmm, rather than dizzy, I actually felt embarrassed and blood rushed to my head...... Well, I guess there’s no mistaking that I got dizzy as a result.]","[......Kaito...... you feel embarrassed...... when you went to bathe with me?]","[Of course, even now, I still feel embarrassed...... but right now, I think the joy of being with Isis-san is stronger. That’s when I feel calmer than when I first came to stay overnight.]","[......I see...... I also...... feel happy together with Kaito...... and it’s because we’re fulfilled...... that we’re together.]","[Right.]","[Ehehe.]","I really feel that because she smiles more and more like this that Isis-san’s charm is increasing. The same is true of our conversation, but the tone of her voice conveys this sense of happiness, and just listening to it makes me break out into a smile.","Unnn...... It’s true that there’s still some embarrassment and some tension in me...... but just as I told Isis-san, I truly felt that I wasn’t only happy, but also deeply content.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Fughhaaa, t- these two, even though they’ve already had quite a few mixed baths together..... they somehow look like a happy couple...... Gununu.]","? ? ? : [......Aren’t they a normal happy couple?]"]},{"number":1536,"title":"Chapter 1536: 1536 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Future 11 ~ ~","paragraphs":["After I swapped turns with Isis-san and had my back washed by her, we soaked ourselves in the warm water. It was sunny during the day, but now there is a faint snowfall, creating a charming and beautiful scene.","[Speaking of which, onsens are rather rare in this world...... I mean, their culture seemed to be a bit minor, but this onsen has always been in Isis-san’s castle, right? I guess you’ve heard about them from Alice?]","[......Unnn...... Shalltear...... knows a lot of things that we don’t know...... She taught us many things...... like how she taught Ein about maids...... and taught Kuromueina about baby castellas...... She taught us many things.]","Somehow, I just heard multiple things that I couldn’t ignore. If what Isis-san says is true, it means that Alice was the one who created that Maid Fanatic and summoned the Baby Castella Demon.","......No, but well, I guess it’s not as if Alice had any malicious intent. As expected, she wouldn’t have told them about those if she had known in advance about their feelings for maids and baby castellas that were so deep that it could be described as madness. After all, when it comes to maids and baby castellas, Alice herself is also their victim......","[I see, Alice came from another world tens of thousands of years before the Hero Summoning took place...... In this world, being the first person from another world, it’s only natural that she would possess various knowledge that others are unfamiliar with.]","[......Unnn...... Shalltear’s stories...... are interesting...... and hearing about the onsen...... I was fascinated by the idea...... of taking a bath together...... so I asked her to make me one.]","Come to think of it, the fact that there are various items in this world that resemble those from my previous world might be attributed not only to the Hero actors but also to Alice. It seems that the world Alice once lived in is quite similar to my world....... Well, the world around the time Alice was transported from was rather futuristic, almost like a sci-fi world. There were apparently items that combined magic and machinery called magitech, so of course there are differences but......","[Do you also go in with your subordinates?]","[......When we have some free time...... but...... it seems like they were being considerate...... so I can relax with Kaito.]","[I see, I appreciate that. Thanks to that, I can now be carefree with Isis-san.]","[......Unnn...... Being alone with Kaito...... also makes me happy.]","Saying that, Isis-san leans against my shoulder. As the both of us were taking a bath, it naturally meant that we’re completely naked, so my heart couldn’t help fluttering when I felt the touch of Isis-san’s bare skin.","I can’t help but avert my eyes, turning my gaze at an angle a little. No, seriously, even though I’m somewhat used to taking a bath with others, I still get nervous.","Isis-san is also considerably defenseless around me....... Well, rather than being defenseless, I guess she just trusts me wholeheartedly......","[......Ahh, b- by the way, it would already be quite late when we got out of the bath, wouldn’t it? We ended up having a good chat with everyone after dinner, and it became a reasonably late hour.]","[......Unnn...... There’s still some time...... but I think it’s already a good time to go to bed...... Humans tend...... to go to bed around 10 at night...... right?]","[Hmmm, it depends on the individual to some extent. I tend to sleep between 10 pm, just like Isis-san said, and midnight. I don’t really stay awake until the day changes.]","For Isis-san, sleep is more of a preference, and she doesn’t need to sleep. Therefore, she relies to some extent on books and other sources of knowledge about Humans’ sleep.","However, this does not mean that the information she got is wrong, and she was actually accurate to some extent. In fact, in my case, I usually go to bed around that time and wake up between 6 to 8 in the morning.","[......I see...... Hey, Kaito...... It might be...... a bit selfish of me...... but can I say something?]","[Eh? Ah, yes. It’s totally fine.]","[......Errr...... I’ve had a room for Kaito prepared...... but if Kaito is alright with it...... I want you to stay in my room....... I want to stay with Kaito...... for the whole day today.]","[......Isis-san. Yes, I understand. Come to think of it, the first time I came to Isis-san’s castle, I stayed in Isis-san’s room, right?]","Isis-san’s castle is large, so there are multiple rooms, and they had properly prepared a room for me to stay in. However, Isis-san’s request is that she wants to be with me more.","Since there was no reason for me to refuse, I returned a reassuring smile and gave my consent to the seemingly lonely Isis-san. In response, Isis-san brightened up and flashed a radiant smile.","[......Unnn!]","As I watched Isis-san nod happily, how should I say this...... I somehow felt a little ticklish and warm. Overwhelmed by a surge of affection, I gently placed my hand on Isis-san’s shoulders and pulled her closely, embracing her lightly.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [...... A- Aaahhh...... I- I have a bad feeling about this...... Hyiiiihh......]"]},{"number":1537,"title":"Chapter 1537: 1537 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Future 12 ~ ~","paragraphs":["After getting out of the onsen, Isis-san and I moved to her room, and all we had to do was sleep. When I come to Isis-san’s mansion, I tend to spend most of my time in the library, so I actually didn’t have that many opportunities to come to Isis-san’s room.","Having such thoughts in mind, I looked back at Isis-san...... and was at a loss for words.","[......................]","[......Kaito? ......What’s the matter?]","[N- No, rather than asking that...... Why are you dressed like that!?]","I think it’s inevitable that I’d reflexively ask that. After all, Isis-san, who had been wearing her usual gothic-style dress just now, suddenly changed into a see-through negligee.","N- No, worst-case scenario, since she creates her outfit with magic, she should be able to switch instantly, so that’s not really a problem...... The big problem here is her appearance.","Wearing a light blue see-through negligee, her underwear and body visible, making her look quite provocative and alluring. Suddenly seeing her in such an outfit made me really surprised, and even now, I’m desperately averting my eyes.","And the problem is that Isis-san hasn’t dressed like that when I came to stay before. Even when I first came to stay overnight and slept together with her, Isis-san was wearing her usual dress. It’s a dress made of magic, so it shouldn’t be obstructive when sleeping.","[......This? ......I thought...... Kaito would like this...... Do you...... not like it?]","[N- No, of course, if you ask me that, I’d obviously like it...... B- But why are you suddenly wearing such an outfit......]","[......Errr...... Shalltear previously said......]","At those words, I immediately thought Alice has been whispering strange things to Isis-san again. However, I suppose I can’t make a decision without listening to Isis-san’s story until the end. Besides, there was still the question of how much the naturally shy Alice would suggest to Isis-san, even when she doesn’t do it herself.","Thinking this way, I listened to what Isis-san had to say.","[......When she came to visit...... with a magazine in hand...... She had consulted with me.]","[Consulted...... Alice did?]","[......Unnn...... Saying various things...... like I guess it really is better to go with this kind of outfit...... She consulted with me...... and it didn’t seem like she was laughing at that time.]","[Fumu......]","[......And then...... referring to an outfit that we saw in the magazine at the time...... Shalltear began mumbling...... “Kaito likes stuff like this huh”...... and stuff like that......]","[......I see.]","I understood the gist of things. It’s possible that Alice wasn’t trying to imbue Isis-san’s mind with strange thoughts or anything like that, but instead, she was talking to Isis-san with the thought of wearing it herself.","She’s the type who approaches things based on form. It’s like she’s one of those young women who have a lot of superficial knowledge about sex. One could feel that she’s only ahead in terms of knowledge, and there are some aspects in which one can grasp that.","However, I don’t think Alice would be able to dress like that, so she probably thought about it but in the end, rejected the idea. This negligee was made by Isis-san based on the magazine that Alice was looking at at that time.","......What should I do here? First of all, fundamentally speaking, Isis-san’s negligee is very attractive. Even when I’m trying to avert my eyes, if I’m not careful, I might find myself glancing her way......","Isis-san and I are lovers, and there’s nothing wrong with looking at her that way. However, since Isis-san is too pure, having such thoughts about her makes me apologetic...... Nngh.","[......Kaito.]","[Eh? ———–Wha!?]","When I was feeling troubled, Isis-san smoothly approached me and hugged me from the front. The negligee, much thinner than her usual dress, directly conveyed Isis-san’s warmth, and I felt my heart pounding loudly.","In response to the confused me, Isis-san held my cheeks in her hands and brought her lips to mine.","[......Hnn...... Kaito...... I love you.]","The touch of her soft lips and her soft whisper to my ears was irresistible, reflexively making me hug Isis-san’s body.","Thereupon, with a dazzlingly gentle smile, Isis-san spoke. The expression on her face seemed to mysteriously contain a sense of maturity.","[......I...... am not as clueless...... as Kaito thinks I am...... okay? ......That’s why...... Let’s do it?]","After saying that in a gentle voice, Isis-san closed her eyes, seemingly expecting something. Of course, as expected, even I am not clueless as to what she was implying...... so at the same time as I put my lips on hers, I hugged Isis-san’s delicate body even tighter.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [.........................]","? ? ? : [She’s dead. No, rather, why the heck am I...... why the heck is Alice-chan getting hit by an outrageous stray bullet!? She’s gotten strangely exposed in a way she didn’t expect...... Ah, geez! Ahh, the next chapter seemed to be the epilogue of Isis-san’s side story.]"]},{"number":1538,"title":"Chapter 1538: 1538 - Extra Chapter: Isis Episode ~ ~ Epilogue ~ ~","paragraphs":["Once upon a time, there was a being who created a certain world, called the Great Evil God of Despair. Born with a strong sense of loneliness, desiring to be connected with beings other than themself, they sacrificed most of their power to create a world...... and were rejected by all the beings inhabiting it.","Once upon a time, there was a lonely girl born from the magic power of the dead. She had a heart more tender than anyone else’s, yet she had the accursed ability to spread death to everything, so she could only tremble and weep with loneliness.","She was picked up by the most powerful Primordial Demon, and although she no longer spreads death, her heart never truly received warmth, freezing with each passing year.","Before she knew it, she was called the symbol of death and the frightening being, and like a fate that can’t be escaped even before she was reborn, she was rejected by most of the world.","However, at the end of her long solitude, she met the sun. Her beloved sun that melts the ice in her frozen heart and gently pulls her hand. The being named Miyama Kaito radically changed her surroundings.","Before she knew it...... She no longer felt lonely, and she naturally began to think of every day as enjoyable.","In a dimly lit room, Isis quietly opened her eyes. Even in the dark room, she can see as well as in the daytime, and looking at the sleeping Kaito, who was embracing her, she gently smiled.","The moment she met Kaito and he took her hand, Isis was convinced. She was born to meet Kaito, and he was the destined person she had been waiting for......","(......That premonition...... wasn’t a mistake...... Kaito...... changed my everything...... If it weren’t for Kaito...... I would surely...... still be alone and trembling in this castle.)","In fact, after meeting with Kaito, Isis’ thoughts became more positive. She remembers her anticipation to meet Kaito, and her enjoyment from spending every day with Kaito.","It was as if the dark and colored world had been dyed with colors, and things that she had seen as a matter of course began to look different.","(......It was truly mysterious...... Even though...... there should be no way I’d love Kaito any greater than this...... I feel like...... I’m loving him more and more....... and that...... makes me really happy...... Being able to...... confidently say that I love Kaito...... makes me happier than anything else.)","Gently reaching out her hand to Kaito, brushing the hair sticking to his face to the side, she then put her hand on his cheek and gently stroked it. Feeling the touch and warmth of Kaito’s cheek, Isis couldn’t help but feel an overwhelming sense of affection, making her smile.","Thereupon, Kaito stirred up a bit and slightly opened his eyes.","[......Hnn? Isis-san?]","[......Ahh...... Sorry...... Did I wake you up?]","[Ahh, no, please don’t worry about it. Is something the matter?]","[......No...... Nothing much...... It’s just...... with Kaito by my side like this...... my feelings of love for Kaito feels fulfilling...... is what I was thinking.]","When Isis apologetically told that to the awoken Kaito, Kaito kindly smiled, wrapped his arms around Isis’ back and hugged her body.","Of course, there was no reason for Isis to refuse his embrace, so seemingly acting like a spoiled child, she happily leaned her body towards Kaito and fell into his arms.","[......I also feel the same way. How should I say this...... It may actually be a very fulfilling thing to be able to naturally feel affection for someone and be able to verbally express it to them.]","[......Unnn...... After all....... that means that you have met someone that you can cherish that much...... That’s why, I’m sure...... that it makes the heart...... the soul happy.]","As Isis happily said this, Kaito lightly placed his hand on her head and gently stroked her soft and smooth hair. While narrowing her eyes comfortably at that feeling, Isis continued.","[......Kaito...... Thank you...... For meeting me...... For loving me...... That...... makes me really...... really happy...... I’ll make sure...... you won’t regret it....... I’ll do my best...... so that Kaito would feel glad that you’ve come to like me.]","[You’ve already achieved that goal. After all, I truly believe that even now, from the bottom of my heart...... Rather, I am the one who should thank you. I’m truly glad that I was able to meet you.]","[......Kaito...... I love you...... I love you very much...... I love you...... so, so much...... that I can’t fully express it in words no matter how much I try.]","[I love you too, Isis-san.]","As if wanting to say that if words can’t fully express it, the two embraced each other tightly, expressing their feelings through actions, and repeatedly exchanged kisses.","In the castle that was supposed to be built in a place of extreme cold, feeling the warmth that almost seemed to burn them......","The girl...... “was” lonely.","That isn’t the case now though, for as long as her beloved sun continues to illuminate her, it will never snow in her heart again. The wish of the sorrowful God who trembled with loneliness, seeking others———— was indeed fulfilled.","And she...... Isis will walk onward to the continuation of her dreams in the future. Together with her beloved......","<Afterword>","【Since Serious-senpai was completely buried in sugar fills, it will take her 3 chapters until she returns.】"]},{"number":1539,"title":"Chapter 1539 - Omen 1","paragraphs":["Inside a castle in the Archlesia Empire’s Royal Capital, Emperor Chris was processing a large volume of documents. Although she had a considerable amount of work in hand, Chris’ expression was cheerful and somewhat happy.","Seeing this, a female advisor of hers chatted with her, seemingly intending to make small talk.","[The economy is on the upswing these days. Seems like things are heading for the better, isn’t it?]","[Yes, it seems like the whole country is becoming more lively, and I want to cherish this atmosphere. Well, I would rather make another push forward, but I can’t be too greedy.]","[It’s true that the reputation of the land under the Providence of God of Fate-sama and the policies encouraged by Her Majesty have borne fruit, but the fact that we were able to establish a connection with the Lord Trading Company is really significant.]","[Indeed, thanks to the fact that the largest and most influential trading company in the country has joined the reformism faction, the other trading companies have become much more cooperative.]","Stopping her pen at the words of her advisor, Chris muttered deeply. Since she became Emperor, she had been trying to reform the financially strained state of Archlesia Empire while fighting against the conservative faction as a reformist.","Her efforts have borne fruit in recent years, with the entirety of the Empire now in a very positive trend, thanks to the rise in the vitality of the country as a whole through various people-friendly policies, the highly popular tourist attraction under the Providence of a Supreme God, and the support of a world-class major trading company.","[I hope we can make the forthcoming Founding Festival a success and keep a firm hold of this economic prosperity.]","[Speaking of Founding Festival, the one held in the Symphonia Kingdom was quite a spectacle. With all the Six Kings participating and the level of attention it brought, its economic effect must have been extraordinary.]","[......Their management must have felt stomachache from all the big shots participating, but even so, I still envy them. Miyama-sama’s influence in matters really is tremendous......]","Her conversation with the advisor shifted to the Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival. It’s extremely rare for all Six Kings to participate in a country’s Founding Festival. Originally, only the members of the Six Kings who had strong ties with said country would participate in it.","In Archlesia Empire’s case, the Dragon King Magnawell has a strong relationship with their Empire, and he would always send one of the Four Great Demon Dragons, excluding Grandiereus, to attend each year’s Founding Festival as his proxy.","[However, even though it may not be on the same level as in the Symphonia Kingdom, Dragon King-sama has obtained a special clone body this year and is able to act without worrying about the physique of his main body, so I am told that he himself will attend the Founding Festival, for which I am very grateful for.]","[It would be nice if Miyama Kaito-sama would open a shop at our Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival...... but with Her Majesty’s capability, is there anything Her Majesty can do to achieve that?]","[Hahaha, there’s no way I can do that. At the time of the Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival, he set up a shop because it just so happened that he himself had such an idea in mind. In fact, his stall was opened in an area where there were not many people, so him opening his shop back then wasn’t for business purposes, but for fun. It’s exactly because Miyama-sama is the kind of person who would comply if one earnestly requests something from him that I can’t carelessly ask him favors.]","[Everything has its difficulties, isn’t it?]","In fact, if Chris were to ask him, there is a possibility that Kaito will open a shop in Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival even if he does not feel like it. However, such an act of taking advantage of Kaito’s kindness will only result in her suddenly getting strangled by someone later on.","Considering the fact that she wouldn’t be exempt from criticism from other countries, she couldn’t go through with such a plan. Moreover, Chris herself didn’t want to do anything that would inconvenience Kaito.","There was a time when she thought of taking advantage of Kaito, but now that Kaito has completely become a singularity in the world...... and most importantly, because Chris has become close to Kaito and has developed affection...... favorable feelings for him, she no longer wanted to use Kaito for the benefit of her country.","[Well, it’s no use thinking about all the special factors. Let’s just keep things sure and steady and think about making the Founding Festival a success. And so, that’s enough chit-chat, let’s get back to work.]","[Understood.]","Chris resumes her work with a chuckle, while her advisor also slightly chuckles and nods her head. The atmosphere in the office was somewhat calm, partly because Chris’ mood had become softer than before.","Right at that moment though, a knock came at the door and another member of her advisors entered with a letter. This needs not be said, but there are many letters that were sent to Chris, the Emperor, on a daily basis.","Such letters would normally be gathered before being delivered to Chris, but the fact that her advisor has specifically brought just a single letter in this matter suggests that it’s likely something of significant importance.","[Excuse my intrusion. Your Majesty, I have received a letter addressed to Her Majesty from Amel-sama. According to the other letter that came with it, Amel-sama is planning to open a stall at the Founding Festival, and this letter is an application for that......]","[From Amel-dono? She sent out this request not as one of the Wingeds, but as an individual? That’s very unusual...... The Wingeds have only opened a small stall every year only to follow duty, so this would be the first time this happened.]","The Wingeds were originally a closed-off species, and they have never participated in the Founding Festival, only setting up a small accessory stall as an act of duty to the Empire.","This situation in which Amel, the Chief of the Wingeds, personally opened a store was also unprecedented. Surprised, Chris unsealed the letter and checked it...... and her eyes opened wide.","The reason was that, contained in this letter that mentioned their intention to submit an application for a stall opening, was a particularly shocking text.","『Stall Subject: The Goods of Chaos Tainted with Everlasting Darkness 《Chaos Regalia》","Stall Owners:","Amel","My Sworn Friend","Product Collaborations:","The Lord of Illusions Clad in Transient Garments","The Young Celestial Spirit Striving for the Absolute』","The contents of the Stall Subject and the Product Collaboration sections were, as usual, phrased in a way that made no sense to Chris, making her wonder what exactly is the stall she was setting up, but upon seeing the text “My Sworn Ally” in the Stall Owner section...... she instantly understood that it indicated Kaito. Chris, sensing a vague premonition that this year’s Founding Festival was going to be tremendous, lightly massaged her forehead.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [I’m starting to see improvements among those in the upper class.]","Makina : [It does seem to be the case. As expected of my beloved child~~]"]},{"number":1540,"title":"Chapter 1540 - Omen 2","paragraphs":["Finished reading the letter from Amel, Chris had a complicated look on her face.","[I can’t quite figure out what kind of goods they are dealing with, but it doesn’t seem like they’re going to sell foodstuffs.]","[The Wingeds does sell feathers ornaments and other such accessories, so wouldn’t it be accessories as well?]","[......It is possible....... but this sworn friend, this is definitely Miyama-sama.]","[Yes, from the information we have gathered, it is certain that Amel-sama calls Miyama Kaito-sama “sworn friend”. However, it’s a bit surprising. Amel-sama aside, for the other Wingeds to approve of this...... This doesn’t happen often.]","[Indeed, with the nature of the Wingeds, I don’t think they would welcome their Chief befriending someone of another species......]","Chris nodded quietly at the words of her advisor. The Wingeds is an extremely closed-off tribe, with a prevailing belief to minimize interaction with other species.","Amel, being their tribe’s chief, occasionally receives invitations and participates in festivals to some extent due to her position. But even so, she still has limited active involvement with other species.","[......In fact, even with the information we gathered at the beginning, it seemed that Amel-sama had been very considerate when associating with Miyama Kaito-sama, right? She did not invite him to the Wingeds’ village, and instead kept her relationship with him personal, so from what I see, I got the impression that she was careful to avoid attracting the attention of the other Wingeds.]","[Considering that, it would indeed be surprising for her to open a stall openly at a festival as important as the Founding Festival...... No...... I see how it is......]","[Your Majesty?]","Although she does refer to Kaito as her sworn friend, for Amel, who seemed to be maintaining her position as the Chief of the Wingeds and had drawn a line she wouldn’t cross, to have planned on setting up a stall together with Kaito in a place where they could potentially be seen by other Wingeds, it was a somewhat questionable action, but halfway through, Chris seemed to have noticed something.","[......I guess she no longer saw the need to hide it anymore. Perhaps, Amel-dono has found out about a certain thing about Miyama-sama.]","[A certain thing?]","[......That Miyama-sama has received the True Blessing of the God of Creation, Shallow Vernal-sama.]","[The True Blessing of God of Creation-sama————Ah, I- I see, it’s because the Wingeds......!?]","[Yes, the Winged is a species of extremely religious people. They live in harmony with nature, including the sky and the earth. They hold deep reverence for the Goddess of Life-sama, and their faith extends similarly to Shallow Vernal-sama, who is the pinnacle of the Gods. In other words, for the Wingeds, Miyama-sama is a great being chosen by the Gods, so regardless of whether he is from another tribe, they would be in favor of their Chief associating with him.]","As Chris explained, the Winged is a species of extremely religious people. They are so religious that they make it their duty to visit the Temple of the God of Fertility, the subordinate of the God of Life, Life, once a month without fail, and they always offer prays to Life and Shallow Vernal when they wake up in the morning and when they go to bed at night.","No matter how well-connected the Singularity, Kaito may be to the political authorities in the world, her tribe’s people would normally have been opposed to their Chief associating with someone of another species, but with Kaito being blessed by Shallow Vernal, it would be a different story.","Kaito, who has received the Blessing of the Great God worshiped by their entire species, is regarded as a God-like being by the Wingeds. Rather, they would instead consider it a splendid and honorable thing that their Chief, Amel, has a close relationship with Kaito. Therefore, when Amel learned that Kaito had received the Blessing of Shallow Vernal, all the constraints regarding her interactions with Kaito disappeared almost entirely, allowing her to deepen her friendship with him as she pleased.","[Ah, he was as outrageous as ever. While it may not have been intentional, this now makes it possible for him to interact with the difficult-to-approach Wingeds in a nearly perfect manner.]","[......Yes, seriously, I guess that’s to be expected of Miyama-sama. It’s likely that if Miyama-sama were to visit the Wingeds’ village, he would be welcomed. Considering that their Chief, Amel-dono, holds him in such high regard as her sworn friend, Miyama-sama may be the only being that isn’t a God capable of freely interacting with the Wingeds.]","For the Wingeds, with whom it’s extremely difficult to have any interaction, let alone have a close relationship, even in the Human Realm, he has become a welcomed presence. Chris could only wryly smile at how much of a singularity Kaito is being as usual...... but then, she seemed to have realized something.","[......However, wait a moment. Suppose, hypothetically speaking...... if the items that Amel-dono’s stall handled were accessories, and if Miyama-sama was involved in the production of those accessories......]","[......That doesn’t sound good, Your Majesty. I’m afraid I have shivers running down my spine right now.]","[Y- Yes, my hands are shaking at that thought too. This doesn’t look good. If we assume that they’re handmade accessories, it’s unlikely that a large quantity can be prepared...... and worst-case scenario, a conflict could occur......]","Yes, it was different from that time in Symphonia Kingdom. That time, he was only selling baby castellas. Food...... But this time, as far as she can tell from the letter, it isn’t likely that they would be selling food.","If they were to sell accessories just like the other Wingeds had done until now, there would be an extremely large amount of people that would want them.","[If that happens, wouldn’t the Imperial Capital be obliterated?]","[......F- For the time being, we need to confirm the details as soon as possible...... We have no other choice but to take desperate measures. Rather than asking the difficult Amel-dono, I’d rather ask Miyama-sama directly. Prepare me some stationery!]","[Understood!]","As she sensed the possibility that something terrible was about to happen, Chris felt pain in her stomach.","<Afterword>","Makina : [.......Handmade items...... made by my beloved child?]","? ? ? : [Stay! Stay!!!]"]},{"number":1541,"title":"Chapter 1541 - Omen 3","paragraphs":["One fine morning, a hummingbird flew to my place early in the morning. Incidentally, one can tell whose hummingbird they are if they are registered with a special magic tool.","Well, hummingbirds normally wouldn’t be sent unless the magic wavelengths are registered with each other, but Count ranks can determine magic wavelengths just by looking at the recipient, so some people can send hummingbirds to those they’ve just met.","As for this time, this hummingbird seemed to have come from someone I know, of which magic wavelengths we had registered with each other...... Chris-san......","Even so, this is quite unusual, receiving a hummingbird from Chris-san. I basically often communicate with Chris-san not by hummingbird, but by letter. I remember her saying that she doesn’t use hummingbirds except for urgent matters, because the hummingbirds don’t allow her to use aristocratic techniques such as decorative words...... Does that mean today’s matter is urgent?","As I had such a question in mind, I touched the hummingbird, and written on it were the words “I would like to talk to you as soon as possible because I would like to confirm something about the details of the stall you will be opening with Amel-dono”.","Huh? The details of the stall? I certainly promised to open a stall with Amel-san, and I had left the application to her, who lives in Archlesia Empire....... but I wonder if she’s having trouble with Amel-san’s usual tone? I guess Chris-san, who was confused by her chuunibyou-ish application, noticed my name in the Stall Owner’s name section and contacted me.","Thinking so, I contacted Chris-san back via hummingbird. “Should we meet in person? If it’s convenient for Chris-san, I can go there right away”. In the case of communication through a hummingbird, there’s a limit on the number of characters a single hummingbird could send out, and explaining things through it would take time. And so, I thought it would be even better if we could meet and talk in person...... to which I immediately got a message stating “Please do come”, so I quickly made preparations and decided to head to the royal palace of the Archlesia Empire.","I had registered the area right in front of the palace as a point of teleportation, so it would be easy for me to come to visit her. Chris-san also seemed to have already talked to the gatekeeper, so I was immediately guided to Chris-san’s office.","Chris-san urged me to sit down on the sofa for reception, and Chris-san sat down opposite me, and someone who seemed like a maid brought me tea and tea cakes.","[......Miyama-sama, I’m very sorry for calling you so suddenly.]","[Ahh, no, please don’t worry about it. And so, we’re talking about Amel-san opening a shop, right?]","[Yes. We received an invitation from Amel-dono, but there’s a slight conundrum...... What exactly is this Chaos Regalia that you both would be dealing with......]","[......Errr, they’re “sundries”.]","[......Sundries?]","It seems that my guess was correct, as Amel-san seemed to have sent out her application with its chuuniness maxed out. She called it Chaos Regalia huh......","[Yes, I think the closest classification of them are sundries. They were originally items Alice made more as a joke...... party goods she made with the money she made from the Six Kings Festival, and the idea of setting up this shop started when Amel-san liked those and thought of handling such products.]","For the time being, I will explain to Chris-san the particulars, including the background of the matter. About how the products the shop Amel-san and I are handling will have various casual stuff, with a vibe similar to a flea market. It certainly would be appropriate to call them, but if we’re gonna be specific, we’re handing party goods made by Alice.","[Like a ball that produces a flashy effect when thrown with Illusion Magic or a sticker with a glowing pattern, they’re items Amel-san and I came up with and Alice made.]","[......A- Ahh, I see, so this Lord of Illusions Clad in Transient Garments in the Product Collaborations section......]","[Yes. In the first place, Amel-san and I just wanted to have fun hanging out in our stall together, so the products we were dealing with were just random stuff, so in addition to the party goods Alice made, we’d just gather up various stuff and put it alongside them, really having that flea market vibe to it.]","[......Fumu. That means, Miyama-sama would also bring something?]","[Eh? Yes, things like ceramic and woodwork.]","To tell the truth, Nebula and Illness-san seemed to have a lot of leftover ceramics and woodwork, so we decided to pack it along and sell it with the other stuff, really just like a flea market.","[......Incidentally, was Miyama-sama involved in the creation of these products?]","[I’m not. It’s just that our Nebula made some things as a hobby and she’s gathered a lot lately, but thinking that just disposing of those would be a waste, I asked her if we could sell them. In the first place, they were just made as a hobby, so the designs don’t have a set theme and are all over the place.]","[I see...... Phew, seems like it will be alright then.]","[Ah, but Amel-san said we should have a brand mark, so Nebula and I thought about it together and decided to put a simple logo mark on the ceramics and woodwork. It would be a logo of three mountains lined up together, using something like a pun on my name. In our world, three, in addition to “san”, could be spoken as “mittsu”, while mountain is spoken as “yama”, so “mittsu yama”. Remove the “tsu”, and you get my surname, Miyama.]","[........................My apologies, regarding that part...... Can you please tell me more about it?]","Until a while ago, Chris-san looked relieved, but when she heard the words I just said, she asked that with a pale expression on her face. I don’t really know why, but for some reason, I felt that Chris-san’s face at that time was very similar to Lilia-san’s expression when she was enduring stomach ache.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [H- Hey, see that, Makina!? It’s not like Kaito directly made them! That’s why, stay!]","Makina : [......Ah, y- you’re right....... U- Uuuu, what should I do about this heightened love power for my child? My frustration is about to explode, you know?]","? ? ? : [.......Isn’t it fine to attack with all your might in that direction over there to relieve stress...... She’s apparently gonna revive in the next chapter anyway......]"]},{"number":1542,"title":"Chapter 1542 - Omen 4","paragraphs":["Chris-san asked me to explain more about the products, but I thought it would be easier if she actually saw the actual products, so I took out three different types of teacups from my magic box and put them on the table.","Incidentally, the designs and shades are different. Nebula and Illness-san are making them as a hobby, so there’s no point in mass-producing the same ones. However, due to the properties of the teacups, it seems that they gathered them in a set of four, so when I sell them, I plan to sell them as a unit.","[I can’t say for sure whether it will sell well at a festival stall or not, but don’t you think they’re well-made?]","[......Indeed. They’re such great teacups that make me want to alleviate the pain in my head and stomach. I see...... So this is your brand mark huh.]","While checking the teacup, Chris-san also checked the three lined-up mountains design mark I mentioned earlier. That brand mark isn’t quite emphasized in the teacups, engraved under the cups.","[......Miyama-sama isn’t involved in the production of these, right?]","[That’s right. The production was completely done by Nebula and Illness-san.]","[......W- What should be done about these? I- I’m not sure...... Miyama-sama didn’t directly make them, but they’re marked with Miyama-sama’s brand...... I can’t predict how the others will move...... Incidentally, Miyama-sama, there are those accessories made from Dragon King-sama’s scales, but do you plan to sell them as branded products as well?]","[No, I don’t. This time would just be a matter of selling the leftovers because it would be a waste to throw them away, and even if we do sell them, it will probably be in a flea market format like this time.]","We don’t have enough to sell on a regular basis. These would just be sold for the purpose of disposing of surplus things that Nebula and Illness-san made that aren’t made use in my house and Lilia-san’s mansion.","And so, I didn’t want to raise the price too much, and after consulting with Nebula, we thought of setting the price at 100R...... which is about 10,000 Japanese yen.","It may be a little expensive to sell them at a festival stall, but if they don’t sell, it doesn’t really matter much to me.","When I told Chris-san about this though...... She was holding her head in her hands. Then, after a moment of silence...... She looked at me with a rather astounded expression on her face.","[......Please set the price at least ten times that amount. Even when multiplied by that much, it’s still too cheap...... Also, please make sure to limit the number of purchases per person. There’s no guarantee that there won’t be people who would want to buy it all up......]","[I see, I hadn’t thought about anyone thinking of hoarding these. It would certainly be better to have a variety of people buying these items...... Errr, I will discuss the prices with Nebula and Amel-san again.]","[That would be great.]","Even though the quality is good, we kept the price low because in the end, they were made by an amateur like Nebula. Well, Nebula’s tea cups are amazing, so I think they are worth 100 times the price I was initially thinking considering their quality, so as Chris-san said, let’s reconsider the price.","[Do you also have samples for the other products your stall will be handling? If it’s possible, I’d like to know them as much as I can......]","[Even though we have magic boxes, there’s the stall space limit, so we don’t have that many...... Ahh, speaking of which, Amel-san said that she would sell something like a brooch modeled after a feather.]","[Ahh, those are traditional accessories of the Wingeds. They’re simple accessories that are often sold at stalls held by them. I see, so you’re also arranging things that are typical of the Wingeds.]","[I’ve seen a few of them...... They’re easy to make, so I’ve promised Amel-san to make them with her next time.]","[.......................]","Hearing what I said, Chris-san looked blankly at me, stiffening in place. The expression on her face seemed to be a mixture of melancholy, despair, and a variety of other emotions.","[......U- Ummm, Chris-san?]","[I’m alright. Yes, I’m alright...... I’m just despairing a little bit about a future I don’t want to imagine.]","[That doesn’t sound alright to me!]","[......I- I- I- Is that so...... T- There are also...... accessories whose production Miyama-sama would be involved in...... My body feels shivers, and my stomach is aching. I think I understand now how Duchess Lilia feels.]","[N- No, even if you say I’m involved in their production...... Amel-san was the one preparing those materials, so I will just be combining them and not processing them, you know?]","[......I- I see...... I- Indeed, if it’s just that, then perhaps......]","Chris let out a relieved sigh with a somewhat hopeful look on her face but......","[Well, there is talk of trying to come up with some original accessories if we have a little extra time......]","[......Miyama-sama, do you enjoy messing with my heart?]","[How come!? A- As far as it goes though, I think there’s almost no possibility of making it just from what I heard from Amel-san.]","[Even if there’s just a 1% chance...... We can’t afford not to be prepared for possible situations...... My apologies. Someone bring me some stomachache pills...... powerful ones.]","With my additional words, her face dyed with despair appeared again. That stuff about original accessories was actually just what Amel-san said from all the excitement she was having back then...... but I really don’t know how that talk would turn out. In the first place, I don’t think I can make original accessories with my skills, and I think there’s almost no possibility of actually making them. Well, that’s what I was thinking...... but it seems like that was the problem.","U- Unnn. I guess if I were to actually make them, I’d have to think about how to deal with people who might act strangely, which includes Shiro-san on that list...... Otherwise, it would end up being quite a big deal for Chris-san......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I’ve resurrected! Unnn? What’s with that light———— Ahh———— Gyaaaaaahhhhhhhhhhh!?]","Makina : [? ? ?, big news! My beloved child is apparently gonna make accessories!]","? ? ? : [Calm down. Stay, stay...... Keep yourself calm, ah, that’s right, attack over there to calm yourself down.]","Serious-senpai : [Wait, stop spawn campi———– There’s that light again———!?!?]","T/N: Shameless advertisement, but please check out the other novel I’m translating, Otherworld Dagashi Shop Yahagi . It’s a slice-of-life novel, talking about a guy who got the job dagashi shopowner when isekai’d. Talks about various snacks and toys, so it’s just a casual read. 30 chapters already released at the moment."]},{"number":1543,"title":"Chapter 1543 - Omen 5","paragraphs":["At this point, only a few people know that Kaito is planning to open a stall at Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival.","Of course, just like how each country has their information networks, there are also those who have their own personal information networks and who are devoted to collecting information on Kaito, but due to Kaito being accompanied by Alice, who can be said to be the world’s strongest in information warfare, so at the moment, even the intelligence agencies of each country have not been able to obtain accurate information.","There is a possibility that Kaito will open a stall at Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival...... They were at the stage of watching future developments with such vague information at hand.","But of course, there were also those...... who quickly grasped this information using a completely different method.","[......Shallow Vernal-sama? What did you say?]","[That there is nothing wrong with me going to a country’s Founding Festival?]","[N- No, but that’s...... that would cause a worldwide uproar......]","[And what does that have to do with anything?]","[N- No, it doesn’t but...... of course, Shallow Vernal-sama’s will takes precedence over anything else.]","In the Sanctuary, high above the God Realm, Chronois, one of the Supreme Gods, had a pale expression on her face. For Shallow Vernal, the God of the world, to attend a country’s Founding Festival, even though she almost never visited the Human Realm, it would be quite the big event, to say the least.","With that alone, let alone feeling pain in her stomach, Chronois felt as if a large hole had opened in her belly.","[......U- Ummm, why did you suddenly decide to participate in a Founding Festival?]","[I heard that Kaito-san is going to open a stall, and that is what I’m aiming for. I’m not interested in that Founding Festival. I’ll leave that to you.]","[......U- Ummm, i- in other words, Shallow Vernal-sama is only going to visit Miyama’s stall, and has no intention of showing up at their Founding Festival at all......]","[That’s right.]","Chronois wanted to curse her inability to faint. But alas, Shallow Vernal is literally an absolute existence in the world. Any objection to her action isn’t plausible...... Moreover, when it comes to situations involving Kaito himself, it was impossible for anyone other than Kaito himself.","Just after Chronois had made a firm vow to contact Kaito as soon as possible and ask him to persuade and stop Shallow Vernal...... a salvation came from someone she hadn’t expected.","The space of the God Realm suddenly cracked open, and with the emergence of light, Eden appeared from the shattered space.","[Shallow Vernal. Please grant me permission to participate in Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival. If my beloved child is going to open a stall, there is no reason why I, his mother, should not visit.]","[......Please keep the jokes at a minimum. It would cause a clamor if a powerful person like you were allowed to participate in a country’s Founding Festival. I will not allow such an act that will cause chaos in the world.]","[........................]","These were words spoken by the Creator God who had been actively trying to bring chaos to the world, but at this moment, Chronois remained silent, closing her eyes and standing upright with a graceful posture. She remained motionless. Standing in upright emptiness...... She heard nothing. There are no objections to the words and deeds of Shallow Vernal.","As expected of a Creator of her world, her resolute attitude of not overlooking the chaos of the world is wonderful, as she persuaded herself to remain unresponsive.","[In the first place, I had already conceded to you at Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival before. However, to continue to demand more, aren’t you pushing things a little too much?]","[Kuh...... When you say it like that...... Even so, if it’s my beloved child’s stall, wouldn’t you yourself also want to visit it in person?]","[Of course, I do feel that way, but if I think about the inconvenience I’ll cause to Kaito-san, if I truly care about Kaito-san, I can’t take such an action.]","[........................]","Chronois has not heard anything. She heard nothing. In fact, since she came to the Sanctuary, she couldn’t remember anything and her stomach doesn’t hurt either. She just happened to be here by chance, so she can’t interrupt the conversation of Creator Gods, so she just quietly waited.","[......Y- You were being that considerate of my beloved child...... I see, if my care for my beloved child is being questioned, I can’t argue against it. I will give up participating this time.]","[Yes, that would be good.]","Reluctantly withdrawing, Eden disappeared after apologizing to Shallow Vernal for her sudden visit. And after an indescribable silence, Shallow Vernal calmly spoke.","[As I recall, Fate has bestowed a Providence to the Archlesia Empire, has she not? If that is the case, then it is safe to assume that the country has some connection with the God Realm.]","[Hahh! That’s right!]","[I will allow you and the other Supreme Gods to attend their Founding Festival. I have no intention of going myself, but if Kaito-san is going to open his stall there, it would be desirable to show a certain level of consideration towards the Empire.]","[Understood.]","At Shallow Vernal’s words, Chronois quietly bowed her head. As to be expected of the world’s creator, Shallow Vernal, considering the balance with Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival having the attendance of all members of the Six Kings, she will show consideration for Archlesia Empire. Furthermore, considering the presence of the three Supreme Gods attending the event, she will casually provide support to ensure that the stall Kaito owned together with the Chief of the Wingeds does not become an unnecessarily controversial topic.","Even though any signs of dissatisfaction were absent on her face, lightly holding on to her stomach, Chronois departed from the Sanctuary, swearing in her heart to later ask Kaito to visit Shallow Vernal and follow her up on this matter.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As expected, when that mad God appears in front of her, even that airhead God would think “If I let her participate, it won’t be good”, and as a result, before she was even persuaded by someone, she decided that she also couldn’t participate......]"]},{"number":1544,"title":"Chapter 1544 - Omen 6","paragraphs":["At Duchess Albert’s mansion in Symphonia Kingdom, the head of the household, Lilia, was enjoying a cup of tea with her close friends, Lunamaria and Sieglinde.","[Things sure have been peaceful lately. It brings a peaceful feeling.]","[Well, the major events of the year are almost over. The Duchy’s businesses and other activities are all going well and are relatively stable.]","[I heard there won’t be any big evening parties for a while? If that’s the case, then Lili can also take it easy.]","It’s no exaggeration to say that Lilia, who is the most famous Duke within Symphonia Kingdom, is reasonably busy. It may not feel that way because she’s very capable, but she has a lot of things to do on a regular basis.","However, even busyness comes in waves to some extent, and at the moment, her ongoing projects have settled down, and there are no major events or gatherings that require her attendance for a while. She had acquired a short-term vacation, allowing her to relax and unwind, soothing the fatigue she accumulated in her daily life.","[However, if Milady lowers your guard like that, something else is bound to happen, isn’t it? Mainly, things that are related to Miyama-sama......]","[......Ughh, that’s a little frightening...... However, Kaito-san seems to be preparing to open a stall for Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival, and I have no plans to participate in it.]","[Famous you may be, you are a Duchess, and you don’t have any close ties to Archlesia Empire. Well, there certainly is no reason for you to participate.]","[It might be possible to go to see Kaito-san’s stall, but if I go attend their Founding Festival, I’ll need to say my greetings to Her Majesty Chris and some other people, and since that’s a hassle, I will pass on it this time. I want to take it easy now.]","[......How should I say this...... Well, you’re kinda relaxed, aren’t you?]","Lilia answered Lunamaria’s words somewhat calmly, and one could see how she’s mentally leisurely. She was interested when she heard that Kaito is opening a stall, but from what she’s heard, Kaito doesn’t seem to be deeply involved in it, and considering the time and effort of participating in another country’s Founding Festival will be, there was no problem with not attending this time.","But sadly...... Lunamaria’s words turned into some sort of prophecy, or perhaps, Lilia herself had just drawn in trouble, as her peace was shattered by Eden’s sudden appearance.","[......E- Eden-sama?]","[Lilia Albert. I have one request to make of you. It would originally be unthinkable for me to ask a resident of another world for help, but on the other hand, I also can’t allow myself to trouble my children now living in this world. If that’s the case, I thought I’d ask you, who I evaluate relatively high among these lumps of flesh. You hold no power to refuse. I shall accept your services with gratitude.]","[......Y- You request...... something of me? W- W- W- What is it?]","It can be said that Eden is one of the pinnacles among the most dangerous beings Lilia knows. At the very least, she isn’t an opponent that can be persuaded or reasoned about, and she can only be stopped by Kaito or Shallow Vernal.","At least, in the current situation where Kaito isn’t around, it would be impossible for her to be stopped with just the people in this place. In the presence of Eden, emanating an overwhelming sense of intimidation that brooks no opposition, not only Lilia, but also Lunamaria and Sieglinde had pale expressions on their faces.","However, a voice resounded from someone they didn’t expect, calling Eden to a halt......","[......Impressive. Truly impressive. Intimidating others with power even when you are the one asking them favors...... If you intend to intimidate Lilia and the others any further, I will have no intention of overlooking it.]","[N- Nebula-san!? Y- You can’t...... This person is......]","Before they knew it, Nebula appeared in front of Lilia and the others, looking straight at Eden and telling her to stop with the intimidation.","Of course, Lilia and the others, who knew how dangerous Eden was, tried to stop Nebula, but the situation took a turn they did not expect.","[......My apologies. I didn’t mean to scare them, but I was in a hurry and became overbearing. I sincerely apologize.]","[It’s good that you understand. Please consider Lilia and the others’ convenience when making your request.]","[Thank you for your advice.]","[............Eh?]","Unexpectedly, Eden obediently acknowledged her fault at Nebula’s words, apologized and bowed her head. It was an unbelievable sight for Lilia and the others, so they couldn’t help looking blankly at that scene.","[Excuse my rudeness, Lilia Albert...... Once again, I would like to make a request of you. My beloved child is selling items at Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival, and I wish to purchase some of them. However, I had been stopped by Shallow Vernal from attending the Founding Festival. Won’t you please go and purchase them for me?]","[......Eh? Ah, yes. I don’t really mind......]","[Thank you. I’ll make sure your efforts are repaid...... Well then, if you’ll excuse me.]","[......Ah, yes.]","Lilia bid farewell to Eden, who disappeared after uttering those words, with a blank expression on her face. However, faced with the situation of ending up participating in the Founding Festival despite her initial plans, she held back the aching from her stomach by drinking some stomach medicine.","<Afterword>","Makina : [I- I’ll say this now so that no one misunderstands, but I really didn’t mean to scare Lilia. It’s just that, that happened immediately after talking with Shallow Vernal, and with me thinking of wanting to go there myself, my way of speaking had come off strong. In truth, I actually have a considerable appreciation for Lilia, and I feel sorry for her.]","Serious-senpai : [Well, you did even give her stomach medicine back then...... Rather, I’m curious about how you’d thank her.]","Makina : [Ah, I hadn’t really thought of that yet, but I wonder what she’d like? Why don’t I give her an Abyss Tartarus? They’re omnipotent, so having one of them would be convenient for her.]","Serious-senpai : [Oi, stop that, idiot.]"]},{"number":1545,"title":"Chapter 1545 - Omen 7","paragraphs":["Yggfresis is a large city in the Demon Realm. At the foot of the World Tree in the center of this city, Lillywood was checking her schedule at her castle while drinking water brought by Camellia.","Lillywood is one of the Six Kings with relatively close ties to the Human Realm, and she has many opportunities to participate in events in the Human Realm. Rather, it should be said that many such related jobs come her way due to aspects regarding Lillywood herself.","There’s Isis, who has her problematic magic power of death, Megiddo, who is dangerous without a stopper around, Magnawell, who has difficulty participating due to his physique, and Shallear, who doesn’t appear in public in the first place...... The only one who is relatively involved in the Human Realm events to a similar extent as Lillywood among the Six Kings is Kuromueina.","[And so, you’ll be attending Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival this year, right?]","“Yes, considering the events back in Symphonia Kingdom, there’s a possibility of a misunderstanding that only Symphonia Kingdom is particularly friendly with the Six Kings, so having the power balance of each country in mind, it is better for us to attend. I heard that Magnawell will also use his clone body to participate, and if I go too, it will keep up appearances to a certain extent.”","[I see. Well, Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival back then was just a special occasion, and all the Six Kings attending an event isn’t something that normally happens.]","“Right. Rather, it was fortunate that the Gods remained silent back then. If even the Supreme God or Shallow Vernal-sama herself appeared back then, it would turn out into a major incident.”","Because of the balance of power among the three countries in the Human Realm, Lillywood was also planning to attend Archlesia Empire’s and Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festivals.","Since Magnawell was invited to Archlesia Empire and Megiddo was invited to Hydra Kingdom every year, LIllywood decided that the presence of two Six Kings would be able to keep up appearances to a certain extent by attending both celebrations.","However, Lillywood’s assumptions were shattered by the words of her subordinate who rushed into her office shortly afterward.","[T- This is bad, Lillywood-sama!]","“What is it? Did Megiddo go on a rampage again......”","[While this information is uncertain, there are apparently talks of all the three Supreme Gods attending Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival!?]","“............Huh?”","It isn’t unreasonable that Lillywood becomes dumbfounded at the words of her subordinate. The Supreme God has even fewer connections with the Human Realm than the Six Kings. Or rather, in the first place, the Gods themselves have little connection with the Human Realm.","While there have been recent instances of Gods, such as the White God Festival, showing a willingness to step up, and their involvement with the Human Realm and Demon Realm has increased compared to before, it was still an extraordinary situation for all the Supreme Gods to participate in a country’s Founding Festival.","[......Have you identified the reason why?]","[No, the information we’ve acquired are convoluted, so we’re still working out the details...... However, it’s a prompt report from a reasonably reliable source.]","“...................”","In response to Camellia’s words, the subordinate who brought the information said that the details weren’t fully confirmed. In response, Lillywood remained silent for a moment before speaking.","“......Gather information on all those who would open up their stalls. This includes not only the registered stallowners, but also their collaborators.....”","[Stallowners?]","“Yes, if all the Supreme Gods are making their move, Shallow Vernal-sama definitely must be involved. Without specific instructions from Shallow Vernal-sama, it’s highly unlikely for all of them to attend a country’s Founding Festival. And when Shallow Vernal-sama makes her move, the main cause would definitely be Kaito-san.”","Of course, Lillywood also pays attention to information about the World’s Singularity, Kaito, but at this point in time, there was still no information about him opening a stall in Archlesia Empire.","“......It’s likely that Kaito-san himself isn’t running the stall. There should be another entity that opened their stall as a representative...... If someone one wouldn’t normally expect to open a stall at the Founding Festival is planning to open a stall, please investigate them in detail.”","[Understood. We’ll move at once!]","The reason why Lillywood hadn’t been able to obtain information until now was Amel. This is because when Amel applied to open their stall, she didn’t mention Kaito’s name and referred to him as “My Sworn Friend”.","Of course, Lillywood would have known she was referring to Kaito when she saw it herself, but even if her subordinates and followers in Archlesia Empire were to see this information, they wouldn’t realize this was Kaito, so no breaking news was circulated.","“......Things are becoming troublesome. Isis and the others will definitely react to this, but if they suddenly decide to participate now, it will cause a great uproar in Archlesia Empire...... On the other hand though, it would also be impossible to have that day arrive without them noticing...... Haahhh...... What should I do......”","As she thought of all the things that could happen and the things she would have to do, Lillywood held her head in her hands.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Hou, the stomachache warriors are assembling...... Things are turning exciting.]","Serious-senpai : [Stop with the stomachache warriors.]"]},{"number":1546,"title":"Chapter 1546 - Omen 8","paragraphs":["Friendship City Hikari, Set-Meal Restaurant Suiren. Kaori, the owner of the restaurant, was having a conversation with Akane, whom she met through Kaito. Since it was before the restaurant opened and there were no other customers, they were able to talk leisurely.","Perhaps hitting it off because they were both people of the same gender from the same homeworld, Akane often came to visit Kaori, taking advantage of the mobility of her Teleportation Magic.","[Speaking of which, I heard Kaori was summoned in Archlesia Empire?]","[Yep. When I was first summoned, it was supposed to be summer, so I was surprised at how cold it was.]","[Ahh~~ I see, the time when they summon people is at the end of December back in Japan, and Archlesia Empire has an especially harsh winter. I also visited Archlesia, so I know how you feel. It’s warm around Symphonia though.]","[The climate in Symphonia Kingdom is stable throughout the year.]","The two sides enjoyed conversing with each other, reminiscing about when they were summoned as Hero actors.","[In Archlesia Empire, I was especially indebted to Chris-san.]","[That’s the current Emperor, right? She still wasn’t one when I was summoned.]","[Unnn. Well, she wasn’t the Emperor yet when I was first summoned. When I opened my restaurant, I got a lot of help from her, so I’m overwhelmed with gratitude around her. She already stands in such a high position now though, so it’s difficult for me to visit her.]","[Hou. Speaking of Archlesia Empire, it will soon be their Founding Festival, right? Aren’t you going to go?]","[Hmmm, it’s not that I don’t want to go, but Archlesia Empire’s Capital is far away...... That would take time and money.]","There is quite a distance from Friendship City Hikari, where Kaori’s restaurant is located, to Archlesia’s Imperial Capital. Using transportation methods such as Flying Dragon Flights or carriages would take a considerable amount of time, so her only option would be to travel using Teleportation Magic. However, teleportation establishments can be quite expensive, making it a tough expense for a commoner like Kaori. In addition, it’s common to wait several hours before teleportation because teleportation shops are very crowded during such events.","When Kaori told Akane that it would be difficult for her to go to the event, Akane spoke with a smile.","[What are you talking about? I can easily bring you there. I’ll take you as far as Archlesia Empire in a flash.]","[Eh? Really? I’m glad to hear that...... but is that alright?]","[Yeah, I was just thinking of taking a little peek over there too, so taking a stopover over here isn’t too much trouble.]","[That’s great! Thank you, Akane-san. I’m looking forward to it~~]","Akane decided to take her to Archlesia Empire, so with all her problems solved, Kaori decided to participate in the Founding Festival, thanking Akane with a smile.","[As expected, meeting Chris-san would be difficult, but seeing her face at the ceremony site would be nice.]","[Right. Well, she’s now an Emperor, so even if you say you’re acquaintances, that doesn’t mean you can easily meet her......]","[Come to think of it, aren’t you going to open up a stall, Akane-san? Festivals are a good time to make money, right?]","[Hmmm. If I try running a stall intending to make a solid profit, it would usually be hard. Putting aside if I’m just setting it up for fun, but if I’m setting it up intending to make a profit, I don’t really feel like it. Our business and festival stalls may be similar, but it’s still different.]","Akane leads a mobile trading company, but it’s a little different from festival stalls. As they are a trading company, the products they handle aren’t food or beverages, so they aren’t suitable for a festival.","Therefore, she intends to participate in the Founding Festival purely as someone enjoying the festivities.","[Ahh, I just remembered, but the stall Kaito-kun had at Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival was amazing, wasn’t it?]","[Never expected he’d have the Phantasmal King as his clerk.]","[Seriously. That child is just outrageous...... I’m glad we didn’t run into the Six Kings or anyone like them who happened to be at Kaito-kun’s stall. Just seeing Phantasmal King-sama there already made me nervous, so I’m confident my heart would have stopped if Death King-sama or War King-sama had been there.]","[Hahaha, right...... Well, I don’t think Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival would get in that much of a fuss, so let’s just take it easy and enjoy ourselves.]","[That’s right!]","What the two of them, lightheartedly laughing like that, didn’t know about...... was that an unprecedented situation has arisen at Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival, where all of the Supreme Gods are in attendance. And the primary factor behind it is none other than Kaito, whom they just mentioned...... only becoming aware of this on the day of the event.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Whoa there, it seems like the stomachache supernova is also participating. Things really are getting interesting.]","Serious-senpai : [Do you plan on thoroughly body-blowing everyone, Kaito......]"]},{"number":1547,"title":"Chapter 1547 - Omen 9","paragraphs":["In preparation for the Founding Festival of Archlesia Empire, I invited Amel-san to my house and together, we were making accessories. What we were making were the Wingeds’ accessories that I was going to put in a stall, and they were fairly simple to make, as all I had to do was combine the materials that Amel brought.","[And like this, you insert it right here and wrap the string around the top...... Ohh, this is much easier than I thought it would be.]","[Fuuu, they are products intended for the masses after all. Considering we require enough of them to brighten up the night skies like an illustrious meteor shower, we don’t make use of forbidden techniques in the process.]","[Indeed, if we’re going to make several of these, it’s better to keep it simple.]","[For the Wingeds, when the only window is opened, those who can descend to the outside world are limited, but the covenant we made with the country will undoubtedly be held true.]","[I see, so this is a rather rare opportunity for the Wingeds then?]","From what I’ve heard from Amel-san and others like Lilia-san, the Wingeds seemed to be a truly closed-off species that doesn’t interact with the outside world much. It appears that they only participate in festivals such as the Founding Festival, which is part of their contract with Archlesia Empire.","[If my sworn friend is interested in the Wingeds, I will guide you to our Utopia. You have the privilege to choose the time, and though it may not be the case in perpetuity, my hermitage will welcome you, my sworn friend.]","[Arehh? Is it really alright for me to visit the Wingeds’ home?]","What Amel-san said just now was “If I’m interested in the Wingeds, why don’t I come visit them sometimes?”, but back when we were trying out chuuni goods, it seemed like it wouldn’t be easy for her to invite me to her place.","Since they are a closed-off species, I had thought that I would need to inform them of my visit plans well in advance and put some groundwork in place, but the way she’s talking now, it seemed like it’s alright for me to visit them anytime.","When I curiously looked at her, Amel-san seemed to have sensed it as she wryly smiled.","[It can’t be helped. I still haven’t acquired the power of omniscience, so I didn’t know that my sworn friend had received the light of creation in your body.]","[Unnn? How does Shiro-san’s blessing have to do with anything?]","[Yeah, the Wingeds is a species that held a strong belief in God and the world. They would never reject my sworn friend who had received the light of creation.]","[I see, so you’re saying that as a species with strong faith, having Shiro-san’s blessing, they will welcome me instead of rejecting me. If that’s the case, I would definitely like to visit Amel-san’s place sometime.]","[Really!? Unnn, I also want to invite my sworn friend to my home! It’s the first time I’ve had friends over to my home, so I’m looki———— Hrnn!? I eagerly await to the day when I can exchange cups with my sworn friend at my hermitage.]","Hearing my words, Amel-san’s eyes lit up, her joy clearly visible within them. How should I say this...... I really feel like I’m seeing this vision of a puppy vigorously wagging its tail.","As usual, her tone of voice got broken and she flusteredly mended it back...... well, while conversing with Amel-san in such a manner, the process of creating the accessories was completed at a much faster pace than I expected.","Well, it wasn’t that time-consuming since the accessories were easy to make, and we were planning to put only a small amount of them in stall, not having them as the main centerpiece.","[It’s surprising that it went faster than I thought we would. What are we gonna do after this?]","[Then, let’s follow the course set by the stars and bring forth the light that shows us the true origin!]","[It’s that original accessory we talked about huh. However, making accessories is quite difficult, isn’t it? What should I do?]","[Fumu, how troubling. By the way, my sworn friend, how is your skills in the ways of the art...... more specifically, to the art of molding?]","Amel-san suggested we go with what we had talked about before, making our own original accessory, but I wasn’t quite sure how to go about it. Making accessories is quite difficult, and I have my doubts about whether we, who are complete amateurs, can handle it.","Well, putting that aside, molding huh...... If you consider that an item I made is now being revered as an idol of the Gun Rock Dragons, one might think I have great accomplishments to that art...... but it would be a mistake to count that one. In the first place, it had turned out into something completely different from what I had originally intended it to be......","[I’m not really confident about it.]","[I see, I myself don’t have much opinion on mine either. Treading through the darkness without the starlight is dangerous...... so we need a guiding light.]","It may be rude to say this was unexpected, but Amel-san seemed to have a relatively solid hold on common sense, as it’s rare for her to force things with just momentum.","She is still interested in creating original accessories, but she understands that it’s difficult for amateurs like us to do it on our own, as she’s quite straightforward in saying that we need a mentor.","[......Fuuu, I see you’re in trouble.]","[The King of Empty Illusions!?]","[Unnn? You thought of something, Alice?]","[Not really...... but I’ve got something just right for you! Alice-chan’s Special, Easy-to-Use Accessory Making Kit! Quite a while ago there was this self-made accessory boom going around, so I made this, thinking it would sell...... but the item in question was discontinued from being sold due to the difficulty of mass production and the limited demand compared to the cost of creating these kits.]","I see...... It sounds bad if I said that sounds like it’s just another one of her unsold items, but since she said it’s a product that’s not worth the cost and effort as a result of raising the quality, that should mean the quality of this kit would probably be good.","If that’s the case, this would mean Amel-san and I can make our own original accessories now...... right?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpaI : [Is that alright? Doesn’t it look like he’s all ready to shoot Chris’ stomach?]"]},{"number":1548,"title":"Chapter 1548 - Omen 10","paragraphs":["The accessory-making kit that Alice took out was something like a box with various tools inside, and it looked difficult to use, at least without any explanation.","Alice handed one kit each to me and Amel-san, and then taking out a kit for herself, she began explaining to us while putting it into practice.","[First, take out and lay out the magic circle sheet.]","[Fumu...... This magic formula seemed to be one for changing the strength of substance?]","[Yes, that’s right. The materials are originally sold separately, but this time, let’s try to make it using steel for a test. The material can be almost anything as long as it’s mineral. As for the size, the most one can use is of the size fitting into this magic circle.]","While explaining this, Alice places a lump of steel on top of my and Amel-san’s magic circle. At a quick glance, processing this looks quite difficult but......","[After placing the material on the magic circle, touch this party here to activate the magic formula. Then, by the effect of the magic formula, even steel can be processed by hand as if it were clay.]","[O- Ohh...... Amazing, it really has become soft.]","When I followed Alice’s instructions, steel became as easy to process as clay. I see, we’re gonna make accessories like this huh......","[You can also use molds and other tools like the ones used for making cookies of various shapes, and you can also mix in multiple minerals. Well, for now, it’s just a trial, so you can make it into whatever shape you want.]","The processing is done according to Alice’s words. Using a cookie cutter that Alice prepared, the process really is simple, as I cut out a star-shaped steel and lightly smoothed the edges.","[And the leftover minerals can be processed into chains. If you push the minerals into this small box here, it will come out in the form of a chain, so adjust the length accordingly and attach it to the main accessory.]","[Like this?]","[Yes, once you’ve done that, cover the box with the lid engraved with the red magic circle and lightly touch it...... With that, the magic that changed the strength of the mineral would be cut off, fixating the shape and completing your accessory.]","[Ohh, so this would be my original creation......]","This really makes it absurdly easy. This kit’s amazing...... It makes it so that accessories are easy to make, and I can make them as detailed as I want. By mixing multiple minerals, it’s possible to change colors, and it’s easy to process complicated shapes.","[Well, this really makes them easy to make...... It certainly makes it possible for me and Amel-san to make a variety of original accessories with it.]","[Isn’t it nice? Normally, I would ask you for a reasonable cost, but this time, well, I’ll just sponsor those out in exchange for receiving a portion of the sales...... By the way, this kit is disposable, so I will have to provide many of the same kits. I will also include accessory molds and ores for processing, and various stuff that you may need.]","[That would be great. Thanks, Alice.]","[My heartfelt gratitude, Great King of Empty Illusions......]","Thanks to Alice, the original accessories that were just Amel-san’s ideas have become a reality, so let’s consult with her in making them.","Since she said any mineral is acceptable, I guess it can also process the Ice Crystals and Blue Diamonds in my magic box huh......","[Well then, Amel-san. Shall we try our hand at making some?]","[Yeah, let us unleash the vibrant energy of our sparkling passion and embody the true essence of our radiance!]","And so, Amel-san and I began to make original accessories, which turned out to be quite interesting. Since we could modify them as we liked, we could make some very curious things, which was quite interesting.","After making a few accessories and getting used to making them, I was thinking of seriously making something, something that would be a satisfactory article, when an idea came to me.","[......Can this item be processed too?]","[That is...... a jewel that confines the night sky!?]","[Yes, in Lilia-san’s mansion, there lived a person named Sieglinde-san who has a pet named Selas, a Special Individual Rainbow Dragon. That child often gives me these Rainbow Diamonds, so I have quite a significant amount of these.]","Although Sela often does things at her own pace, she is quite emotionally attached to me and occasionally gives me Rainbow Diamonds, and if I’m not mistaken, I have gathered quite the amount in my magic box.","I think it is considered as a mineral, so perhaps, these Rainbow Diamonds, which are said to be as hard as Orichalcons, might also be able to be processed.","[Fummu, my sworn friend, this is just a suggestion...... but how about giving that jewel a different name?]","[A different name?]","[Yeah, it holds a different appearance as the original fragment of a rainbow, nor do I think the name “A Drop in Blue Sky” is appropriate for such a thing that seemed to hold the sparkle in the night sky.]","[I see. Now that you mentioned it, it isn’t like a normal Rainbow Diamond, so it might be better to have another name for it. I will discuss it with Sieg-san next time.]","[Umu...... Ahh, b- by the way...... can I perhaps...... use a little bit of those too?]","[It’s alright. I have a lot of them, so feel free to use them.]","[Wow, thank you! That jewel looked so cool and I would like to use i———– Hrnn!? My gratitude, my sworn friend...... This will make my origin gem shine even better.]","While having such a fun ruckus, I proceeded with making accessories while discussing various ideas with Amel-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Stop! Stop it already!!! That material is ridiculously insane, and the Life Points of Chris’ stomach have already dropped to zero, you know!? Chris, unlike Lilia, has a low stomachache tolerance. If you unleash a body blow with the same intensity as you usually do to Lilia, wouldn’t that be a disaster!?]"]},{"number":1549,"title":"Chapter 1549 - Omen 11","paragraphs":["Thanks to Alice’s kit, the process of creating original accessories with Amel-san went quite smoothly, and it was decided to put a few of them on the store shelves.","[We are ready to sell our products. Now that the products are ready, all we have to do is wait for the Founding Festival.]","[Yeah, thanks to my sworn friend, the articles of chaos have been gathered and lined up in the current era. All we have to do now is wait for the appointed time.]","[By the way, I asked Amel-san to apply for us, but how is our location like?]","[There’s no problem with the location. In this festival that assembled the stars, it is not only on the stage that we can witness the brightest of lights. For even beyond the single ray of light that filters through like dappled sunlight, the truth shall exist.]","[I see, rather than one that borders a main street, I would also prefer a quiet place. It would seem like a hidden gem.]","[......A hidden gem...... Nice.]","According to Amel-san, it seems that she chose a place that isn’t too crowded, not like a busy plaza, for her application. I guess it would be something similar to the location I had applied for in Symphonia’s Founding Festival.","In fact, neither I nor Amel-san are interested in making money, so I’m grateful for having that. Because there are only me and Amel-san here as shopkeepers, I hope it will not be busy compared to the Founding Festival in Symphonia Kingdom.","Well, unlike how it was back at Symphonia Kingdom, since we aren’t selling food but general merchandise, it shouldn’t be that crowded......","[Then, why don’t we have a light discussion about our schedule that day then?]","[Yeah, I don’t have any objection. The wavelengths of the time that we tick should be aligned in order to be ready for the festival. We can either select a place of appointment, or perhaps, we can have this place as the place of appointment......]","[Yeah, that’s certainly troubling. I’d like to preview the site in advance, either the day before or at some point. Since our stall itself can be transported using the magic box, there isn’t really any need for us to set it up the day before, but if we could visit the location in advance, I can register it with my Teleportation Magic Tool, allowing us to meet up on-site.]","[I see, preparations certainly are important. Confirming our Utopia once...... Let’s think about this subject.]","After consulting with Amel-san,......we decided to visit the location of our stall together before the Founding Festival, register the coordinates in my Teleportation Magic Tool, and then we’d meet at the site on the day of the festival.","The area around the Central Plaza where the ceremony is to be held is supposed to be enclosed in a Teleportation Inhibition Ward, but the area where Amel-san and I will be setting up our stall doesn’t seem to have such a problem, so we can teleport there with Teleportation Magic.","At any rate, now that everything is ready...... I guess I should write a letter to Chris-san. Including the fact that I also made original accessories......","In her office in the Royal Castle of Archlesia Empire, Chris had a nervous look on her face in front of the letter she received from Kaito. Unusually for her, she looked hesitant, or perhaps afraid, and couldn’t bring herself to open the seal of the letter.","Given that the presence of the three Supreme Gods has already been confirmed, for Chris, who reached a state of needing to take stomach medicines despite feeling grateful for how bustling this year’s Founding Festival will be, the contents of this letter from Kaito are incredibly important.","After thinking about it for a while, Chris made up her mind, opened the envelope and after carefully reading through the letter...... she blankly stared into the empty space, seemingly burnt out.","Seeing her expression as if she had given up on everything, her advisor who was waiting by her side flusteredly called out to her.","[Y- Your Majesty? Are you alright?]","[......It’s over...... The carnival of hell is about to begin.]","[......C- Could it be......]","[He apparently made them, original accessories...... Moreover, only a few of them would be available in his stall......]","In Kaito’s letter, it was written that he made original accessories and that only a few of them were displayed in their stall. This would definitely lead to the start of a blood-soaked conflict.","Seeing the despair on Chris’ face, her advisor...... didn’t look pale, as she spoke with a small smile on her lips.","[Yeah, don’t worry about that.]","[ ! ? ! ? ]","As Chris looked surprised at the sudden change of tone of her advisor, immediately after that, her advisor’s appearance blurred and changed to that of Alice.","[A- Alice-sama!? S- Since when have you...... No, I see...... You have already replaced her when that letter was brought here?]","[Yes, I’ve given your advisor another job under Chris’ name, and she should be back in about 15 minutes. And so, going back to business...... Well, you don’t have to worry. Regarding Kaito-san’s self-made accessories, almost no information about them is leaked at the moment. I’ve told Amel-san and Kaito-san in advance not to tell about this to others, while I’ve tampered with Kuro-san’s necklace while they were making them, so the only people who would know about Kaito-san’s accessories are Kaito-san, Amel-san, Chris-san...... and those Creator Gods lurking around Kaito-san.]","[......C- Can I be relieved hearing that?]","[For the time being, regarding those Creator Gods, it seems that as a result of mutual restraint, neither of them will participate in the Founding Festival, and Kaito-san will probably do something about Shallow Vernal-sama.]","Hearing Alice’s words, Chris thought for a moment and then patted her chest in relief. Her biggest concerns, Shallow Vernal and Eden, wouldn’t make a move, and Alice has blocked information about this matter towards the other Six Kings.","In that case, there was a good chance that the conflict she feared wouldn’t occur, and they would also likely avoid a situation where the Six Kings would suddenly decide to participate with Kaito as their purpose.","[......Well, I’m not saying they won’t ever find out, so I think it’s best if you stay vigilant. That said, you can still be relieved to some extent, right?]","[......T- Thank you very much. M- My stomach really hurt and I was in despair because of this.]","[No, no, don’t mention it. Well, if I don’t follow up on this much...... In any case, I’ll be excusing myself here......]","After saying that, Alice disappeared, while the left behind Chris stroked her chest in relief...... However, even excluding Kaito’s original accessories, the Founding Festival, with the confirmed participation of the three Supreme Gods and two of the Six Kings, is already an astounding event. Regardless, recalling the days of stomachache that lay ahead of her, Chris took out her stomach medicine from the drawer.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [That’s a nice follow-up. Alice, even with how she usua...... Wait? In the first place, wasn’t it because she gave those strange kits that those original accessories were completed? Then, isn’t this situation just something you intentionally instigated!?]"]},{"number":1550,"title":"Chapter 1550 - Gifts for My Lovers 1","paragraphs":["The preparations for Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival were now in full swing, and Amel-san left after discussing the meeting time and other details for the day’s events.","Meanwhile, I was arranging some of the original accessories I had created some time ago on the table in my room.","Currently lined up on the table are accessories made using rare gemstones and metals such as Rainbow Diamonds, Blue Diamonds, Ice Crystals, and Orichalcons...... Accessories that were not for sale.","It’s obvious. Amel-san and I aren’t clueless idiots. Even if we consider the fact that we amateurs made it and that it’s been oddly processed, also taking into account various other factors, there’s no way we can sell something that would be worth white gold coins at something like a festival stall.","What we plan to sell at the stalls at the festival are silver accessories made from ordinary silver. The reason why I made accessories using rare gemstones was...... of course, there’s my curiosity in trying out making them, but more than that, I made them with the intention of giving them to my lovers.","Chris-san was also wary of me making original accessories, and it certainly wouldn’t be strange for someone like Shiro-san to forcibly make her moves in that case, so it’s no exaggeration to say that I prepared these to prevent that from happening.","I also asked Alice if I could use the kit for that purpose, to which she readily agreed, saying “Please make mine filled with love and affection, okay?”.","Fortunately, I had purchased various gemstones when I made the music box for Lilia-san and the others, so I took the trouble to create an image with colors that matched each of them.","For example, Sela’s Rainbow Diamond may still be called Rainbow Diamond, but its color seemed more like an aurora trapped in the night sky, so I made it for Kuro, thinking that it would match her image.","On the other hand, the original Rainbow Diamonds, those that aren’t produced by Sela, matched Shiro-san’s image in terms of colors, so I purchased some Rainbow Diamonds from Alice and made an accessory for Shiro-san with them.","Well, since I made accessories for my lovers separately like that, I think this would prevent Chris-san from being troubled with people coming to the Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival to purchase the accessories I made but...... I wonder how things would turn out?","In any case, thanks to making these for everyone, I could only make a few items to sell at our stall, but well, I just made those kinds of accessories because of Amel-san’s idea, so wouldn’t it be better to make her original accessories the focus instead?","For the time being, let’s go to the Sanctuary immediately after this and hand it over to Shiro-san. It’s also simply because I’m currently in my room and can easily pass through the Gate Magic Tool, so I think I should go to her first......","Well, although they’re honestly accessories made by an amateur...... I think I made Shiro-san’s accessory quite well. I made it with the image of a flower blooming in the Sanctuary, and although it may sound like I was just tooting my own horn, it turned out quite nice. If anything, it might be what I had the most confidence in among the accessories I made for my lovers.","Hoping that she would be pleased, I immediately used the Teleportation Gate and headed directly to the Sanctuary, and immediately saw Shiro-san’s back upon teleportation.","Seems like she was waiting pretty close to my teleportation point.","[Shiro-san, hello.]","[Hello, Kaito-san. It’s a beautiful day, isn’t it?]","......Well, ain’t that a nice smile on your face...... Her lips are raised in an unusually visible way, and I’m not just speaking metaphors here, as I feel like there’s some sort of halo shining from behind her...... Someone’s definitely excited. I could tell at a glance that her tension was at its peak.","It’s no surprise that Shiro-san must have sensed my purpose for coming here. She would have seen me making the accessories, and of course, Shiro-san would also know that I made an accessory for her.","However, her good mood doesn’t seem like it was just that...... Ahh, I see, she also read my thoughts before I went through the gate earlier, didn’t she? That the accessory I made for Shiro-san is the one I have the most confidence in, and she should also know that I came to Shiro-san to give her accessory first among my lovers.","......That’s why she was that visibly cheerful huh...... How should I say this....... Shiro-san is very much just like always, as even with all her antics, she’s quite the lovely person.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ghaaakkk, w- what...... Pretending to be a stomach blow...... Only to actually be a sweetness blow!? M- Moreover, u- uwaahhh...... It’s over there...... There’s a freaking 1 over theeeeeere!]"]},{"number":1551,"title":"Chapter 1551 - Gifts for My Lovers 2","paragraphs":["I came to visit Shiro-san with the original accessory in hand, and she already looked like she was in a good mood.","I wryly smiled at how easy-to-tell her emotions are at the moment, but since she already knew what my purpose here is, I decided to get right to the point.","[Shiro-san, I made an original accessory based on you, and I’m wondering if you would like to have it.]","[Thank you, it makes me very happy.]","What I prepared for Shiro-san was a necklace made of Rainbow Diamonds. In the art battle back in the Six Kings Festival, I once created some sort of sad creature, but even though it might just be self-praise, this necklace is really well done.","No, well, that sad creature had made a great leap and has become an idol prayed to by Gun Rock Dragons, so in a sense, you can say that it’s also a great success but......","In any case, unlike back in the Six Kings Festival, I was able to look at reference materials and Alice gave me advice on how to make them, and with the shape of a flower, I think it’s a pretty good job.","When I presented her with such a necklace, Shiro-san spoke with a smile on her lips.","[Oops, oh my. This is troubling. My hands are full at the moment.]","[Eh? What are you saying————- Wait, since when is that staff in your hands!? Also, what’s the point of holding that with both hands?]","Somehow, before I knew it, Shiro-san was holding a staff as big as Iris-san’s ?ποκ?λυψι? in both hands. Yeah, her hands certainly are blocked. Or rather, she had blocked them...... What is this? What’s her purpose for having that?","[In that case, can’t Kaito-san put the necklace on me?]","[Eh? Ahh, so that’s what’s happening......]","[What do you mean? My hands just happened to be full.]","Apparently, she wanted me to put the necklace on her and was doing that small play. How should I say this...... That’s just like Shiro-san, so I involuntarily chuckled.","However, since I don’t have any particular reason to refuse, I decided to approach Shiro-san and put the necklace on her neck. Since we are about the same height, I should be able to smoothly...... smoothly...... Well, seems like putting a necklace on someone is harder than I thought.","[......Alright, with this———!?]","While struggling, I managed to securely put the necklace on her. Just when I was about to let go of my hands though, Shiro-san’s face unexpectedly came close and she lightly kissed my lips.","It was completely unexpected, and when I stiffened in surprise, Shiro-san happily smiled and spoke.","[......Thank you. Does it suit me?]","[Y- Yes, it suits you.]","[Fufu, I’m glad.]","Kuh, frustrating it may be, but she’s absurdly cute. Perhaps, because she’s growing mentally more and more, she’s recently been making surprise attacks like this, making Shiro-san quite formidable.","It’s just, well, even though it’s an accessory made by an amateur, I’m happy to hear that she’s happy with it.","Having such thoughts in mind, Shiro-san happily looked at the necklace before speaking again.","[Speaking of which, Kaito-san...... I was the first one, yes?]","[Eh? If you mean the order in which I’m handing the accessories, then you are the first. Alice also mentioned that she would like me to give her present later, not in that situation, so I haven’t given her her accessory yet......]","[I see, I see.]","Shiro-san, who heard my words, nodded with a very satisfied expression on her face. Shiro-san certainly has this fixation about that kind of thing, so I have this impression that being first makes her happy, and in fact, she seemed to have been quite delighted.","It’s kinda interesting because I can tell from her expression and gesture that she’s very satisfied.","[......This is also the best one, isn’t it?]","[I suppose so. Of course, the designs I made were different, so I can’t simply compare them...... but I personally think this is the best one I created.]","[Fumu fumu...... Is that so.]","Uwahh, she looks so happy. I’m not sure if her joy isn’t hidden at all or that she just didn’t have any intention of hiding it, but in any case, it felt like she was brimming with happiness.","How should I say this...... she looked really lovely, and seeing her expressing her joy to this extent, it makes me happy too......Somehow, I have the impression that my affection for Shiro-san is increasing.","[......Kaito-san, this is troubling.]","[Eh?]","[My hands are quite free here, you see? Isn’t this a good time to reaffirm your love for me with a hug?]","[Pfft, ahaha...... Even without reaffirming it, I think I have enough amounts of love in me...... but well, regardless of that, I might want to have that hug.]","I couldn’t help but burst out laughing at Shiro-san’s request for a hug, which was just like her, but I also wanted to hug Shiro-san, so I decided to just accept her proposal.","When I took a step closer to Shiro-san and hugged her body, Shiro-san also seemed to be somewhat excited, as she put her hands behind my back.","Feeling the warmth and softness through our close contact, how should I say this...... while strongly, truly strongly feeling this sense of happiness...... I enjoyed embracing Shiro-san for a while.","<Afterword>","Makina : [Unnn, unnn. My beloved child is a caring one, isn’t he? Accessories for lovers...... for lovers...... lovers...... Eh? What about mine?]","Serious-senpai : [......Ah (Realized something).]","Makina : [There’s one for me too, right? After all, I’m his mother, and in a way, I’m closer to him than his lovers!]","Serious-senpai : [No, he did say he prepared them for his lovers, so I think those who aren’t lovers are excluded—————Hyiiihh! T- The highlight here is......]","Makina : [......Unnn? You said something?]","Serious-senpai : [I- I- I guess he may also have prepared for others...... A- Ahaha......]"]},{"number":1552,"title":"Chapter 1552 - Gifts for My Lovers 3","paragraphs":["After finishing giving Shiro-san’s accessory to her, I wondered who I should give to next time, but I guess it wouldn’t be any trouble if I handed it over based on who is the most nearby.","First, I checked to see if Anima was home, but it seemed that she went outside, so I couldn’t give it to her right away.","In that case, the next closest would be Lilia-san and Sieg-san. No, it’s true that Alice would technically be the closest, but since she asked me to give hers later, I decided to consider her miscellaneous goods store as her location.","And so, I went to visit Lilia-san first...... but for some reason, Lilia-san looked very tired.","[......Arehh? Lilia-san? You look kind of tired......]","That’s strange? Lilia-san hasn’t been busy with work lately, and last I heard, she should have been talking a little while ago that she was relatively free and could relax for a while. It was like, the expression on her face is also questioning where that cheerful face at that time disappeared to.","[......Ahh, Kaito-san. No, ummm, it was hurriedly decided that I would participate in Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival, so I was a little tired after confirming and completing various procedures.]","[Eh? Arehh? Lilia-san, didn’t you say that you wouldn’t be participating in Archlesia Empire?]","[That was the plan but......]","Of course, I have told Lilia-san in detail that I will be opening a stall with Amel-san at Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival. If she finds out about this later, she will definitely get angry, so I intend to thoroughly inform her in advance.","I remember that Lilia-san also told me that she had no particular plans to participate in Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival, and she even kindly told me “Please enjoy yourself”.","I asked her why her plans had suddenly changed, and to my surprise...... She told me that Eden-san had come and asked her to visit my stall in her stead.","According to Lilia-san, she wasn’t forced to do this by Eden-san, it was just a request, but even if that’s so, I don’t think Lilia-san could refuse Eden-san. Seriously, even though she isn’t someone I could have told her about, but even without considering that, she sure attracts trouble like a black hole......","[......However, that’s surprising. I honestly thought Eden-san would come to my stall herself.]","[Yes, I was a little skeptical, but it seems that she had a contract with Shallow Vernal-sama, so she couldn’t go there directly.]","[I see......]","Certainly, if someone is able to control Eden-san, it would be someone like Shiro-san...... I also felt like she was reprimanding Eden-san during my housewarming party, so she may have stopped Eden-san from going on a rampage without my knowledge.","[......I see, if Eden-san isn’t going to directly come, I think it would be better if I give this to Lilia-san.]","[Unnn? What is it?]","[Well, I actually expected Eden-san to come to our stall. And so, while Amel-san and I were making original accessories for the stall, I thought that Eden-san would definitely want it, so I made a separate one for her.]","Yes, I was wary of Eden-san’s visit right from the start. Considering who the most dangerous person in terms of damage to Chris-san would be, no matter how I thought about it, it would be Eden-san. And if I were to make original accessories, I was sure that there was no way Eden-san would not want it, so I made an accessory for her.","Alice recommended a necklace in the shape of a gear, so I prepared a necklace in that shape, planning to give it to Eden-san when she comes to my stall. However, since she had asked Lilia-san to go to my stall in her stead, it would be best to have her hand it over along with other products.","That way, Eden-san’s impression of Lilia-san would improve and she might be less likely to drag Lilia-san around her absurdities in the future.","Also, the purpose of having Lilia-san give it to her instead of me is to prevent Eden-san from going on a rampage.","[And so, please give this to her.]","[Thank you. Indeed, with this, Eden-san will certainly be pleased, and it will be easier for me to give her the item.]","[Also...... This is for Lilia-san......]","[Eh? For me?]","[Yes. I made it with Lilia-san’s image in mind. I tried making you a brooch, but I apologize for it being amateurish. If it’s alright with you, please accept my gift.]","[Kaito-san......]","The brooch I made for Lilia-san is one made with a rare gemstone called Imperial Twin Topaz, which has two colors of blue and yellow at the same time...... as if there’s a blue sea trapped inside a yellow gemstone.","I made it with the image of a dragon-like feather, and I think I was able to do it relatively well thanks to Alice’s guidance. However, it isn’t of a quality that would allow one to wear it to a social occasion, so I think it would be used more in a casual setting......","[......Thank you. This makes me happy. Also, if Kaito-san is alright with it, would you like to go to a ball together with me next time? If possible, I would like to wear this brooch when I’m with Kaito-san......]","[Eh? Yes, if you’re alright with me, I’ll go with you anytime.]","[Fufu, I’m looking forward to it. Seriously, blowing away the tiredness I had just before as if it was a lie...... Somehow, I suddenly found myself feeling really happy.]","Lilia-san’s expression as she said that with a smile wasn’t like the tired one she had before, giving me the impression that she was really happy. I also want to fulfill Lilia-san’s request as much as possible, so I’ll practice dancing so that I’ll be ready whenever she invites me again.","<Afterword>","Makina : [M- My chiiiiiiiild! I- I believed in you!!! Mother really believed in you...... Ah, my beloved child really is a cute and good child. I’m a bit dissatisfied that he can’t give it to me directly, but acting all reserved and handing it to Lilia also shows his cuteness, and that’s fine too!!!]"]},{"number":1553,"title":"Chapter 1553 - Gifts for My Lovers 4","paragraphs":["After I finished giving Lilia-san the accessories, I decided to look for Sieg-san. I thought of asking someone where she was, but it seems there was no need to do so. As I was walking down the hallway, I looked out into the garden and saw Sieg-san with Bell and the others.","Since she was playing with Bell and the others at this hour, I wonder if Sieg-san was on her day off? Sieg-san, who loves animals, often plays with Bell, Lynn and Sela on her day off after all. No, it’s already evening, so it is possible that she had already finished working early hours......","Realizing that I can’t help but smile at the sight of a happy Sieg-san, I moved towards the garden and called out to her.","[Sieg-san, hello.]","[Kaito-san? Hello, have you finished setting up your stall?]","[Yes, there’s no problem with that. I was looking for Sieg-san earlier, when I saw you here.]","[You’re looking for me?]","Incidentally, Sieg-san also knows that I will be opening a stall at Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival, and she also knows that I was preparing for that with Amel-san today.","Or rather, with how flamboyant Amel-san’s entry was, everyone knows who was at the mansion.","[Actually, when we were preparing our merchandise, we talked about making original accessories, and I made accessories for my lovers at that time. So, if you’re alright with it, please take this.]","[T- Thank you. I was surprised but..... fufu, this makes me happy.]","The accessory I prepared for Sieg-san is a bracelet. Well, since Sieg-san is Sela’s owner, I wanted to make sure that Sela’s Rainbow Diamond was used for that accessory.","However, when one thinks of Sieg-san’s image, it would be the color red...... After much deliberation, I decided to create a bracelet with a design in which two gemstones intertwine each other.","I was grateful that the materials could be softened and processed, making it easy for me to create a shape that would normally be difficult.","[It’s a bracelet using Sela’s Rainbow Diamonds and a gemstone called Astral Ruby.]","[Sounds like it’s made with quite the outrageous materials. I think the price of that thing is outrageous...... However, I guess that’s very typical of Kaito-san. I will treasure it.]","After receiving the bracelet, Sieg-san smiled happily, and immediately put on the bracelet and showed it to me.","I felt my heart warmed by her gentle smile, when I suddenly remembered the conversation I had with Amel-san.","[Ahh, speaking of which, I’m changing the subject...... but regarding Sela’s Rainbow Diamond, Amel-san thinks that it would be better to give it a different unique name......]","[I see, Sela’s Rainbow Diamonds certainly are different from the usual ones, and it isn’t rainbow-colored in the first place. Perhaps giving it another name would be better.]","[Yes, and I think it would be better if her owner, Sieg-san, gave it its name......]","Yes, it’s quite simple of a story but...... Sela’s Rainbow Diamonds aren’t an obvious rainbow color like normal Rainbow Diamonds, instead possessing an aurora-like hue. Depending on the angle, it may look like a rainbow, but I think it’s more appropriate to describe it as an aurora rather than a rainbow.","[Hmmm...... I suppose so. Speaking of which, there was a variant of Blue Crystals called Midnight Crystals, right? How about emulating it and calling them Midnight Diamonds?]","[Yeah, that sounds great. Combined with its black color, it gives off a feeling reminiscent of the aurora floating in the night sky...... Then, it’s decided that it’s now called Midnight Diamonds.]","[Yes. Well, it may not be that necessary since it’s not distributed to the general public. It would only be Alice-sama who would sometimes buy them......]","[It does seem like she likes them as a material.]","Alice likes Sela’s Rainbow...... Midnight Diamonds. It’s softer than Orichalcon, but easier to use because it has a good magic power flow, is easy to process and has a clear acquisition location.","Since Orichalcon is an alloy to begin with, the process of making the Orichalcon itself is time-consuming and troublesome.","[......Hmmm. If possible, I was thinking of going to give the accessories to my other lovers as well, but the sun is already setting today, so I guess I’ll give the others theirs tomorrow.]","[That would be good. It isn’t like you needed to be in too much of a rush...... Since you’re here, why don’t we play together with Bell-chan and the others?]","[I guess so. Even though the sun will set soon, there will still be some time, so let’s play.]","[Yes.]","Hearing my reply, Sieg-san held my hand with a joyful smile and made our way toward Bell and the others, who were restlessly waiting for us. Just like that, we spent the time happily playing and enjoying ourselves as much as time allowed.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......J- Just like that, he would be passing the accessories one chapter at a time to his lovers huh...... N- No more...... May seriousness come already!]","? ? ? : [Have you ever had a wish like that come true in the past?]","Serious-senpai : [......None. Even when things transitioned to a serious tone, it ended up being surprises, and there were many scenes where I wasn’t there.]","? ? ? : [Then, that’s your answer.]","Serious-senpai : [D*mn it!]"]},{"number":1554,"title":"Chapter 1554 - Gifts for My Lovers 5","paragraphs":["After giving the accessories for Shiro-san, Lilia-san and Sieg-san, I decided to leave giving the others to my other lovers later since the day is already over.","For the time being, I guess I will Anima hers when she comes home, and Kuro, who I expect to come over at night? As for Anima, I heard that she had left because of her investments, so she will be back in a little while.","I asked Caraway to tell Anima to come to my room when she returns, so she should come by when she returns.","As I was thinking about this, I felt the presence of someone approaching with my Sympathy Magic. I don’t usually turn it on all the time, but this time, I had it on because I was waiting for Anima, so I was able to detect her approach.","Well, unlike Detection Magic though, I couldn’t really tell where they are now. All I know is that, coming this way, Anima feels like...... she’s trying to suppress this feeling of excitement from her.","After a few moments, there was a knock at the door, and when I gave her permission to enter, Anima entered the room.","[Master, you wanted to see me?]","[Ahh, welcome home, Anima. Unnn, I have something to tell you.]","[Hahh! Please leave it to me!]","[......Unnn?]","Anima, straightening her back, salutes...... She also feels kinda cheerful, making me some sort of phantom of a dog with its tail wagging, waiting for my next words.","Is this that.......? I didn’t tell Caraway what I called Anima here for, so she may have just gone to Anima, telling her that I called for her, so Anima thought I needed her help.","And now, happy to be relied on by me, she looked really pumped up as she waited for my favor...... my orders......","[......Ahh, no, Anima. It’s not like I have anything to ask you, I just called you because I have something I want to give you.]","[Ahh, I- I see......]","Ah, she deflated. Somehow, even though she’s a bear, Anima really feels like a dog. Even now, she looked like a puppy who thought she’s gonna be taken for a walk, only to find out that she was mistaken. Somehow, she strangely looked cute.","However, Anima immediately regained her composure and asked.","[So, Master. What is it that you wanted to give me?]","[Errr, I was preparing for my stall with Amel-san today, and we decided to make original accessories earlier, so thinking of gifting one to Anima, I made this accessory for you.]","[......Eh? M- Master made this for me?]","What I made for Anima was a necklace. I have given hair ornaments to Anima before, so I took hair ornaments out of consideration...... With Anima’s fighting style being hand-to-hand combat, I also didn’t consider giving her a bracelet because I thought accessories in her hand or arm would become a hindrance.","At first, I was thinking of giving her earrings, but since Anima’s ears have a special shape, it would be difficult for an amateur to figure out what kind of earring would be better, so to be safe, I chose to make a necklace for her.","It was a necklace made from a beautiful brown gemstone called Gran Amber, and I think it fits well with Anima’s image.","When I presented the necklace to Anima, she timidly accepted it. Her expression looked tense, but with how her ears were twitching, I could tell she was pleased.","[......T- Thank you. It’s so sudden that I can’t think of a clever response...... but this makes me happy.]","[I’m glad if Anima is pleased with it. I made it myself, so I know it’s rather shoddy, but I’m glad you like it.]","[I’m really glad! I can’t really verbalize this joy I’m feeling, but I’m certain that my joy is overflowing and won’t stop overflowing!]","[Ahaha, hearing you say that makes me happy.]","Anima had a truly joyful expression on her face, and as I had thought, it really feels like I’m seeing the phantom of a dog vigorously wagging its tail behind her. Seriously, she really feels like a dog.","Even without my Sympathy Magic, her feeling of joy is quite conveyed, which makes me happy as well.","[Speaking of which, I’m changing the subject, but have you had dinner yet, Anima? I haven’t eaten yet, so want to eat together with me?]","[Ah, yes. I’ll be happy to join you!]","Towards Anima, who was happily smiling, I also smiled and as if to escort her, I gently pulled her hand.","Anima seemed startled for a moment, but as her happy smile immediately returned to her lips, she returned the grip on my hand. Just like that, holding each other’s hands, we proceeded to move toward the dining hall together.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Gfuuu...... This is tough...... S- Serious, come quickly......]","? ? ? : [No, it’s not like the next one will be serious even after this arc is over, you know? The next arc will definitely be about Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival, and the only serious thing around would be the serious damage the Stomachache Warriors’ stomachs will be facing.]"]},{"number":1555,"title":"Chapter 1555 - Gifts for My Lovers 6","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I didn’t have time to write, so today’s chapter is a little short.","While I was relaxing in my room after eating dinner and taking a bath, Kuro came to visit me with baby castellas as usual.","[Kaito-kun, I’m here~~]","[Welcome. I already made us some coffee......]","[Thanks~~]","I brewed and prepared the coffee Ozma-san gave me. Thinking about it again, I’m not sure it would be good to have coffee before going to bed, but perhaps because of Shiro-san’s Blessing, I don’t remember feeling like the caffeine made it hard for me to sleep.","We then went through the usual routine of drinking coffee and eating baby castellas, but Kuro’s behavior was different from usual.","She was kinda fidgety, she’s glancing at me expectantly from time to time.","[......Kuro, you knew, didn’t you?]","[......W- What could you be talking about......]","When I omitted the subject and asked her about it, Kuro averted her gaze, looking like she knew what I was talking about...... She’s so easy to tell. This is just a guess, but Kuro definitely knows that I made original accessories and was giving them to my lovers.","It’s probably because of my necklace huh...... Well, I’ve felt that this was the case several times already before, so it’s not something I should be concerned about now.","In any case, it seemed like she was looking forward to the accessory gift from me, so she looked fidgety. Come to think of it, I feel like she came to visit earlier than usual today.","How should I say this...... Seeing her acting like a child looking forward to a present, I couldn’t help chuckling, so I took out the accessory for Kuro from my magic box.","[I made a bracelet for Kuro. I gave you a necklace before, and I had Kuro make this Teleportation Magic Tool in the shape of a bracelet before...... It’s not exactly matching, but I tried making it into a similar design.]","[Ahh, you’re right! Its design does kinda resemble Kaito-kun’s Teleportation Magic Tool. The Magic Crystal is Sela-chan’s Diamond huh. The shape is also beautifully made, and it’s so perfect that I can’t believe it’s the first time you’ve made it. It’s amazing, Kaito-kun.]","[Ahaha, thanks. Hearing you say that makes me happy.]","Kuro happily receives the bracelet from me with a smile, puts it on her arm and compares it with my Teleportation Magic Tool.","I’m happy that she’s delighted with it, and the words of praise Kuro spoke in a gentle voice are pleasant to hear.","[......Thank you, Kaito-kun. I’ll take good care of it.]","[Yeah.]","[I’m also wearing the necklace you gave me before, you know? See!]","[Ahh, you’re right.]","The necklace that Kuro showed me was the necklace that I had given to her after having Alice modify it.","[......Somehow, even though it wasn’t so long ago that you gave it to me, I’m feeling a bit nostalgic. I gave you this necklace before Kuro and I became lovers, right?]","[Unnn. Right, right, I was happy when I received this, but I also felt a little lonely because I thought Kaito-kun would be leaving back home. However, thinking about it now feels like a good memory.]","[You’re right———— Unnn?]","While I was feeling nostalgic, Kuro suddenly came up to me and fawningly embraced me. I was a little surprised by her sudden action, but I also felt like flirting with Kuro a bit, so I put my hands on her back and hugged her.","With Kuro held in my arms, fitting snugly against me due to our height difference, I feel an indescribable sense of endearment.","[I wonder why? I feel like relaxing with Kaito-kun like this today.]","[Hmm, that’s right. Why don’t we just keep the idle chatter like this?]","[Unnn!]","Without specifically doing anything more, simply embracing each other...... We spent a relaxing time feeling each other’s warmth. In a way, I think this in itself is quite extravagant.","Even if there’s nothing dramatic about it, just being together like this makes me feel happy. Sometimes Kuro would rub her face against my chest, sometimes I would stroke her head, we enjoyed our alone time together to our heart’s content.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Errr, all that’s left now is...... Isis-san, Vier-san, Fate-san and Alice-chan, right?]","Serious-senpai : [......There are still that many? I feel like I’m gonna die already......]"]},{"number":1556,"title":"Chapter 1556 - Gifts for My Lovers 7","paragraphs":["Morning the next day, the first place I went to was the God Realm. My purpose was to give the accessory I made for Fate-san to her...... As for the reason why Fate-san was the one I went to first today, it was simply because I later thought I should have dropped by after giving Shiro-san’s to hers yesterday.","When I teleported to the Upper Level of the God Realm and went to Fate-san’s temple, Fate-san, lying on a cushion floating in the air as usual, greeted me with a smile.","[Yahhoo~~ Kai-chan~~ Welcome. I’m glad you came~~]","[I’m sorry for bothering you this early in the morning.]","[No problem. Kai-chan is always welcome to visit anytime. I mean, in the first place, there is no night in the God Realm unless Shallow Vernal-sama does so~~.]","[Come to think of it, that really was the case.]","After Fate-san lightly waved a finger, a sofa and a table appeared out of nowhere. Then, as Fate-san urged me to sit on the sofa, tea and sweets appeared on the table.","It seems that Fate-san’s power as a God has become much stronger than before, allowing her to do things like Shiro-san does.","[So, what’s up today?]","[Ahh, wasn’t I planning to open a stall at Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival?]","[Yeah? You were?]","[......Arehh? Didn’t I tell you?]","[I feel like I heard about it, but I also feel like I didn’t. Hmmm, I think I did hear about it, but it doesn’t seem to have anything to do with me, so I probably forgot......]","[It’s definitely the latter.]","How should I say this...... This really is just like Fate-san. Rather, precisely because she just doesn’t depart just because she heard I’m opening a stall, that her thought process in matters like this is much safer. In a sense, she’s a precious person who would likely reach the conclusion that expressly going to my stall is troublesome.","[Ahh~~ However, I see now. Kai-chan opened up a stall huh...... So that’s why Shallow Vernal-sama gave out such permission.]","[Unnn? What did Shiro-san say?]","[Well, you see, for this year’s celebration of Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival, the Supreme Gods, including me, have been given permission to attend. We’re not really ordered to attend, it’s more like “You can attend if you want~~” or something like that. I thought for sure it was a trade-off from giving Archlesia my Providence recently...... but if Kai-chan is opening a stall, considering how things went when you opened a stall back in Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival, I guess it’s more of a feeling of consideration for the power balance between the countries?]","[......Fumu, and that means?]","[You see, Symphonia having all the Six Kings participating in their Founding Festival is quite the hot topic. We don’t really want a situation where the Symphonia Kingdom gets too far ahead of the others and cause friction between the countries~~ I don’t know how things would go in Hydra Kingdom though......]","[I see.]","Now that she mentioned it, Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival, in which all the Six Kings are present, would likely be a hot topic. In order to counteract that, I guess they will strive for balance by having all the Supreme Gods attend Archlesia Empire’s festival huh? Well, Shiro-san just gave her permission and didn’t force them to participate, so even though there are such speculations, I guess their attendance would just be left to each person’s judgment.......","[......Seems like you all got it rough. Well, we’ve gotten off topic, but about the purpose of my visit today....... I was thinking of giving this to Fate-san as a present.]","[Oyo? A hair ornament? The decoration attached to it is Queen Amethyst, right?]","[Yes, I made original accessories as a product in our stall, so I decided to make handmade accessories for my lovers as a gift, and this is the one I made for Fate-san.]","To be honest, I wasn’t sure what accessory to give to Fate-san. In the first place, I don’t think she even wears accessories, so I thought a simple one would be good...... but necklaces and brooches would get in the way when she’s lying down.","And so, I chose to make a hair accessory that can be attached to a hair tie. Fate-san ties her hair in twin tails, and I thought of adding a small splash to her cuteness.","[Ohhh, Kai-chan made this? It’s amazing! You’re so skillful~~]","[Ahh, no, it’s thanks to the creation kit that Alice prepared for me......]","[However, it’s definitely better than anything I could make. Well, I would probably get bored halfway through making them but...... in any case, thanks~~ This makes me happy!]","[I’m glad you’re pleased with it.]","After Fate-san praised me with a smile, she immediately attached it to her hair. The hair accessory made with Queen Amethyst has a slightly bluish-purple color that is different from Fate-san’s hair color, but serves more as an accent.","[How is it? Does it look good on me?]","[Yes, it looks great on you, making you look adorable.]","[Ahaha, thanks~~ Even so, you caught me off guard there~~ making my heart beat fast like that. And so, Kai-chan, arms open wide!]","[Yes? Eh? Like this———–]","[Orya!]","[———-Whoa!?]","I spread out my hands as Fate-san told me, to which Fate-san floated out of the cushion she was lying on and settling herself between my arms, she embraced me.","[And so, Kai-chan, let’s do some lovey-dovey~~]","[I don’t really know what you mean but...... Well, I guess that abruptness is just like Fate-san.]","Fate-san has a rather capricious personality like a cat, but when she’s being spoiled like now, how should I say this...... She’s really cute.","While feeling my cheeks involuntarily loosening to a smile, I patted the head of Fate-san who was happily hugging me.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ofuu...... More sugar power than I thought is...... No, but that aside, compared to Shiro, Kuro or Eden, it seems like she has no knowledge of Kaito’s current situation. This gives the impression that she has absolutely no intention of invading Kaito’s privacy, and in fact, she appears to be an extremely decent person...... She also seems to be enjoying her time with Kaito, including the time he was telling her what was going on lately, even happily praising Kaito for it...... Isn’t Fate turning out to be a better lover than expected?]"]},{"number":1557,"title":"Chapter 1557 - Gifts for My Lovers 8","paragraphs":["After visiting Fate-san, I decided to visit Dr. Vier’s clinic. At first, I was thinking of going to Isis-san’s place first, but when I checked the time after visiting Fate-san, I realized that if I were to head there right now, I would be able to see Dr. Vier between her morning and afternoon consultations at her clinic.","Well, the break time actually depends on the patients, and it’s not necessarily the case that she’d always have the time to take a break...... but fortunately, she didn’t have any urgent work to do at the moment, as she seemed to be taking a break drinking herb tea when I arrived.","[Welcome. You have great timing, I just brewed a fresh pot of herb tea.]","[Hello, Dr. Vier. Ahh, that great timing...... You mean, to brew your tea “again”?]","[Unnn. I kinda dropped the pot earlier......]","[Ahh, I see.]","It seemed like she was as clumsy as usual, as she had already dropped a pot of herb tea she had brewed once. As I watched Dr. Vier scratched her head with a wry smile, a wry smile also appeared on my lips. Even though she was quite clumsy a lot of times, Dr. Vier is a Peak Count-rank, so it’s a bit reassuring to not have to worry about her getting burned or injured...... Well, that’s probably why she was so negligent that she screws up so often......","[So, what’s the subject for your visit today?]","[Ahh, you see, I mentioned before that I was going to have a stall at Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival, right?]","[You did say that. Even though it hasn’t been that long since Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival, you’re quite the busy bee, Miyama-kun~~]","[Ahaha, well, in a way, Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival is also the reason why I’m attending there.]","In the first place, this all started when Amel-san felt down because I didn’t invite her when I opened a stall for Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival.","Thinking that way, in a sense, it’s like I opened a stall at Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival because I opened one at Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival.","[In that case, why don’t you complete the set and participate in Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival as well?]","[No, as expected, that’s just rough. If I were to participate in Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival, I would rather just be looking around the stalls.]","[Ahh~~ I see, that certainly is difficult to do when you’re opening a stall, isn’t it? During Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival, I was also involved in helping at an external relief facility, so I didn’t have much time to look around.]","[Because many people inevitably get injured in the heat of the moment, doctors certainly are busy.]","Dr. Vier helped out at a simple relief facility where doctors gathered for Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival. It was like those first-aid tents at events, where injured and sick people get treated.","[Well, it’s a festival after all, so it can’t be helped. Oops, sorry, sorry, we’re getting off track, aren’t we?]","[No, please don’t worry about it. So, getting to the point......]","When I explained that I made the accessories to give to my lovers when I made the products to sell at the Founding Festival, Dr. Vier’s eyes lit up and she looked happy.","[Ahh, I got it! It’s a ring, right? If I’m not mistaken, otherworlders give them to their lover as a gift!]","[Well, you aren’t mistaken, but you’re having some misunderstanding...... In any case, unfortunately, what I’m giving you now isn’t a ring.]","Perhaps the ring that Dr. Vier is thinking about is the engagement ring. In the world of polygamous Trinia, the culture of giving an engagement ring to your spouse doesn’t exist. Instead, there are some similar exchanges, such as exchanging matching jewelry at weddings......","[I see~~ Not “now” huh~~ Then, the ring...... would come at a later date......right?]","[......Y- You’re right.]","Mhmm? Could she actually not be misunderstanding and actually had an accurate understanding of how rings in our world works? H- Hmmm, I’m not sure. She kinda has this mischievous smile on her lips, but at the same time, that doesn’t seem to be the case.","[W- Well, for the time being, what I’ve prepared for you is a necklace.]","[Ohh, it’s beautiful. It’s silver, no, gray? It looks like my hair color.]","[Yes, I actually chose the jewel based on the color of Dr. Vier’s hair, which is a combination of Gray Diamond and Platinum.]","What I prepared for Dr. Vier was a necklace. First of all, since Dr. Vier is a doctor, I thought accessories worn on the hands and arms might get in the way. Also, she wears something like a headdress for nuns, so I thought hair ornaments and earrings might not be visible, which is why I chose a necklace.","As for the reason why I chose to make it into a cross-like shape, well, her nun-like clothes really just had this strong impression on me.","[Thank you! I’m really glad~~ Wait, I’ll have to properly cast State Preservation magic on it and make sure I won’t break it.]","[If you’re delighted with it, it would make me happy too.]","[Ehehe...... Ahh, by the way, do you still have some free time?]","[Yes, I don’t have any urgent plans.]","[I see, then while we’re at it, why don’t we go have lunch together? There’s a good restaurant near here, you know?]","[That sounds great. I’d be happy to join you.]","It was just around lunchtime, and Dr. Vier’s suggestion was right on time. Having finished my herb tea, I got up from my seat and helped clean up her place a bit, before we headed for the entrance of the clinic to get ready to depart together.","[Ahh, Miyama-kun, stop for a moment.]","[Yes?]","[Thanks for the accessory——– Chuu.]","[Eh?]","[Fufufu, it’s just a token of my appreciation. Then, let’s go~~!]","After giving me a surprise kiss on the cheek and giving me a smile, Dr. Vier pulled me by the hand and walked away with a grin.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......I’m alright...... I’m alright. I’m a seriously strong serious...... I’ve overcome the rough seas of sugar many times before...... I’ll definitely be alright this time too......]","? ? ? : [You overcame those? Seems more like you got swept away and got crushed though......]"]},{"number":1558,"title":"Chapter 1558 - Gifts for My Lovers 9","paragraphs":["After having lunch with Dr. Vier, I decided to visit Isis-san’s castle. I could have gone to Alice’s miscellaneous goods store first, but since I’m using Teleportation Magic to travel, the effort in going to either place would have been the same. Besides, I could just go to Alice’s miscellaneous goods store later from the basement of my house, so I decided to postpone my visit to her later.","When I arrived at Isis-san’s castle, Polaris-san greeted me and guided me to the place where Isis-san was.","[Eh? Lillywood-san is also here?]","[Yes, she just arrived a few minutes ago. She’s talking with Isis-sama at the moment. I have already confirmed with them that there is no problem if Miyama Kaito-sama is present.]","[I see, so Lillywood-san just came to visit?]","[I don’t know what the purpose of her visit was, but it seemed that Lillywood-sama had a difficult look on her face.]","[A difficult look?]","I don’t know what’s going on, but for Lillywood-san to have a difficult look on her face, that means she didn’t come to visit simply to hang out with Isis-san or to have a chat with her.","In that case, did some sort of trouble occur? As I had such a thought in mind, when I entered the room that Polaris-san guided me too, just as I was told, Isis-san and Lillywood-san were there.","[Hello, Isis-san, Lillywood-san.]","[......Kaito...... Welcome..... I’m glad...... you came.]","“Hello, Kaito-san. What a coincidence, meeting you here.”","After a quick greeting, I took a seat and Polaris-san prepared me a cup of tea, after which she left with a bow.","After seeing them off, I called out to them again.","[Even so, it really is a coincidence, isn’t it? Did Lillywood-san just come in a little while ago?]","[......Unnn...... She said she wanted to talk to me about something?]","“Yes, in a way, Kaito-san’s arrival could facilitate this conversation. Kaito-san, just to confirm, but is it true that you will be opening a stall at Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival.”","[Eh? Yes, that’s right?]","What Lillywood-san asked me was the opening of a stall at Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival. Incidentally, I had told Isis-san before, but I had not told Lillywood-san about it, so it’s surprising that she didn’t know about it.","[I’ll be opening a stall with Amel-san, a Winged whom I met at a tea party to which Lillywood-san invited me before.]","[......What kind of stall...... are you going to set up this time?]","[I’m planning to open a general store. We’ll handle products from Alice’s store and handmade accessories.]","“......Handmade...... accessories?”","When I talked to Isis-san about the content of the stall, it hadn’t been decided yet, so when I explained it again, Lillywood-san looked as if she heard that the world had ended.","[......Lillywood-san?]","“K- Kaito-san, just to confirm...... but those handmade accessories, does that also include accessories made by Kaito-san?”","[Yes, just a few of them......]","“........................I see.”","I wonder why? The expression on her face looked as if she had given up on everything...... Ahh, that’s the same look Chris-san had before. Ahh, I see, it makes sense now. Could it be that Lillywood-san is also worried about the same thing as Chris-san?","[Ahh, Lillywood-san, please don’t worry. I’ve also considered how to handle Shiro-san and Eden-san, and I’ve also consulted with Alice to make sure I have all the information I need.]","“Ah, s- so that’s how it is...... May I ask you a little more about that?”","It seems my prediction was correct, as Lillywood-san was clearly relieved and asked for an explanation, so I told her that I had prepared separate accessories for my lovers and Eden-san.","“......That’s great. Really...... It seems that my worries turned out to be groundless. Actually, because of that, I was thinking of persuading Isis-san to reconsider attending Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival...... but it looks like that won’t be necessary.”","It seemed that Lillywood-san’s business here was to persuade Isis-san not to participate in the Founding Festival. Just as Fate-san had mentioned before, it seems that she is concerned about the balance of power among the three countries.","Well, in any case, Lillywood-san’s expression clearly brightened up, so I think it was really fortunate that I was able to explain it at this time.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Wait, the flow of things here doesn’t really look good...... From the looks of things, this chapter was completely cut off so that it could be used to talk about giving the accessory to Isis...... but it doesn’t look good...... The flow of things doesn’t look good.]"]},{"number":1559,"title":"Chapter 1559 - Gifts for My Lovers 10","paragraphs":["Lillywood-san seemed to have resolved their concerns after listening to me and looked relieved. After discussing matters to some extent, she mentioned having work to attend to, so she courteously bid farewell to me and Isis-san before departing using Teleportation Magic.","And in the room with Isis-san and I left alone, Isis-san was looking at me with eyes sparkling with anticipation. Since Isis-san was also present during the conversation with Lillywood-san earlier, she’s obviously aware that I have created an original accessory specially made for her.","[Errr, now then, once again, I have prepared an accessory especially for Isis-san again, so if you’re alright with it, please accept it.]","[......Kaito...... Thank you...... I’m so happy...... Can I open it?]","[Of course.]","[......Ahh...... This is......]","The accessory I made for Isis-san is a brooch. Isis-san’s image color is blue, and there are gemstones associated with Isis-san, such as Ice Crystals and Blue Diamonds, and there’s no way I wouldn’t incorporate them.","[Actually, at first, I was thinking of making you earrings...... but with my skills, I couldn’t make a good shape without it being at a certain size, so I ended up making a brooch.]","[......It’s beautiful...... Blue Crystal flower.]","[As expected, when I think of Isis-san, the first thing that comes to my mind is the Blue Crystal Flower, so I tried to make it into that shape.]","When I think of Isis-san’s image, what I think about first are Blue Crystal Flowers, so I was able to quickly decide to use that motif for her accessory. However, it was quite difficult to make a flower shape, and I couldn’t achieve the desired form with small accessories, so I decided to make it into a brooch instead.","In terms of total time, Isis-san’s accessory took the most time to create, but I was satisfied with the result.","[......I’m happy...... Of course, I’m happy about receiving the present...... but most of all...... Kaito thinking about various things for me...... doing your best for me...... makes me happy the most.]","[If Isis-san is delighted about it, then it’s worth all the hard work I put in.]","Seeing Isis-san’s face with tears in her eyes and a genuinely happy expression, I felt that the hard work that went into creating it was really trivial.","As I relished such a sense of accomplishment, Isis-san quickly got up from her seat and approached me. Then, gently embracing me, she held my head against her chest.","Her soft touch and pleasant smell, and the slightly cool touch of Isis-san’s hands give me an indescribable feeling of happiness.","[......This is troubling...... I’m feeling so happy...... that I don’t even know...... how I can properly express it...... My love for Kait is overflowing.]","[If you’re that delighted, then that makes me happy too.]","As I responded to her words, I wrapped my arms around Isis-san’s back and embraced her. This kinda feels refreshing. Since Isis-san’s holding my head while I’m sitting, my face is positioned on her chest...... How should I say it...... It looks like I’m hugging Isis-san from below.","Not only did I revel in the blissful sensation that enveloped my face, it was also quite unusual to find myself looking up at Isis-san due to our height difference.","Isis-san’s gentle expression, as her eyes narrowed while gazing at me, exuded an extraordinary beauty. It felt as if her expression carried an overwhelming sense of affection and maternal love, even more so than usual.","[......Kaito...... I love you.]","After conveying those words in a bewitchingly sweet voice, Isis-san slowly brought her face closer. In response, I also lifted myself slightly from the chair, bringing my face closer as well. Perhaps influenced by the effect of our gazes different from usual, the moment we shared our kiss, our lips met with a fresh feeling unlike usual.","As our lips pressed together, Isis-san tenderly stroked my head, making me feel Isis-san’s warmth embracing me from all directions, in a way that was somewhat addictive...... frighteningly so...... It was a truly blissful moment we exchanged at that time.","<Afterword>","Sugar : [......It’s okay...... It’s just a fatal injury.]"]},{"number":1560,"title":"Chapter 1560 - Gifts for My Lovers 11","paragraphs":["Only one original accessory for my lovers remains, the one I made for Alice. I mean, Alice getting it last is just strange.","With that in mind, I moved to the basement of my house and headed for Alice’s miscellaneous goods store, but then I suddenly thought I could just give it to the weapon store instead, so I headed over there...... when I saw the words “Currently Doing Preps” on a signboard hanging on the door, written in Japanese. Seems like I should be heading to the miscellaneous goods store instead.","With a light sigh, I touched the wall in front of the T-shaped fork in the road. It wasn’t mentioned when I was first guided around, but when the person registered on the wall at the intersection between the weapon shop and Iris’ bar touches it, a door leading directly to the miscellaneous goods store appears. This way, one can head to the miscellaneous goods store without having to pass through the bar...... My home sure has a lot of hidden gimmicks.","[......Oya? If it isn’t Kaito-san, welcome! How can I help you today?]","[......H- How shameless......]","When I went through the door and entered the miscellaneous goods store, Alice was sitting at the counter, making a deliberately surprised expression on her face.","There’s a limit to how shameless a person can be. I mean, the one waiting for me at the counter now isn’t the cat-costumed one that usually looks after the store, but Alice’s main body.","[Now then? I wonder why you visited me?]","[No, I mean, you were there when I was making them......]","[Making? Kaito-san, did you make something? How surprising. I didn’t know you had such a creative hobby...... So, what did you make?]","[.....................]","It seems that she intends to persistently claim ignorance. In fact, the kits for making the accessories were provided by Alice so the blatantness of her ignorance is already at its maximum.","I think she herself knows that she’s being shameless...... but well, I guess this is just like Alice......","[......No, actually, I made some accessories in preparation for my stall at Archlesia Empire’s upcoming Founding Festival......]","[What!? Kaito-san, you’re setting up a stall at their Founding Festival!?]","[......You know that it isn’t possible for another body of yours, clone or not, to not know about this, right?]","[Ah, that’s right. You’re offering my products there after all...... Well, let’s leave the tomfoolery aside......]","Looking at the chuckling Alice, I guess the series of shameless acting was over, so I took out the accessory I made for Alice.","Speaking of her accessory, the fact is, I had quite a bit of trouble making the accessory for Alice. The image color I had in mind for Alice is yellow or gold, so thinking about that isn’t a problem at all, but I had a hard time deciding what motif to use.","If I had associated Isis-san with Blue Crystal Flower, Alice’s motif would be a knife, a mask, or one of her stuffed costumes, and I didn’t feel any of those were clearly fitting for an accessory.","[......In the end, I ended up making it into a star shape...... Sorry it’s so simple.]","[No, no, I’m glad. Just because it’s simple doesn’t mean Kaito-san’s affection for me is small, and rather, this is the result of a lot of considerations.]","[I also wanted to make various kinds of accessories if possible, but I ended up with a lot of necklaces and brooches.]","[Well, considering the ease of making them and the ease with which the recipient can wear them, it just inevitably turns out that way, doesn’t it?]","What I prepared for Alice was a star-shaped necklace. After various considerations, choosing a necklace felt like the safest and most versatile option, one that wouldn’t go wrong.","Well, just as Alice said, brooches and necklaces are indeed easier to create in terms of shaping, making them more beginner-friendly for amateurs.","[......However, why did you expressly put off receiving it for later? Couldn’t you just receive it right then and there?]","[No, no, Kaito-san. This kind of thing requires a suitable atmosphere, mental preparations and mental preparations......]","She just said mental preparations twice. That’s definitely the main reason why, isn’t it...... Fumu, considering Alice’s character though, I can see now why she didn’t accept it at that time......","[......You mean you were simply embarrassed to accept it in the presence of Amel-san?]","[............No, you’re mistaken. It’s not that I was embarrassed to receive it at that time, or that I didn’t feel like I could stop my face from smiling, it was just a decision I made after considering various things in general......]","[I see...... Alice, that necklace looks really good on you, making you look cute. Moreover, Alice being shy like that is also cute and something I like.]","[And why are you saying that now!? You’re clearly trying to make me feel embarrassed here...... Of course, I’m feeling shy!!! Please don’t underestimate how much of a sh*tty noob in love I am!!!]","[......I should have told you this earlier, but I don’t really think that’s something you strongly declare, you know?]","Alice, visibly blushing as she shouted in response to my words of praise, conveyed her genuine happiness and delight from my gift. Even with all her antics, seeing her like that brought a smile to my lips.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [By the way, Sugar-senpai.]","Serious-senpai : [......Eh? Are you by chance talking about me? Stop fooling around, I’m the most serious among the serious......]","? ? ? : [No, you don’t exactly sound persuasive with your body half-turned into sugar like that...... Besides, in the afterword in the previous chapter, it seemed like your true identity was revealed......]"]},{"number":1561,"title":"Chapter 1561 - Archlesia Empire Founding Festival 1","paragraphs":["It was finally the day of Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival, and I came with Amel-san to Archlesia Empire’s Imperial Capital early in the morning to set up our stall.","[My sworn friend, the promised time has finally arrived. Let’s make this day, a day of celebrations, brighten with the radiance of our darkness!]","[It’s almost time, isn’t it? By the way, Amel-san, are you keeping your wings small?]","[Yeah, I am one burdened with destiny. I do not say that attracting attention is a bad thing, but sometimes it can be a cage. If these wings are an obstacle to my freedom, it would be a delight to let them sink into the dreamscape for the moment.]","[I see, it’s certainly conspicuous, and being the Chief of the Wingeds, Amel-san is probably a well-known figure.]","Amel-san’s distinctive black wings are now reduced in size and hidden by her jacket, making it difficult to recognize her as a member of the Wingeds at a glance.","When asked why, she replied that her black feathers are so prominent that they are likely to attract attention, and since she’s the Chief of the Wingeds, she doesn’t want to attract such attention, so she hides them.","[As a matter of fact, that isn’t the case. With my black wings concealed, I would become but an enchanting wanderer. Just as the great King of Empty Illusions had become the great King of Empty Illusions, I too can temporarily deceive the world.]","[Isn’t it more because Amel-san’s face isn’t well known?]","[That’s right. Our Winged is a closed-off race. I myself have never been in the spotlight. Therefore, many people are unaware of the sparkle of my true darkness.]","[I see, then I can rest assured that we won’t attract any unwanted attraction.]","To summarize Amel-san’s words, even though Alice, who is the Phantasmal King, acts as the shopkeeper Alice in her miscellaneous goods store, her original identity as the Phantasmal King is unknown to those around her. Similarly, Amel-san also avoids being in the spotlight too much, so it seems that by concealing her black wings, she can go unnoticed.","By the way, I might be digressing, but recently, I have become able to understand Amel-san’s words without much difficulty, perhaps thanks to having gotten used to it. In a sense, I guess one can say that this is also personal growth...... Amel-san looks happy when she talks to me, so if she’s delighted, I guess it isn’t all that bad.","In a way though, I somehow feel like the chuuni spirit laying dormant within me was being unsealed, so I’m feeling somewhat uneasy.","Well, anyway, now the number of visitors who would come to see Amel-san, the Chief of the Wingeds, will decrease, and I will be able to relax and enjoy my time here in the stall.","It seems that Amel-san has also chosen a relatively less crowded location for our stall, so it’s unlikely that we’d be too busy.","[Since all we have to do is take them out of the magic box, the opening of the stall itself should be easy, right?]","[Unnn. Just opening up a stall with my sworn friend, ehehe, just having fun without worrying about sales————- Hrnnn! It is important to fulfill my covenant with my sworn friend, and the acquisition of money is not our main purpose. Let’s enjoy this festival that comes only once a year.]","[You’re right. Let’s have fun and don’t worry about the sales. As we discussed, Amel-san will sell the goods purchased from Alice’s shop, while I will sell the ceramics brought from my place.]","[I understand. However, there’s no need to be bound by such rules. Let us adapt to change as needed, flowing gracefully like running water. If my sworn friend requires help, I will always lend out a hand.]","[Thank you. I’ll be counting on you.]","We’ve already decided on our responsibilities to some extent, but as Amel-san said, we’ll be flexible and help each other according to the situation.","Well, since there are a lot of hobby items and the prices of our items are fairly high, our place shouldn’t be that crowded.","While I was thinking about this, I heard what sounded like fanfare.","[What is that sound?]","[It’s the music that signals the beginning of the festival. They infused magic to make it resonate equally throughout the stage. Just as it’s the melody that marks the beginning, it’s also the melody that marks the end......]","[Music that is magically made to be heard throughout the capital to signal the start of the festival huh. And when the festival ends, that music will ring again......]","[As expected of my sworn friend. It seems that our hearts are still firmly connected today.]","[Ahaha. For the time being, it seems that the Founding Festival has officially started, so I will be in your care today.]","[Unnn! Let’s do our best together!]","When I called out to her, Amel-san nodded with a bright smile, accidentally responding without her chuuni acts. As I reflexively chuckled at her antics, I revitalized my motivation in preparation for our first customer.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......D*mn it, my body won’t return back from being sugar. W- Well, I guess I should be happy that the damage was just this much huh......]","? ? ? : [No, you’re saying that so casually, but seriously, what kind of ecology do you have...... I hope you realize that “returning back from being sugar” is already abnormal.]"]},{"number":1562,"title":"Chapter 1562 - Archlesia Empire Founding Festival 2","paragraphs":["At the castle in the Imperial Capital of Archlesia Empire, Emperor Chris was greeting her visitors with a smile. Chris has a lot of work to do today, as it is the day of the national celebration of the founding of their country. It is her job to greet important guests.","That said, as the Emperor, Chris can only greet the most powerful people in person......","[I bid you welcome, Your Excellency, Duchess Albert.]","[It’s been a long time, Your Majesty Chris. You can just call me by my first name.]","[Well then, Duchess Lilia...... Thank you for joining us this time for our Founding Festival.]","[I must have caused trouble for the inconvenience caused by my sudden request. I apologize.]","[No, I have heard about the situation. I am not inclined to blame you when it is that one who is responsible for this matter. She isn’t the kind of person in which our thoughts can reach......]","The people Chris came to greet was Lilia, who was accompanied by Sieglinde and Lunamaria, and she showed them to their guest room. Lilia wasn’t originally scheduled to participate in the Founding Festival, but was suddenly chosen to attend under Eden’s instruction.","Eden’s instruction was for Lilia to go to Kaito’s stall, but being a Duchess, visiting the Founding Festival while not participating in the ceremony could be perceived as disrespect to their imperial authority, although it was sudden, she decided to attend their Founding Festival ceremony as well.","Chris is well aware of how unreasonable Eden was, so she pleasantly accepted her request for participation in the ceremony.","[Even so, even excluding that, we as a country are grateful to have Duchess Lilia participate in our festival. Duchess Lilia is now the greatest and strongest noble in Symphonia Kingdom after all.]","[......That’s quite strange, isn’t it? Until just a few years ago, I was just supposed to be someone who was on par with lower-ranking nobles other than military might, someone who had no major businesses and lacked financial resources but......]","[Hahaha, now you’ve become the strongest military force in Symphonia Kingdom, possess a voice that rivals that of royalty, strong connections and overwhelming financial power, and even that Sky Castle bestowed by the God of Creation, which has become synonymous with the Royal Capital in its 2 years of existence. Both in name and reality, you have risen to the top noble within the Kingdom.]","[......It was mostly due to Kaito-san’s influence though.]","In response to the words Chris cheerfully said, Lilia gave her a wry smile with an indescribable expression on her face. In fact, just as Chris said, Albert Duchy is now a noble lineage that reigns at the top of Symphonia Kingdom.","[With a truly terrifying momentum, we ended up gathering both power and funds.]","[Due to Miyama-sama’s influence, exchanges with the Six Kings and other high-ranking personnel were opened, and with such a thing happening, the number of people who wanted to have a connection with Albert Duchy increased. Such nobles want Duchess Lilia to have a good impression of them, so they bring you deals favorable for Duchess Lilia. As a result, businesses and connections accumulate at an accelerated pace, and the power of your Duchy itself grows. That being the case, the number of low-ranking nobles who want to be under your protection will increase, and a major faction will be completed...... That’s how things turned out to be.]","[Yes, thanks to that, I am now completely recognized as the top of the Albert Duchy Faction. Well, simply put, the increase in financial resources and the availability of talented individuals have also contributed to a sense of stability, alleviating the busyness of allowing me more free time.]","[That’s all well and good, but considering that the resulting extra time has led you to travel to other countries like this, I guess it isn’t all good.]","[Hahaha...... Well, when it comes to Eden-sama though, she probably would have commanded me to go here regardless of whether I was busy or not......]","In the first place, fundamentally speaking, the influence of the World’s Singularity, Kaito, is tremendous. Kaito’s existence is well-known among the nobles, and his lover, Lilia, who is also part of their society, possesses immense power of voice just by association with him. Of course, she will not bring out Kaito’s existence into social gatherings or negotiations, nor does she have any intention of using it...... Even without considering that, Lilia possesses overwhelming power and is hailed as the strongest in Symphonia Kingdom, having received the True Blessing of the God of Time and Space. Adding having been bestowed with the Sky Castle by the God of Creation to that, Lilia now holds incredible strength and immense financial resources.","......It was just that Kaito’s friendships are abnormal enough to overshadow that.","[......By the way, Duchess Lilia, this is a private subject that has nothing to do with diplomacy......]","[Yes?]","[......Do you know of any good stomach pills? I have to greet World King-sama, Dragon King-sama and the three Supreme Gods after this......]","[I deeply sympathize with how you feel...... Seriously...... I sympathize with it so much that it hurts. If you’re alright with what I use, I’d introduce several brands to you.]","[My gratitude.]","Looking at the indescribable expression on Chris’ face, Lilia guessed everything that’s going on. After all, the one who suffers the most damage in matters like this is none other than Lilia......","Until now, Lilia hadn’t interacted much with Chris, but after this exchange...... As someone who knows the same pain, she felt like they could get along with each other.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [I see, the Stomachache Warriors are naturally drawn to each other.]","Serious-senpai : [Of course, they’d be drawn to each other! After all, they both share the same cause of stomachache......]"]},{"number":1563,"title":"Chapter 1563 - Archlesia Empire Founding Festival 3","paragraphs":["After welcoming Lilia and showing her to her guest room, Chris was still busy moving around. Then came the time to meet the three Supreme Gods, which could be said to be the most important part of the event.","As for the members of the Six Kings in participation in their Founding Festival, she knew them to some extent. Magnawell has a deep friendship with Archlesia Empire, and she’s also acquainted with Lillywood, who in the first place, is known as the one with the best personality among the Six Kings.","Unlike them, she had almost no interaction with the Supreme Gods. The Supreme God responsible for Archlesia Empire the God of Life, Life, but Life, who basically never goes to the Human Realm, has never spoken to anyone. Typically, her subordinate Gods like God of Fertility would participate in such ceremonies.","She has also never spoken much with the God of Fate, Fate. They’ve only talked a little when she granted her Providence on her land in the past.","As for the God of Time and Space, she has more experience talking with her than with the other Supreme Gods. Chronois basically negotiates with the rulers of the three countries and the Six Kings, assuming the role of the representative of the Gods, at the Festival of Heroes. But even when she had more conversation with her compared to the other Supreme Gods, she doesn’t remember having had conversations close enough for her to understand Chronois’ temperament.","Therefore, while she aimed to avoid any major blunders, she hasn’t been able to come up with a hospitality plan highly suitable for them, so to be safe, she had prepared the highest level of hospitality to welcome them.","[Welcome, it is an honor to have you here.]","[Umu, we are under your care today, Emperor Archlesia. Normally, it would be the God of Life, who is in charge of Archlesia, that should be the one dealing with public matters, but when all of us Supreme Gods act together like this, I am basically in charge of dealing with them, so I would like your understanding that I will be acting as their representative.]","[Understood. We have prepared a room for you and will show you around. After confirming the schedule for today’s ceremony, you are free to spend the rest of the day at your leisure.","[I understand. Well then, please show us the way.]","When Chris nervously called out to the Supreme Gods who had appeared, Chronois responded with a smile. Although her tone sounded arrogant, Chronois is the friendliest of all the Supreme Gods, as she followed Chris’ guidance without any objection.","After moving to their room, they were given a brief explanation of the Founding Festival ceremony.","Although the Founding Festival itself began early in the morning, the ceremony will be held at noon, so they have relatively plenty of time available for them. After confirming the schedule, Chronois nodded once before turning to Life.","[I have no particular objections about it. What about you, God of Life?]","[No problems with it either. I don’t see how we have any special role to play other than our participation, and since we have some time before the start time, I will meditate for a while.]","[......You’re just sleeping though......]","In essence, when God of Life speaks of meditation, she actually meant she will be sleeping within the free time until the ceremony begins, and seeing her going back to her usual antics, Chronois let out a sigh.","Still, since she was just sleeping, it’s not like she’s bothering the Empire, she shouldn’t be a problem, so after thinking that, she turned to Fate.","[As for God of Fate——— Huh?]","[......Eh?]","Immediately after turning to Fate, Chronois’ mouth gaped in surprise, while Chris’ eyes opened wide. Fate wasn’t in the place where she should have been, and instead, there was a vertically long cushion with a piece of paper pasted on it.","“I’m gonna go visit Kai-chan’s stall~~ I’ll be back if I remember about this again.”","Yes, she immediately scampered away. This time, the Supreme Gods’ attendance was only permitted by Shallow Vernal, and “they were not ordered to attend”. Despite her tendency to be awfully apathetic with most things and averse with troublesome stuff, Fate surprisingly agreed to attend the ceremony. Chronois, while somewhat skeptical, just attributed it to Fate’s recent increase in productivity and thinking “Perhaps even God of Fate is starting to embrace her role as a Supreme God”, she interpreted it in a positive light.","[......T- That...... That fool!!!]","But in reality, the awareness of being a Supreme God doesn’t exist in her mind at all. Fate simply wanted to go see Kaito open his stall and while she’s at it, decided to participate in the ceremony at the same time, so her priorities were overwhelmingly in favor of Kaito’s stall rather than the ceremony.","Even so, it was written that “if she remembered, she would return”...... but Chronois, knowing Fate well, was sure that there was no way for her to forget about this......","[......M- My stomach......]","The fact that one of the three Supreme Gods had just left the royal castle and was publicly participating in their festival made Chris unconsciously hold her stomach.","Chronois also held her head to endure a surging headache, and after staying silent for a while, she spoke.","[Apologies, Emperor Archlesia. I should have seen this coming. I’ll bring that fool back for the time being, so you can rest assured.]","[Y- Yes. Thank you in advance.]","[You also have your own difficulties huh...... In any case, the schedule is fine as it is. Just tell me where Miyama is.]","After saying that while getting up from her seat, Chronois let out a big sigh before heading off to capture the runaway Fate.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [A- Amazing. What’s amazing? It’s that although Kaito didn’t do anything, he still generally dealt a heavy blow to the stomach...... Stomach Blow True Masters can attack the stomach without even taking any action huh......]","? ? ? : [They really should have noticed it when Fate-san obediently agreed to participate, didn’t they? Yeah, she certainly has grown, but her dislike for troublesome stuff hasn’t changed at all...... At the point when she tries to participate in a troublesome ceremony, there’s obviously some sort of hidden agenda behind it.]"]},{"number":1564,"title":"Chapter 1564 - Archlesia Empire Founding Festival 4","paragraphs":["The Royal Capital of Archlesia Empire is bustling with people during the Founding Festival. In the Founding Festival where the closer one is to the central plaza where the ceremony is held, the more crowded the stores are, two women were walking away from such a plaza.","Both were dressed in civilian clothes and looked like sisters...... but the young woman walking in front of the other, wearing clothes that looked simple, but of good quality, had an air of nobility to her.","[......Milady, the Master will scold you again.]","[Don’t worry. I’ll be back in time for the ceremony. Besides, we nobles should know more about the lives of our citizens. As the young lady of the innovative nobility, I need to see and learn about the city with my own eyes.]","[The words you said were admirable, but it’s greatly perplexing that you’re simply just acting out of curiosity. No one knows what danger there is for the daughter of a Marquis to be walking around a place like this......]","[That’s why the maid that you are is escorting me. Don’t worry, we won’t be here long.]","The woman is the daughter of a Marquis and walking behind her is the maid who serves as her guard. This daughter of a Marquis who belongs to the innovative faction has always been interested in the life of the common people and often travels incognito with her maid.","[The conservatives have lost momentum recently, so it’s easier to take action. Seriously, those conservatives are hard-headed...... Even when they don’t have overwhelming power like the Six Kings, they think they’re superior only because of their past glory and bloodlines.]","[Well, bloodlines are important after all. That’s what makes you nobility.]","[That’s just an old way of thinking. I wouldn’t go so far as to say that politics should be citizen-centric just like they do there in Hydra Kingdom, it’s about time for the nobility of Archlesia Empire to undergo some changes....... but there are a lot of hard-headed people out there. That’s why people say we’re behind compared to Hydra and Symphonia.]","[Those things basically change depending on who’s on top. The previous emperor was a staunch conservative, and since the current Emperor Her Majesty Chris sat on the throne, reforms are progressing steadily, so I think in the not-too-distant future, the Empire will be in the form that Milady envisions.]","[You’re right. That would be great...... Ohh, we’ve gone all the way here to enjoy our time for the Founding Festival, so let’s not talk politics. Come on, let’s go and look around the stalls!]","After giving a small smile at the maid’s words, the young lady smiles, as if to regain her composure, and begins to look around.","[Speaking of, wouldn’t it be better if we were closer to the center of the city? It would have made it easier for us to return......]","[The stalls near the central plaza are just those I’m somewhat familiar with, and there are so many people that it’s hard to move around. It’s in places like this, off the beaten path, that we can find the eccentric stalls and such.]","[You sure are having fun......]","[Yes, we’re at a festival after all...... Ara? I’ve already discovered an unusual stall over there.]","The young lady, moving her gaze around, noticed a certain stall. She couldn’t quite describe what stall it was, as she was even feeling something ominous from it, but in any case, it was a stall with too many decorations and it stood out in a strange way.","[......D- Doesn’t that place look suspicious? From a distance, it looks like a general store, but doesn’t it have lots of strange things in it?]","[It’s stalls like that where we can find the best bargains. Come on, let’s check it out!]","The young lady went to the stall with great enthusiasm, and her eyes lit up when she saw the unique items lined up on the storefront.","[Excuse me, I’d like to take a look around. They all look unusual and quite interesting......]","[Ahh, I bid you welcome, Guided One. You may select to your heart’s content.]","[......Ah, yes.]","The young lady stiffened and her eyes opened wide when she saw the one manning the stall, bidding her welcome with theatrical exaggeration.","(......Eh? Isn’t she...... the Wingeds’ Chief, Amel-sama? T- There’s no mistaking it. Even though she’s hiding her wings...... There’s no way I, a daughter of a Marquis, would mistake the face of an important person in our country. W- W- W- W- Why would the Wingeds’ Chief open a stall in a place like this? Ah, n- no, that aside, I must not be rude! If by any chance I offended the Wingeds’ Chief, it would cause a lot of trouble to Father......)","The general public isn’t very familiar with Amel, and without her wings, she would be unnoticeable to most people since few have seen her face, but the daughter of a high-ranking noble would have seen her before, and although she was trying desperately to maintain her composure, perhaps because of her ladylike education, she was inwardly flustered.","[If there is something you don’t understand, I’ll explain it to you, so please feel free to ask us.]","[Eh? Yes, thank you very...... much......]","As if being guided by a newly heard voice, her gaze quickly moved to the other person standing next to Amel...... and the young lady’s face paled.","(Ababababa...... I- I- I- Isn’t that Miyama Kaito-sama? T- T- T- There’s no way I’d be mistaking this. The same face I saw in his portrait...... N- No, if it was merely his face, there was a possibility that it was just someone else who happened to resemble him, but the fact that he is with Amel-sama, he’s definitely the real one...... Awawawawa, w- w- why is such a person opening a stall here!?)","Kaito is also famous among the nobles, and as he was someone considered amongst the most important people in the world, the young lady’s parents showed her his appearance over and over again, and she was repeatedly told not to make any careless mistake around him.","(C- C- C- Calm down! I- I am the daughter of a Marquis...... I- I must not show how shaken I am! If I were to displease Miyama Kaito-sama, wouldn’t our Marquisate disappear the next day!?)","Desperately telling herself in her heart to keep her composure, so as not to appear unnatural, the young lady gently put her hand on her aching stomach.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I’ll tell you exactly what just happened...... Just as everyone thought the Stomachache Warrior from the Demon Realm would now make her appearance, a nameless mob lady ended up getting bodyblowed instead......]"]},{"number":1565,"title":"Chapter 1565 - Archlesia Empire Founding Festival 5","paragraphs":["While being shocked by the presence of Kaito, the young lady is still thinking at high speed while trying to keep a calm expression on her face.","(C- C- C- Calm down. Keeping in mind my strict ladylike training, I- I- I should keep calm...... and quickly sort out the situation. Nobles are forbidden to thoughtlessly make contact with Miyama Kaito-sama. However, that is only because Miyama Kaito-sama does not intend on participating in social circles, so what is forbidden in this case should be trying to make a connection with Miyama Kaito-sama for one’s own benefit.)","The act of inviting Kaito to tea parties and evening parties is strictly prohibited by the royal families of each country. The reason is that if such a thing is allowed, there would be no end to such invitations, and Kaito himself did not want such a thing.","Also, it’s obviously forbidden to make use of Kaito for political purposes. If one tries to do so, they would be erased by the Phantasmal King.","(However, the current situation is that I just happened to drop by Miyama Kaito-sama’s store, so this encounter could be considered safe. That said, it would be inappropriate for me to introduce myself here. I am currently a customer as he was a clerk, and introducing myself in such a position is unnatural. Furthermore, from what I have heard of Miyama Kaito-sama’s character, having the fact that Miyama Kaito-sama is working here as a clerk known to others causing a fuss would be something he doesn’t desire.)","The young lady is the daughter of a Marquis who belongs to the innovative faction, a faction that basically recognizes Kaito favorably. Unlike the conservative nobles, they aren’t as harshly threatened by Eden.","The young lady herself held favorable thoughts towards Kaito who was bringing significant changes not only to Archlesia Empire, but also to various places. She even harbored feelings that were close to admiration, or perhaps, even yearning.","(My guard maid isn’t a noble. She may know Miyama Kaito-sama’s name, but she shouldn’t have seen his portrait, and as long as I don’t call Miyama Kaito-sama’s name, she shouldn’t realize his identity. In that case, it should be fine...... R- Rather, thinking about the blessed opportunity that I have for coming upon Miyama Kaito-sama’s stall, I am really fortunate.)","The young lady may not show her thoughts from her facial expression, but with Kaito’s Sympathy Magic, keeping up appearances doesn’t really hold any meaning. The young lady’s flusteredness and confusion were clearly conveyed to Kaito.","However, Kaito can only read emotions, not their mind. Therefore, he recognized the bewilderment and other various emotions the young lady feels as “she is confused by the strange goods lined up in front of Amel”.","[Besides those goods, we also have ceramics and accessories here.]","[Ah, is that so? Well then, let me have a look.]","The young lady, whose vision was somewhat limited due to nervousness, turned her gaze from the items in front of Amel to the ones in front of Kaito.","(Purchasing in itself is not a problem, but the question is how many I should buy...... If they’re products from Miyama Kaito-sama’s stall, I would like to buy as much as possible, but that would only cause trouble, and if the other nobles find out about it later, it would only create an opportunity for those brainless individuals who are only capable of undermining others to complain and find fault. I guess the purchase should only be limited to one or two items.)","While calmly thinking about this, the young lady caught sight of a set of teacups in a beautiful wooden box placed in front of Kaito.","[......Oh my, what beautiful teacups? Were they produced by a craftsman of considerable renown? However, I’ve never seen this crest before.]","[Ahh, those were something our place made, and we put that mark on them to distinguish them from others. It’s not something we usually sell, so I don’t think you would recognize it.]","[ !? S- S- S- So that’s how it is......]","The young lady couldn’t hide her feelings of astonishment at the explanation Kaito gave with a gentle smile.","(T- T- T- Teacups produced in Miyama Kaito-sama’s home, holding Miyama Kaito-sama’s brand!? T- T- T- This is quite the outrageous item, so much so that just possessing these could raise the status of our household...... and even without that, these teacups are magnificently finished, and it looks like it’s a set of four. Considering that I can get multiple items while narrowing down the number of my purchases, this may be the best choice...... The question now is whether I actually have enough money on hand to purchase such a teacup set.)","From the eyes of the young lady who has seen various types of ceramics, the teacups were so refined that it was hard to believe that they were sold at a stall.","In that case, she could only expect them to be quite expensive, making the young lady wonder if she currently has enough money on hand.","(Inside my magic box are 2 white gold coins, 5 gold coins, 5 silver coins and the rest is just change from the stuff I brought to enjoy my time with the stalls. Will these be enough? Depending on the situation, I might even have to send my maid on an errand back home...... No, then the other nobles may notice it, so if I don’t have enough money on hand...... Regrettable it may be, I could only buy another item.)","After putting her thoughts together, the young lady faces Kaito with a somewhat nervous look on her face. Feeling her throat parched from the nervousness in her heart, she asked Kaito.","[......Ummm, how much for this teacup set?]","[A set of four costs 1000R.]","[I see, 1000R...... Unnn? U- Ummm, excuse my discourtesy, but the amount you mentioned...... It’s not 10000R, but 1000R?]","[Yes. It’s 1000R.]","[.................................I see.]","The young lady became baffled. Frankly speaking, the quality of the teacups at hand is excellent. Even without Kaito’s brand on it, buying them for 10000R wouldn’t have been a waste, and they were beautiful ceramics at a level rarely seen even in high-end stores that are purveyors to the Imperial households.","With the added value of Kaito’s brand added to it, it wouldn’t be surprising if the price jumped up another 10...... no, even 50 times...... but she was told that they only cost 1000R.","The cost was so unexpected that it made her cheeks twitch, and as she felt her stomach aching again, the young lady told Kaito that she would buy the teacup set.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Quite the promising candidate she is for a Stomachache Warrior. She didn’t introduce herself to Kaito, so she’s still an unnamed mob, but if she makes a reappearance, there’s a good chance that she’ll be given a name.]","Serious-senpai : [It does come with the added bonus of even more stomachache though...... but from Kaito’s perspective, she was someone who praised and purchased the teacups made by Nebula, which he dotes on so much, so him having a good impression of her...... shouldn’t be impossible...... right?]"]},{"number":1566,"title":"Chapter 1566 - Archlesia Empire Founding Festival 6","paragraphs":["Although she was astounded by the incredibly low price in relation to the quality, the teacups before her were produced at Kaito’s household and were not sold to the general public. Therefore, Kaito has the authority to determine its price, and naturally, the young lady can’t complain about it.","On the contrary, one could consider it fortunate to be able to obtain good-quality items at a low price, but the fact that the young lady feels apologetic about it is likely due to her good nature.","[......Well then, can I have this teacup set?]","[Yes. Thank you for your patronage. Shall I put them in a bag?]","[Ahh, no, I have a magic box, so it’s alright.]","Although she still looked bewildered, she decided that it would be impolite to ponder over the situation any longer in front of the stall, so she paid the 1000R cited by Kaito and bought the teacup set.","(It’s too cheap that I feel apologetic, but in the first place, Miyama Kaito-sama is a person who has financial power that can’t be compared to ordinary nobles. Considering this, I suppose it would be correct to regard this stall opening as a kind of entertainment, and he may not be too concerned about sales. In any case, I have acquired wonderful teacups. Mother and Father should be delighted with these.)","Despite her confusion, there’s no doubt that she had bought a great product. As they were items with Kaito’s brand on them, there’s no doubt that they would be highly regarded in social circles. Moreover, considering from the position of a member of a Marquisate and also from a personal perspective, it’s undeniable that this is a product that one can take pride in around other people. That’s why, there’s no problem———– or so the young lady told herself in her heart, but immediately right after, Kaito presented to her a small wooden box with a gentle smile.","[Here’s a freebie for your purchase.]","[......A freebie?]","[Yes, this is also something we made, an assortment of crafted sugar. They’re quite beautiful, and you can use them to make a cup of tea if you like.]","[Oh my, thank you very much for your kindness.]","Respectfully bowing her head as she received the wooden box, the young lady looked at the wooden box.","(A wooden box with an astonishingly good quality. Moreover, crafted sugar...... Come to think of it, I remember hearing that a high-ranking noble from Symphonia Kingdom hosted a tea party, where a beautifully crafted sugar was presented. That noble apparently also got the crafted sugar by chance, and it wasn’t something that was commercially available...... Was this the same crafted sugar as that? It is quite possible...... but it would be impolite to open the box here and check its contents. Checking it would be when we get home huh.)","With that conclusion in mind, the young lady put the wooden box away in her magic box. With this, her shopping was safely finished, but just as she was about to thank him before she left, a cheerful voice resounded.","[Kai-chaaaaan! I came to visit~~]","[Eh? Fate-san!?]","[. . . . . . ! ? ! ? ! ?]","Seeing the being on the floating cushion that suddenly appeared beside her, the young lady involuntarily covered her mouth with her hand to suppress her scream.","(Ababababa...... G- G- G- G- Goddess of Fate-samaaaaa!? W- W- W- Why is she at a place like this...... Wait, she definitely came here to meet up with Miyama Kaito-sama. T- This won’t do. If we stay in this kind of place, we will disturb not only Miyama Kaito-sama, but also Goddess of Fate-sama. Fortunately, she doesn’t seem to be interested in us, so let’s quietly leave this place......)","Even though she was surprised by Fate’s appearance that her heart was about to burst, the young lady desperately kept her mouth shut so as not to displease her and tried to quietly leave the place, but as if to ridicule such thoughts, a new voice came from behind the young lady who was keeping her gaze towards Fate.","[God of Fate! You wretch, you dare play me for a fool!!!?]","[Keh, God of Time and Space!? You chased me already?]","[Of course, I would! You damned idiot!!!]","The one who appeared behind the young lady was one of the Supreme Gods, Chronois, and being sandwiched between the two Supreme Gods, Fate and Chronois, the young lady screamed in her heart.","(Higyyaaaaaaaahhh!? E- E- E- Even Goddess of Time-sama!? W- W- W- What is with this situation...... W- W- W- What should I do......)","Seemingly asking for help, the young lady looked at her maid guard who was just looking at her at a distance. As expected though, just as the young lady was uncomfortable with her current situation, the maid didn’t want to get involved in a situation where two Supreme Gods appeared, as she seemed to be pretending like they were strangers somewhere far away.","Left behind by her own guard, the young lady, for the umpteenth time today, put her hand on her aching stomach and looked up to the heavens with eyes like that of a dead fish.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [This shower of offensive attacks...... I felt a strong will to destroy her stomach at any cost...... Also, the mob lady is just too pitiful.]","? ? ? : [Well, Kaito-san will probably help her out, so she should be alright...... but if you trace the cause of her suffering, the original culprit is actually Kaito-san......]"]},{"number":1567,"title":"Chapter 1567 - Archlesia Empire Founding Festival 7","paragraphs":["I had set up a stall at Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival with Amel-san, but things had taken a rather strange turn right from the start. No, things were actually going well at first. We set up our stall like normal, the first customer came in, and the teacup set made by Nebula was sold. It was a favorable start......","But then, Fate-san suddenly appeared...... and then, shortly after, Chronois-san came after. I can immediately guess the situation just by listening to the exchange between the two of them. In short, Fate-san disappeared as soon as they arrived at the castle and came here, and Chronois-san must have chased after her. Chris-san must be holding her head in her hands right now.","However, what is more important right now is to rescue the customer who is sandwiched between Fate-san and Chronois-san, looking like she was about to die. When two Supreme Gods suddenly appeared and started arguing with each other with you in between, of course, you would be surprised.","[Please calm down, both of you. You’re troubling the customer over there......]","[Fue? Ah, you’re right...... Well, sorry, sorry. Right now, I’m manipulating fate so that people around won’t pay attention to this stall, but the children who were here from the beginning are out of the scope. I was so surprised by God of Time and Space’s appearance that I didn’t notice her.]","[Mhmm? Sorry, I also had blood rushing up my head...... I’m sorry for startling you.]","[Ah, n- n- no! I- I- I’m n- not concerned about it at all!]","When I called out to them, Fate-san and Chronois-san seemed to notice the customer immediately, and apologized to the customer with embarrassed expressions on their faces.","Well, the customer, who was apologized to by Supreme Gods, instead looked embarrassed though, having quite the outrageous look on her face......","[Please excuse them for startling you. Are you alright?]","[Y- Yes! T- T- There’s completely no problem! I- I- I should be the one apologizing for the inconvenience instead, not leaving quickly even though I had finished my shopping......]","The emotion conveyed by my Sympathy Magic strongly expressed a sense of guilt, so it seemed she thought she had caused this mayhem by not leaving the storefront quickly enough.","No, well, I guess that’s what would happen when two Supreme Gods suddenly appear huh...... At any rate, we’ve caused her trouble, so I’d like to give her something as an apology...... Is there something I can give her? Ahh, come to think of it......","[Please accept this as an apology for startling you. It’s just something like a good luck charm, so if you don’t mind......]","[Ah, t- that is...... I apologize for causing you worry. However, I suppose it would also be rude not to accept it...... Well then, please allow me to gratefully accept it.]","[Yes. Thank you for your purchase today.]","What I had given her as an apology was an accessory made from Magnawell-san’s scales...... or rather, a prototype. When I asked Alice to process them back then, she proposed several designs to me, but I had one that wasn’t officially adopted, so I gave it to her as an apology.","Hearing that it was a rejected design may sound bad, but it actually uses more scales and had more gorgeous decorations than the official ones, but the unit price would likely go up because of it, so the design was rejected and we officially adopted a simpler design, so it definitely looks good.","The customer looked apologetic for having to receive an apology gift, but after accepting the accessory, she repeatedly bowed before leaving. She really praised the teacups that Nebula had made, so I think she’s a good customer.","[......Errr, so, once again, I kind of understand the situation...... What are the two of you here for?]","[I came to hang out in Kai-chan’s shop~~]","[Well, I’m sure you can already tell, but this fool disappeared during our conversation with Emperor Archlesia, so I pursued her here.]","Unnn. Well, it really was as I expected. I can already clearly tell the situation at hand. I can see the scene of Fate-san sneaking away, Life-san sleeping, and Chronois-san exchanging a few words with an astounded Chris-san.","[In any case, we’re going back, God of Fate.]","[Hold on a moment there, God of Time and Space. We’ve come all this way to Kai-chan’s shop, you know? Going home without checking out his stuff would be rude to Kai-chan, and wouldn’t that also be rude to Shallow Vernal-sama?]","[Mnghh...... Guhh...... No, indeed. No matter what the circumstances may be, if one visits a store, it would certainly be rude to leave without doing anything huh?]","Because Chronois-san is too serious, I feel like she kinda got tricked. No, well, it won’t take much time to buy an item and then go home, so I guess it would be alright if they just buy something?","[And so, Kai-chan! You got anything to eat or drink here?]","[......I guess orders like that would appear when you see a storefront like this. I do have a drink made from the Fruit of the World Tree here......]","[Ahh, then, gimme some of that!]","[......Should I throw a tsukkomi or pretend I didn’t hear that......]","It isn’t that we’re selling them at our stall, but I do have a lot of them in my magic box, so I take out a drink made from the Fruit of the World Tree. To put it simply, Fate-san just wants to do the act of shopping at my store, so any product would be fine.","For the time being, let’s have her choose which one she’d like: a drink made from a normal Fruit of the World Tree or a drink made from the Fruit of Nebula’s World Tree.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [By giving away a one-of-a-kind accessory made from the scales of the Dragon King, he raised a stomachache flag to the mob lady, and by selling a drink made from the Fruit of the World Tree, he raised a stomachache flag to Chris...... Is he the Stomachache Demon or what?]"]},{"number":1568,"title":"Chapter 1568 - Archlesia Empire Founding Festival 8","paragraphs":["Since they had originally come to participate in the ceremony, and furthermore, since Fate-san had escaped during their meeting with Chris-san, Fate-san and Chronois-san left after purchasing drinks made from the Fruit of the World Tree.","Because Lillywood-san told me not to circulate the original Fruit of the World Tree, what I gave them were drinks made from the Fruits of Nebula’s World Tree.","Well, in the first place, I just happened to sell those to them, and since it was originally not for sale, it will not be distributed anymore.","[......My sworn friend is amazing! When two Supreme Gods suddenly appear, even I can’t act——— Hrnn!? Well, as expected of my sworn friend.]","[W- Well, some troubles occurred, but we had at least sold one product, so things are going well.]","Our first customer wasn’t someone related to me, but someone who was genuinely interested in our stall, so I think that was great.","As for Fate-san and Chronois-san’s sudden invasion, thanks to Fate-san’s Fate Manipulation, there was thankfully no commotion that occurred.","While I was thinking about this, some people suddenly came out from other stalls nearby. They were petite in stature, but had solid muscular bodies. Their short, macho appearance kinda makes me think of Dwarves.","[Errr, Amel-san. I hadn’t seen many Dwarves before, but the people over there are Dwarves, right?]","[Yeah, just as my sworn friend said, they are the people of the forge. They’re probably about to drink Fire Wine to celebrate the start of the festival. I’ll warn my sworn friend now, but the people of the forge will go to the surrounding stalls to distribute Fire Wine, but I advise you to refuse.]","[......Is it a dreadful drink?]","[One sip and your face will turn as red as flames, hence its name Fire Wine...... It’s safe to avoid unless you are a very strong drinker. If you drink the wine they offer, you certainly will gain admiration from the Dwarves, but there is a difference between courage and bravery.]","[I see...... By the way, what about you, Amel-san?]","[Regardless of how strong of a drinker I am, I don’t intend to drink today. Drinking alcohol intoxicates my wings, pulling me down from the blue skies and imprisoning me to the earth. A terrifying item they had.]","I understand the gist of what she was saying. We have arrived early, but the Dwarves...... they may have a connection with an association or a gathering of nearby Dwarves, involved in setting up a stall. Those people are now gathering to celebrate the Founding Festival, toasting with Dwarven alcohol and sharing it with the surrounding stalls.","If you drink it, the Dwarves will look at you favorably, but it seems to be quite strong. And Amel-san isn’t going to drink today because she apparently can’t fly well when drunk.","As I was convinced about that, just as Amel-san said, the Dwarves went around the nearby stalls in order and eventually came to our stall.","[Yo, buddy, it’s a nice day for a festival, isn’t it!? How about some provisions from us Dwarves?]","[Ahh, yes. I’ll gratefully take it then.]","[M- My sworn friend!?]","[It’s alright. I may not look like it, but I’m actually a strong drinker......]","Rather than a strong drinker, thanks to Shiro-san’s Blessing, I can only get tipsy, and when I think “I don’t want to get drunk” or “I want to sober up”, the alcohol in my body instantly disappears. It’s just my guess, but it’s probably the effect of the Blessing of a God of Alcohol, God of Health or someone like them, but in any case, drinking wouldn’t be a problem at all.","And so, I received the large tankard offered to me and thinking that I don’t want to get drunk, I drank the alcohol in it in one gulp...... Hmmm. This alcohol certainly is strong, but I think that the alcohol I drank with Megiddo-san was more intense. Come to think of it, I remember her saying something about how even Dwarves would get drunk off of that drink.","[Thank you very much. It tasted great.]","[B- B- Bro...... Drinking that and not even turning pale, aren’t you quite the drinker? Hahaha, I like you! Oi, give our buddies here some freshly grilled skewers from our stall!]","[Is that alright?]","[Ou! In honor of your good drinking habits, it’s on the house. I guarantee their taste.]","[Thank you very much.]","Just as Amel-san said, after drinking their alcohol, the Dwarf told me that he liked me, spoke to the clerk at his stall and gave us skewers as a present, before leaving with a hearty laugh. How should I say this...... He’s as dynamic as Megiddo-san, but it feels pleasant...... indeed just like a Dwarf.","[M- My sworn friend! That was amazing, drinking Fire Wine and remaining completely composed. My sworn friend is strong even when it comes to alcohol huh. That’s kinda cool———– Hrnn!? The fact that you don’t succumb to alcohol earns you my respect.]","[Ahaha, thanks. That’s thanks to Shiro-san’s Blessing though.]","To Amel-san, who praised me with sparkling eyes, considering that this was ultimately thanks to Shiro-san’s Blessing, I could only respond with an indescribable wry smile.","<Afterword>","Makina : [Hmm~~ but in reality, Shallow Vernal’s Blessing will never be lifted in the future, so isn’t that practically my child’s power?]","Serious-senpai : [Well, even if that’s actually the case, not acting all arrogant would be just like Kaito, right?]","Makina : [As expected of Serious-senpai! You know my beloved child very well! Alright, let’s keep on talking about my beloved child with me!!!]","Serious-senpai : [Absolutely not!!!]"]},{"number":1569,"title":"Chapter 1569 - Archlesia Empire Founding Festival 9","paragraphs":["Chris was waiting in the reception room of the castle in the Royal Capital of Archlesia Empire when Chronois and Fate returned. It had only been a few minutes since Fate had left, but Chris was in an indescribable state as she was left alone in the same room as Life.","Life is the Supreme God in charge of Archlesia Empire, and all the lower-ranking Gods who have temples in the Empire are under her command. Furthermore, one of the lower-ranking Gods, the God of Fertility, is a very important being who had bestowed her Providence throughout Archlesia Empire, where it’s difficult to grow crops, so for Chris, she was someone she can not afford to be rude to.","However, not knowing whether Life had already immersed herself in her meditation or was simply unwilling to talk, Chris found that Life simply sat in silence, and thinking she shouldn’t talk to her while she was meditating, Chris spent several minutes feeling like she’s in hell, as she could only silently wait with the Supreme God.","Well, Life actually wasn’t asleep at that time, but as Chronois would always be in charge of negotiations like this, she didn’t know what to say when the two of them were alone. And putting aside if it was the previous Life, the current Life has grown to a certain extent after the White God Festival and has become somewhat friendly towards the Humans...... but looking at it another way, because of that, she hesitated and was unable to speak, fearing that she might say something strange.","As Life herself was feeling awkward being in that situation, she was relieved when CHronois and Fate returned.","[I’m sorry to keep you waiting, Emperor Archlesia.]","[Ahh, no, please don’t worry about it. It was only a few minutes......]","[We’re baaaaack~~ Ahh, we also bought Risris and God of Life’s share. Here you go.]","[......Eh? Ahh, thank you very much...... Unnn? This is? It seemed to be some sort of drink......]","Fate, with a casual smile on her lips, gives out drinks made from the Fruit of the World Tree to Life and Chris, as if she were giving out souvenirs.","However, upon receiving it, Chris curiously tilted her head. Her confusion was understandable, as she knew that Fate had gone to Kaito’s stall. However, she had heard in advance that Kaito’s stall is a general store, and she had already checked the merchandise they were selling to some extent. She had also confirmed that they weren’t selling any food or drink.","[That’s right~~ I bought these from Kai-chan’s stall, drinks made from Fruits of the World Tree.]","[..................Please wait a moment. I’m not sure my mind is ready to accept the reality of the situation right now......]","When Chris heard Fate’s words, blood seemed to be instantly drained from her face, and her expression turned into one that could be described as despair.","However, seeing the expression on Chris’ face, Chronois had a face full of pity as she spoke.","[I understand how you feel, but don’t worry. These drinks were prepared for God of Fate when she forcibly asked Miyama to prepare something for her. Those weren’t something sold in his shop, nor would it probably be sold to anyone else.]","[Ahh, s- so that’s how it was...... I’m glad...... Really glad.]","The figure of Chris, who was still holding on her stomach, yet showing a relieved expression from the bottom of her heart, looked somewhat heartbreaking, and Chronois, who understood what she was feeling well, had an indescribably sympathetic expression on her face.","Not bothering to pay attention to Chris and Chronois, Fate called out to Life while drinking her own drink.","[The drink is delicious, isn’t it? However, hmmm...... God of Life, is this just my imagination? I’m kinda feeling like I’m filled with power......]","[How unexpected. I’m feeling that way myself. I mean, from what I can observe from you, God of Fate, all of your abilities seem to have doubled......]","[What? Indeed...... Both God of Fate and God of Life, including your magic power, are clearly stronger than usual...... What is this drink? Does the Fruit of the World Tree have such an effect?]","Chronois, who turned her gaze upon hearing the conversation between the two, also had a clearly surprised expression on her face. That’s to be expected. Doubling the abilities of the Supreme Gods, Fate and Life, isn’t possible with normal Support Magic. However, it actually feels like their every ability is doubled.","Given their already immense original abilities, to have them doubled is truly tremendous. While Chronois mutters in astonishment, Life tilts her head and speaks.","[......There’s something I don’t understand though. The Fruits of the World Tree are restricted by the World King...... so it wouldn’t be strange if there were hidden effects other than recovery. But indeed, if they had such an effect...... I can understand why she would want to restrict its distribution.]","[Arehh? However, wasn’t it said to be the Fruit of Neburin’s World Tree? The World Tree where Neburin dwells is somehow different from the normal World Tree, so isn’t it possible that her fruit has a different effect?]","[I see, that’s possible. The Fruits of the World Tree, albeit in small numbers, are still in circulation, and if such an effect were hidden, there’s no way it wouldn’t be revealed......]","Seeing the three Supreme Gods discussing with serious expressions on their faces, Chris looked as if all the troubles in the world were piling up on lap one after another, and as she thought the conversation entered a realm where her thoughts can no longer keep up, she once again held down on her aching stomach.","[......I mean, World King will be coming soon anyway, so couldn’t we just ask her directly?]","When Fate said such a thing and a meeting between the Supreme Gods and the Six Kings might actually take place in her Empire, Chris could only stare into the void with distant eyes.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The follow-up body blow had dealt its damage. Chris had already become a prominent Stomachache Warrior.]","? ? ? : [They also raised a flag of Lillywood-san getting caught up in it. Just when she was breathing a sigh of relief when Isis-san called off her participation......]"]},{"number":1570,"title":"Chapter 1570 - Archlesia Empire Founding Festival 10","paragraphs":["In the reception room at the castle of the Archlesia Empire, there was Lillywood, who had just arrived. As soon as Lillywood arrived at the castle, she heard from Chris, who came to greet her, the Chronois and the other Supreme Gods were looking for her, so she came to the reception room where the Supreme Gods were, tilting her head without any idea what was going on.","“So, what was your business with me?”","[Yeah, sorry for suddenly calling you here. It’s about this drink made from the Fruit of the World Tree, which had roughly doubled our abilities. This is the first time we’ve heard of such an effect, but is this one of the abilities of the Fruit of the World Tree, or perhaps......]","“Yes, that’s the effect of the Fruit of Nebula’s World Tree. The World Tree in Kaito-san’s house seemed to have undergone a strange mutation, and the effect of her fruit is different from normal. It has the power to temporarily increase the ability of those who eat it...... But when I checked it before, its boosting effect should be 1.5 times the user’s. Has it been improved? Or perhaps, does it have a different effect when consumed by Gods? Well, I suppose I’ll check on that later.”","[See, it really is just the Fruit of Neburin’s World Tree being special, wasn’t it?]","[That seems to be the case...... Even so, why do so many strange things gather around Miyama?]","After listening to Lillywood’s explanation, Chronois and the others seemed to be relieved, happy that they solved the mystery of the Fruit of the World Tree drink. The effect of doubling Chronois and the others’ abilities is quite tremendous, but as it wasn’t something that’s publicly distributed, and knowing that Lillywood already knew about it, they seemed to have decided that it wouldn’t be a problem.","[Sorry for the troubles, World King.]","“No, please don’t worry about it. Well then, I will go to the room I have been assigned. I’m sure Magnawell should be here by now.”","[I would also head out to greet Dragon King-sama......]","With the problem solved, Lillywood moved to another room, while Chris also left the room to greet Magnawell.","As Lillywood was moving towards the room prepared for her though, one of her dependents came running up to her, looking a bit flustered.","[......Lillywood-sama, there’s something I need to urgently report......]","“What is it?”","[War King-sama had apparently been sighted in their Humanized form in the Imperial Capital......]","“Megiddo was? Why were they......”","After listening to the information from her dependent, Lillywood looked surprised and thought about it. Only Lillywood and Magnawell will participate in the Founding Festival’s ceremony, and Megiddo is not scheduled to participate.","In the first place, the information she heard was that Megiddo was sighted in the city, so she was able to guess that she had come to the Founding Festival for some kind of purpose other than participating in the ceremony.","“......I see, they came here to buy Dwarven alcohol huh. Well, that shouldn’t be a problem then. Megiddo certainly is a troublemaker, but I don’t think they’re interested in the Founding Festival itself, so they’ll probably go home as soon as they buy their alcohol.”","[I suppose so. This year, the Dwarves’ alcohol-related store seemed to be located away from the center of the city, so there’s little chance their presence would cause a commotion.]","“Yes, indeed, according to the map, they are far away from the central plaza, so we can be relieved...... re...... lieved......”","[L- Lillywood-sama?]","Megiddo’s Humanized form is moderately well-known, and since Megiddo walks around cities without using Recognition Inhibition or Information Concealment Magic, intending not to hide anything, Lillywood concluded that although Megiddo’s presence would likely cause a commotion, it should be fine since she was just here to buy alcohol, but immediately after looking at the map, her expression turned pale.","“......K- Kaito-san’s shop is near that area.”","[E- Ehhh!?]","Yes, the Dwarves’ alcohol-related store that Megiddo might be after is near Kaito’s store this time, and if things continue as they were, it was highly likely that Megiddo would stop by Kaito’s stall.","“N- No, that said, that doesn’t mean that there will be trouble...... h- however, what is this? This uneasiness I’m feeling......”","Feeling an indescribable sense of unease, Lillywood looked at the view of Archlesia Empire’s Imperial Capital from the window with an anxious expression on her face.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [A- A chain reaction is occurring, stomach pains are triggering further stomach pains. H- However, is there a pattern here that leads to Lillywood’s stomachache?]","? ? ? : [Megiddo-san goes to Kaito-san’s shop → Hears from Kaito-san that Lillywood-san and Magnawell-san are attending the ceremony → “Alright, then I’ll show up too”, or so the stupid gorilla simply thinks → Chris-san and company gets a full course stomachache.]","Serious-senpai : [......There’s still something pursuing Chris huh......]"]},{"number":1571,"title":"Chapter 1571 - Archlesia Empire Founding Festival 11","paragraphs":["The opening of the stall with Amel-san was relatively successful. There were a moderate number of customers, and although not much time had passed since the start of the event, a good number of items were sold.","The chuunibyou goods and other such items looked unusual at first glance, drawing people’s initial interest with their appearance, and the cheap price tag meant that people who had loosened their purse strings from the festive atmosphere nicely bought them.","[The sales are going well. At this pace, it looks like we’d be able to sell quite well.]","[As expected, everyone is captivated by the deep darkness. I’m glad to see the number of my kindred spirits is increasing.]","Well, I think the people who bought them not because they were cool, but because they were interesting and interesting when seen as party goods...... but some things are better left unsaid.","Incidentally, we also got permission from Alice to set them at a lower price. Or rather, Alice isn’t really that keen on the sales of a small stall, so she says it’s fine to sell it at almost cost price. Being able to sell it quite cheaply is also one of the factors contributing to our good sales.","Well, though I say that, our place isn’t really that busy, with guests coming at a moderate pace, which was just right. As I was thinking about this, I suddenly heard a familiar voice.","[This area sure got a lot of alcohol~~]","[There seem to be a lot of Dwarven stalls here. Kaori’s place also deals with alcohol, right? You stocking up on something?]","[Ah~~ No, I already got traumatized from trying out stocking up alcohol...... but since Shige-san likes to drink, buying something for him as a souvenir might be a good idea. Ahh, there’s an interesting one over there with an unusual at...... mos...... phere?]","[Unnn? What’s the...... matter?]","Yes, it was unexpectedly Kaori-san and Akane-san. Did they come to hang out at the Founding Festival? Even so, for me to meet them at a place like this, what an amazing coincidence.","They seemed to have noticed me as well, as after looking surprised, they approached our stall.","[What, if it isn’t Kaito. Not only at Symphonia’s, you also opened up your stall here?]","[Yes, my friend invited me...... What a coincidence. I didn’t think the two of you would come to the Founding Festival.]","[I was summoned to Archlesia Empire when I came to this world after all. Things got heated when the topic of Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival was brought up and we decided to go hang out together. We never thought we’d see Kaito-kun here though......]","After exchanging smiles, Akane-san glanced at Amel-san and tilting her head, she turned to me again and asked.","[So, Kaito...... Which distinguished person is she now?]","[She’s the Wingeds’ Chief, Amel-san.]","[.......Seriously...... You...... Are you for real?]","[If I’m not mistaken, the Wingeds is a species that doesn’t interact with those of other species at all...... and for you to open a stall with their Chief, this child really is beyond my common sense.]","The two of them looked genuinely surprised to hear my words, and Kaori-san was clutching her stomach. I was tempted to throw out a tsukkomi, but I thought it would be better to introduce them to Amel-san first, so I explained it to her, who was curiously looking at me.","[Amel-san, these are Mizuhara Kaori-san and Mikumo Akane-san, who are from the same world as me and used to be Hero actors.]","[Heehhh...... People from the same world as my sworn friend huh. I see, you two were indeed also quite unusual, for you possess special magic power. So you girls are also Guided Ones...... In that case, one deems it right to introduce myself. I am Amel, the pitch-black wings that unite those who live in the sky, his sworn friend.]","[......H- Huh.]","Hearing Amel-san happily speaking, Kaori-san had a slightly puzzled expression on her face, while Akane-san’s cheeks were silently twitching. Perhaps, she felt the urge to throw a tsukkomi at Chuuni MAX Amel-san’s words, but she couldn’t bring herself to actually throw it out because of Amel-san’s identity, so she was holding herself back.","Thus, the troubled Akane-san only brought her face close to mine and spoke to me in a whisper that no one else could hear.","[Sorry, let me tsukkomi for just this one thing...... Kaito. why did you become the sworn friend of the Wingeds’ Chief?]","[.......Apparently in our previous life.]","[How the heck did that happen!? Heck, even if you two did know your past lives, you both would probably be still in different worlds......]","[Even if you tell me that......]","[What else do you expect!? It’s not like I can play banter with the top of the Wingeds, so I can only throw my tsukkomis at you...... I mean, why is it that everytime I encounter you, you’d always be with someone remarkable? Are you seriously aiming to destroy everyone’s stomachs......]","As Akane-san dexterously threw her tsukkomis in a whisper, I could only wryly smile with an indescribable expression on my face. Well, now that she mentioned it, I actually seemed to be with someone different who was also quite influential every time we’ve met, so I can’t really complain.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [T- This is!? Looking at the timing of these two, after this would be the perfect moment for Megiddo’s raid flag. Stomachache leading to more stomachache, a Great Stomachache Chain!?]"]},{"number":1572,"title":"Chapter 1572 - Archlesia Empire Founding Festival 12","paragraphs":["Although surprised by Amel-san, Kaori-san and Akane-sana regained their composure and began to look at our merchandise. Akane-san was also showing a merchant’s face and looked especially interested in the chuuni goods that Amel-san was in charge of.","Since they are rare and inexpensive, there’s certainly a possibility that they could be used for some kind of business. But in that case, she will have to negotiate with the Phantasmal King, Alice...... Well, this was just my guess, and I’m not really sure what she’s actually thinking when she looks at the merchandise.","Meanwhile, Kaori-san seems to be more interested in the ceramics in front of me than the chuuni goods. The fact that she’s looking more towards the tableware than the cups, I wonder if it was because she’s the owner of a restaurant?","[These ceramics are nice...... It has a Japanese style to it, so I think I can use these in my restaurant.]","[Are you gonna buy them?]","[N- No, as expected, with its price...... Besides, I’m afraid to use high-end items in my restaurant. Don’t you have anything that is less expensive, Kaito-kun?]","[Well, there are these accessories here. I made them, and as they’re items made by an amateur, they’re cheap.]","Among my acquaintances, Kaori-san has a commoner’s sense of money, which is in a way, something precious to me. Chris-san and the others said that my ceramics were still too cheap, but according to Kaori-san’s impression of it, they were high-class ceramics that were too expensive to afford.","No, I think that Kaori-san’s sense is the normal one. There were just too many rich people around me...... But looking back, I feel that the very first customer also reacted that my items were rather cheap. She seemed to be dressed well, so she might be a noble who came to the festival incognito.","[Eh? Kaito-kun made these? That’s amazing, Kaito-kun’s pretty dexterous huh.]","[No, it’s thanks to the simple production kit Alice made.]","[Then, while I’m here, I guess I’ll buy one...... Ah, you mind if I buy two?]","[I don’t mind, but you aren’t talking about 2 accessories combined into one, right?]","[Unnn. I was thinking of buying another as a souvenir for Olivia-sama...... She’s a regular customer, and if it’s an accessory made by Kaito-kun, it would make her happy.]","[Ahh, I see.]","She was rather timid when she first met Olivia-san, but somehow, I got the impression that she was building a good relationship with her. Kaori-san is sociable, and even with all this and that, it’s possible that she and Olivia-san were friends.","While thinking about that, I sell two accessories to Kaori-san. I have 5 accessories that I made myself for sale, so there are 3 left.","[Thanks! As for Akane-san...... Wait, you’re gonna buy that many!?]","[On? Yeah, thought I’d try to buy a whole bunch of them. They’re low-priced and you don’t see them very often anywhere else, so I thought it would be nice to stock up and sell them......]","[Alice is the one who makes them, so if you want to buy more, you can talk to her.]","[The creator is Phantasmal King-sama!? No wonder, even though it’s low-priced, their quality is excellent...... However, Phantasmal King-sama has trading companies, right? No, I’m not sure which company she had, but she’d definitely have a huge company under her influence, so if she’s gonna sell something, why not sell it there?]","[No, Alice makes those items as a hobby, so I’m sure you’d be able to negotiate with her.]","[Fumu...... Then, I’ll see how things turned out, so when that time comes, I’d like to ask you for introductions.]","Alice actually doesn’t handle her temperature-regulated bedding and sleeping bags through her own company, and was instead handing them over to Kuro’s company. The items available at her miscellaneous goods store are mostly consistent with her hobbies, and it doesn’t seem like she sells them on a large scale. In fact, the chuuni goods don’t seem to be sold anywhere else, and depending on how their negotiations go, I feel like she’ll easily accept it, so I think Akane-san got a chance.","[Are you two going to the Central Plaza after this?]","[Unnn, that’s the plan. Since we had attended the festival, we thought we’d go see the ceremony.]","[I heard that the Supreme Gods are all attending this year. It’s a good time to be a spectator.]","After they had finished buying what they wanted, I had a quick chat with them. This kind of leeway is one of the advantages of having a stall in a place where there are few pedestrians.","Perhaps, there might be a chance of running into someone I know by chance again, and it’d be nice to be able to have casual conversations.","[Come on, we’d better get going.]","[Ah, yes. Thank you for your purchase.]","[Kaito-kun, you do your best with your stall————-]","[Oh? So you’re here! Yo, Kaito!!! What a coincidence!!!]","[———–Hyiiihhh!?]","Just as Akane-san and Kaori were about to leave, I heard a familiar loud voice, and soon after, a large muscular red-haired man....... the Humanized Megiddo-san appeared in front of our stall.","[M- Megiddo-san?]","[Ou! I came to buy some alcohol, when I felt your magic power, so I came to see you! What an interesting-looking stall you got here...... Ahhn?]","[ [ ! ? ] ]","Megiddo-san, who was heartily smiling, seemed to have noticed the nearby Akane-san and Kaori-san and looked at them, making them immediately straighten their backs.","Well, I understand how they feel. It wasn’t like Megiddo-san had any malice towards them, but her looking like a muscular and tall guy is quite intimidating. Meanwhile, Akane-san, her back still straightened, stared at me with half-open eyes.","This was just my hunch, but somehow, I feel like her voice telling me “You, enough with this already......”.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [It’s a gorilla raid. Gorilla-san is basically a vulgar gorilla, so of course, they would be surprised if a gorilla suddenly appeared in front of them~~]","Serious-senpai : [Well, with Megiddo’s character, it isn’t like she was trying to intimidate them, with her thoughts more like “Who the heck are these?”, but she just had to say that “Ahhn?” with a really threatening voice.]"]},{"number":1573,"title":"Chapter 1573 - Stomachache-Filled Founding Festival 1","paragraphs":["There may be no other scene in which the situation of a frog being stared at by a snake fits so well. The tall Megiddo-san looking down at Kaori-san and Akane-san looks like women being entangled by a delinquent.","[......Somehow, the two of you look familiar. Who are you two?]","[Megiddo-san, these two are Mizuhara Kaori-san and Mikumo Akane-san, people who are from the same other world as me, and used to be Hero actors.]","[Ahh, I see, you’re former Hero actors! That’s why you looked familiar. I do feel like I’ve seen you in a Festival of Heroes back then.]","[Also, you’re scaring them.]","[Ahhn? Why would they feel scared? Did they do something to feel guilty about?]","Kaori-san and Akane-san’s shoulders shook when they heard Megiddo-san’s intimidating voice, but as someone who had known her for a while, I know that she was just being her usual self and wasn’t mad at them. However, for people who hadn’t met Megiddo-san very much, it wouldn’t be strange for them to think that she’s angry.","[No, it’s because of your gaze and the pressure you’re emitting. Even if that wasn’t what you had intended, it looked like Megiddo-san is glaring, so it would be better if you’d at least lower your voice a bit.]","[......Kaito, seriously...... Why do you take such a light tone towards War King-sama?]","[W- W- W- Wouldn’t they get mad? T- They might kill us......]","[No, please calm down, you two. It’s not like Megiddo-san is angry. Sh...... They’re just being usual. They’d even get in a better mood while drinking alcohol.]","When Megiddo-san is in a good mood, she smiles a lot and one would really feel how cheerful of a person she is, but in normal circumstances, she may look a bit grumpy, even when she actually isn’t.","This is hard to tell unless one had actually seen her in her angry mood, as when she is angry, she looks much more intimidating.","[......So, which one is which?]","[Ah, errr, this one is Mikumo Akane. I’m the Chairman of my trading company, Mikumo Trading Company.]","[Ou, I see, I’ll call you Akane then. Mikumo Trading Company...... Ahh, I think that one’s familiar. You operate a mobile trading company, right?]","[Y- Yes, that’s right.]","Akane-san seemed surprised that Megiddo-san knows about the Mikumo Trading Company, but even when Megiddo-san looks like that, she’s someone who invests in various things such as trading companies, so she’s knowledgeable about them.","After talking with Akane-san to some extent, Megiddo-san then turns to Kaori-san.","[That would mean this one’s Mizuhara Kaori then? I’ll call you Kaori.]","[Ah, yes. I’m Mizuhara Kaori-san. I work in a restaurant in Friendship City called Suiren, where I serve dishes from our world.]","[Hou, other world dishes huh. Sounds interesting, I’ll come eat there some time.]","[Hwoehh? Ah, yesh, I’ll be waiting.]","Kaori-san looked like she was gonna cry for a moment when Megiddo-san told her that she was interested in other world cuisine and that she was going to go to her restaurant next time, but of course, there’s no way she’d be able to deny her.","As expected though, with all the things happening, I couldn’t help feeling worried about Akane-san’s stomach, so I decided to help her out.","[Megiddo-san, let’s go together at that time. I know where her restaurant is.]","[Ou, I’m looking forward to it!]","[K- Kaito-kun......]","Kaori-san’s mental state would somewhat be more relieved with me there with them, so I suggested that for the time being, to which Kaori-san looked as if she found salvation in hell.","After a brief conversation, Kaori-san and Akane-san decided to continue looking around the festival, so they politely bid their farewells to Megiddo-san before hastily leaving.","After seeing them off with a wry smile, I turned to Megiddo-san and called out to her.","[Speaking of which, it’s a bit too late to ask, but did Megiddo-san come to attend the Founding Festival?]","[Unnn? Ahh, I came to buy some booze. There’s this delicious booze called Dwarven Fire Wine, but they don’t sell it in large quantities unless it’s for a large festival. I just bought about a hundred barrels of them.]","[......A hundred barrels.....]","Errr, a barrel of alcohol...... should be 160 liters, right? That means a hundred barrels would be 16000 liters? I thought for a moment that she may have bought too much but well, Megiddo-san should be able to calmly drink that much huh......","[......So you’re not gonna attend the ceremony like Lillywood-san and Magnawell-san then?]","[Ahhn? Lillywood and Magnawell are here? Not their subordinates?]","[Yes, and it seems that all the Supreme Gods would also be in attendance this time.]","[Hou~~ I see...... Then, I guess I’ll check it out later.]","Megiddo-san happily smiles as she said this, but is it really alright to do something flippantly like that.","[Eh? Is it really alright to do something flippantly like that?]","[Ahhn? I’m not gonna attend the ceremony, just gonna give Lillywood and the others a quick hello, so they shouldn’t mind.]","[......Huh.]","Hmmm, well, I guess that could be the case? Indeed, if she’s just going to greet them...... Her Humanized-form’s face is also well-known that they’d easily let her inside the castle......","[That aside, quite the interesting stuff you got here...... Wait, if it isn’t Amel? So you’re also here.]","[It has been a while, O King of the Raging Flames. I thank the guiding stars for this chance encounter in this festival......]","[Ou, you’re still making no sense like usual.]","Megiddo-san seemed to know Amel-san, as she heartily smiles at her. Since Megiddo-san is a person who likes someone as long as they’re strong, Megiddo-san didn’t seem to care at all about the way Amel-san talked. That part of her really is just like Megiddo-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai: [No, the heck is that title!? N- No way, the chain still continues huh...... However, how are things gonna go after this......]"]},{"number":1574,"title":"Chapter 1574 - Stomachache-Filled Founding Festival 2","paragraphs":["At any rate, it seems that Megiddo-san decided to check out my and Amel-san’s stall before greeting Lillywood-san and the others, as she looked at our wares with great interest.","Picking up an accessory I had made with Alice’s creation kit, she looked impressed.","[Hou~~ Kaito made this huh? I see...... Isn’t this quite a nice piece of work!? The design is a bit commonplace, but I could see the care for its workmanship, and for someone who made something like this for the first time, it’s quite good.]","[Thank you. Hearing you say that makes me happy...... Are you going to buy it?]","[No, accessories get in the way of battles so I won’t buy them. However, I think they’re nice enough accessories to sell.]","This is what truly makes Megiddo-san amazing. She praises something’s good points without hesitation, and even though she praises something, she doesn’t buy something she doesn’t need, which is just like Megiddo-san.","After nodding her head while looking at the accessories I made, Megiddo-san turns her attention to the ceramics Nebula made.","[......This is amazing. This Nebula, it’s that midget Spirit back at your place, right? While achieving perfect baking, the colors incorporated as patterns stand out vividly. These definitely are first-rate products...... Wait, Kaito. Why are you making that subtle expression on your face again?]","[No, my head knows that this was the case but......]","I know that Megiddo-san knows a lot about art, but it just feels so out of place, like there’s this bone stuck in my throat.","Thereupon, that certain someone who wouldn’t shut up at such a situation silently showed herself and started stirring things up again.","[Gorilla-san, I’ve already said this multiple times, but you don’t have the face to be talking about art. That face of yours isn’t one that talks about ceramics, but something whose appearance itself destroys ceramics.]","[You b*stard...... You selling a fight or what?]","[You want us to sell that? What a pushy customer we have...... OUUUUCH!?]","It looks like they’re gonna start a fight, so I hit Alice with Shiro-san’s Special Piko Piko Hammer.","[If you start a fight in a place like this, it’d be a disaster for Chris-san’s stomach.]","[No, we’d properly make sure we teleport to the Demon Realm, okay?]","[No, in that case, it would be a headache for another person, so don’t do it.]","Mainly because Lillywood-san would be the one screaming...... No, but Lillywood-san did also fight Megiddo-san in the Demon Realm...... Well, it’s better to contain troublesome things ahead of time.","[Hmm~~ If that’s what Kaito-san says...... Seems like you get to keep your life, Megiddo-san.]","[What? You won’t fight? Oi, oi, you can’t do that after making someone’s hopes up...... Even though I thought I could finally fight seriously after a long time.]","[Should I call Kuro then?]","[......Wait, Kaito. Alright, I’ll give up...... So, let’s not do anything hasty......]","Even with all her antics, Alice listens to me when I speak, so there’s no problem on her side. As for the musclehead that was about to go battle mode, I know that Megiddo-san can’t raise her head against Kuro, not just in the past, but even now, so it’s possible to come up with a countermeasure against her.","Both Alice and Megiddo-san seemed to have defused the situation for the time being, and the tense atmosphere earlier had disappeared.","[Speaking of which, aren’t you gonna buy snacks to accompany your alcohol? I’ll raise the price just for you.]","[No, you’re supposed to make it cheaper there...... Well, since you don’t mess around with food, there’s no doubt the taste would be good. Bring an appropriate amount to my castle later, and contact Agni or Bacchus for the payment. Tell them to take the money out from the vault.]","[Yes, yes, thank you for your patronage~~]","The two of them sure are quick to switch from one thought to another, even though they were just being hostile earlier...... As expected, even with all the things they say, the two of them are pretty close to each other.","Well, even with all the happenings, things sure are peaceful.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [That’s just how it is, isn’t it? Unlike the Stomachache Warriors, those on Kaito’s side see this as just a normal leisurely stall opening, and with acquaintances coming by to chat every now and then, things are going quite leisurely...... It isn’t quite leisurely for the Stomachache Warriors though......]"]},{"number":1575,"title":"Chapter 1575 - Stomachache-Filled Founding Festival 3","paragraphs":["Megiddo-san eventually bought a vase made by Nebula. The plates and cups aren’t suitable for her use in her normal form as the War King, so she put flowers in them and planned to display them in her room.","When I heard how she’s gonna use them, a complicated expression appeared on my face again...... but I think that can’t be helped.","[Even so, my sworn friend’s friendship network sure is broad. As expected, the shining stars must gather around the star that shines the brightest huh?]","[I wonder about that? Even so, we sure meet a lot of my acquaintances...... Hmmm, is that the sound of fireworks?]","[Yeah, the ceremony is about to start. By now, the central plaza should be filled with people and chaos is in full swing.]","[It’s practically the main event after all. Well, this area isn’t really that affected by that.]","The Central Plaza certainly may be crowded, but it doesn’t really matter much for this place that is far away from the Central Plaza. That aside, it’s almost lunchtime already, so I’d like to eat at a time like this when there are few customers around.","Given that, this might just be the right time to have lunch.","[Amel-san, since the ceremony has started, it seems like there will be fewer customers than before. Shall we go out for lunch now while we have the chance?]","[Agreed. However, how do we do that? Shall we meet at a later time or perhaps shall we temporarily seal the dark relics in the chasm......]","[Hmm, well, once we put away our stall, we can just go eat together. Let’s just put away our wares in the magic box, and put up a sign saying we’re on our lunch break.]","[Unnn, you’re right. I also want to eat together with my sworn friend...... Hrnn. In any case, with the decision settled, let us depart.]","Since we aren’t really aiming to have as kuch sales as possible, we just decided to close our stall and head for a nearby shop to have lunch together.","With us going to a festival today, I’d like to eat something festive.","While Kaito and Amel had temporarily closed their stall and were on their way to have lunch, Kaori and Akane were on the Central Plaza.","[Uwahh, there really are lots of people around......]","[No, this is more than in the past years. Since all the Supreme Gods are present this time, there will likely be many people trying to force their way in just to catch a glimpse of them...... However, this is a situation where we should keep our distance.]","[Unnn. Even if we can’t speak, I came here hoping to at least catch a glimpse of Chris-san...... However, it seems impossible to get any closer to the Central Plaza than this.]","Rather than coming to see the ceremony, the two of them arrived at the Central Plaza casually intending for a light sightseeing, as Kaori wanted to catch a glimpse of Chris, whom she knows.","However, with the confirmed attendance of all the Supreme Gods, there were a tremendous number of spectators at the ceremony, making it impossible not only to catch a glimpse of Chris but even to get anywhere near the Central Plaza.","Seeing so many people...... so much so that it couldn’t be described by just wall of people anymore, Kaori and Akane gave up on heading to the Central Plaza and decided to turn back.","And at a somewhat more spacious place away from the crowd, wearing tired expressions on their faces, they exchanged idle chatter.","[......There are too many people.]","[Seriously, it really feels like a festival...... They’ve also set up a Wide-Area Teleportation Inhibition Barrier in the Imperial Capital, so I can’t use Teleportation Magic at all. Getting around all these people is quite inconvenient. Well, in any case, it seems impossible for us to see the ceremony.]","[You’re right. It’s unfortunate, but let’s give up.]","[......Unnn? Ohh, isn’t this Kaori and Akane? We meet again!]","[ [ War King-sama!? ] ]","As the two were exchanging such words, they heard a familiar loud voice, and when they hurriedly turned around, they saw Megiddo walking towards them.","Since Megiddo doesn’t use Recognition Inhibition or Information Concealment Magic, many people are aware of her Humanized-form, and with many people knowing that she is the War King, a commotion occurred in the surroundings.","However, Megiddo’s rough temperament...... rather, her personality, which is widely known for mercilessly killing anyone who interferes and displeases her, has made people cautious about approaching her or obstructing her path. As a result, the people around them quickly made way, avoiding any unnecessary interactions or disruptions.","In that situation, Kaori and Akane, who were left behind by that wave of people, became the center of attention. Both of them were sweating profusely, but Megiddo, who doesn’t pay much attention to such details, casually approached them and struck up a conversation.","[So, what were you two doing here?]","[Ah, errr, we were going to the Central Plaza to catch a glimpse of Chris-san, but there were too many people there......]","[Y- Yes, so we just turned around and are now taking a break.]","[Chris? What, you two are acquainted with Emperor Archlesia? Ahh, I see, you two were Hero actors...... I guess Archlesia was the country that summoned you two then?]","[Ah, yes. Me and Akane-san were summoned in Archlesia.]","Despite feeling somewhat intimidated by Megiddo’s imposing presence, Kaori and Akane were able to have a conversation to some extent, thanks to the prior information provided by Kaito that “Megiddo wasn’t in a particularly bad mood”.","After listening to what the two said, Megiddo thought for a moment before clapping her hands together.","[Alright! In that case, I’ll go bring you there!]","[ [ ......Yes? ] ]","[I was just on my way to see Lillywood and Magnawell. Right, with that decided, let’s go!]","[Hoeehhh? U- Umm, War King-sama!?]","[Why...... Why is this happening...... My stomach hurts...... I don’t wanna think what happens after this......]","Megiddo, who apparently thought she had a great idea, swiftly scooped up Akane and Kaori, their faces filled with despair, and placing them on her shoulders, Megiddo leaped into the air, avoiding the crowd as they kicked off into the sky.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai: [Come to think of it, this gorilla suddenly appeared in Symphonia Kingdom behind a pillar of flames, acting like she’s the only honored one throughout heaven and earth.]","? ? ? : [As expected of Demon Realm’s troublemaker, this is definitely the classic pattern of showing up right in the middle of the ceremony...... Furthermore, Kaito-san, who could have stopped Megiddo-san, doesn’t seem to have any intention of approaching the Central Plaza. Instead, he had closed up shop and gone to have lunch, seemingly unbothered by Megiddo-san’s presence in Archlesia Empire...... I’m afraid a chain of stomachaches is about to begin.]"]},{"number":1576,"title":"Chapter 1576 - Stomachache-Filled Founding Festival 4","paragraphs":["I am now going to check out stalls for lunch with Amel-san. If we approach the Central Plaza, the number of people increases, so conversely, if we move away from the Central Plaza, the fewer the people will be.","Fortunately, the ceremony had just started, so the stalls were relatively empty and we didn’t have to wait too long to buy food.","[There are quite a few options, isn’t it? Amel-san, do you have anything specific you want to eat?]","[Hmmm, I’m not sure. I’m kinda craving for something with meat in it, but those fish skewers also look delicious. What about you, my sworn friend, do you have any specific food you want to eat?]","[I feel like eating yakisoba, but stalls in this world wouldn’t have them.]","[Is that so? That indeed sounds like an unfamiliar dish. What kind of dish is it?]","[If I had to describe it based on dishes of this world, it’s something like pasta.]","In this world, there is no ramen, so Chinese noodles don’t exist in the first place. And so, I have never seen a stall selling yakisoba either. There were some food stalls that served dishes using pasta or slightly thicker noodles than somen, but they were different from yakisoba.","Takoyaki does exist, although it’s something more like a minor dish. However, there are no stalls selling yakisoba. Alice did make some at the beach, but she has a lot of things that don’t exist in this world, so she’s a special case, and it’s not something that generally exists.","Also, this is completely unrelated to our current topic, but is Amel-san aware that she was talking in her natural tone?","[I see, pasta huh...... Ahh...... Erhem! I can feel the melancholy in my sworn friend’s heart when it comes to the flavors of your homeworld. If we could find something similar nearby...... Wait, my sworn friend! That stall over there! It’s apparently selling yakisoba, you know?]","[Eh? Ah, you’re right. I never expected we’d see one here...... Did a former Hero actor actually pass the dish down?]","Indeed, in the direction Amel-san pointed, there really was a food stall with yakisoba written on it. This is an unexpected turn of events. Perhaps, even though I’ve never seen it before, it had already existed in this world? In any case, this is great news, so we promptly went to check it out.","Just as I was feeling a bit excited upon finding that yakisoba stall......","[......Of course, it’s Alice-chan!]","[Should have known it’s you! Rather, why the heck are you wearing an octopus costume!? It’s not connected with yakisoba at all!]","Alice, wearing a stuffed octopus costume, was the owner of that stall. I already had a slight hunch this was the case, but it really is her huh.","No, well, putting that aside, let’s just be happy that I got to eat yakisoba......","In the Central Plaza of Archlesia Empire, the ceremony, which could be called the main event of the Founding Festival, was being held. Among the powerful people attending the ceremony, it was Fate, the most powerful of them all, who noticed it first.","However, Fate showed no interest and didn’t make any mention of it, and the one who voiced out the abnormality was the second person to notice it, possessing exceptional abilities, was Lillywood.","“......This is!? D- Don’t tell me......”","[Lillywood, what in the wo...... This magic power, is this Megiddo? That fool really is heading over here!?]","Following Lillywood, who murmured with a pale expression on her face, Magnawell, who was sitting nearby, also sensed the magical power approaching the Central Plaza and tensed up.","Coming their way is Megiddo, who shouldn’t have been planned to attend the ceremony this time. However, both Lillywood and Magnawell are well aware of it, being familiar with Megiddo’s unruly personality......","[World King, Dragon King, what is the meaning of this...... This was unlikely, but there’s no way the War King is planning to come to the plaza in the midst of the ceremony, right?]","“I’d like to say that that wasn’t the case but...... Megiddo gives reasonable consideration to those they like, but completely disregards the convenience of those they don’t. Due to their strong dislike for the aristocratic nature of Archlesia Empire, there is a possibility that they may not consider the interests of the country......”","[They leaped into the air. They should be here anytime soon...... What should we do, Lillywood? Should we blow them away?]","Anticipating that Megiddo would arrive at their location shortly, Chronois flusteredly asked, but both Lillywood and Magnawell themselves were unable to remain calm in the current situation.","In response to Magnawell’s suggestion of attacking the approaching Megiddo and blowing them away into a sub-dimension, Lillywood was about to reflexively agree but......","“......Ah, no, we can’t! There seemed to be people on his shoulders. This magic power...... Otherworlders? However, it feels different from Kaito-san’s magic power...... then who in the world are they? I- In any case, launching an attack to blow away Megiddo would also harm those two!”","[......If we don’t do that though, we won’t be able to stop them......]","Although their conversation was exchanged in whispers, Chris, who was seated relatively close to them, could hear it and as she contemplated the situation that was about to unfold, her eyes turned as lifeless as that of a dead fish.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai: [The difference between the heartwarming peacefulness of Kaito’s side and the hellish scene unfolding on the Stomachache Warriors’ side after just a few seconds was amazing......]"]},{"number":1577,"title":"Chapter 1577 - Stomachache-Filled Founding Festival 5","paragraphs":["The Central Plaza where the ceremony for Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival is held. In the space there for attendees and guests to watch the ceremony, the atmosphere was tense.","Chris tried desperately to think of what to do, but no matter how wise she may be, she had too little time.","Rather, her mind was only filled with the thought that this would just be a dream. However, even that wish was in vain...... as Megiddo landed in that space from the sky.","[Alright, we’ve arrived! Yo, Lillywood, Magnawell! I came here to see you!]","“..................”","[....................]","It was fortunate that she did not land directly on the plaza in the middle of the ceremony, but it was still very conspicuous to land from the sky on the seats where powerful beings gathered, an area that originally gathered a lot of attention due to the splendor of the guests.","It didn’t take long for everyone around to realize that it was Megiddo who had appeared. Seeing Megiddo raised on hand in greeting after dropping off Akane and Kaori, seemingly unconcerned about what was going on here, veins popped out of Lillywood and Magnawell’s forehead.","However, as to be expected of the Six Kings, they instantly exchanged eye contact and nodded to each other before taking action.","“Megiddo, I understand that you’re rushing here because you were late, but showing up directly at the venue isn’t commendable, is it?”","[Ahhn, what are you......]","[Indeed, doing that would inevitably cause trouble. Considering your personality, I understand “your desire to attend according to schedule”, but even if that’s the case, you could have just arranged for a substitute in advance.]","“......No, what in the heck are you two......”","Amidst Megiddo’s confusion from their unexpected reaction, Lillywood and Magnawell continue to speak as if they intend to forcefully push through with the narrative “Megiddo was originally scheduled to attend but arrived late”.","Such is understandable. Indeed, it’s more acceptable that they were originally scheduled to attend but arrived late due to a delay caused by some trouble, rather than having one of the Six Kings abruptly intruding during the ceremony. It provides a better explanation and resolution.","[War King-sama, we have been waiting for you. Please wait a moment and we will have your seat ready as soon as possible......]","[Ahh? No, it’s not like I’m here to attend your———- Ahhn?]","Chris also understood Lillywood and Magnawell’s intention and immediately started talking as if Megiddo had been planned to attend from the start.","Megiddo, who was about to deny those words, had her attempt cut short as Lillywood and Magnawell lightly placed their hands on both of Megiddo’s shoulders———- their hands gripping with a force that could almost crush them, and whispered in a voice audible only to Megiddo.","“......Enough with that and align your words with us.”","[......You can either match what we’re saying, or you can get a good scolding from Kuromueina, whichever you prefer.]","[......O- Ou...... I don’t really know what’s going on, but alright. However, why is it that you all look so mad?]","“And whose fault do you think......”","[Calm down, Lillywood. This is just what they are.]","With Kuromueina’s name being vrought up, Megiddo had no choice but to obediently comply, and even though he looked perplexed, he ultimately accepted that he is now attending.","In such an atmosphere, where it was believed that the worst-case scenario had been averted...... the next focus of everyone’s attention was on the two individuals that Megiddo had brought along.","Amidst the gathering of powerful beings, the two individuals brought to that scene, trembling with expressions that seemed like they were on the verge of collapsing, caught everyone’s attention. Chris, who knew Kaori, hurriedly approached them and spoke to them in a hushed voice.","[Kaori-san...... Why are you here......]","[Ahh, C- C- C- Chris-san...... It’s— It’s been a while...... I- I- I’m sorry for t- t- the sudden arrival...... Errr, w- we’re not sure why this happened either, but when I was with Akane-san over there, we were suddenly brought here by War King-sama......]","[Ahh, those two are apparently Kaito’s acquaintances. They kinda mentioned wanting to meet Emperor Archlesia, so I brought them along while I’m at it.]","Chris had a rough idea of what was going on after hearing Kaori’s pitifully trembling words and Megiddo’s words, but it was difficult to move the two who were attracting so much attention away from the scene as if nothing had happened.","While she was thinking about what she should do, a high ranking noble in the audience opened their mouth.","[Oya? Could those two be the former Hero actors? Good gracious, as to be expected from Emperor Chris. Not only maintaining a solid relationship with the otherworlders who have completed their roles as Hero, but also inviting them to the ceremony, it’s truly a deep friendship they have established...... If I may ask, were they also involved in that trouble that caused War King-sama’s delay?]","[......Yes, I invited the girls as a sign of our friendship with the other world, but a little trouble occurred and War King-sama solved it. We will have to prepare their seats as well.]","[I knew that was the case. We as well think that the otherworlders are important..... but our people are a bit confused, so it would be great if Your Majesty could give a few words of explanation.]","[Yes, indeed. I will explain immediately.]","With the favorable reception towards the two by a high-ranking noble holding authority, the questioning gazes toward Kaori and Akane from the surrounding people gradually dissipated.","While patting her chest in relief, Chris apologized to the two for having decided to have them suddenly participate in the ceremony, and told the people that the two of them were former Hero actors who have decided to live in this world, and that they would also be guests this time.","Fate, who was watching the scene from a distance, giggled with some amusement.","(......That noble, they’re someone instigated by Shall-tan huh? Even though she does all sorts of things, she’s still as kind as ever. In that case, I guess I’ll follow up on them too...... Let’s have the fate of the populace favorably accepting those two’s attendance become definite...... Alright, that does it......)","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The stomachs of the two who ended up participating in the ceremony by chance seem like they are about to explode. With that, they should have a moment of respite from further stomach blows...... or will they? The Stomachache Black Hole had still kept her silence...... Seems like there are still more things that are about to happen......]"]},{"number":1578,"title":"Chapter 1578 - Stomachache-Filled Founding Festival 6","paragraphs":["The sudden intrusion of Megiddo, along with the unexpected participation of past Hero actors, had caused a commotion in the VIP seats. Amidst the chaos though, Lilia had breathed a sigh of relief, gently brushing her chest.","Of course, Lilia was also surprised by Megiddo’s intrusion, and she could painfully understand the anguish Chris, Lillywood, and the others are feeling. But in this situation, the central figures at the moment are the Six Kings and Emperor Chris, and Lilia, who is merely a noble from another country, isn’t related to the topic at all.","At least, she was relieved that she didn’t have to endure the feeling of her stomach churning, or so she was thinking but......","[Ohh, isn’t this Lilia!? You also came too!!!]","[Whooehh!?]","Lilia’s relief, however, crumbled like a house of cards when Megiddo, who had spotted her, approached her in a friendly manner and started speaking to her.","There shouldn’t have been much interaction between Lilia and Megiddo, so she was perplexed as to why Megiddo was calling out to her in such a friendly manner...... But in the first place, Megiddo has a penchant for formidable individuals, regardless of gender. She highly values Lilia, who was born with an unparalleled talent among the Humans and gained power equivalent to that of a Count-rank in just over 20 years. Having witnessed Lilia’s battle under the effect of the Critical Point of Fate during the War in the God Realm, Megiddo is convinced that she will eventually become a powerful individual rivaling the Six Kings.","Thus, it’s only natural for Megiddo to be fond of such a talented and powerful individual.","[It’s been a while, you’re even stronger than when I last saw you. It’s amazing how fast you’ve grown.]","[Ah, Aeehh? Y- Yes. T- Thank you very much!]","[If you weren’t a noble from Symphonia, I would have invited you to be one of my subordinates but...... how about it? Why don’t you quit being a noble and join my camp? I’ll even arrange it so that you become one of my Executives, you know?]","[Ah, n- no, I’m thankful for your praise but...... I’m already content with my current position......]","[That so? That’s a shame then. Let me know if you change your mind. If it’s you, you’re more than welcome!]","It would have been fine if this were an exclusively private conversation. However, in the current setting, there are attendees from various countries and many people watching. If such a conversation were to take place under such circumstances...... It is inevitable that the Head of the Albert Duchy would be recognized as “having earned high praise from the War King and established a friendly relationship, to the extent of being invited to join their Executives”.","In addition, Lilia had already become quite famous, attracting numerous nobles who wanted to establish connections with her. This resulted in busy days for her. Just when she thought things had finally settled down recently and she would have some free time...... This happened.","With a strained smile twitching on her face, imagining the multitude of letters that would likely arrive after this founding festival, Lilia suppressed the pain in her stomach.","I eat yakisoba I bought at Alice’s store with Amel, sitting on a wooden bench that Alice has prepared for us. It’s amusing that Alice cheekily brought her own portion and is sitting along with us.","[Ah, it’s delicious! I like its strong flavors! So this is the flavor of my sworn friend’s world!]","[In the country in the world I lived in, this dish was quite popular. It was quite a staple at festivals like this.]","[I see~~ It’s the first time I’ve tasted something like this so I think it’s interesting! It’s really interesting knowing how different our world is from yo———- Hrnn!? F- Fufu, experiencing an unknown world always makes my heart leap. It feels similar to the sensation of opening a door leading further into the depths.]","It seems that when Amel-san gets excited, she basically forgets the character she’s projecting. Just like this time, she liked the taste of yakisoba, which caused her chuuni speech to be broken.","Seeing her looking so embarrassed that her cheeks blushed a bit while she ate her yakisoba, I couldn’t help smiling.","As I was thinking that, I saw Alice suddenly having an indescribable expression on her face.","[......Alice?]","[Why does that person always end up in a troublesome situation without fail in these types of situations......]","[Unnn?]","[Ahhh, no, it’s nothing. That aside, we’ve got some karashi mayonnaise here, you want some?]","[Ahh, that sounds great.]","(T/N: karashi mayonnaise is basically a combination of mustard and mayo)","Karashi mayonnaise is very tasty and changes the taste of the yakisoba completely. However, I’m slightly concerned about what Alice muttered just now.","When it comes to troublesome situations, the first person that comes to my mind is Lilia-san, who often draws troublesome matters towards her...... but Lilia-san should be attending the ceremony right now, and I can’t imagine any troublesome matters happening at the ceremony.","Even if trouble occurs in the ceremony, Lilia-san shouldn’t have anything to do with it, and Alice also said that it’s nothing. In that case, I guess I should just not worry about it then......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As expected of the strongest Stomachache Warrior, she truly is on a different level. To draw in stomachache flags not only here in this Founding Festival, but for later as well......]"]},{"number":1579,"title":"Chapter 1579 - Stomachache-Filled Founding Festival 7","paragraphs":["After eating yakisoba with Amel-san, we resumed running our stall. Though I said that, as the ceremony of the Founding Festival is currently being held, I feel that we’d be getting fewer customers than in the morning, so we were able to take it easy. Well, we set up our stall not because of money, so that isn’t really a problem.","[Seeing the number of customers decreasing like this, the ceremony must be quite bustling.]","[Yeah, today’s festival involves the Gods after all. The festival normally wouldn’t be this big.]","[Certainly, with all three Supreme Gods in attendance, there must be quite a crowd.]","Even though Lilia-san participating in this Founding Festival was Eden-san’s fault, I feel like she’s got it rough...... Arehh? Come to think of it, in the end, will Lilia-san be coming by to our stall?","I already handed to her a befitting accessory, which was Eden-san’s objective for sending her here, so strictly speaking, there’s no need for her to come anymore. Lilia-san is a Duchess and quite famous as the Strongest Human, so I feel like it would be difficult for her to come.","[Do you have troubles in mind? If you want, I can always lend you my strength.]","[Yeah, I’m worried if Lilia-san will be able to properly come to our stall...... Unnn?]","[I see, she does hold a considerable position, so that might be difficult. I understand. My bel———- Hrmph! Miyama Kaito-san’s problems, I’ll solve it for you!]","[......Ahh, errr...... Mana-san? Why are you here?]","The person who suddenly appeared was Amaterasu-san’s subordinate who was Eden-san’s representative at the time of Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival...... or so she claimed she was. No matter how I looked at it, Mana-san seemed to have a higher position than Amaterasu-san.","She’s definitely connected with the other world...... or rather, our former world’s Eden-san, isn’t she? Why did she come to Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival as if it’s the most obvious thing in the world?","[That is, of course, to see Miyama Kaito-san’s sta————- Ouuuuuch!? Wait, I’m still talki————— Ouuuuuch!?]","Before I could get a proper response to her question, Alice, who also suddenly appeared, grabbed Mana-san’s head and slammed her to the ground. Thereupon, seemingly rubbing her face down on the ground, she took her away somewhere.","W- What the heck just...... I mean, Mana-san is as mysterious as ever. Even though Alice was treating her so roughly and was being dragged away in such a painful-looking way, almost as if she’s a prisoner being sent to the chopping block, she was still waving her hand my way...... Who is she?","[......That friend of my sworn friend sure is a bundle of personality.]","[H- Hmmm. I don’t really know about her either. I mean, was she really the subordinate of my acquaintance? ......I only know that she was a self-proclaimed subordinate and is close with Alice.]","[Fumu, if she’s acquainted with the King of Empty Illusions, is she connected with the Kings of the Demon Realm?]","[No, she was apparently connected with the God of the world I was in.]","[To the God of my sworn friend’s world?]","[Something close to that...... I guess?]","Not really having a clear answer to Amel-san’s question, I could only tilt my head and give her such a vague reply.","Makina, who was finally brought into a subspace by Alice while her face was being dragged on the ground by said person, puts her hand on her battered face to restore it.","[Isn’t that mean, Alice!? This body isn’t made strong at all, you should be more gentle with it!]","[No, what do you think you’re doing, you stupid Makina!!!? What, appearing at Kaito-san’s stall like it’s a matter of course, you asking for a beating!!!?]","[No, as I’ve mentioned before, I haven’t visited as Eden, so it’s perfectly safe. Not only that, I haven’t caused any trouble for my beloved child, so it’s double safe. Moreover, I’m trying to be of assistance to my beloved child, so I believe that’s a triple————- Ouch!?]","As Makina tried asserting her innocence with a brilliant smile and a thumbs up, she was met with Alice smashing her fist on her head. Makina, in pain, tears streaming from her eyes, rolls on the ground.","[You asked Lilia-san to act as your representative, so I thought you’d be quiet......]","[N- No, wait, Alice! I have no intention of going shopping or anything at my beloved child’s store. I leave that to Lilia. However, even so! My beloved child is working hard at his stall. It would be inexcusable and a tremendous sin for his mother that I am to not go and see my hardworking child. Of course, I know that being a mother isn’t just about assisting her child in everything. That’s why I didn’t interfere when my beloved child was preparing for his stall, and even now, I have no intention of thoughtlessly shopping there. However, I believe that a mother’s support can be like a source of energy for my beloved child. By receiving my loving cheer, the burning emotions my beloved child held for his mother is ignited, and that ultimately converts into an infinite wellspring of vitality. As it has been expressed in various works of media, the power of love is boundless, and my own power is also infinitely vast, so in essence, my love is justice! To put it in a straightforward example, it’s like a mother attending her child’s school observation day. It’s a sacred ritual where I confirm my beloved child’s growth, imprint their hard work into my memory, and engrave their significance in my heart. Yes, it doesn’t hold any impure thoughts or my desire to lick my beloved child at all. Ahh, no, of course, I do have the desire to lick my beloved child. Losing that feeling, even for a moment, would be nothing short of blasphemy against my beloved child. So, as his mother, I firmly maintain the fundamentals and always maintain an unwavering motherly stance that allows me to lick my beloved child anytime. Ah, in this case, the “stance” refers to the mental aspect rather than the physical one. In other words, it means that I am always prepared to accept my beloved child, regardless of the circumstances. That ultimately represents the boundless love of a mother. Now, to get back on track, as someone who possesses such infinite love, I cannot help but participate in my beloved child’s momentous occasions. Yes, indeed, I understand what you were trying to say. His stall at Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival was already popular, so you’re saying this isn’t the first time he’s setting up a stall. I see, your argument is not incorrect, but I want you to think about it carefully. My beloved child is a supreme existence in each and every moment, and there is never even a split second of the same state. Everything is fresh and everything is shining, and that’s exactly why he’s my beloved child. In other words, my beloved child, who is the light of the world, is always in the spotlight, shining in every moment and in every form. However, I believe that milestones, that turning points are important even within that context. In other words, my beloved child, who is managing a stall like this time, possesses not only the usual loveliness but also the dignity of bearing responsibility. He possess multiple beauties and sacredness, like the moment when a chrysalis turns into a butterfly. By witnessing my beloved child, the love for my beloved child within me also blooms, glittering like a drop of dew on a magnificent flower. And thus, a perfect cycle is formed where my shining love brings even more vitality to my beloved child, and we mutually influence and inspire each other. I dub this the infinite power of love, a power that is crucial for the growth of my beloved child. That’s why, if I truly love my beloved child, as his mother, it is necessary for me to go there myself! But unfortunately l, due to the contract with Shallow Vernal, I am unable to come with my true form, nor am I able to come as Eden, and that is a promise I am unable to break. Well, now that I think about it, during the Symphony Kingdom, I was told not to go as Eden either, and in the end, I couldn’t go...... Well, it can’t be helped. I believe that there should be no obstacles in the path of my beloved child and his mother, but still, when I think about the growth of my beloved child, I understand that some trials are necessary. My Eden self, his mother is unable to come to his stall. It’s like the sadness of a mother not being able to attend her child’s class observation, and such a thought truly saddens me. I’m filled with a strong desire to break the contract and rush to my beloved child’s side. But I’m sure my beloved child doesn’t want me to suffer for his sake. He’s a kind-hearted child. However, as his mother, I still want to watch over my beloved child’s growth, even if he doesn’t realize my presence nearby...... That’s why I’m here, using the alias “Mana”, sending my cheers to my beloved child. Of course, my beloved child doesn’t realize that I am his mother. However, deep down in his soul, he must be able to feel it! Yes, the big bang of my lo————–]","[You’re still acting all brazen!]","[———-OUUUUUUUUCH!? Wait, s- stop with the iron claw! You’ll crush my head!]","After watching Makina, who spoke rapidly with eyes tainted by madness, Alice looked at her with genuine astonishment and swiftly clutched her hand with an iron claw, aiming to crush her head.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Somehow, not too long ago, a flag about further pursuit attacks on the Stomachache Warriors that will deal its damage later on has been erected......]"]},{"number":1580,"title":"Chapter 1580 - Stomachache-Filled Founding Festival 8","paragraphs":["The ceremony for Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival, although there were some troubles, was proceeding smoothly. Megiddo also watched the ceremony quietly, which relieved Lillywood and Magnawell, seeing that she had not caused any additional trouble.","Since it was a ceremony to commemorate the founding of the country, it was like a formal ceremony, and the smooth and refined movements they did without hesitation after repeated practice are highly praised even by Megiddo, garnering considerable praise from everyone.","Amidst all that, Lilia, who was sitting in the VIP seat, had a pained stomach as she thought about what lies ahead, but she wore an expression that seemed to suggest she had overcome a high hurdle.","But right after that, a voice echoed in Lilia’s head.","(Can you hear me, Lilia?)","(......Eden-sama?)","Surprised upon hearing a voice resounding directly in her head, she lightly looked around, but she didn’t find Eden nearby. Even then, Lilia was also a considerably powerful person, so she wasn’t that shaken. She was convinced that a World Creator like Eden would be able to easily do something like this.","(Yes, I am now directly speaking to your mind. You can also respond to me by just thinking about it. Now then, I’ll get straight to the point. You have yet to come to my beloved child’s stall.)","(M- My apologies! A- As expected though, it would be difficult for me to go there during the ceremony because of my position......)","Lilia paled at Eden’s words. Eden is a Creator God who prioritizes Kaito above all else, and she was undoubtedly a dangerous God.","Due to Lilia’s position as a VIP, it was difficult for her to go to where Kaito’s stall is located before the ceremony, and she did plan to visit later but...... it’s hard for her to believe that Eden would take into account the circumstances of the inhabitants of this world.","(No, I’m not blaming you.)","Contrary to Lilia’s expectations though, Eden didn’t seem to be particularly blaming Lilia about this matter.","(I approached you now because, considering the crowded condition of that place, I thought that even after the ceremony, it would be difficult for you to visit. Lilia, I allow you to state your honest opinion. Answer whether or not, taking into consideration your own circumstances, if it would be difficult for you to visit my beloved child’s stall. I assure you that you will not be punished on this matter.)","(Ah, yes. Ummm, i- it is true that after this ceremony, I have to attend a party at the castle, so I can’t say I have much time to spare. I’m sure Her Majesty Chris is aware of the situation and will allow me to leave in the middle of the ceremony, but I’ve drawn a lot of attention to myself because of War King-sama’s earlier action......)","Lilia’s initial assumption was that she would temporarily leave the party and head for Kaito’s stall after receiving permission from Chris, who she had told about her situation in advance.","At that time, Lilia assumed that even when she’s somewhat famous, she isn’t that high-profile, and since attention should be focused on the Supreme Gods and the Six Kings, she thought it wouldn’t be so difficult to get out of the party.","However, the spotlight fell on Lilia’s head because of that incident with Megiddo. Considering that it may be difficult to approach the Supreme Gods or the Six Kings, even if she’s from another country, Lilia is also a noble just like them, making it easier for them to initiate a conversation with her as a noble of Archlesia Empire. That being the case, it was almost certain that many nobles would gather around Lilia at that party.","It is certainly difficult to get out of the party...... but even so, almost all the nobles know about Eden’s terror, so she thought it was possible to get out of the party by explaining the situation. However, even in that case, it was still going to take her more time than her original plan.","(I see, can I take it as it being possible, but it would take you some time?)","(Y- Yes, that is indeed the case. This Founding Festival is very crowded, and due to the large-scale Teleportation Inhibition Barrier in place, it is not possible to use Teleportation Magic to move around, and since I’m not very proficient in Teleportation Magic, disregarding the Inhibition Barrier, attempting teleportation is very difficult for me...... so I will inevitably have to move by foot. Well, not really on foot, as I intend to move through air with Recognition Inhibition Magic, so I think it will not be a problem to some extent...... but I assume I’d only get there by evening.)","Lilia explained the situation as thoroughly as possible. She isn’t sure how much Eden will really understand her situation, but fortunately, she feels like Eden was being relatively considerate this time, so she thought there was a possibility that she would be able to convince Eden if she gave her a detailed account of the situation.","(I understand. I am the one who requested your assistance this time. That being the case, I will help you visit my beloved child’s stall.)","(Help?)","(Yes, I will teleport you to my beloved child. In that case, you should be able to visit within a short period of time.)","(That would be great. Indeed, if I can teleport, it will only take me a short time to slip out of here.)","Finding Eden’s suggestion a welcome one, Lilia was relieved to know that she could have plenty of time to spare. However, her relief was shattered into pieces immediately afterwards.","(I suppose I’ll also have to consider that party. That being the case, to ensure that you won’t have to leave the party, “you could just visit my beloved child now”.)","(———-Huh? Ahh, ummm, Eden-sama!?)","(Well then, give my regards to my beloved child.)","(Please wait a———-)","As Eden’s declaration finally registered in her mind, an expression of despair appeared on Lilia’s face, but before she could tell Eden anything, the action was already taken————- and Lilia Albert, “using a mysterious Teleportation Magic that even the Supreme Gods and the Six Kings cannot detect”, disappeared from the VIP seat at the ceremony together with her chair.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, since she finds it difficult to slip out of the party...... and Lilia is just observing the ceremony right now and has no role whatsoever...... She could just go there now huh...... Does this God not have any human heart at all......]","? ? ? : [Well, she is trying to be considerate...... Her consideration was fatally misplaced though......]"]},{"number":1581,"title":"Chapter 1581 - Stomachache-Filled Founding Festival 9","paragraphs":["Lilia Albert suddenly disappeared from the VIP seat at the Founding Festival ceremony. Some did not notice it because it was instantaneous, but those that did were astonished...... that especially goes with the Supreme Gods and the Six Kings.","[......Lilia disappeared? That’s impossible, I hadn’t felt any flow of magic...... Kuh!]","[Calm down, God of Time and Space. If you think about this for a moment, you’ll know who the culprit is.]","Chronois, who is nearby Lilia, immediately stood up from her chair, thinking that something unforeseen had happened to Lilia and intended to search for her. However, Fate intervened and stopped her.","Thereupon, using her Authority to make sure the common citizens couldn’t hear her words, Fate continued.","[There are only a limited number of people who can use Teleportation Magic at a level we can’t detect at all. First, there’s Shallow Vernal-sama, but there’s no reason for Shallow Vernal-sama to do this. And then, there’s also Underworld King and Shall-tan who could do it if they wanted to, but they also have no reason to do this...... By process of elimination, you should already know who it is, right?]","[...... It’s the Otherworld God huh.]","[Yes. And if that God is the cause, then you should know where she is. Try sensing the location where Kai-chan set his stall.]","[......I see, I can certainly sense Lilia’s magic power over there. In that case, I can be relieved...... No, thinking about the mental burden this would be on Lilia, I can’t quite describe how I feel......]","Sensing that Lilia is relieved, Chronois feels relieved for the time being. However, considering Lilia’s current emotional state, Chronois couldn’t help feeling pity towards her.","With fewer customers due to the ceremony, I take it easy and chat with Amel-san while we tend to the store. The ceremony is probably at its midpoint, right? I don’t know the exact details of what is happening there, but I imagine it will be a rather formal and solemn ceremony.","While I was thinking about that, Lilia-san suddenly appeared in front of me, sitting on a chair.","[ [ ! ? ] ]","Eh? What’s this? What’s going on? Why did Lilia-san suddenly appear, sitting on a chair...... looking as if she’s despairing everything in this world?","[......Lilia-san?]","[......As expected of a high-ranking noble, she makes her entrance while elegantly sitting on her chair...... I think? Can’t say I understand the situation.]","Both Amel-san and I are completely baffled by the situation. After all, Lilia-san, who definitely should be attending the Founding Festival ceremony, is suddenly here, and I have no idea why she is here or the reason behind the extremely sorrowful expression she had on her face.","As I looked at Lilia with this indescribable feeling in mind, she spoke a little later.","[......Why...... Why is this happening...... My stomach hurts...... I don’t wanna imagine what the venue looks like now.]","[U-Ummm? Lilia-san? What in the world is going on?]","[Why? Why is this happening to me...... Wait, thinking about it again, that happening is related to Kaito-san again!!!]","[Uwahh!?]","[Why is it that every single time, something like this happens to me...... I feel like there’s already a hole in my stomach! Heck, it’s quite surprising that a hole still hasn’t opened up in my stomach yet!!!]","[Ah, wait, stop, it hurts...... You’re making me dizzy......]","Lilia-san, who vigorously stood up from her chair, grabbed my collar with teary eyes and shook my body.","She isn’t really trying to attack me, but an important point to note here is that Lilia-san’s strength is on a completely different level from mine. Because of this, my body is slightly lifted, and I’m being shaken in the air with considerable speed, causing my head to feel shaken. Although she’s probably being considerate and holding back to some extent, this is still enough to make me feel dizzy.....","[C- Calm down, Duchess Lilia! I don’t know what happened, but violence isn’t the answer to it! My sworn friend looks like he’s about to faint, so can’t you calm down!?]","[......Eh? Ahh, K- Kaito-san!? A- Are you alright!?]","[S- Stars...... Flickering stars......]","Thankfully, Amel-san stopped her before my consciousness was blown away by her violent shaking, and Lilia-san, who had regained her composure, let go of her hands that were holding my collar, and my body finally landed on the ground.","It’s just, my vision is flickering. It feels like I’ve been made to headbang at super speed, so my head is spinning quite a bit. N- No, well, looking at Lilia-san’s anguished expression, I can’t really complain...... or rather, based on the way she spoke, the fundamental cause of whatever happened to her was me.","However, leaving that aside...... I’ll have to wait a little longer to hear more details......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Only for Lilia was the stomach damage dealt too terrible. As expected of the Strongest Stomachache Warrior, she really is on a different level from the others......]"]},{"number":1582,"title":"Chapter 1582 - Stomachache-Filled Founding Festival 10","paragraphs":["In any case, my eyes, which had been spinning after being shaken violently, recovered and Lilia-san regained her composure, so we decided to ask her about the situation again.","From what I heard, it seems that Lilia-san was observing the ceremony from the VIP seats just as was originally planned, but then Eden-san telepathically called out to her. It appears that Eden-san arranged for Lilia-san to come to my shop during the ceremony so that she wouldn’t have to sneak out for the party after the ceremony.","That is quite...... No, Eden-san probably thought she was being considerate, but just like Shiro-san, her common sense as a World Creator is skewed...... It’s just, as the person herself doesn’t have any ill intention for her actions, it’s difficult for one to complain to her about it.","[......That is quite, well, how should I say this...... It really isn’t my place to be telling you this, but Lilia-san sure got it rough.]","[Yes, I mean, things may be alright at the moment...... but I’m afraid of what will happen after I return to the venue.]","It’s obvious, but the ceremony’s venue is a place where many influential figures of the country gathered, so in order to prevent terrorism and other such threats, they have thoroughly set up various barriers, including Teleportation Inhibition Barriers, and magic tools.","Eden-san being able to easily bypass all of those measures and teleport only Lilia-san to a specific location was just to be expected of her, but it was inevitable that Lilia-san would attract attention upon her return, making her visibly uneasy about it, her stomach seemingly churning in pain.","[......It’s just, Lilia-san, I just have a simple question to ask. What’s the reason why you were teleported here? Well, you know...... Since the accessories that would likely be Eden-san’s purpose have already been handed over to her, there doesn’t seem to be any particular reason to buy anything else, right?]","[About that, well, I’m not entirely sure either. Eden-sama mentioned something about cheering for Kaito-san’s store, so perhaps that was her intention...... If her main purpose was for me to personally visit your stall, then it seems like the goal has already been achieved after coming here, right?]","I had already explained to Lilia-san in advance the products we would be selling at our stall, and putting aside Alice’s party goods, she is familiar with the ceramics and other items I make at my house, and would be able to easily obtain them if she consulted Nebula.","If that’s the case, she really may have simply come to just see me.","[......Speaking of which, how was the ceremony? There were so many people, so we didn’t bother going to the Central Plaza.]","[It’s really rough. Seriously! It’s really rough!!!]","[Eh? T- That much?]","[War King-sama suddenly came out of nowhere and caused quite a commotion.]","[.....................]","I think those few words explain everything. Megiddo-san said it would be alright, but issues really happened huh...... Rather, even though she only intended to meet the others, she went and broke in during the ceremony huh......","[Ahh, speaking of which, War King-sama brought with them Akane-san, whom we met at Maid Olympia before, and another person who also seemed to be an otherworlder, and those two were also unexpectedly scheduled to participate in the ceremony.]","[Akane-san, and the other person would probably be Kaori-san...... Eh? Those two too?]","Seriously, what’s going on? First of all, I have no idea why Megiddo-san brought Akane-san and Kaori-san with her.","Although they had met each other at our stall, they should have separated afterward...... Did they meet again by chance after that?","[......How should I say this...... Things are really chaotic there. Lilia-san, would you like to stay here until the ceremony is over?]","[......That’s a very appealing proposal. Even though I can’t avoid the barrage of questions during the party later, it’s reassuring to know that I won’t worry about drawing strange attention during the ceremony...... However, I also need a good reason......]","[Is telling them I held you back from going back work?]","[It would definitely work.]","If the reason is that I held her back, I don’t think there would be any complaints even if Lilia-san returned late. I’m sure Chris-san and others would probably understand as well, and as for me, I’m told that I’m quite well-known among the nobility, and considering Lilia-san is my lover, I think me asking for my lover’s time to chat with her since she came to visit would somehow work as a reason.","[In that case, please take a rest here for a while. We can temporarily store the ceremony chair in our magic box, so it won’t be visible from the outside within the stall, and since there aren’t many customers......]","[......I guess you’re right. Thank you. Certainly, I’d like some time to calm down a bit, or rather, to prepare myself for the party later on, so I’ll take you up for your word.]","Does Lilia-san not want to return to the ceremony, where she will undoubtedly be the center of attention? After agreeing to my suggestion and storing the chair, she entered the back of the stall, in the same area with me and Amel-san.","The stall was elaborately designed to be relatively large, mostly based on Amel-san’s request, so even with the three of us, there is plenty of space. There are also areas that are not easily visible from the outside.","[...... my sworn friend, Duchess Lilia, I have a question...... How does Duchess Lilia return for the celebrations?]","[......Now that you mentioned it, that is a good question. Lilia-san, what will you do when you return?]","[......I wonder?]","Lilia-san tilted her head in response to Amel-san’s reasonable question, her expression filled with uncertainty.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, Kaito really had no clue about the ceremony-related ruckus, so it’s no wonder why he’ll react like that...... The temperature difference between his place and stomachache side is terrible.]"]},{"number":1583,"title":"Chapter 1583 - Stomachache-Filled Founding Festival 11","paragraphs":["Lilia-san decided to take a break for the time being, and along with Amel-san, we were chatting while tending to the store in a relaxed atmosphere.","While seated on a simple chair I had taken out of my magic box, Lilia-san had an expression of curiosity on her face.","[......So this is what it feels like behind a stall huh. It feels quite fresh and somewhat intriguing.]","[This kind of atmosphere is quite fun, isn’t it?]","Come to think of it, Lilia-san is a former princess and a Duchess, so it’s unlikely for her to personally run a stall like this. Being someone who likely hasn’t even visited a regular stall very often, it’s possible that she finds everything here quite novel and interesting.","[Speaking of which, aren’t you also having a hard time here too, Amel-sama? This being a stall handled by Kaito-san, wouldn’t many famous people have visited here?]","[Fumu? No, the connections my sworn friend has certainly is admirable, but at present...... It’s just the God who Governs Time, the God who Supervises Fate, and the King of the Raging Flames, I think? No, of course I could feel their majesty, but there is a relative amount of space between the times I met them.]","[Right. Other than when Chronois-san and Fate-san initially arrived, and Megiddo-san came later, we’ve been able to relax and take it easy with just a few sporadic customers coming by.]","In fact, this time, it’s probably because I had distributed the accessories to my lovers in advance. And unlike the baby castella stall from before, our stall this time doesn’t deal with food, so the number of customers wasn’t that large.","My impression is that many people checked out our stall out of curiosity, thanks to the attention to detail that Amel-san put into the appearance. Some of the ceramic items are also selling well, so it feels like moderately affluent individuals also came...... but compared to Symphonia’s Founding Festival, the foot traffic is really low here, allowing us to have a relaxed atmosphere.","[......I- I see...... Sounds peaceful. Unlike mine......]","[L- Lilia-san?]","[No, I’m sorry. I’m just feeling a bit overwhelmed thinking about what happens later......]","[Hmmm, I don’t think I can be of much help about that...... Ahh, are you feeling hungry? I have yakisoba and other stuff here if you’d like.]","To cheer up Lilia-san, who seemed melancholic, I took out the yakisoba that I had bought in larger quantities and offered it to her. Lilia-san looked at it with a sense of curiosity, her interest piqued and a spark in her eyes.","Come to think of it, during the beach trip, Alice quickly made yakisoba for Eden-san, but I don’t recall Lilia-san ever having the opportunity to see yakisoba before.","[......Ahh, it’s delicious! Is this a pasta dish from Kaito-san’s world?]","[Something like that. Alice made these, and I think they’re very rare in this world.]","Lilia-san likes grilled skewers and tends to enjoy commoner tastes, so it seems like she really liked the yakisoba, as she happily bundled it up like spaghetti and ate it, a smile appearing on her face.","Well, according to Lilia-san, it’s going to be tough after she returns, so I hope she can relax a little here.","While I was thinking about this, Lilia-san suddenly stopped eating and her expression changed to a serious one, and Amel-san’s expression changed as well.","[My sworn friend, a great magic power is drawing near...... However, what an unusual magic power......]","[Their magic power does feel like that of a monster. Moreover, this amount...... Isn’t this on the level of a Count-rank? However, they had an unusual magic power unlike that of Dragons......]","[Eh? Is that so...... Errr...... Arehh? Isn’t this?]","I am not that proficient in detecting magic power. Unlike Amel-san and Lilia-san, I don’t have the ability to discern someone’s race through magic, but I do have my Sympathy Magic that allows me to expand my detection range. By doing so, I can sense who is approaching. Of course, this is only if the person is someone I am familiar with... And this time, it belongs to someone I knew.","[Kaito-san? Do you have an idea who they are?]","[Yes, I think the reason you two find that magic power unusual...... was probably because it was “the magic power of a Slime”.]","[Slime!? Eh, m- my sworn friend!? By Slime, are you talking about that Slime!? There’s a Slime that possesses this much magic power in the world!?]","I think Amel-san’s surprise is justified. Slimes are known as a harmless and weak monster among monsters. But as far as this one is concerned, they are definitely a Count-rank.","[......Kaito-san, could they be that one you talked about before......]","[Yes, I think it’s Roze-san. I don’t know why Roze-san, who should rarely leave the Forbidden Land, is here though......]","Immediately after I replied to them such words, with the sound resembling a ball bouncing up and down, a familiar Slime livelily bounced our way.","(Kaito-kuuuun! Roze came to visit~~!)","Seeing Roze-san, calling out a cheerful voice...... well, voice from her magic wavelength, Lilia-san...... had this expression that seemed to say “In the end, this is how it turns out huh”.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Here we witness Lilia, drawing to hear a Count-rank whom she had never met in person until now...... No matter how I look at this, the word “stomachache” couldn’t help popping out in my head.]"]},{"number":1584,"title":"Chapter 1584 - Stomachache-Filled Founding Festival 12","paragraphs":["The one who arrived just as Lilia-san was taking a break was Roze-san, the Slime who is the administrator of the Six Kings Dungeon in the Forbidden Lands and a member of Kuro’s family.","[Roze-san, you came. I was surprised, but I’m glad you came to visit.]","(Ehehe~~ Roze wanted to surprise Kaito-kun, so Roze kept it a secret!)","[Are things going to be alright back in the dungeon though?]","(Unnn! Roze knows what’s going on in the dungeon even when Roze is far away after all. Besides, besides, Roze prepared a lot of things for today so that Roze won’t be in danger! Well, Roze is strong, so it’s actually alright even when Roze doesn’t have an escort, but just as Kuromu-sama said, just in case.)","[I’m sure Kuro is worried about Roze-san too...... but escort?]","I understand how Kuro feels. Indeed, Roze-san may be a Count-rank possessing magic power that astonishes Amel-san and Lilia-san, but due to their childlike atmosphere, one just couldn’t help feeling anxious for them. No, if they actually fought, they would probably be incredibly strong, but it’s hard to sense that from their appearance and atmosphere. They just feel more like a Slime with immense magical power.","However, putting their atmosphere aside, I lean forward and look around, but I can’t see anyone other than Roze-san.","(Unnn. Right now, Roze’s body is adorned with numerous Special Magic and Barrier Magic...... Come out~~)","As Roze-san announces this, Roze-san’s shadow spreads out in waves, and a black jester clown appears from within their shadow.","......Isn’t that Luminax...... Moreover, it’s in its Final Phase. If I recall correctly, it was an incredibly dangerous Golem that moved at a speed so fast that even Peak Count-ranks couldn’t perceive, being the strongest Golem in the Six Kings Dungeon aside from Kuro’s Golem.","[......Ummm, Kaito-san? We couldn’t understand what Roze-sama was saying...... but what in the world is that thing with a bizarre magic power?]","[An abyssal jester emerging from the shadows. This dark magic power, possessing jet-black presence as if it was materialized despair...... Somehow, it reminds me of the King of Empty Illusions.]","[Ah, Amel-san got it right. Currently behind Roze-san is Luminax, the Golem modeled after Alice. I’ve heard it’s difficult to operate those Golems out of the Six Kings Dungeon though......]","According to Roze-san, it takes a lot of work to operate the Six King Golem outside of the dungeon. They apparently prepared a lot, applying various Special Magic and Barrier Magic to their own body......","(Unnn, it was rough~~ It took Roze about 10 days to prepare the magic techniques to bring out Luminax just like this time. However, Roze can only take it out for one day.)","[That certainly is inefficient. Well, that just shows how powerful it is...... Arehh? Lilia-san, it just occurred to me...... but Luminax possesses vast amounts of magic power, right?]","[Yes, when it was in the shadows, I couldn’t sense it at all, but it is now emanating tremendous magic power.]","[......This magic power, couldn’t those in the ceremony sense it too?]","A Six King Golem is technically considered a Peak Count-rank...... but as it possesses an exceptionally high amount of magic power, the current Duke-ranks, with a few exceptions, are generally unable to contend against it.","That especially goes with Luminax, as with Alice frequent patches, it had ended up becoming the strongest Golem aside from Cross of the End’s Final Form.","In that case, I thought that the current situation now turned out that a being with such tremendous magic power had suddenly appeared in the Imperial Capital, so I asked Lilia-san about it.","Lilia-san thought about my words for a moment before speaking.","[They would detect it, and the Security Staff would probably be flustered because of the appearance of an unknown being with powerful magic power, but it will be reported to Her Majesty Chris, to which World King-sama or Dragon King-sama will give her an explanation...... Even if that wasn’t the case, since the location of the magic power is here in Kaito-san’s stall...... I don’t think it’d cause much of a commotion, with them just brushing it off as another one of Kaito-san’s antics.]","[......Another one of my antics, I don’t really understand what you mean. I also couldn’t find the appropriate way to react to that.]","[......You have previous records already after all. Kaito-san is just perceived now as a walking anomaly......]","[I don’t really wanna agree to that, but I also couldn’t quite refute......]","I am feeling a bit disgruntled about being called a walking anomaly, but when Lilia-san is the one telling me that, I can’t find the heart to complain. I do feel self-conscious about the things that occurred in the past.","Well, in any case, I’m relieved that it won’t become a big deal...... Ah, no, Chris-san’s stomach might hurt though...... Well, after the Founding Festival, let’s apologize to her just in case.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Even a long-ranged Stomachache Shot won’t miss. So this is a Stomachache Specialist...... It’s probably a disaster for Chris who got hit by a stray bullet though......]"]},{"number":1585,"title":"Chapter 1585 - End of Stomachache Festival 1","paragraphs":["In any case, I briefly explained to Lilia-san and Amel-san about Roze-san and Luminax. As she loves stories about Six Kings Dungeon and the Six King Golems, Amel-san’s eyes lit up.","[Luminax...... Even its name is cool. The design too......]","[......In other words, they’re Copy Golems of the Six Kings back then...... It does possess tremendous magic power befitting it...... M- My stomach hurts.]","On the contrary though, Lilia-san was holding on to her stomach, seemingly enduring a stomachache. Roze-san then put away Uminax, before happily leaping to my shoulder and started bouncing about.","Seeing them seemingly expressing their joy by trembles and vibrations was so cute and soothing to watch.","Thereupon, at that moment, I heard what sounded like fireworks...... This sound resounding...... I suppose that marks the end of the ceremony?","[Amel-san, was that the signal for the end of the ceremony?]","[Yeah, that’s right. The second fanfare signals the end of the ceremony. It doesn’t mean the festivities have ended though, only that the ceremony has been brought to a close.]","[I see...... That means Lilia-san will be returning soon, right?]","[That’s right. Even when the ceremony has ended, there’s still the party...... However, it seems like———– ! ? ]","The ceremony was over, but I still wondered how Lilia-san was going to return, when Lilia-san’s suddenly stopped her words mid-conversation. Somehow, it feels like she’s talking with Eden-san right now.","[......It seems that Eden-sama will be bringing me back as well.]","[Ahh, then you won’t have to worry about being late.]","[Yes, that’s quite fortunate of me...... I feel really reluctant going back through that though......]","Come to think of it, Lilia-san disappeared suddenly using Teleportation Magic in the middle of the ceremony. Well, I have a feeling that the Supreme Gods and the Six Kings understand the situation, but even so, when she returns, she will undoubtedly face various questions. I feel like things would be quite busy during that party.","[......Though I say that, not returning isn’t an option, so I have no choice but to brace myself. Kaito-san, thank you for the delicious yakisoba.]","[No, I’m just glad if you could take some break...... Ah, pieces of aonori seaweed can sometimes get stuck in your teeth when you eat yakisoba, so please make sure to check in the mirror.]","[I understand. The Founding Festival is still going on, so please do your best in your stall.]","After leaving those words with a smile, Lilia-san suddenly disappeared without any warning. No doubt, she was teleported by Eden-san’s Teleportation Magic.","Well, as Lilia-san said, the Founding Festival is still going on, so let’s work on our stall. I also have to introduce my products to Roze-san, who just arrived......","Just as I was thinking all that though, a sense of unease suddenly crossed my mind.","[......Sorry, Alice. I have a question.]","[Yes, yes, what is it?]","[Lilia-san was teleported by Eden-san just now, right?]","[That, she did.]","[......This is obvious, but Eden-san knows that next on Lilia-san’s schedule is to attend the party in the castle, right?]","[I’m sure she does.]","The fireworks that signaled the end of the ceremony went off just a few minutes ago. I believe that at the moment, the attendees such as the Supreme Gods and the Six Kings should still be at the Central Plaza, still moving back to the castle where the party is to take place.","[......Given this situation, where do you think Eden-san would have teleported Lilia-san to?]","[......Indeed. Since the ceremony is already over, it’s highly likely that she would have been transported to her next destination, which is the party venue.]","[......The people who attended the ceremony haven’t arrived at the party venue yet, have they?]","[Pretty sure they haven’t arrived yet. If you ask me, they may be on their way to the party.]","[......In other words, Lilia-san has been teleported to the “party venue where she’s all alone, with the organizers not having arrived yet,” is that correct?]","[Lilia-san sure got herself in a really tricky situation......]","Imagining Lilia-san being alone at the party venue...... surrounded by maids and servers who are preparing and staring at her in astonishment, I can’t help but feel a mix of indescribable emotions.","As I was thinking this, Alice suddenly muttered with a pitying expression on her face.","[......After hearing Kaito-san bring that up, I just thought of something.]","[Unnn?]","[If you reach the level of Eden-san, you can manipulate time and perform teleportation with temporal shifts. So, ummm, even if Lilia-san disappeared here now, the place where Lilia-san was teleported to...... may actually be “the venue just before the party started”.]","[.......................Worst-case scenario?]","[While this is pure speculations, some weird precautions being taken to ensure that there was no waiting time occurred for Lilia-san...... isn’t completely impossible.]","If that were the case, it would result in the sudden appearance of Lilia-san through a mysterious Teleportation Magic just as the distinguished nobles gather and the party is about to begin...... Either case feels like hell.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It says it’s the end of the festival. However, it doesn’t say it’s the end for the stomachaches...... I mean, the Strongest Stomachache Warrior is already taking a nasty hit early on.]"]},{"number":1586,"title":"Chapter 1586 - End of Stomachache Festival 2","paragraphs":["Archlesia Empire, the Imperial Castle’s Great Hall. At the venue of the party held after the Foundation Festival’s ceremony, prominent figures, including the Supreme Gods and the Six Kings, gathered together.","However, Lilia, who disappeared during the ceremony, had not yet returned. Chris had a worried look on her face, but since she couldn’t delay the party, she prepared to give her starting speech.","At that moment, Fate, who was lying on a floating cushion, raised an eyebrow and sat up, seemingly reacting to something.","[......I wonder, is Lili-tan cursed or what?]","[Unnn? God of Fate, what are you———–!?]","Just as Chronois tilted her head in response to Fate’s mutterings, without any magical premonitions, Lilia suddenly appeared at the party venue...... “right next to Emperor Chris, who was about to deliver her opening speech”......","Needless to say, as she was about to give her speech, Chris was currently at the center of attention, and Lilia suddenly appearing right beside her would undoubtedly attract everyone’s attention in the venue.","And sadly for the two, both Chris and Lilia are quick thinkers. Right after Lilia appeared, Chris understood the situation, and Lilia, sensing the attention of the people around her, immediately grasped the situation as well.","However, understanding the situation didn’t change anything, and the two of them exchanged looks of indescribable despair, and they could only turn away and look up to the heavens almost simultaneously.","But right after that, Lilia’s figure disappeared again...... and appeared right next to Fate.","[Ah~~ Sorry, sorry. I intended to teleport you to my side, but my coordinates were a little off~~]","[......No, please don’t worry about it.]","Again, Chris is intelligent. Upon hearing Fate’s apology in a casual tone, she immediately grasped Fate’s intention.","The words Fate said seemed to convey that Lilia’s disappearance during the ceremony was, in a way, because she herself teleported her...... and after Chris’s response, Fate glanced at Chronois, and after a slight nod from Chronois, she spoke up.","[Lilia, I apologize for having you act like a messenger as I pleased. It posed various issues for me, a Supreme God, to leave the ceremony’s venue, but as you have been bestowed with my True Blessing, I saw you fitting to be my substitute. You must have been surprised by the suddenness, aren’t you? I’m sorry about that.]","[ ! ? N- No, being of service to Goddess of Time-sama is an honor beyond measure.]","In fact, Fate and Chronois had anticipated this development to some extent beforehand. Or rather, they had a discussion to prepare a supporting response for Lilia when she returned during the ceremony.","Fate used her Authority of Fate to ensure that everyone present at the party venue could clearly hear Chronois’ current statement.","Chronois prepared an answer that would be difficult to refute before the barrage of questions began. Lilia disappeared during the ceremony because Chronois asked her to act as her substitute, and she smoothly executed the teleportation with the help of Fate, who is a Supreme God capable of bypassing Teleportation Inhibitions.","Lilia seemed to instantly grasp their intentions as well, feeling deeply grateful in her heart as she matched her words with them.","[Apologies, Emperor Archlesia. We’ve caused a slight fuss.]","[No, please don’t worry about it. With this, it seems that all the participants have gathered, so let’s start the party.]","As Chris nodded with a somewhat relieved expression, she began her opening speech for the party. In the midst of that, adjusting her voice so that it wouldn’t be heard by those around, Fate spoke to Lilia.","[Well, that was a disaster, wasn’t it, Lili-tan? Anyway, you should stay with us for a while after the party starts. If you stay with us, other nobles won’t be able to talk to you, right? Well, you can’t exactly stick with us all the time though, so I guess we’ll split up after the atmosphere at the party calms down to some extent.]","[She’s right. Indeed, that way we can prevent a crowd from gathering around Lilia right after the start. If it’s a little while after the conversations have started, you should be able to handle the sporadic questions as they come up. I feel like dealing with those would still be rough though......]","[No, I’m truly grateful from the bottom of my heart. Fate-sama, Chronois-sama...... Thanks to you two, I feel really at ease.]","Indeed, if they take precautions for the time right after the party starts, they can prevent a situation where everyone simultaneously gathers around Lilia.","Feeling relieved that the worst-case scenario was avoided, but still considering the challenges that lay ahead, Lilia gently placed her hand on her stomach.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ahh~~ I see...... Looking at it from the perspective of regular nobles, the difference in power is so vast that they wouldn’t realize Eden was the one who teleported Lilia. However, if they hear that it was done by a Supreme God, they would likely be satisfied and find it plausible. Considering Lilia has received Chronois’ True Blessing and is known to have a deep connection with the God Realm, her interactions with the God Realm are likely to be known as well...... Fate really has grown remarkably.]"]},{"number":1587,"title":"Chapter 1587 - End of Stomachache Festival 3","paragraphs":["After Lilia-san left, I continued talking with Amel-san and Roze-san at the stall. It seems that Roze-san originally came to visit my stall out of curiosity, and they don’t have much interest in the Foundation Festival itself. After browsing through the products at my stall and making a few purchases, they playfully climbed onto my shoulder and swayed their body, seemingly enjoying themselves.","(Roze, you see, loves this kind of festive atmosphere~~)","[I like it a lot too. Amel-san, Roze-san seems to like the festive atmosphere, how about you, Amel-san?]","[Being a Winged, I’m easily misunderstood, but I like this atmosphere too. This world in which I alone dances, merely observing the people gathering at the festival has changed. Even watching the scenery flow within a small box can be a delightful experience.]","(......World? Box?)","[Amel-san is a Winged, a species that were enclosed from others, but she seems to like the atmosphere of festivals. However, it seems that Amel-san finds the experience fresh compared to when she simply participated in the festival or ran a stall like this.]","(Fumu fumu.)","Whoa there, this might be quite challenging, isn’t it? First of all, Amel-san cannot read Roze-san’s magic wavelength as a language. Therefore, I, who can recognize the magic wavelength as a language thanks to Shiro-san’s blessing and my Sympathy Magic, have to interpret for her.","And since Roze-san also couldn’t understand the meaning of Amel-san’s chuuni phrases, it’s necessary for me to interpret for her.","In other words, in order for these two to have a conversation, I have to step in between them and interpret each time, which is quite a hassle.","A solution would be for Amel-san to speak plainly, so I would only have to translate Roze-san’s words...... but well, Amel-san seems reluctant to reveal her true self, so I don’t think she’d willingly do that. Besides, the effort required for interpretation isn’t that much, so I’ll just take it easy and enjoy translating for the two while having a conversation with both of them.","In a luxurious room in the Imperial Castle, different from where the party is being held, Kaori and Akane looked nervous.","[......How did this happen?]","[I can only say we had bad luck...... but it’s a good thing we didn’t have to attend the party. That party filled with nobles isn’t comfortable both for my mind and my stomach.]","[Akane-san, isn’t this a chance for you to get customers?]","[Our trading company isn’t aimed for the wealthy. Yeah, we may be able to expand our sales channels, but it won’t be that much~~ Basically, we are a type of trading company that handles wholesale deals, rather than handling expensive items.]","Though they were drawn into the festival due to Megiddo bringing them along with her, thanks to Chris’ consideration, the two of them didn’t participate in the palace party. Instead, they were able to take a break in a separate room.","Ideally, it would have been best for them if they could return after the ceremony. However, considering that Kaori coincidentally had a reunion with Chris, it felt like a missed opportunity to leave without even talking.","Of course, Chris being the Emperor couldn’t immediately make time to talk, so they agreed to do so after the party. Both of them had unintentionally drawn attention during the ceremony, and they were mentally exhausted, so they gratefully accepted Chris’ kindness and took a break in a separate room.","[Even so, Kaito sure is the type of person who influences those around him...... No, seriously, if we hadn’t found Kaito’s shop there and hadn’t coincidentally met War King-sama at that moment, this development wouldn’t have happened.]","[Seriously, what a stomach-churning boy he is...... However, I’m honestly glad I got to meet Chris, and it’s not like he intentionally did anything, so I can’t really complain.]","[Hmm, guess you’re right. From my perspective, our trading company has gained prestige, and considering that we were able to meet War King-sama, we’ve got significant positives. However,that doesn’t change the fact that my head and stomach hurts......]","In fact, Kaito’s influence is tremendous, but in the end, it generally turns out positively for those swept away by it. The same goes for Lilia, there is a high possibility that her connections with the aristocrats of the Arcresia Empire will increase due to this incident, and the advantages for her Duchy are significant.","The same also goes for Chris, as despite the unexpected incidents, the ceremony has become unprecedentedly high-profile with three Supreme Gods and three of the Six Kings in attendance. There’s also a high possibility of the overall prosperity of Archlesia Empire improving.","Yes, in a way, thanks to Kaito, numerous people have received tremendous benefits...... that is, only in exchange for stomachaches......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The contrast between the atmosphere of the Stomachache Warriors and Kaito remains as usual...... And indeed, in exchange for stomachaches, significant benefits have been granted...... It’s just, this is the type in which you exchange your stomach for profits......]","The manga’s Volume 8 will be released on July 25th. Here’s its cover image.","<img 2020=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-100961 size-full\" wp-content=\"\" uploads=\"\" 05=\"\" grrc23tachnwe32nf9688mq4m0t9_14ia_9r_dw_1187.jpg\"=\"\" alt=\"\" width=\"351\" height=\"500\" grrc23tachnwe32nf9688mq4m0t9_14ia_9r_dw_1187.jpg=\"\" 351w,=\"\" grrc23tachnwe32nf9688mq4m0t9_14ia_9r_dw_1187-211x300.jpg=\"\" 211w,=\"\" grrc23tachnwe32nf9688mq4m0t9_14ia_9r_dw_1187-75x106.jpg=\"\" 75w\"=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 351px) 100vw, 351px\">"]},{"number":1588,"title":"Chapter 1588 - End of Stomachache Festival 4","paragraphs":["Lillywood, at the venue where the Founding Festival party was being held, was relieved to see that the event was finally over.","“For a moment, I was worried about how things would turn out, but Lilia-san returned safely and Fate and the others followed up for her nicely, so things were brought to a close peacefully.”","[Umu. I also felt flustered during the ceremony, but fortunately, it didn’t turn into a major commotion.]","[Good grief, you guys worry too much.]","“..................”","[Hold yourself back, Lillywood. I know how you feel but......]","As Megiddo casually announced while drinking, Lillywood gave a look that seemed to say “You’re also among those who caused a commotion”, her expression filled with killing intent that was completely unexpected from her usual gentle demeanor, Magnawell restrained her.","While the three Kings were having such a conversation, a palace servant approached them and spoke in a voice inaudible to those around them.","[Seriously, you sure don’t think much, Gorilla-san.]","[Ahhn? If it isn’t Shalltear...... The heck are you doing here?]","[Well~~ I had secretly infiltrated with my clone, thinking I would provide support if Lilia-san seemed to be in trouble, but it turned out there was no need for it.]","Alice, having considered the possibility of Lilia being forcibly teleported by Eden to the venue at a strange moment, had disguised herself as a servant and infiltrated the venue so that she could provide support if needed during her conversation with Kaito.","But then, thanks to Fate’s prompt actions, there was no need for her to take action, so she approached the three of them for a different matter.","[Well, in that case, I’ll just relieve Lillywood-san and Magnawell-san’s frustration.]","[Ahhn?]","[This is a message from Kuro-san. She said she will come and scold Megiddo-san here at the castle later, so please wait there and don’t run away.]","[......Y- You...... You snitched to Kuromueina......]","In response to the words Alice said with a grin, Megiddo murmured with a pale expression on her face, unlike the cheerful demeanor she had before. Kuromueina was the only person in this world who she couldn’t stand up against, and just thinking about the scolding that awaited her made her want to bury her head in her hands.","“......Shalltear, wonderful job.”","[Umu. At the very least, brace yourself for a stern scolding, Megiddo...... Since you’ll be attending Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival later, it’s about time you learn some manners.]","[Gununu......]","As Alice had said, it seemed that Lillywood and Magnawell felt a bit relieved, and smiles appeared on their faces.","Meanwhile, at a place far away from where the Six Kings were, the three Human Realm Rulers gathered and talked.","[Good gracious, that was quite the disaster, young Chris...... However, for Archlesia Empire, this seems to have been a significant plus, and I can’t help but envy you.]","[You’re right. Although my stomach hurts... Considering the economic effects and other factors from this incident, this is something I’m actually somewhat grateful. Especially with the Supreme Gods participating, it left an impression that Archlesia Empire has deep connections with the God Realm.]","[In that sense, it sounds like Symphonia Kingdom has a close relationship with the Six Kings...... Well, I suppose it’s not the time to make sarcastic remarks about this particular incident.]","With a light sigh, Chris lets out a small sigh, causing Ryze to involuntarily smile wryly. Ryze also went through a lot during the previous National Foundation Festival, and with Kaito living in the capital, he frequently experiences stomachaches. Understanding this, even though they usually exchange sarcastic remarks, he couldn’t help but show a sympathetic look towards Chris.","[Mhmm, but with Archlesia’s festival after Symphonia’s being like this, how is our Hydra Kingdom going to celebrate our Founding Festival. Overcoming this insurmountable hurdle...... Isn’t it impossible!? Our Founding Festival is already coming next month, and we can’t organize an event as grand as having all the Six Kings or all the Supreme Gods attend at this point......]","[Indeed, with the current flow of things, there will be many who will be wondering how it will be like for Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival.]","[Haahhh...... I wish Kaito would also come and set up a booth at our Hydra. If that happens, you know, something interesting might occur, don’t you think?]","[Indeed, something might happen, but it’s not like you can ask Miyama-kun to set up that stall, and if something really were to happen, Her Majesty Laguna might also get a stomachache.]","[Mnghhh.]","With Symphonia Kingdom and Archlesia Empire showcasing such lively celebrations for their Founding Festivals, as the ruler of one of three countries in Human Realm, Laguna has the desire to avoid falling behind in terms of attention and prominence.","However, Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival is relatively close to that of the Archlesia Empire’s, with only about a one-month difference between them. The list of attendees has already been finalized, and the application for stalls has been closed.","However, if she doesn’t take some action now, her country will fall significantly behind the other two countries, so Laguna crossed her arms and groaned with a difficult expression on her face.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Is it just my imagination? I feel like a new stomachache flag had just been raised somewhere.]"]},{"number":1589,"title":"Chapter 1589 - End of Stomachache Festival 5","paragraphs":["Roze-san stayed and helped out in the stall for a while before leaving after about an hour. After that, Amel-san and I just took it easy, and things were going very well, with nothing unusual happening.","The stall’s sales are doing well, with a moderate number of customers, neither too busy nor too slow. Even the chuuni goods are selling due to their novelty, while surprisingly, the sales of the ceramics have also been good. I thought our pricing was too high for a festival stall but...... I just couldn’t understand why.","[Heck, I wonder why all these people are dutifully buying only one set of the ceramics?]","[Indeed, that was a question I had as well. Although I could understand those lot who pooled their money and purchased a set as a group, they don’t seem interested in obtaining multiple lustrous items. How puzzling. Could it be that there’s a mysterious agreement in place for this festival?]","[An agreement that allows purchasing only a set of ceramics? Ahaha, that’s certainly an unusual agreement.]","[As expected, I may have jumped to conclusions too quickly. That aside, it’s a good thing that things are going well, and the end of the festival is not far away. The relics of darkness may not hold any limits, but as for our other items, we may have to reconsult with their origin.]","Just as Amel-san said, the inventory for chuuni goods was quite a lot, so it should be impossible for us to sell all of them, but the remaining quantity of ceramics and accessories is getting low, so we’d likely sell out before the festival ends.","However, as the ceramics and accessories decrease, the storefront is starting to feel a bit lonely.","[With gaps between our items becoming noticeable, the overall appearance of our stall doesn’t look good, don’t you think?]","[Indeed, empty spaces do give one a feeling of emptiness.]","[Ahh, then, why don’t we put up some of my weapons? I have a surplus of those weapons that Aoi-san and Hina-san didn’t buy......]","[.....Well, I guess that’s fine. Don’t put out something that’s too big though.]","To be honest, having party goods, pottery, accessories, and weapons all displayed in a single stall felt strange. However, once I became conscious of those empty spaces, I couldn’t help but want to fill them with something, so I decided to go along with Alice’s suggestion and arrange the weapons on display.","Though I say that, there really weren’t that many weapons added to the stall. They were just mostly knives, with a few swords on display.","After a few while after we laid out weapons for the time being, a pair of customers arrived and started looking at the weapons. A somewhat mage-like woman and a red-haired swordsman...... From the atmosphere around them, they seemed to be adventurers.","[......It looks like a very nice sword at a quick glance......]","[Ehh~~ But doesn’t it look more suspicious like that? We’re talking about a sword being sold in a festival stall, you know?]","[No, but I really have this good feeling about it...... Excuse me, you mind if I unsheathe this for a sec?]","[Ah, yes. I don’t mind, but please be mindful of your surroundings.]","The red-haired man asked me, to which I replied it was fine. Thereupon, the red-haired man, looking used to handling a sword, unsheathed the sword and gazed at the blade.","[Look, Nicole. It really is an amazing sword!]","[......H- Hmmm. It really does look nice and well-made. I mean, it even looks much better than the sword you’re using now, Leo.]","[Right? This is a lucky find!!!]","[......However, that makes me wonder more why such a high quality sword would be in a stall at a festival......]","The man and woman are whispering to each other, but I can’t make out the content of their conversation. From what I sense with my Sympathy Magic, the woman seems to be puzzled.","Hmmm, displaying weapons along with our lineup of items must be quite suspicious huh?","[......Ummm, how much is this?]","[That would be 5 copper coins.]","I answered the woman’s price inquiry. The pricing is set by Alice and is generally the same as the prices when the weapons are sold in my underground weapon shop back home. The sword that the red-haired man is currently holding is among the lowest quality among Alice’s weapons, and according to the person herself, they’re “draft swords made from leftover materials of other swords”, so it’s priced at around 50,000 yen.","[......See that, it really is suspicious! There’s no way a high-quality sword would be sold for just 5 copper coins! There definitely must be some kind of catch to it!]","[No, no, couldn’t these just be leftovers being sold? Besides, from the looks of it, there’s no magic casted on it, right?]","[From what I can tell, that is.]","[Then, it will be alright. You’re the magician I trust the most after all.]","[......Idiot.]","The two started whispering amongst themselves again, but the man finally ended up buying the sword. As we watched the backs of the departing pair, Amel-san suddenly murmured quietly.","[......Hmmm, I feel like I’ve seen that swordsman somewhere. Where have I seen him again?]","[Unnn? Is he a famous adventurer?]","[Hmmm, no, it might just be my imagination. I felt like I recognized him, but I haven’t interacted with adventurers at all, so I’m probably just mistak———- Hrnn!? It seems I was a bit confused by a temporary illusion. Don’t mind me.]","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Just like Amel, I feel like I’ve seen him somewhere......]","? ? ? : [Fourteenth in line of the succession to the throne, the Prince and his partner, appearing in Chapter 510: Rejected Content 3.]","Serious-senpai : [Ahh! Come to think of it, that guy exists......]"]},{"number":1590,"title":"Chapter 1590 - End of Stomachache Festival 6","paragraphs":["The sun has set, and most of the products at our stall have been sold. Somehow, the weapons sold well, and despite preparing a large quantity of chuuni goods, we ended up selling a relatively large amount of them, so it might be considered a great success for our stall.","While I was thinking about this, I suddenly heard the sound of fireworks.","[......Ohh, those fireworks......]","[The fanfares announcing the end of the festival. With this, the Founding Festival has come to a close. Nevertheless, there are no clear limitations imposed on the shimmering stars. Those who wish to shine brightly will continue to do so for a while longer.]","[I see.]","The fireworks marked the end of the Founding Festival celebrations, but there are no restrictions on when stalls can close, so many will be open for a while.","We were also not restricted and I have my Teleportation Magic Tool, but there isn’t really any need for us to keep the stall open until too late. Most of our products have been sold, so it’s about time to close up the shop, right?","As I was thinking about this, Amel-san spoke with a slightly embarrassed expression on her face.","[Ahh, errr...... my sworn friend. Thank you for going along with my selfishness today. Thanks to you, I had a very enjoyable day.]","[No, no, it was fun for me too. I had a more relaxing and enjoyable time than that time I opened a stall at Symphonia Kingdom, so I’m rather glad you invited me.]","[I’m glad to hear that.]","Unlike her usual chuuni-style way of speaking, Amel spoke in a natural tone, a shy smile on her lips.","[......I’ve been wanting to try out running my own stall. However, I’m a Winged after all. Except for the few who held the role of setting up our tribe’s stall, us Wingeds don’t run stalls, and we rarely attend the Founding Festival.]","[I guess you must have a lot of restrictions on the interactions you can have with other species huh.]","[Unnn. Besides, I am a Special Individual. I do receive special treatment among the Wingeds...... but that special treatment was also the reason I’ve never had the experience of playing with friends either.]","I heard various things about how the Wingeds is a closed-off species, but among that species that tend to stick with their own kind, Amel-san is a Special Individual, making her special both in a positive and negative sense.","Perhaps, Amel-san’s strange way of speaking may be a manifestation of her desire for attention towards oneself.","[However, I’m glad I could meet with my sworn friend! Since my sworn friend has the blessing of Shallow Vernal-sama, I don’t receive any complaints from my fellow tribe members even when I hang out with my sworn friend, but on the contrary, I was even encouraged to become closer to you! I’m happy that there’s no need for me to hesitate to meet and hang out with my sworn friend.]","[......Let’s play together sometime again. Joining events like this is fun, but going somewhere and playing games is also enjoyable.]","[Unnn. Ehehe, I’m looking forward to it...... Oops, erhem. In a way, one could say a new covenant has been established.]","[Ahaha, I guess so.]","I couldn’t help smiling seeing Amel-san intentionally changing her tone. When I first met her, I thought she was a lively person... Well, she certainly has quite the personality...... but deep down, she has a more childlike nature than her actual age. She genuinely enjoys playing with friends and has an easy-to-talk-to, straightforward personality.","Considering their circumstances, I guess one could say Amel-san shares some similarities with Isis-san. In any case, if my presence is a good thing for Amel-san, I’m happy about it, and I hope we can continue to be good friends from now on.","While thinking about such things, the sound of fireworks I couldn’t see from our position resounded. The fireworks, which continued for a while, eventually stopped, and the Founding Festival came to an end.","But well, that doesn’t mean the atmosphere around here won’t change right away. Especially since this area is quiet with not many people passing by......","For the time being, I guess it’s about time we pack up our stall.","[......It seems like your stall is still open.]","[Welco——— Huh?]","[ ! ? ! ? ! ? ]","Just as I was reflexively responding to the voice I heard, I stiffened. Beside me, Amel-san had an expression of heartfelt astonishment, and I can painfully understand what she’s feeling.","[......Eh? Why? I thought you weren’t coming...... Shiro-san?]","[I said I wouldn’t attend the Founding Festival. However, the fireworks earlier marked the end of Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival. Therefore, I see no problem with me at this moment, which isn’t within the scope of the Founding Festival.]","[No.................. I think there’s a big problem......]","Indeed, she hadn’t come to attend the Founding Festival. Right now, the festival has already ended, and Shiro-san only visited Archlesia Empire’s Capital...... She certainly hadn’t gone back on what she declared.","However, there is one significant problem... Even if things are peaceful at the moment, the mere fact that Shiro-san has come to the Human Realm is a major issue...... I feel like Chronois-san and the others were probably panicking by now.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Just when I thought she’s being quiet, she seriously came up with such sophistry!? The title did say that Stomachache Festival had ended...... but I guess the stomachaches still hadn’t ended huh.]"]},{"number":1591,"title":"Chapter 1591 - End of Stomachache Festival 7","paragraphs":["Alongside the fireworks that marked the end of the festival comes the conclusion of the party at Archlesia Empire’s Imperial Castle.","Although there were some troubles, such as War King Megiddo’s sudden intrusion, and Lilia being teleported, the party had progressed rather steadily since then and had come to an end without incident.","As they had expected, Lilia was bombarded with questions from various nobles, but despite looking fatigued, she had grown accustomed to sudden attention like this ever since she received Chronois’s temporary blessing. Fortunately or unfortunately, she was able to handle the situation without any problems.","Emperor Chris was also relieved that she had somehow managed to get through the Founding Festival without incident, and a smile of relief was on her lips.","However, in the midst of such an atmosphere, Fate’s expression, which had remained relaxed up to this point, changed drastically. Fate, who had been nonchalant even when the War King appeared and when Lilia disappeared, now clearly looked flustered.","[......G- God of Time and Space! T- This is bad......]","[O- Oi, what’s with you, God of Fa——— This is!? C- Could it be......]","[There’s no mistaking it. Shallow Vernal-sama had...... W- Why?]","Chronois, who looked puzzled seeing the flustered Fate, and Life, who was sleeping with her eyes closed, both realized the reason why Fate was flustered one beat later.","Yes, it was because they had detected the arrival of their absolute master, Shallow Vernal.","[What’s the meaning of this, God of Time and Space!? Shallow Vernal-sama is currently......]","[Y- Yeah, she definitely stated that she won’t be attending the Founding Festival. How come Shallow Vernal-sama acted contrary to her own statement......]","[......It’s over.]","[ [ Eh? ] ]","Hearing Life questioning her with a flustered expression on her face, Chronois gave her response with an equally bewildered look. The degree of flusteredness from the Supreme Gods was evident to those around, causing the Six Kings and Chris to involuntarily hold their breath at the sudden turn of events.","At that moment, Fate seemed to have realized something and muttered with a pale expression on her face.","[After the fireworks, the Founding Festival ends.]","[Wha!? So that’s how it is...... This is bad, if Shallow Vernal-sama comes here, it will cause a commotion unlike that time with the War King......]","[In any case, I will go to the scene! I will use my authority to keep the surrounding people away and prevent anyone from getting close to that area.]","[I’ll leave that to you, God of Fate! I will immediately contact the God Realm and send reinforcements...... God of Time and Space! I entrust this place to you!]","[Y- Yeah, I know.]","The actions of the Supreme Gods were swift. Fate immediately informed others that she was heading to the scene and disappeared using teleportation, while Life returned to the God Realm once to summon subordinate High -ranking and Low-ranking Gods.","[......G- Goddess of Time-sama......]","[Sorry, Emperor Archlesia. This is an emergency. For now, wait inside the venue and do not go outside. If news spreads that Shallow Vernal-sama is here, it could cause tremendous chaos.]","[U- Understood. I will ensure that those currently in the castle are strictly instructed not to leave the castle and do not make contact with the outside.]","Shallow Vernal is a goddess revered throughout the world. There are an incredible number of believers who wish to catch a glimpse or offer prayers to her. This situation is completely different from when the Supreme Gods and the Six Kings are present. Even during the Festival of Heroes, there are only limited opportunities to see Shallow Vernal, as she appears for only a brief moment on the final day. It wouldn’t be surprising if everyone currently in the Imperial Capital moved en masse towards the area where Shallow Vernal is said to be, aiming for the Kaito’s stall.","If that happens, it would be inevitable for panic to ensue. That’s precisely why Fate acted immediately and moved to seal off the area. If they can contain the spread of information there, they can at least prevent the situation from escalating into a commotion...... If there were already witnesses who saw Shallow Vernal appear and they managed to inform others before Fate’s arrival though, it would be troublesome.","In any case, there is a need for an urgent response. Soon after receiving Life’s request, powerful High-ranking Gods specializing in Information Concealment, such as the God of Thoughts, gathered to start handling the situation.","For the time being, the biggest concern of a large commotion occurring has been averted...... but the problem lies in what Shallow Vernal will do next.","It’s the most obvious thing in the world, but Shallow Vernal is an absolute being for the Gods, and if she were to express a desire to visit and see the surrounding stalls, there would be no way they’ll stop her. Rather, in the first place, there are few beings like Kuromueina and Kaito who can restrain Shallow Vernal’s actions.","[......Chronois-sama, what do you think would happen after this?]","[Since the Underworld King is not present, the only one who could possibly voice their opinion to Shallow Vernal-sama is Miyama. We can only hope that Miyama can somehow persuade Shallow Vernal-sama to go back as soon as possible.]","In response to Lilia’s question, Chronois could only reply such with an indescribable expression on her face. Faced with a scenario where even the Supreme God Chronois could only hope that Kaito would somehow do something about it, Lilia and Chris, who were listening nearby, held both of their stomachs.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As expected of the Last Boss. Her Stomachache Power is on a different level......]"]},{"number":1592,"title":"Chapter 1592 - End of Stomachache Festival 8","paragraphs":["Unexpectedly, right at the very end of the day, Shiro-san had suddenly come to visit...... I see, she really is just like a Last Boss she claimed herself to be. Leaving those unimportant thoughts aside...... Isn’t this quite a big deal!?","As I thought that, I glanced to the side and saw Amel-san, who before I knew it, had assumed a prayer pose on both knees, the same one Lilia-san taught me when I first met Chronois-san.","When I cast my gaze around, I noticed that the Dwarven vendors at the nearby stalls and the festival participants had all assumed the same posture, quietly and solemnly praying.","I suppose even casually speaking in the presence of the world’s Creator God, Shiro-san, may be regarded as disrespectful. As a result, the area around us became unusually quiet, as if the festive commotion had been nothing but a lie.","[.....Ahh, errr...... Shiro-san. I’ll confirm this just in case, but what are you here for?]","[Shopping, I suppose.]","[......To be more specific, what are you shopping for?]","[I dunno?]","[You don’t know......]","The airheaded way Shiro-san tilted her head in wonder when asked about her purpose, all while stubbornly sticking to their far-fetched logic, is truly just like her.","But seriously, I wonder what Shiro-san came here for? I mean, all the merchandise has already been sold out, and it’s hard to imagine Shiro-san wanting any of the chuuni goods. I even gave them the accessories I made in advance...... I can’t figure out what she’s after.","[It’s not like I’m particularly looking for anything. I simply wanted to engage in the act of shopping at Kaito-san’s stall......]","[Fumu?]","[Back in Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival, I didn’t come to Kaito-san’s stall...... even though Kuro went.]","[...................]","[I had received the baby castella you made , but we haven’t had a purchase exchange at your stall...... even though Kuro did.]","[............Ah, yes.]","Doesn’t she look quite dissatisfied there!? Well, now that she mentioned it, Kuro did come directly when I set up a stall back in Symphonia...... Shiro-san did have quite a sense of rivalry when it comes to Kuro, so she was probably dissatisfied with how only Kuro got to go shopping at my stall.","[Ahh~~ Then, I hadn’t intended to put all of these in our stall, but we still have teacups with our brand mark on them, so would you like them?]","[I’ll have that then.]","[Understood...... Here you go.]","Since Shiro-san often drinks tea, she should have many opportunities to use teacups, so I suggested that to her, to which she seemed to show no particular objections and appeared to be fine with it.","Well, it seems that Shiro-san simply wanted to engage in the act of shopping at my stall, and she doesn’t have particular preferences regarding the items they purchase, so she’d likely be fine with anything.","[Well then, keep the change.]","[Hold on a moment there, Shiro-san, that’s just strange. You don’t go “Keep the change” when you’re presenting to me a bag jingling with coins. How much is even in this bag?]","[A hundred white gold coins.]","[That’s way too much!]","[Keep the change.]","Why the heck is this God giving a billion yen for a teacup set!? Moreover, she probably created this money...... Is money really something one can just create? No, I guess rules like that don’t apply to Shiro-san huh...... Shiro-san is the rule of this world itself, and if she just says they’re white, then crows are white. No, I’m not talking metaphorically, as crows would seriously turn white, and the world would recognize them as white birds.","Being an absolute being in this world, it’s probably alright for Shiro-san to do it. I guess the only one who would even think of complaining to her about doing something like this is Kuro......","[By the way, Kaito-san, I’d like to confirm something...... Did Kuro come to this stall?]","[Eh? Kuro didn’t come. She isn’t planning to come either......]","[I see......]","Ahh, she looks really proud now. Frankly speaking, she even looks pretty smug about it...... I’m sure this is something she’ll brag to Kuro the next time they drink tea together, to which they’ll probably end up fighting again.","As I was pondering over such matters, Shiro-san made the teacup she had received disappear before continuing.","[Well then, I’ve fulfilled my purpose here, so I’m going back.]","[Ah, yes. Thank you.]","[Hmm, please do your best with your stall, Kaito-san.]","[......Thank you. Errr, even when I said all that, I’m really glad you came to visit, Shiro-san.]","[Fufu......]","We were about to go close up our stall though...... Well, whatever. She probably just wanted to have such an exchange too.","Besides, well, I’m honestly happy that Shiro-san came all the way here. No, considering the circumstances around our stall and the current condition Chris-san’s stomach probably is in, I do have some complicated feelings, but I am glad that Shiro-san came.","As I was thinking that, I heard the sound of another fireworks going off in the sky, even though the fireworks should have already ended. However, upon seeing gigantic “DOYA” up in the night sky, I quickly turned to Shiro-san, seeing a smile on her lips as she vanished from sight.","Stop that...... Stop with the Doya Fireworks...... Yeah, Chris-san and the others are likely holding their stomachs by now.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [No, Chris certainly is already like that, but by her voluntarily going back, the desperate measures of the Supreme Gods were also brought to naught...... In a way, I guess you could say this is truly just like her.]"]},{"number":1593,"title":"Chapter 1593 - End of Stomachache Festival 9","paragraphs":["Just as Shiro-san suddenly arrived, Shiro-san also suddenly set off fireworks on her way back. Well, putting that aside...... I have a feeling Chris-san and the others are considerably worrying about that mysterious firework forming into otherworld letters, but for the time being, there’s no way for me, who is over here, to assess the situation on that side, so I will just leave it at that.","Just when I thought that Shiro-san left and things are now settled...... Fate-san suddenly appeared in front of me.","[.....Eh? She went back!?]","[Shiro-san? Yes, she already went back home.]","Although Fate-san was unusually flustered that she hadn’t even spoken who she was talking about, it was needless for me to think who she was referring to.","When I told her that Shiro-san already left, Fate-san’s tense expression relaxed and seemingly deflating, she collapsed on a suddenly appearing floating cushion.","[Haahhh~~ Well, I’m glad but...... I, uhhh, rushed here, you know......]","[Ahh, after you sensed the moment Shiro-san appeared?]","[Unnn. I really rushed here. We knew that if Shallow Vernal-sama appeared here, it would cause a huge commotion, so I used my Authority of Fate to quickly prevent people from reaching this area and manipulated people’s memories to ensure that what happened here wouldn’t spread...... After needing to consider various things, I kinda feel mentally drained...... Well, at least things turned out well.]","I see, I think I can guess the general situation. The Supreme Gods probably sensed Shiro-san’s magic power and went into a frenzy at the party venue.","When Shiro-san comes to the Human Realm or the Demon Realm, it’s almost always with all Gods, so Fate-san probably rushed to the scene in an attempt to respond quickly.","Perhaps, just like that time when I first met her, Fate-san came to use her Authority of Fate to keep people at a distance...... Well, Fate-san came all prepared for that purpose, but Shiro-san returned immediately, and considering how this actually leads to the best result, she’s probably having complex feelings right now.","[Haahhh~~ I’m mentally exhausted...... Kai-chan, hug me, pet me...... pamper me.]","[......I don’t know what you’re demanding me that for...... Yes, yes. Like this?]","[Haahhh~~ I’m feeling healed~~]","Fate-san swiftly moved from the front of the shop to the back and hugged me, so I lightly embraced her as requested and gently stroked her head. Perhaps due to mental fatigue, she seemed to enter a state of rest for a while. Somehow, a somewhat relaxed atmosphere suddenly appeared around us, and I couldn’t help smiling wryly.","At the venue where the Founding Festival party was being held, Chronois, with a serious expression on her face, was looking out the window at the sky.","[......The symbols from before...... I often saw Shallow Vernal-sama use those, so those fireworks must be done by Shallow Vernal-sama.]","[I heard from Kaito-san that those were otherworld letters, and Shallow Vernal-sama apparently uses them when she’s in a relatively good mood......]","[Fumu, in that case, we can take it as Shallow Vernal-sama satisfied for the time being.]","After hearing Chronois’ muttering, Lilia added some explanations, and upon hearing those words, Chronois looked relieved. At the very least, it seemed that the situation didn’t turn into one where they had upset Shallow Vernal’s mood......","Well, with the mysterious fireworks going off in the sky above the Imperial Capital, Chris looked as if she was about to faint......","As Chronois and Lilia exchanged such a conversation, Life came up to them.","[God of Time and Space. For the time being, I told God of Thoughts that there’s no longer any need for them to come this way.]","[Yeah...... Even so, I couldn’t understand the situation. It is certain that Shallow Vernal-sama returned, but the circumstances surrounding her return remain a mystery. Perhaps Miyama was able to persuade her successfully?]","[It seems like God of Fate has yet to return.]","[I can sense her magic power in the location of Miyama’s stall, so she’s probably confirming the situation over there. She should return once she confirms the situation, so if God of Fate says that there’s no problem anymore, we can lift the blockade here.]","For the time being, with Shallow Vernal’s departure, the atmosphere has calmed down to some extent. Once Fate, who is probably confirming the details with Kaito, comes back, they can hear the full story and bring this matter to a close......","Or so they were thinking, but Fate opted to act spoiled around Kaito and slacked off on what others consider her duty, not even bothering to confirm the circumstances...... Not going back until Chronois finally ran out of patience and angrily picked her up......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Fate starts slacking off as naturally as breathing...... Certainly, since the Airhead God had already returned, she got no reason to work seriously...... And at the end of the festival, Chris’ stomach receives tremendous additional damage. This is but an initiation for a new Stomachache Warrior.]"]},{"number":1594,"title":"Chapter 1594 - End of Stomachache Festival 10","paragraphs":["In the guest room of the Imperial Castle of Archleshia Empire, Kaori and Akane were waiting when Chris, who had finished attending to the party, arrived.","[I apologize for keeping you waiting for a long time, you two.]","[Ah, no, it’s alright. Thank you for the hard work, Chris-san.]","[We were just taking it easy here anyway, even troubling the others to look after us...... Besides, we’ve actually already gone around the notable spots in the festival, so it’s alright.]","Hearing Chris apologize, Kaori immediately responded to her, and keeping in mind that the other party is an Emperor, Akane made sure to have proper honorifics to her words.","Chris originally planned to dismiss Kaori and Akane at some point. However, she ended up busier than expected and didn’t have the time to visit Kaori and Akane, so the two had to wait until the party was over.","However, Chris had instructed the maids to provide the best possible hospitality for them, so the two of them enjoyed a relaxing time, savoring the palace’s cuisine and delicious snacks. In fact, it had been quite comfortable for them.","[......Even so, it’s been a while since we last met, Kaori-san. Due to my position, I haven’t had many chances to visit Friendship City, but how is your restaurant doing?]","[Ah, yes. Thanks to Chris-san’s various help, it’s going smoothly...... Y- Yes, very smoothly...... It’s going so well hereafter that it hurts my stomach.]","When Kaori stated it was going well, she definitely meant it. With Friendship City’s Founder Olivia having become a regular customer and War King Megiddo declaring to visit next time, she could see her shop’s popularity increasing. Though, from Kaori’s perspective, that’s a topic that gives her stomachache......","Chris, who somewhat knows what’s going on through their letters, gave her a smile of sympathy, seemingly coming from one experiencing the same hardships.","[I can honestly understand how Kaori-san feels.]","[......Today must have been a rough day, Chris-san.]","[Yes, but today’s gains have been enormous as well. Today’s events allowed us to leave an impression that our Archlesia Empire has deep connections with the God Realm, and economically, it’s a situation in which I couldn’t have wished for more. Well, just like Kaori-san though, what happened makes my stomach churn......]","In fact, looking at the results alone, this year’s Foundation Festival turned out greater than what Chris could have wished for. All the Supreme Gods attended the ceremony, and in the end, even Shallow Vernal visited the Imperial Capital... Though her intentions might be different, she had even raised celebratory fireworks.","Not only does she truly appreciated being recognized for establishing a friendly relationship with the God Realm, she also witnessed her country’s distinction with Symphonia Kingdom, which held the impression of being close to the Six Kings.","Considering how Archlesia also had places such as the land under Fate’s Providence, the economic effect of such recognition is immeasurable. As Chris had hoped, there is no doubt that Archlesia Empire is about to enter a period of prosperity.","Well, of course there had been a lot of accidents that occurred today, and even Shallow Vernal made her appearance at the end of the festival, so she felt like her stomach was being pierced by multitudes of needles...... but once she considered such pain as a necessary expense, she thought her country had acquired something too big of a profit.","Furthermore, with the ceramics bearing Kaito’s emblem as a spark, there’s an atmosphere among the nobles suggesting an incoming boom in ceramics and other earthenware products. With a significant population of Dwarves in Archlesia, known for their expertise in craftsmanship, this kind of artisanal product is likely to receive a strong tailwind for a thriving economy.","[Well, the sun will be setting soon, so if you two are alright with it, I suggest staying the night. I’ll have rooms prepared for you two.]","[Ah, yes. Ahh, no, I’m alright with it, but what about you, Akane-san?]","[I’m alright with it too.]","After hearing their response, Chris smiled and nodded. Then, as if a thought had crossed her mind, she called out to Akane.","[Speaking of which, Akane-san, right? Are you perhaps Mikumo Trading Company’s Akane-san?]","[Oya? Have you heard of us?]","[Yes, it’s a trading company that I personally find intriguing...... I heard they recently started dealing with some interesting accessories. If you don’t mind, I’d like if we have some talks and perhaps, engage in negotiations as well.]","[......As expected of the Wise Emperor, you have sharp ears. Yes, said products target reasonably affluent customers, so I do hold interest in such negotiations.]","Even though she looked impressed at Chris’ words, Akane, being the business-minded person she is, was already making her calculations in her mind.","With the target audience in mind for the accessories made from the Dragon King’s scales commissioned by Kaito, Archlesia Empire, with their heavily noble-oriented culture, appeared to be a suitable market. Feeling optimistic about this negotiation, Akane smiled...... and at the same time, observing Chris’ expression, changing from one suffering from stomachache to that of the Wise Emperor in an instant,a look of admiration appeared on Akane’s face.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The impact to the stomach might be significant, but the fact that it easily brings about profits on the same level as that, this truly is the focal point of the World’s Singularity.]"]},{"number":1595,"title":"Chapter 1595 - Events Afterwards 1","paragraphs":["A minor issue occurred in Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival with Shiro-san suddenly arriving at the last moment, but it didn’t cause much commotion. After I finished tidying up our stall with Amel-san, we had dinner together and called it a day.","We were able to enjoy ourselves leisurely, and our stall also turned out great with almost all of the prepared items sold out. Making a promise with Amel-san to hang out with her again, the stall-setting for the Founding Festival came to a close.","And a few days later...... Seeing the expression of my sudden visitor, I couldn’t help wryly smiling.","[......You know, don’t you think this truly expresses the unfairness of the world? Even if one says it’s the truth of the world, I suppose it can’t be helped, but those who feel the disparity can’t help but feel sorrowful.]","[......Errr, what exactly are you talking about?]","[No, it’s not like I’m complaining to you, nor do I have anything I’m displeased about...... but I heard something about you setting up a stall in Archlesia after setting up one in Symphonia. No, not like I’m complaining or displeased with anything though......]","[You really look pretty displeased though!?]","In front of me sits Hydra Kingdom’s King Laguna-san, sipping her tea with a slightly displeased expression on her face. I can understand what she wants to say. In other words, she probably wants to point out that it’s unfair that I set up a stall for Symphonia Kingdom and Archlesia Empire, but doesn’t plan on setting up one for Hydra Kingdom.","[I mean, Symphonia and Archlesia are really flourishing, and for argument’s sake, I am Hydra’s King, so seeing all that happening doesn’t feel amusing. I’m not saying Kaito’s at fault for it, but I’d like it if you’d at least listen to this elderly King’s complaints...... You bring about an incredible economic impact, you know? Even if such isn’t intentional.]","[Hmmm. As for me, I really did just set up my stall.]","[Hahaha, one that causes quite the ruckus, that is. But still, overall, it’s safe to say that it brings about substantial profits.]","Talking openly about the strategic aspects of her country and coming directly to who she thinks is the main reason to vent frustrations, it’s truly just like Laguna-san. It’s also not like she’s demanding to have me set up a stall at Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival, so it’s relatively easy for me to interact with her.","[......Rather, you wouldn’t ask me to set up a stall at Hydra Kingdom, right?]","[No, I won’t...... With how nice you are, you’ll probably set up one if I did ask you, but you won’t find doing that any fun, right? Besides, you wouldn’t have enough time for it.]","[Is Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival coming soon?]","[Early next month.]","I see, there’s not even a month left huh. It would indeed become very hectic if I were to try setting up a stall, so I’d really like to excuse myself from doing that. Well, Laguna-san herself seemed to have guessed that, so she didn’t even try asking me that.","[......Unnn? Arehh? In that case, why did Laguna-san come to visit me today? You seriously didn’t come here just to complain, right?]","[No. Well, I guess I did partly come for that, but I just came here to invite you.]","[Invite?]","[Umu. Even when you have attended Symphonia Kingdom and Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festivals, you haven’t been able to go out much, have you? That’s why the invitation is for you to simply come and enjoy the Hydra Kingdom’s founding anniversary festival as a regular festival-goer. Our Hydra Kingdom’s people are lively, so the festival is sure to be vibrant~~]","[I see......]","Indeed, just as Laguna-san had pointed out, since I was running stalls at Symphonia and Archlesia’s Founding Festival, even when I looked around, I would only get to explore the vicinity of my stall. At least, I haven’t taken part in the main ceremonies of either festival.","In that light, Laguna’s suggestion is very appealing. It would be very nice to just purely enjoy the festival.","[That sounds great. I certainly haven’t been able to take my time just walking around, and I’m genuinely interested in how Hydra Kingdom’s festival would be like......]","[Umu umu! Sounds nice, isn’t it? And that’s why, I brought this here today.]","[Unnn? What’s this?]","[I have prepared seats for the ceremony at the grand square. Ahh, it’s not like they’re VIP seats or anything though, just seats that can be purchased by relatively affluent individuals among the citizens. They offer a more spacious view compared to general seating. Four seats make up one space, so it’s four tickets for one space. You can use all of them if you want, or just a part of them. If you’re not interested in attending the ceremony, it’s also not a problem if you don’t use it. Kaito helped me back with the tourist spot before so this is more of a thank-you gift. Don’t be reserved and accept it.]","[Thank you.]","I was just thinking about wanting to see the ceremony, so these reserved seats tickets are much appreciated. Since I’ve received these tickets, I guess I’ll go invite someone to hang out with at Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Laguna sure is freaking capable. By inviting him like that, she can prevent the situation where he isn’t present at Hydra’s Founding Festival unlike the other two countries, easily make a good impression on him, and even expect the secondary effect of him inviting his lovers. Since she isn’t demanding anything from him or restricting his activities, she will also not get caught within what’s considered as NG acts for those ensuring Kaito’s security.]","? ? ? : [By giving those reserved seat tickets, not only can Kaito-san leisurely enjoy the festival, but it also leaves a subtle impression on the foreign nobles and rulers who are attending the festival in the VIP seats. It’s highly likely that Kaito-san’s acquaintances, including Megiddo-san, will be in the VIP seats, so there is also the possibility of them greeting him at that time.]"]},{"number":1596,"title":"Chapter 1596 - Events Hereafter 2","paragraphs":["After Laguna-san left, I went to my room and looked at the reserved-seat ticket I had received. It was apparently for a large seat for four people, but there wasn’t really any need to use all four seats.","I mean, there’s only a few days left until the Founding Festival, and since I was planning to go to the festival mainly to enjoy myself, with the ceremony just an afterthought, I thought it would be better to invite someone among my lovers to go with me.","However, I guess it wouldn’t be a good idea to invite Shiro-san or Kuro here. Especially if I simply wanted to enjoy the festival, that would be difficult with a celebrity who attracts a lot of attention.","Considering someone who won’t draw attention even if we go together, and someone whose schedule she can easily adjust...... Someone I can easily invite......","[Alice, wanna go with me to Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival?]","[......I’m somewhat curious what thought process you had that led you to choosing me..... But well, I do welcome going together with you though.]","[Well, I thought that if I go with you, I can simply enjoy myself...... Alice has also helped me a lot in various ways for Symphonia Kingdom and Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festivals, so this can also be my way to express gratitude......]","[Ohh...... Kaito-san, you in your dere phase? Well~~ This certainly makes all of Alice-chan’s efforts worth it~~]","[......Guess I’m going with someone else then?]","[Wait, I’m just kidding, okay? Just kidding. It’s a Transcendental Beauty’s joke.]","Her fooling around at a moment like this really is just like Alice, but for the time being, it seems it’s an A-Okay for her to go with me for the Founding Festival. Well, by hanging out together with her, I knew I’d be able to have leisurely fun, and even though I’d likely end up having to treat her, that isn’t really a problem.","It’s also reassuring going there together with the knowledgeable and considerate Alice.","[Incidentally, you gonna invite some others too?]","[Hmm~~ Nope, isn’t it fine if we go with just the two of us? If we go with those you’re close with, either Kuro or Fate-san would end up causing a ruckus around us......]","[Well, that’s true. In that case, since we have the opportunity, let’s enjoy ourselves just with us two.]","Back when I once asked her who she’s fine going on a date together with, she’s alright with going together with Kuro or Fate-san, but found going on a date with others troublesome. Even with how much she fools around, Alice generally is a kind person, so even if she found herself in a situation where she goes on a date with me together with someone else, she would probably handle it well...... but well, it’s best to go with just the two of us.","[......Come to think of it, thinking of Alice and festivals......]","[Whoa there, Kaito-san, let’s be careful with our next words, yes? Too much embarrassment and I’d end up escaping, you know? You fine with that? Can you not underestimate how much of a love noob I am?]","[No, like I said, that isn’t something you should say so proudly......]","I remember going to a festival together with Alice. However, I kinda feel like memory is spotty, with me finding some parts of that time difficult to recall. Alice’s best friend...... A World Creator from a different world should also be there with us, but I can’t remember any of the moments involving that person. I suppose this is also because of the power of a being who was a World Creator just like Shiro-san.","However, I can clearly remember the scenes when that person is not present, so I do remember the time I went on a date with Alice at the festival. It seemed like Alice found that time too embarrassing though, not wanting to talk about it......","[By the way, what’s Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival like?]","[It’s basically no different from Symphonia’s or Archlesia’s. If you’re asking what’s unique about their festival, I guess it’s that Megiddo-san attends their ceremony every year. Megiddo-san is quite favorable to Hydra Kingdom after all......]","[Ahh~~ Now that you mentioned it, I think I heard something like that before.]","Hydra Kingdom’s overall national culture is adventurous, which made their country quite appealing to Megiddo-san. In fact, it appears to be a country that is proactive and at the forefront of various reforms, as evidenced by being the only one among the three countries to have introduced a parliamentary system through voting for representatives.","As is the case with the Flying Board competition that was held just lately, it seems that due to the country’s adventurous culture, the citizens’ enthusiasm was incredible, creating a vibrant and lively festival atmosphere.","[......Well, Laguna-san probably plans to bring her Joker to the board this year.]","[Joker?]","[Yes, putting aside her desire to abdicate her throne, Laguna-san is very capable as a King. Currently, both Symphonia Kingdom and Archlesia Empire had made an impact on the public during their Foundation Festival, while Hydra Kingdom seems to be falling behind the other two countries, giving the impression of remaining unchanged from previous years. However, when one looks at actual national power, Hydra currently stands at the top, but it might not be apparent to the general public.]","[I see......]","Indeed, considering the situation from the public’s perspective, they could get easily swayed by the impactful information, with keywords such as “all Six Kings in attendance” or “gathering of the Supreme Gods” bringing about significant impact. If there is nothing noteworthy happening in Hydra during this event, there is a risk of being perceived as falling behind the other two countries, which could also have implications on their economy.","[And so, that Joker of theirs is?]","[You could say she’s making an illegal move. There’s only card of hers that Laguna-san can use that can compete with the attendance of all Six Kings and Supreme Gods......]","[......Ahh, I think I know now what you’re talking about.]","[Well, it would just be too bad for Neun-san.....]","Yes. Just as Alice said, Laguna-san has extremely powerful connections, no less than the Six Kings and the Supreme Gods. Laying in wait in her hand is her a certain card, the Legendary Hero who was the bridge between the three realms......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [This is...... the presence of a new stomachache!?]"]},{"number":1597,"title":"Chapter 1597 - Events Hereafter 3","paragraphs":["Hydra’s King Laguna and Neun were fishing at a fishing spot in a corner of Hydra Kingdom.","Since the area around their spot was currently enclosed with Barrier Magic, Neun wasn’t wearing her full-body armor, and was instead dressed in comfortable clothing, with a private atmosphere around the two of them.","[Well~~ The weather sure is beautiful. A perfect day for fishing...... I’ve been busy lately, so it’s nice to be able to spend some time relaxing like this.]","[Ahh, come to think of it, it’s almost time for Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival, isn’t it? Being the King, you must be very busy, Laguna.]","[I really am. Moreover, with not much time between our festival and Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival, things had been quite hectic...... Haahhh...... I wish to step down from the throne already, but while I’m the King, I will do what I can.]","Seeing her best friend who repeatedly says she wants to quit being King but was unable to, Neun couldn’t help chuckling. Perhaps because she acts decisively when needed as King and produces solid results that she couldn’t pass the throne to others, or so she thought.","[Even so, right after Symphonia, Archlesia had also done one tremendous job.]","[Ahh, I heard all the Supreme Gods appeared? I didn’t attend their Founding Festival, so I only heard about it through rumors...... but with Symphonia having had all the Six Kings in attendance and Archlesia having had all the Supreme Gods, Hydra Kingdom must be in quite pressure, isn’t it?]","[You said it...... Good gracious, with things like this, Hydra Kingdom must do something for our Founding Festival...... is what many people think. It’s just, the attendees have already been chosen, and it’s difficult to make any changes to the ceremony now......]","[Hahaha, that’s rough.]","Neun chuckled, acting as if it were someone else’s business...... In actuality, at this point, this matter certainly was someone else’s business for Neun. Yes, at this point, that is......","[Even so, being with you like this reminds me of the old days. Well, we didn’t have nearly as much opportunity to fish on that trip...... but those days feel quite nostalgic.]","[Indeed. It was a journey filled with many challenging moments, but it was also filled with wonderful memories.]","[Umu. Come to think of it, you used to complain a lot about bread back then. No, you never said it in front of others, but you often grumbled about wanting to eat white rice in front of us who you knew well.]","[......Haha, well, rice is the heart of the Japanese after all......]","The two were talking happily as they reminisced about their former journey to defeat the Demon King, but upon Laguna’s next words, the atmosphere around them began to change a bit.","[Speaking of which, I do remember having cooperated quite a bit in the search for that rice. I gathered information from various sources and found out that it was produced in small quantities in a remote corner of Hydra. After that, I continued working on reaching out to various places to get hold of that rice. As a result, during the latter half of our journey, we somehow managed to get the rice delivered to us......]","[Eh? Yes, that’s right. I had been in your care at that time.]","[No, no, it’s only natural to lend a hand when one’s friends are in need. Just the words “I will never forget this favor for my whole life” Hikari told me back then made me feel rewarded and fulfilled.]","[............Ummm, Laguna? Why are you talking about this now? N- No, that certainly was the case and I am very grateful to you for that but......]","Was it perhaps her intuition honed through her experiences in her journey as the Hero? Somehow, Neun felt like the conversation was heading in an unfavorable direction.","At least until now, Laguna has never done something like this...... implicitly saying remarks that indirectly say “You do remember you owe me a favor, right?”. And then, thinking of their earlier conversation about Symphonia Kingdom and Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festivals...... She had a very unpleasant premonition.","[No, well, I was just recollecting the past. It’s not like I intend on burdening you with a sense of obligation, lending a helping hand to a friend in need is only natural...... By the way, Hikari. I’m changing the subject for a bit but......]","[......W- What is it?]","[You see, I’m actually in a terribly troubling situation...... I’d like to hear your opinion as my reliable friend. As my friend...... You won’t mind me consulting you with something, right?]","[...................................Yes.]","Laguna said such words with a beaming smile on her face, but after looking at her with an indescribable expression on her face, Neun looked up at the sky with an expression of complete resignation.","On that day, contrary to Neun’s state of mind...... the sky above Hydra Kingdom was hatefully blue and clear.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As expected, it really is here huh, the strongest card Laguna can use...... The First Hero...... Her name recognition in this world is overwhelming, and there are various speculations about whether she is alive or dead, so the attention level their Founding Festival would have with her presence would definitely be amazing.]"]},{"number":1598,"title":"Chapter 1598 - Events Hereafter 4","paragraphs":["At the royal castle of Symphonia Kingdom, Symphonia’s King, Ryze, had a difficult look on his face. The reason for this was the information that came from the country’s intelligence department.","The information spreading around was about Hydra Kingdom, and although there had been no official announcement from Hydra Kingdom as of yet, it was information that was attracting a great deal of attention.","[......Then, there’s a high probability that this is true?]","[Yes, there’s a strong possibility that the rumor that a stone monument presented to Her Majesty Laguna by First Hero Kujou Hikari being unveiled at Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival is true. There’s something that is kept quite securely in Hydra Kingdom’s royal castle, and it’s highly likely that it’s the aforementioned stone monument......]","[I see...... As to be expected of her. I’m not sure if I should say she’s quite shrewd or not, but she sure used something that could be considered forbidden......]","A stone monument left by the First Hero still stands on the Hero’s Hill, where people from all over the world visit to pray and express their gratitude. That shows how great of an achievement the First Hero had in her journey.","As her whereabouts after the signing of the Treaty of Friendship were still unknown, there were rumors of the First Hero’s existence in this world up to this date, her probable death, and her possible return to Japan after the completion of her journey.","At the same time, it was also rumored that Underworld King Kuromueina and the Hero’s party might have known what happened to her, but until now, the circumstances about this matter had never been revealed.","However, information that Hydra Kingdom was going to unveil a stone monument given to Laguna by the First Hero at their Founding Festival shocked everyone.","First of all, there’s a high degree of credibility that the aforementioned stone monument is authentic. Laguna was a member of the First Hero’s party and one of the world’s greatest heroes. That being the case, it’s not surprising that she received some kind of message from the First Hero.","However, the important question here was when said monument was given to her. If it was at the time of the signing of the Treaty of Friendship a thousand years ago, her having such a thing does make sense. Even still, it definitely would turn out into big news worldwide......","However, this raises questions about why any information about this monument was not disclosed until this moment, and along with that, there was also the growing rumor that “the monument was actually gifted only very recently”. If this were true, this could end up being evidence to support the theory that the First Hero still lives together with everyone.","And indeed, some of those holding power, including Ryze...... have witnessed the war in the God Realm revolving around the World’s Singularity, Kaito. And sighted within that battlefield at that time was the First Hero....... Therefore, he thinks it is quite possible that the First Hero is still living quietly in this world.","(Merely the possibility of a message from the First Hero is enough to generate this level of attention...... but when it’s confirmed as a fact, the level of attention their Founding Festival generates will likely surpass even that of Symphonia Kingdom and Archlesia Empire...... She’s really gone and done it.)","It’s a fact that the Six Kings and the Supreme Gods are extremely high profile...... but they do show up once every 10 years for the Festival of Heroes. The opportunity to meet both the Six Kings and the Supreme Gods in that one place exists.","However, the First Hero, on the other hand, even though she’s been known worldwide, since the signing of the Treaty of Friendship, she had never appeared in public, and even her whereabouts are shrouded in mystery. Having the knowledge of her existence would certainly bring about a great impact to the world.","Admiring Laguna’s actions, Ryze speculated that the current vague flow of information is also part of her plans. With the current situation, with various opinions being expressed while the information remains vague, the moment when Hydra Kingdom makes its official announcement will create a significant impact and guarantee a bustling Founding Festival.","[......By implementing such a strategy, it reflects a strong sense of their confidence...... In other words, it’s almost certain to be authentic...... With considerable attention already gathering within Symphonia Kingdom, it’s essential to be prepared for an immediate proclamation once the formal announcement from Hydra Kingdom is made.]","[Understood.]","During such a tumultuous time when the world is buzzing with excitement, the center of attention, the First Hero...... Neun had her head slumped on a desk.","[Hahaha, so that’s why you ended up making a stone monument huh. Seems like you also got it rough, Hikari~~]","[This isn’t some laughing matter, Hapti...... Just thinking about how this would increase attention on me and strange statues of me would start popping around again makes me feel depressed.]","[Well, the way I see it, the sales of Hikari Manju going up is a good thing. Rather, as expected, even Laguna won’t ask for your direct appearance huh~~]","[If she had asked me that, she knew I would have refused. She was very shrewd like that, and she was able to determine the line where I would compromise.]","In fact, Neun doesn’t have any intention of appearing in public any longer. Indeed, as the First Hero, the power of her words has become quite influential, but she herself doesn’t wish for her words to have unintended consequences and impact various things.","In the first place, she set out to defeat the Demon King because she wanted to help those who had helped her, not because she wanted wealth or fame.","Hearing Neun’s words, Hapti chuckled before speaking.","[Well, since we’re here, why don’t the two of us see the festival too?]","[......I suppose so. I don’t really want to get anywhere close to the Central Plaza, but we could explore other areas’ stalls and booths.]","[It’s decided then~~]","Hearing the words Hapti spoke in a laid-back tone...... words of invitation which she could tell were intended to change her dejected mood, Neun faintly smiled.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, she isn’t going to be directly attending, but is going to present them something...... Even so, fumu...... Neun and Hapti will participate in the Founding Festival Together. Meanwhile, Kaito has 2 extra seats on hand...... Oya? Oya oya?]"]},{"number":1599,"title":"Chapter 1599 - Ceramics and Crafted Sugar","paragraphs":["When I was walking around the garden after brushing Bell on a nice day, I saw Lilia-san having a cup of tea on the terrace overlooking the garden.","How should I say this...... It might just be my imagination, but she looked pretty tired.","[Lilia-san, don’t you look kinda tired?]","[....................]","[Eh? Ah, errr, is it because of me?]","When I called out to her, Lilia-san looked at me with an indescribable expression on her face, with an atmosphere around her that seemed to ask me “Whose fault do you think it is?”.","I’m feeling kinda awkward, but after a moment, Lilia-san let out a sigh and wryly smiled.","[......No, well, if you ask me if it’s Kaito-san’s fault, I’m torn whether I should say yes or no. There’s no doubt that Kaito-san is involved as a significant factor in this matter but......]","[U- Unnn? Ah, Luna-san. Thank you.]","Hearing the subtle way she was phrasing her words, I tilted my head in confusion. As I sat in the seat across from her, Luna-san prepared a cup of tea for me, to which I took a sip and waited for Lilia-san to continue.","[......Since Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival, there seems to be a boom in ceramics, especially among the Empire’s nobility......]","[......Eh? Could it be......]","[Yes, the ceramics with the brand mark that Kaito-san sold were said to be especially envied by the people. Not only that, that crafted sugar seems to have gotten popular as well.]","From what I heard, it almost sounds like it’s my fault...... but ceramics turning out that way definitely is due to me opening up such a stall. No, but I didn’t even know that noble-like people would come to buy my items...... Ahh, no, I guess I wouldn’t know if they had sent out servants or some other people to buy for them huh......","As I pondered such things, Luna-san wryly smiled and began to speak.","[That being the situation, Miyama-sama would usually be flooded with inquiries, but Miyama-sama’s case is quite unique, so they are unable to bother you with direct inquiries or cause you any inconvenience. As a result, naturally, as to where those inquiries inevitably come to...... Yes, they were directed to Milady.]","[......Hearing that, doesn’t it totally seem my fault?]","[......Ah, no, well, it’s not like Kaito-san had any ill intentions, and originally, my household has been like a contact point for Kaito-san, so things turning out like this isn’t entirely surprising...... There are also some circumstances that we’re helpless about.]","Arehh? Somehow, don’t things seem kinda strange? Lilia-san seemed to be following up on me quite a lot...... In any case, it feels a bit odd.","No, of course, considering the various past events, I know that Lilia-san has a kind personality, but due to various past events, I’m really associating discussing matters like this to me being scolded, so things feel a bit out of place.","Well, regarding this matter, I did inform Lilia-san about selling branded ceramics beforehand, so in that sense, she might have already somewhat expected things turning out like this in advance.","However, when I thought that it still felt a bit out of place, Luna-san chuckled.","[I can sort of understand Miyama-sama’s doubts, but in this case, Milady really can’t blame Miyama-sama.]","[......What do you mean?]","[Well, the primary cause for that matter regarding the ceramics certainly is Miyama-sama...... but in that case with the crafted sugar, Milady herself asked Illness-sama to give her some of those, which she used as gifts to other nobles, so she was completely reaping what she sowed...... And so, with the combination of the crafted sugar and ceramics, the flow of the store began to sound like a lot of good quality items could be procured from Miyama-sama......]","[A- Ahh, I see, I sort of understand now.]","In short, the current trend among the nobility revolves around my family’s products, including the ceramics and crafted sugar. However, as Lilia-san herself also played a role in igniting this trend, I guess she really can’t complain about it?","No, I think I’m largely responsible for that matter with the crafted sugar as well...... but with Lilia-san’s personality, she considers herself just as guilty about this matter as I am.","[Well, the ones who produced both of those items are Illness and Nebula-san though......]","[Those too sure have gotten into crafting stuff lately. Last time I saw them making something, they made a wooden pendulum clock together.]","[It seems like Illness is also having a great time doing it, so I can’t really complain either. However, all the things they created have an extremely amazing quality, don’t they? Well, I guess that’s really just as expected of them.]","Lilia-san’s expression was somewhat gentle as she smiled wryly, and she seemed pleased that Illness-san, who had never had much of a hobby before, was enjoying making things with Nebula.","[......By the way, Kaito-san, that matter is all fine and good, but I want to ask you something......]","[Yes?]","[I heard a rumor that in Archlesia Empire, weapons made with such outstanding techniques that even the Dwarves were amazed were sold at the Founding Festival...... Do you have any idea what this was talking about?]","[.......................]","Well...... It seems like I’m gonna get scolded for something apart from the ceramics.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [However, the one you sold shouldn’t be of very good quality, wasn’t it?]","? ? ? : [Well, even if they are weapons made from leftover materials, there’s a reason why Alice-chan is called a Legendary Blacksmith.]","Serious-senpai : [On the contrary, there are even suspicions that you might actually be the creator of all the Legendary 〇〇 series......]"]},{"number":1600,"title":"Chapter 1600 - Nebulas New Creation 1","paragraphs":["It was a sunny afternoon and I was sitting at a table in the backyard when Nebula and Illness-san called me over. I was told that it was for an unveiling of their new creation.","Yep. They apparently made something new again. What is it this time? Glassware? Or perhaps, does it have something to do with the several unfamiliar trees growing in the backyard?","[Milord, thank you for waiting!]","[No. About that new creation......]","[Yeeeees. It’s thiiiiis.]","[......Errr, this is...... Milk tea?]","The teacup that Illness-san put in front of me was filled with a drink that looked like milk tea. The sweet and soft aroma wafted through the air. I have never drank milk tea that much, but just with the aroma alone, I’m convinced that this was definitely a delicious milk tea.","[It’s a royal milk teaaaaa.]","[Fumu...... Sorry for my lack of knowledge. What’s the difference between milk tea and royal milk tea?]","Somehow, I got the impression that royal milk tea feels more...... well, royal, but I didn’t know exactly how it was different.","When I asked them about it, Nebula slightly nodded before explaining.","[Milk tea is made by mixing black tea brewed normally with hot water and milk. On the other hand, for royal milk tea, after steeping the tea leaves with a small amount of hot water to unfurl them, milk is added to extract its flavors.]","[I see......]","To put it very simply, milk tea is mainly black tea with milk added, but when the tea is predominantly milk-based, it’s referred to as royal milk tea?","For the time being, taking a sip before it cools down...... I could taste its incredibly rich milk flavor with the neat infusion of black tea’s taste, giving it a gentle and soothing flavor that almost makes me let out a sigh of satisfaction.","[......Delicious. I’ve never had royal milk tea before, but it tasted this good huh.]","[Kuhihi, about thaaaaat, it’s due in large paaaaaart to the tea leaves made by Nebulaaaaaa.]","[Yes! The tea leaves that I newly cultivated are the perfect ones for royal milk tea, as they deliver the best flavor when extracted with milk. Normally, hot water is used to unfurl the tea leaves before brewing with milk, but this tea can easily be brewed with milk only at low temperatures. If you are so inclined, you can even make cold royal milk tea out of these!]","[That sounds like great tea leaves. As expected of Nebula, you really are amazing.]","[I am Absolute after all!]","While lightly stroking the proud Nebula’s head, I sipped on the royal milk tea. I see, tea leaves especially cultivated for royal milk tea huh. Moreover, from what I heard, it seems these tea leaves can be extracted even under conditions that would be difficult with regular tea leaves.","Just from what I heard, these tea leaves seem incredible, but since Nebula is a Plant Spirit, I guess she is capable of selective breeding. Well, with how amazing of a child Nebula is, it isn’t really surprising if she could cultivate completely new breeds of tea leaves.","[They really are interesting tea leaaaaaves. Since it’s specialized for royal milk teaaaa, if you extract it with regular teaaaaa, it will turn out tasting weeeeeeird. You could say they really aaaaaaare tea leaves exclusively for royal milk teaaaaa. Since Miladyyyyy also loves royal milk tea, I plan to have her sample it tooooooo.]","[......I see. However, with how amazing these tea leaves are, wouldn’t Ein-san and the others want to procure these again?]","[I already made sure not to overlook that aspect. I prepared an abundant amount in advance, so even if there are people who would want some, we can accommodate them. I will also give several cans of these to Milord, so if people ask you for some, you can give those to them.]","[Alright. Thanks, Nebula.]","In fact, I think Ein-san would be quite delighted with these, and Jutia-san, who also loves tea, might also be interested in having some. For the time being, since I already thought of those two, I’ll go deliver some to them right away.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I feel like that’s a completely new type of tea leaves that hasn’t existed before → Well, Nebula is amazing, so I guess she just selectively bred something...... Hmmm, he had completely turned into his idiotic parent mode. Just as usual, his judgment on matters regarding Nebula was quite messy.]","? ? ? : [I just hope that royal milk tea doesn’t put a hole in Lilia-san’s stomach.]"]}]);
